('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_50','spiral','''spaɪrəl','''spaɪrəl','[vi] 盘旋；盘旋上升；急剧增长; [adj] 螺旋形的; [n] 螺旋形； 螺旋式的上升','Crime has spiraled out of control .  犯罪活动激增，已经失控。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_51','artistic','ɑr''tɪstɪk','ɑːr''tɪstɪk','[adj] 艺术的； 富有艺术性的， 精美的； 有艺术天赋的','artistic work  艺术作品'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_52','ramble','''ræmbl','''ræmbl','[vi] 漫游；漫谈，闲聊; [n] 漫步','There’s plenty to discover as you ramble around this little island.  漫步这个小岛，你会有很多新发现。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_53','vocation','vo''keʃən','vou''keɪʃn','[n] 职业； 使命感； 圣召','It could well be that he has a real vocation.  他很可能有种真正的使命感。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_54','halt','hɔlt','hɔːlt','[v] 停住， 停下; [n] 停止，阻止；暂停','The parade halted by a busy corner.  游行队伍在一个热闹的拐角处停下了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_55','throw','θro','θrou','[v] 投，掷，抛；丢，扔；使陷入，使处于；使困惑，使吃惊; [n] 投， 掷， 抛； 投掷的距离','The bus stopped suddenly and we were all thrown forwards.  公共汽车猛地停住，我们都往前栽。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_56','sunset','''sʌnsɛt','''sʌnset','[n] 日落， 傍晚','a glorious sunset  壮丽的日落景象'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_57','stature','''stætʃɚ','''stætʃər','[n] 身材， 身高； 地位， 声望， 名望','He grew in stature (= became more admired or popular ) during the campaign.  在这场宣传活动中，他的声望提高了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_58','dogged','''dɔɡɪd','''dɔːgɪd','[adj] 顽强的， 坚持不懈的； 顽固的， 固执的','a dogged determination to succeed  不屈不挠的成功决心'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_59','plasma','''plæzmə','''plæzmə','[n] 血浆； 等离子体','Now there are no gaps, so this is the state of matter, and this was the state of a plasma.  现在没有任何间隙，这样这是物质的状态，而以前是一个等离子体状态。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_60','exorbitant','ɪɡ''zɔrbɪtənt','ɪg''zɔːrbɪtənt','[adj] 过高的， 不合理的','Exorbitant housing prices have created an acute shortage of affordable housing for the poor.  过高的房价使穷人负担得起的房源严重短缺。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_61','surgery','''sɝdʒəri','''sɜːrdʒəri','[n] 外科手术； 外科学； 手术室， 诊疗室','Dr. Hanson is in surgery.  汉森医生在手术室。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_62','violent','''vaɪələnt','''vaɪələnt','[adj] 暴力的； 感情强烈的， 激情的； 强烈的， 激烈的','the increase in violent crime  暴力犯罪的增多'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_63','inaccessible',',ɪnæk''sɛsəbl','ˌɪnæk''sesəbl','[adj] 难达到的， 不可及的； 不能得到的','In winter, the villages are inaccessible by road.  冬天时，进入这些村子的路很难走。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_64','resolve','rɪ''zɑlv','rɪ''zɑːlv','[v] 解决；决定，决心；分解；显现; [n] 决心， 决议','Barnet was desperate for money to resolve his financial problems.  巴尼特急需钱来解决他的经济问题。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_65','choreograph','''kɔriəɡrɑ:f','''kɔːriəgræf','[v] 设计舞蹈动作， 编舞','The show is very cleverly choreographed.  这个节目的舞蹈动作设计得非常好。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_66','confront','kən''frʌnt','kən''frʌnt','[vt] 使面临， 使遭遇； 对抗','The problems confronting the new government were enormous.  新政府面临的难题是巨大的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_67','nonverbal',',nɑn''vɝbl','''nɑːnvɜːrbl','[adj] 非语言的','nonverbal forms of communication  非语言交际形式'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_68','deploy','dɪ''plɔɪ','dɪ''plɔɪ','[vt] 部署， 调度； 利用','a job in which a variety of professional skills will be deployed  要用到多项专业技术的工作'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_69','reproduce',',riprə''dus','ˌriːprə''duːs','[v] 繁殖， 生育； 复制； 再现','The turtles return to the coast to reproduce.  海龟回到岸上繁殖。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_70','skeleton','''skɛlɪtn','''skelɪtn','[n] 梗概， 提纲； 骨架， 骨骼； 框架','We agreed on a skeleton outline of the proposal.  我们给提案商定了一个基本框架。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_71','huddle','''hʌdl','''hʌdl','[vi] 聚集在一起， 挤作一团； 蜷缩， 缩成一团， 蜷缩; [n] 挤在一起的人','We lay huddled together for warmth.  我们紧紧挤在一起取暖。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_72','syntactic','sɪn''tæktɪk','sɪn''tæktɪk','[adj] 句法的； 按照句法的','syntactic structure  句法结构'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_73','rendition','rɛn''dɪʃən','ren''dɪʃn','[n] 表演， 演唱； 提供， 给予； 翻译','He gave a moving rendition of Lennon’s ‘Imagine’.  他深情地演唱了列侬的《想象》。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_74','intersection',',ɪntɚ''sɛkʃən','ˌɪntər''sekʃn','[n] 交点； 十字路口， 道路交叉口','We crossed at a busy intersection.  我们穿过了一个繁忙的道路交叉口。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_75','scholarship','''skɑlɚʃɪp','''skɑːlərʃɪp','[n] 奖学金； 学问， 学识','Her latest publication is a fine piece of scholarship.  她最新出版的作品是一部优秀的学术著作。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_76','myriad','''miriəd','''mɪriəd','[adj] 无数的； 大量的; [n] 无数；大量','the myriad causes of homelessness  导致人们无家可归的种种原因'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_77','besides','bɪ''saɪdz','bɪ''saɪdz','[adv] 而且， 还有; [prep] 除…之外','I need the money. And besides, when I agree to do something, I do it.  我需要这笔钱，而且，我一旦答应做什么事情就会做到。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_78','implement','''ɪmplɪmɛnt','''ɪmplɪm(ə)nt','[vt] 使生效， 执行， 实施','The government promised to implement a new system to control financial loan institutions.  政府许诺要实施新的制度来控制金融贷款机构。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_79','disperse','dɪ''spɝs','dɪ''spɜːrs','[v] 分散， 散开； 疏散； 散布','Police used tear gas to disperse the crowd.  警察用催泪瓦斯驱散人群。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_80','erratic','ɪ''rætɪk','ɪ''rætɪk','[adj] 古怪的， 反复无常的； 不规则的； 不稳定的','His breathing was becoming erratic.  他的呼吸越来越不均匀。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_81','incinerate','in''sinəreit','ɪn''sɪnəreɪt','[vt] 焚化， 焚毁','Which is better to incinerate the rubbish from our towns or to tip it into disused quarries?  在我们城里把垃圾予以焚化，还是倒进废弃的采石坑，哪一种方法好？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_82','fantasy','''fæntəsi','''fæntəsi','[n] 想象， 幻想','I used to have fantasies about living in Paris with an artist.  我过去常幻想着在巴黎与一位艺术家同住。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_83','capillary','''kæpəlɛri','''kæpəleri','[adj] 毛状的； 毛细血管的; [n] 毛细血管','This consists of a capillary connected to a mercury reservoir.  这由一根与汞池相连的毛细管所构成。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_84','deform','dɪ''fɔrm','dɪ''fɔːrm','[v] 变形','Wearing badly-fitting shoes can deform your feet.  穿不合脚的鞋会使脚变形。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_85','erode','ɪ''rod','ɪ''roud','[v] 侵蚀， 腐蚀','The cliffs are being constantly eroded by heavy seas.  悬崖正不断受到汹涌海浪的侵蚀。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_86','informative','ɪn''fɔrmətɪv','ɪn''fɔːrmətɪv','[adj] 提供消息的， 给予知识的； 见闻广博的','Both men termed the meeting friendly and informative.  他们两人都称这次会晤亲切友好，使双方增进了解。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_87','check','tʃɛk','tʃek','[n] 支票；账单；','Can you cash this check for me?  您可以为我兑现这张支票吗?。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_88','frustrate','''frʌstret','''frʌstreɪt','[vt] 使感到灰心， 挫败； 阻止','Their attempts to speak to him were frustrated by the guards.  他们想跟他说话，但被警卫拦住了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_89','sparse','spɑrs','spɑːrs','[adj] 稀疏的， 稀少的； 贫乏的','his sparse brown hair  他那稀疏的棕色头发'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_90','gorgeous','''ɡɔrdʒəs','''gɔːrdʒəs','[adj] 漂亮的； 令人愉快的； 华丽的， 灿烂的','a gorgeous cake  漂亮的蛋糕'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_91','pragmatic','præg''mætɪk','præg''mætɪk','[adj] 务实的， 注重实效的， 实用的','Williams took a more pragmatic approach to management problems.  威廉斯在管理问题上采用的是一种更务实的做法。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_92','erosion','ɪ''roʒən','ɪ''rouʒn','[n] 腐蚀， 侵蚀； 削弱， 减少','the problem of soil erosion  水土流失的问题'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_93','methane','''mɛθen','''meθeɪn','[n] 甲烷， 沼气','Methane is one of the principal gases contributing to the greenhouse effect.  甲烷是造成温室效应的主要气体之一。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_94','tectonic','tɛk''tɑnɪk','tek''tɑːnɪk','[adj] 地壳构造的','tectonic movements  地壳构造运动'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_95','superstitious','''sʊpɚ''stɪʃəs','ˌsuːpər''stɪʃəs','[adj] 迷信的， 受迷信思想支配的','a superstitious woman  一个迷信的女人'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_96','ascend','ə''sɛnd','ə''send','[v] 上升， 升高； 攀登','The plane ascended rapidly.  飞机迅速爬升。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_97','elasticity',',ilæ''stɪsəti','ˌiːlæ''stɪsəti','[n] 弹力； 弹性','the skin’s natural elasticity  皮肤天生的弹性'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_98','proactive',',pro''æktɪv','ˌprou''æktɪv','[adj] 积极主动的； 先发制人的','a proactive approach to staffing requirements  对人事需求的积极处理方法'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_99','aboriginal',',æbə''rɪdʒənl','ˌæbə''rɪdʒənl','[adj] 原始的；土著的，土生土长的; [n] 土著','...Aboriginal art.  …土著艺术。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_100','indispensable','''ɪndɪ''spɛnsəbl','ˌɪndɪ''spensəbl','[adj] 必不可少的','Mobile phones have become an indispensable part of our lives.  移动电话已经成为我们生活中的必需品。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_101','lens','lɛnz','lenz','[n] 透镜； 镜头； 镜片','a standard 50mm lens  50毫米标准镜头'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_102','embody','ɪm''bɑdi','ɪm''bɑːdi','[vt] 表达， 体现； 含有','She embodies everything I admire in a teacher.  她具备了我所钦佩的教师该具备的一切素质。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_103','verifiable','''vɛrə,faɪəbl','''verɪfaɪəbl','[adj] 可证实的， 可核实的','This is not a romantic notion but verifiable fact.  这不是一个不切实际的念头，而是一个有依据的事实。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_104','comprehensible','''kɑmprɪ''hɛnsəbl','ˌkɑːmprɪ''hensəbl','[adj] 可理解的， 能懂的， 能充分理解的','Her speech was slurred and barely comprehensible.  她的发言含混不清，几乎无法听懂。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_105','motive','''motɪv','''moutɪv','[adj] 发动的； 导致运动的; [n] 动机，目的','Water provided the motive power for the mill.  水为磨坊提供了动力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_106','elliptical','ɪ''lɪptɪkl','ɪ''lɪptɪkl','[adj] 椭圆的； 隐晦的； 省略的， 简略的','Kepler published his discovery of the elliptical orbits of planets in 1609. 1609  年开普勒公布他的发现，认为行星轨道为椭圆形。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_107','emancipate','ɪ''mænsɪpet','ɪ''mænsɪpeɪt','[vt] 解放， 解除','Slaves were emancipated in 1834.  奴隶于1834年获得了解放。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_108','romantic','ro''mæntɪk','rou''mæntɪk','[adj] 爱情的； 浪漫的， 富有情调的； 多情的； 不切实际的， 幻想的； [R-]浪漫主义的','‘Tom always sends me red roses on my birthday.’ ‘How romantic!’  “我过生日时汤姆总是给我送红玫瑰。”“多浪漫啊！”'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_109','motivate','''motə''vet','''moutɪveɪt','[vt] 激励； 激发','A good teacher has to be able to motivate her students.  好教师必须能够激发学生的积极性。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_110','spoil','spɔɪl','spɔɪl','[v] 破坏； 宠坏， 溺爱； 变质','She’s an only child, but they didn’t really spoil her.  她是独生女，不过他们也没有娇惯她。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_111','multiply','''mʌltɪplaɪ','''mʌltɪplaɪ','[v] 增加； 繁殖； 乘','Bacteria multiply quickly in warm food.  细菌在温热的食物里繁殖得很快。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_112','pasture','''pæstʃɚ','''pæstʃər','[n] 牧场，草原；','large areas of rough upland pasture  大片起伏的山地牧场'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_113','conducive','kən''dusɪv','kən''duːsɪv','[adj] 有助于…的， 有益于…的','an environment conducive to learning  有助于学习的环境'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_114','pilot','''paɪlət','''paɪlət','[adj] 试验性的; [n] 飞行员，领航员；领导人; [vt] 驾驶， 领航； 试行， 试用； 使通过， 引导','The plan is to launch a pilot programme next summer.  计划是在明年夏天实施一个试验性方案。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_115','curative','''kjʊrətɪv','''kjurətɪv','[adj] 有助于治疗的，有疗效的; [n] 药物','the spring’s alleged curative properties  这处泉水号称能治病的功效'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_116','cartilage','''kɑrtɪlɪdʒ','''kɑːrtɪlɪdʒ','[n] 软骨','Andre Agassi has pulled out of next week''s Grand Slam Cup after tearing a cartilage in his chest.  安德烈·阿加西胸部软骨拉伤后已退出了下周的大满贯赛事。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_117','snide','snaɪd','snaɪd','[adj] 伪造的； 不诚实的； 讽刺的， 挖苦的， 含沙射影的','He made a snide comment about her weight.  他说了一句刻薄的话评论她的体重。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_118','multiple','''mʌltəpl','''mʌltɪpl','[adj] 多样的；多重的; [n] 倍数','Baxter was rushed to the hospital with multiple stab wounds.  巴克斯特因多处刺伤被紧急送往医院。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_119','expose','ɪk''spoz；ek-','ɪk''spouz','[vt] 暴露， 显露； 揭露， 揭穿； 使接触， 使面临','He lifted his T-shirt to expose a jagged scar across his chest.  他撩起T恤衫，露出横贯胸部的锯齿状伤疤。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_120','magnet','''mægnɪt','''mægnət','[n] 磁铁， 磁体； 有吸引力的人','Prospect Park, with its vast lake, is a magnet for all health freaks.  拥有大片湖区的展望公园是所有健身迷的向往之地。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_121','versatile','''vɝsətl','''vɜːrsətl','[adj] 多才多艺的； 多用途的','a very versatile performer  多才多艺的表演者'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_122','concentrate','''kɑnsn''tret','''kɑːnsntreɪt','[v] 集中，专心；','Now please concentrate.  现在请集中注意力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_123','versus','''vɝsəs','''vɜːrsəs','[prep] 对， 对抗； 与…相对， 与…相比','the New York Knicks versus the LA Lakers  纽约尼克斯队对洛杉矶湖人队'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_124','penmanship','''pɛnmən''ʃɪp','''penmənʃɪp','[n] 书法','children practicing their penmanship  练习书法的儿童'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_125','tundra','''tʌndrə','''tʌndrə','[n] 苔原， 冻原， 冻土地带','Gley soils are typical of tundra , meadows, and boggy areas.  该种土壤是苔原、 草地以及沼地所特有的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_126','explosion','ɪk''sploʒən','ɪk''splouʒn','[n] 爆炸； 爆发； 激增','We heard a loud explosion.  我们听到一声巨大的爆炸声。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_127','tinker','''tɪŋkɚ','''tɪŋkər','[vi] 做焊锅匠；做拙劣修补; [n] 补锅匠','Arcane nullifiers recognize Common, but only an experienced tinker, shouting out the correct codes, may command them.  虽然奥术消除者被认可为是公民，但只要是一名经验丰富的修补匠，高喊出正确的指令，就可以命令它们。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_128','populate','''pɑpjulet','''pɑːpjuleɪt','[vt] 居住于','The highlands are populated mainly by peasant farmers.  高原人口主要是农民。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_129','puncture','''pʌŋktʃɚ','''pʌŋktʃər','[v] 刺穿；泄气，挫伤; [n] 小孔； 刺伤','A piece of glass punctured the back tyre.  一块玻璃把后轮胎戳破了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_130','permit','pɚ''mɪt','pə''mɪt','[v] 允许， 许可; [n] 许可证， 执照','Smoking is only permitted in the public lounge.  只允许在公共休息室里抽烟。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_131','translation','træns''leʃən','træns''leɪʃn','[n] 翻译； 译文， 译本','She read the letter and gave us a rough translation (= she did not translate everything exactly ) .  她看了信，给我们大概翻译了一下。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_132','personnel',',pɝsə''nɛl','ˌpɜːrsə''nel','[n] 全体人员， 员工','All personnel are to receive security badges.  所有人员都将拿到安保徽章。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_133','splash','splæʃ','splæʃ','[v] 溅， 泼; [n] 重点文章；溅上的液体；斑点','The children were splashing about in the pool.  孩子们在水池里戏水。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_134','fountain','''faʊntn','''fauntn','[n] 喷泉； 丰富来源， 源泉','...the fountains on the 16th Street Mall.  …第16街商业区的喷泉。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_135','porcelain','ˈpɔrsələn','''pɔːrsəlɪn','[n] 瓷器， 瓷','a porcelain vase  瓷花瓶'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_136','catalog','''kætəlɔg','''kætəlɔːg','[n] 目录','Can you catalog all these books?  你能给所有这些书编目录吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_137','part-time',',pɑrt''taɪm','''pɑːrtˌtaɪm','[adj] 兼职的； 部分时间的','a part-time job  兼职工作'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_138','pioneer',',paɪə''nɪr','ˌpaɪə''nɪr','[vt] 开拓，开创; [n] 开拓者， 创始人','The new cancer treatment was pioneered in the early eighties by Dr Sylvia Bannerjee.  这种新的癌症治疗方法是由西尔维娅·班纳基医生在80年代初期开创的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_139','chilly','''tʃɪli','''tʃɪli','[adj] 寒冷的； 冷淡的， 不友好的','Getting chilly, isn’t it?  天冷了，是不是？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_140','flagellum','flə''dʒɛləm','flə''dʒeləm','[n] [昆] 鞭毛；鞭子；鞭状匍匐枝',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_141','rhinoceros','raɪ''nɑsərəs','raɪ''nɑːsərəs','[n] 犀牛','Some of the projects will also support conservation efforts of near-extinct animals in Kalimantan, including rhinoceros, Irrawaddy dolphins, and orangutans.  其中一些项目也将支持对加里曼丹濒危动物的保护活动，包括犀牛、伊洛瓦底江海豚和猩猩。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_142','implication','''ɪmplɪ''keʃən','ˌɪmplɪ''keɪʃn','[n] 含义； 暗示， 暗指； 卷入， 牵连','They are called ‘Supertrams’, the implication being that (= which is meant to suggest that ) they are more advanced than earlier models.  它们被称作“超级电车”，这是暗指它们比先前的型号更先进。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_143','fierce','fɪrs','fɪrs','[adj] 凶猛的， 残忍的； 狂热的， 强烈的； 激烈的， 猛烈的','fierce fighting in the city  城里的激烈战斗'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_144','reservation',',rɛzɚ''veʃən','ˌrezər''veɪʃn','[n] 预约， 预订； 保留意见， 疑惑； 居留地','a dinner reservation  预订晚餐'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_145','block','blɑk','blɑːk','[vt] 阻塞；阻碍，妨碍; [n] 大块； 街区； 障碍物','A fallen tree is blocking the road.  一棵倒下的树把路阻断了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_146','cordial','''kɔrdʒəl','''kɔːrdʒəl','[adj] 亲切的， 热诚的','The talks were conducted in a cordial atmosphere.  会谈在友好的气氛中进行。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_147','odorous','''odərəs','''oudərəs','[adj] 有气味的， 难闻的； 香的， 芬芳的','odorous gases  有气味的气体'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_148','cooperation','ko,ɑpə''reʃən','kouˌɑːpə''reɪʃn','[n] 合作， 协作','the need to strengthen international co-operation  加强国际合作的需要'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_149','conceit','kən''sit','kən''siːt','[n] 自负， 自大','The conceit of the woman!  这个自负的女人！'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_150','modulate','''mɑdʒəlet','''mɑːdʒəleɪt','[v] 调整， 调节； 调制','These drugs modulate the disease process.  这些药物能控制病情的发展。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_151','mottled','''mɑtld','''mɑːtld','[adj] 有杂色的， 斑驳的','His red, mottled face showed the effect of too much whisky.  他那张红红的、满是斑点的脸表明，他威士忌喝得太多了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_152','morphology','mɔr''fɑlədʒi','mɔːr''fɑːlədʒi','[n] 形态学， 形态论','Morpheme is the basic unit in the study of morphology.  词素是形态学研究的最基本的单位。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_153','distant','''dɪstənt','''dɪstənt','[adj] 远离的， 遥远的； 疏远的， 冷淡的； 久远的； 不同的','the sound of distant gunfire  远处的炮火声'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_154','resonance','''rɛznəns','''rezənəns','[n] 共振， 共鸣； 回声， 反响','a tradition that has little resonance in the 21st century  在21世纪难以引起共鸣的传统'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_155','propose','prə''poz','prə''pouz','[v] 建议， 提议； 提名， 推荐； 打算， 计划； 求婚','the changes currently proposed by the local planning authorities  目前由地方规划局提议的改革'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_156','spearhead','''spɪr''hɛd','''spɪrhed','[n] 先锋，前锋，先头部队; [vt] 为…作先锋； 带头做','the troops who spearheaded the rescue mission  在救援任务中充当先锋的部队'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_157','seismograph','''saɪzməɡræf','''saɪzməgræf','[n] 地震仪， 测震仪','On the right waist have a seismograph, it tender prior to the earthquake forecast the earthquake.  在右腰上有一个地震仪，它嫩在地震前预报地震。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_158','reform','rɪ''fɔrm','rɪ''fɔːrm','[n&v] 改革， 改造， 革新； 改正， 改过自新','plans to radically reform the tax system  彻底改革税收制度的计划'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_159','angular','''æŋɡjəlɚ','''æŋgjələr','[adj] 有角的， 尖角的； 消瘦的， 瘦骨嶙峋的','a tall, angular young man  又高又瘦的年轻男子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_160','daylight','''delaɪt','''deɪlaɪt','[n] 日光； 白昼','The park is open to the public during daylight hours .  公园白天对公众开放。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_161','podium','''podɪəm','''poudiəm','[n] 讲坛， 讲台； 指挥台','Unsteadily he mounted the podium, adjusted the microphone, coughed, and went completely blank.  他摇摇晃晃地走上讲台，调好麦克风，咳嗽了几声，接着脑子就一片空白。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_162','binary','''baɪnəri','''baɪnəri','[adj] 二进制的； 二元的； 由两部分组成的','a binary star system  双星系'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_163','ensue','ɪn''su','ɪn''suː','[vi] 继而发生， 接着发生','If the Europeans did not reduce subsidies, a trade war would ensue.  如果欧洲不减少补贴，贸易战将随即爆发。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_164','crazy','''krezi','''kreɪzi','[adj] 疯狂的， 不理智的； 狂热的， 热衷的； 精神失常的','The neighbours must think we’re crazy.  邻居一定会认为我们疯了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_165','microscopic',',maɪkrə''skɑpɪk','ˌmaɪkrə''skɑːpɪk','[adj] 用显微镜可见的； 极小的','a microscopic speck of dust  微小的尘粒'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_166','homage','''hɑmɪdʒ','''hɑːmɪdʒ','[n] 尊敬， 敬意','The film pays homage to Martin Scorsese’s ‘Mean Streets’.  该影片向马丁·斯科塞斯的《穷街陋巷》致敬。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_167','penicillin',',pɛnɪ''sɪlɪn','ˌpenɪ''sɪlɪn','[n] 青霉素， 盘尼西林',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_168','pine','paɪn','paɪn','[vi] 憔悴； 难过， 悲伤; [n] 松树','Six months after he left, she was still pining.  他离开六个月了，她还是很悲伤。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_169','enlightenment','ɪn''laɪtnmənt','ɪn''laɪtnmənt','[n] 启发， 教化， 启迪； [the E-]启蒙运动','Stella had a moment of enlightenment.  斯特拉恍然大悟。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_170','irony','''aɪrəni','''aɪrəni','[n] 反话， 讽刺， 嘲弄； 具有讽刺意味的事','Life is full of little ironies.  生活中充满了小小的讽刺。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_171','mandatory','''mændətɔri','''mændətɔːri','[n] 强制的，法定的，义务的； 受托人； 代理人',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_172','caterpillar','''kætɚpɪlɚ','''kætərpɪlər','[n] 毛毛虫','I saw a caterpillar on the leaf.  我看见一条毛毛虫在叶子上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_173','hypertext','''haɪpɚ''tɛkst','''haɪpərtekst','[n] 超文本','...information embroidered with colourful graphics and tied together by hypertext links.  …饰以彩色图表并用超文本链接组合在一起的信息。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_174','bedrock','''bɛdrɑk','''bedrɑːk','[n] 基础， 根基； 基岩','Marriage and children are the bedrock of family life.  婚姻和子女是家庭生活的基础。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_175','syndrome','''sɪndrəm','''sɪndroum','[n] 综合征； 典型表现','people who suffer from irritable bowel syndrome  患有肠道过敏综合征的人'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_176','newsprint','''nuzprɪnt','''njuːzprɪnt','[n] 新闻纸','...a newsprint warehouse.  …一个新闻纸货仓。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_177','tow','to','tou','[vt&n] 拖， 牵引','The ship had to be towed into the harbor.  那艘轮船不得不被拖进港口。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_178','harmonic','hɑr''mɑnɪk','hɑːr''mɑːnɪk','[n] 泛音；','And the researchers say our brains might like these chords because their frequencies resemble those of a single harmonic note.  研究人员表示，我们的大脑喜欢这些和弦，可能是因为这些频率与一个单谐波音符类似。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_179','haul','hɔl','hɔːl','[v] 拖，拖运; [n] 拖， 拉， 拖运； 一次获得的数量； 旅行的距离','the steam locomotive which hauled the train  拖动火车的蒸汽机车'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_180','energetic',',ɛnɚ''dʒɛtɪk','ˌenər''dʒetɪk','[adj] 精力充沛的， 积极的','an energetic man  精力旺盛的男子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_181','quilt','kwɪlt','kwɪlt','[v] 缝被；缝制; [n] 被褥','Maggie knows how to quilt.  玛吉知道怎样缝被子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_182','premier','prɪ''mɪr','prɪ''mɪr','[adj] 第一的， 首要的； 最著名的; [n] 首相，总理','one of Dublin’s premier hotels  都柏林最好的酒店之一'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_183','allergic','ə''lɝdʒɪk','ə''lɜːrdʒɪk','[adj] 过敏的， 变态反应的； 对…讨厌的','an allergic reaction to nuts  对坚果的过敏性反应'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_184','oceanographer',',oʃɪə''nɑgrəfɚ','ˌəuʃə''nɑːgrəfər','[n] 海洋学者','In 1904 Johannes Schmidt, a young Danish oceanographer and biologist, got a job aboard the Thor, a Danish research vessel, studying the breeding habits of food fishes such as cod and herring.  年轻的丹麦海洋学家兼生物学家乔纳斯·施密特在丹麦研究船“托尔”号上找到一份工作，研究食用鱼（如鳕鱼和鲱鱼）的繁殖习性。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_185','anecdote','''ænɪkdot','''ænɪkdout','[n] 秘闻； 轶事， 趣闻','The book is full of amusing anecdotes about his life in Japan.  这本书里全是他在日本生活的趣闻轶事。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_186','officious','ə''fɪʃəs','ə''fɪʃəs','[adj] 爱发号施令的， 爱指手画脚的','an officious traffic warden  一名爱发号施令的交通督导员'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_187','infiltrate','ɪn''fɪltret','''ɪnfɪltreɪt','[v] 渗入， 渗透； 悄悄进入， 潜入','Police attempts to infiltrate neo-Nazi groups were largely unsuccessful.  警方想打入新纳粹团体的行动基本上不成功。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_188','minor','''maɪnɚ','''maɪnər','[vi] 辅修; [adj] 较小的；次要的; [n] 未成年人；辅修科目','What are your major subject and minor subject?  你的主修科目和辅修科目是什么?。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_189','hostile','ˈhɑstl','''hɑːstl','[adj] 不友好的， 敌意的； 敌方的','Southampton fans gave their former coach a hostile reception .  南安普敦队的球迷对球队的前任教练很不友善。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_190','flora','','''flɔːrə','[n] 植物群','Tourism is damaging the flora and fauna (= plants and animals ) of the island.  旅游业正在破坏该岛的动植物资源。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_191','celestial','sə''lɛstʃəl','sə''lestʃl','[adj] 天空的， 天上的','...the clusters of celestial bodies in the ever-expanding universe.  …不断扩展的宇宙中的这些天体群。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_192','decode','','ˌdiː''koud','[vt] 译， 解， 破译','The software decodes the information embedded in the satellite broadcasts.  这种软件能够解读衞星广播中的信息。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_193','bruise','bruz','bruːz','[v] 出现伤痕；挫伤; [n] 伤痕， 擦痕， 青肿','She fell off her bike and bruised her knee.  她从自行车上摔下来，擦伤了膝盖。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_194','crawl','krɔl','krɔːl','[v] 缓慢行进；爬行; [n] 缓慢的速度','The floor was crawling with ants.  地板上爬满了蚂蚁。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_195','identical','aɪ''dɛntɪkl','aɪ''dentɪkl','[adj] 相同的； 同一的','four identical houses  四幢一模一样的房子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_196','unaided','ʌn''edɪd','ʌn''eɪdɪd','[adj] 未受协助的， 独立的','She can no longer walk unaided.  她再也不能独力行走了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_197','ambitious','æm''bɪʃəs','æm''bɪʃəs','[adj] 有雄心的， 有野心的','Alfred was intensely ambitious, obsessed with the idea of becoming rich.  艾尔弗雷德雄心勃勃，一心想着发财。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_198','academic',',ækə''dɛmɪk','ˌækə''demɪk','[adj] 学术的；学校的，学院的；纯理论的; [n] 大学教师','He possessed no academic qualifications.  他没有学历。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_199','coral','''kɔrəl','''kɔːrəl','[adj] 珊瑚色的， 红色的; [n] 珊瑚','It is like the bow of the King of the Persians that is painted with vermilion and is tipped with coral.  你的嘴唇就像是波斯王国的弯弓，那是一张涂上朱砂的弯弓，那是一张头上镶嵌珊瑚的弯弓。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_200','function','''fʌŋkʃən','''fʌŋkʃn','[v] 运行； 起作用; [n] 机能，功能，作用；函数','Her legs have now ceased to function .  她的双腿现在已经丧失正常功能了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_201','raise','rez','reɪz','[v] 举起，提升；直立；增加；募集；饲养，养育；引起；提出; [n] 提升， 增加','Can you raise the lamp so I can see?  你能把灯举高点好让我看清吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_202','delinquency','dɪ''lɪŋkwənsi','dɪ''lɪŋkwənsi','[n] 行为不良； 过失， 失职','the ever-rising statistics of delinquency and crime  青少年违法犯罪不断增加的统计数字'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_203','pipe','paɪp','paɪp','[vt] 用管道输送；用线路系统传输; [n] 管子， 管道； 烟斗','villages with no piped water  没有管道供水的乡村'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_204','pliant','''plaɪənt','''plaɪənt','[adj] 柔软的； 温顺的； 易受影响的','Isabel was pliant in his arms.  伊莎贝尔温顺地依偎在他怀中。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_205','revere','rɪ''vɪr','rɪ''vɪr','[vt] 尊敬， 敬畏','The Chinese revered corn as a gift from heaven.  中国人将谷物奉为天赐礼物。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_206','representative','''rɛprɪ''zɛntətɪv','ˌreprɪ''zentətɪv','[adj] 典型的， 有代表性的; [n] 代表，代理人','The pollsters asked a representative sample of New York residents for their opinions.  民意调查员向一些有代表性的纽约居民征询了意见。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_207','sneaky','''sniki','''sniːki','[adj] 偷偷摸摸的， 鬼鬼祟祟的','a sneaky little trick  鬼鬼祟祟的小把戏'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_208','longitude','''lɑndʒətud','''lɑːngətjuːd','[n] 经度， 经线','The town lies at longitude 12˚ east.  这个镇位于东经12度。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_209','pigeon','''pɪdʒɪn','''pɪdʒɪn','[n] 鸽子','One blue pigeon sitting on a wall.  一只蓝色的鸽子蹲坐在一堵墙上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_210','lax','læks','læks','[adj] 懒散的； 不严格的， 马虎的','One of the problem areas is lax security for airport personnel.  其中一个问题是对机场人员的安全措施不严格。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_211','comparison','kəm''pærɪsn','kəm''pærɪsn','[n] 比较， 对比； 比拟， 比喻','Her paintings invite comparison with those of the early Impressionists (= they remind you of them ) .  她的画作让人想起早期的印象派作品。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_212','lay','le','leɪ','[v] 产； 放置； 铺； 筹划， 设置； 提出， 提交','He laid his hand on my shoulder.  他把一只手搭在我的肩上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_213','hatch','hætʃ','hætʃ','[v] 孵化，孵出; [n] 开口； 舱门','The eggs take three days to hatch.  这些蛋要三天时间才能孵化。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_214','patriot','''petrɪət','''peɪtriət','[n] 爱国者','It has been suggested the founders were not true patriots but men out to protect their own interests.  有人指出创建者并非真正的爱国者，而是一些维护自己利益的人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_215','pernicious','pɚ''nɪʃəs','pər''nɪʃəs','[adj] 有害的， 恶性的','the pernicious effects of poverty  贫穷的危害性'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_216','revert','rɪ''vɝt','rɪ''vɜːrt','[v] 恢复； 归还， 归属','Jackson said her boss became increasingly depressed and reverted to smoking heavily.  杰克逊说她的老板变得越来越抑郁，又重新大量吸烟了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_217','cohabitation','ko,hæbə''teʃən','ˌkouˌhæbɪ''teɪʃn','[n] 同居， 同住','The obligation of cohabitation of spouses is the basis of marital rights.  夫妻间的同居义务是夫妻其他权利与义务的基础。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_218','herbivore','ɝ​bəˌvɔr','''hɜːrbɪvɔːr','[n] 食草动物','Most herbivore teeth are grinders, canines are usually absent.  食草动物的牙齿大部分是臼齿，通常没有犬齿。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_219','successive','sək''sɛsɪv','sək''sesɪv','[adj] 接替的， 继承的； 接连的， 连续的','The team has had five successive victories.  这支球队已经连胜五场了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_220','adventure','əd''vɛntʃɚ','əd''ventʃər','[n] 奇遇； 冒险活动','a great adventure  一大奇遇'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_221','ceremony','ˈsɛrəˌmoʊni','''serəmouni','[n] 典礼， 仪式； 礼节','a wedding ceremony  婚礼'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_222','improve','ɪm''pruv','ɪm''pruːv','[v] 改善， 改进， 增进； 好转， 进步','a course for students wishing to improve their English  为想提高英语水平的学生开设的一门课'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_223','idyllic','aɪ''dɪlɪk','aɪ''dɪlɪk','[adj] 田园诗般的， 田园风光的， 牧歌的','This idyllic pastoral scene is only part of the picture.  但这种田园诗般的乡村风光仅仅是一个侧面。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_224','hawk','hɔk','hɔːk','[n] 鹰，隼；主战分子; [vt] 叫卖， 兜售','Oil thieves sometimes hawk stolen gasoline on the side of highways.  石油大盗们有时在公路边上兜售偷来的石油。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_225','speckle','''spɛkl','''spekl','[v] 弄上斑点；点缀; [n] 斑点； 色斑','AIM: To investigate the relation between left ventricular torsion(LVtor)/ rotation and cardiac cycle in normal persons by speckle tracking imaging(STI).  目的：探讨斑点追踪显像技术（STI）评价正常人心肌旋转及左室扭转与心动周期时相关系的价值。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_226','emanate','ˈɛməˌneɪt','''eməneɪt','[v] 散发； 表现， 显示','He emanates tranquility.  他身上散发着一种恬静气质。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_227','exterior','ɪk''stɪrɪɚ','ɪk''stɪriər','[adj] 外部的，外表的; [n] 外部， 外表','The exterior walls need a new coat of paint.  外墙需要刷新漆了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_228','captivity','kæp''tɪvəti','kæp''tɪvəti','[n] 囚禁， 拘留','The hostages were released from captivity.  人质被释放了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_229','levy','''lɛvi','''levi','[vt] 征收; [n] 征收额； 税款； 征兵','They levied religious taxes on Christian commercial transactions.  他们对基督教的商业交易征收宗教税。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_230','effective','ɪ''fɛktɪv','ɪ''fektɪv','[adj] 有效的， 生效的； 显著的； 实际的， 事实上的','The cheaper drugs are just as effective in treating arthritis.  较便宜的药品对治疗关节炎同样有效。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_231','muscle','''mʌsl','''mʌsl','[n] 肌肉； 体力， 力量， 实力； 影响力','Relax your stomach muscles , then stretch again.  放松腹部肌肉，然后再绷紧。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_232','generous','''dʒɛnərəs','''dʒenərəs','[adj] 慷慨的， 大方的； 大量的， 丰富的； 宽厚的， 宽宏大量的','a generous glass of wine  一大杯葡萄酒'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_233','flux','flʌks','flʌks','[n] 变迁， 不断的变动','Everything is in flux at the moment.  眼下一切都变化不定。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_234','jelly','''dʒɛli','''dʒeli','[n] 果冻， 胶状物','raspberry jelly  山莓果冻'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_235','probe','prob','proub','[v] 探查，探测；盘问，追问; [n] 探针； 探测器； 探索， 调查','Police probed claims that he had sold drugs.  警方就有人称他贩卖毒品一事进行了调查。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_236','crescent','''krɛsnt','''kresnt','[adj] 新月形的；逐渐增强的; [n] 新月； 新月形， 月牙形','a small crescent of pastry topped with cheese  顶上浇有奶酪的新月形油酥小糕点'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_237','inflate','ɪn''flet','ɪn''fleɪt','[v] 充气， 膨胀； 鼓吹， 吹捧； 涨价','It took us half an hour to inflate the dinghy.  我们用了半小时给橡皮筏充好气。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_238','stable','''stebl','''steɪbl','[adj] 稳定的，安定的；牢固的；沉稳的; [n] 马厩','A wide base will make the structure much more stable.  宽大的底座会使结构牢固许多。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_239','quantitative','''kwɑntətetɪv','''kwɑːntəteɪtɪv','[adj] 数量的， 定量的','...the advantages of quantitative and qualitative research.  …定量和定性研究的优点。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_240','clamor','''klæmə','''klæmər','[n] 吵闹， 喧哗',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_241','harness','''hɑrnɪs','''hɑːrnɪs','[vt] 利用…产生动力；给上挽具; [n] 马具','We can harness the power of the wind to generate electricity.  我们可以利用风力发电。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_242','foment','','fou''ment','[vt] 煽动， 挑起， 激起','They were accused of fomenting rebellion.  他们被指控煽动叛乱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_243','respond','rɪ''spɑnd','rɪ''spɑːnd','[vi] 回答， 答复； 作出反应； 响应','They are likely to respond positively to the president''s request for aid.  他们有可能积极地回应该总统的援助请求。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_244','incident','''ɪnsɪdənt','''ɪnsɪdənt','[n] 事情， 事件； 摩擦， 冲突','Am I at risk because of some incident in my sexual past?  我过去性生活中的某件事会使我处于危险境地吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_245','cluster','''klʌstɚ','''klʌstər','[vi] 成群， 成串； 丛生； 群集; [n] 簇，团，串，丛；群','The passengers clustered together in small groups.  乘客们聚集成小群体。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_246','prey','pre','preɪ','[vi] 捕食，捕获; [n] 猎物； 受害者， 牺牲品','The effect was to disrupt the food chain, starving many animals and those that preyed on them.  后果是打断食物链，使许多动物和捕食它们的动物饿死。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_247','attire','ə''taiə','ə''taɪər','[n] 穿着，服饰; [vt] 给…穿衣， 打扮','...seven women dressed in their finest attire.  ...七位着盛装的女士。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_248','tug','tʌɡ','tʌg','[v] 拖，','The woman gently tugged his arm.  那女人轻轻拽了拽他的胳膊。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_249','neuron','''nʊrɑn','''nurɑːn','[n] 神经元， 神经细胞','Between any neurons, between the axon of one neuron and the dendrite of another, there''s a tiny gap.  在神经元之间，在一个神经元的轴突，和另一个神经元的树突之间，有一个细小的缝隙。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_250','vertebrate','''vɝtɪbrət','''vɜːrtɪbrət','[adj] 有脊椎的; [n] 脊椎动物','Dead bodies of vertebrate in the field should not be collected or closely examined.  不要太接近脊椎动物的尸体或收集它们作样本。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_251','expedition',',ɛkspə''dɪʃən','ˌekspə''dɪʃn','[n] 远征； 探险','an expedition to the North Pole  北极探险'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_252','concert','''kɑnsɚt','''kɑːnsərt','[n] 音乐会， 演奏会； 一致','a rock concert  摇滚音乐会'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_253','absorb','æbˈsɔrb; æbˈzɔrb; əbˈsɔrb','əb''sɔːrb','[vt] 吸收； 理解， 掌握； 吸引…的注意， 使全神贯注； 使并入， 同化','Plants absorb nutrients from the soil.  植物从土壤中吸收养分。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_254','supply','sə''plaɪ','sə''plaɪ','[n] 供应；储备；补给; [vt] 供给， 供应； 满足， 弥补','The nation’s fuel supplies will not last forever.  这个国家的燃料供应不会无穷无尽。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_255','concern','kən''sɝn','kən''sɜːrn','[vt] 涉及，关系到；使关心，使担忧; [n] 关心， 挂念； 关系； 有关的事， 负责的事； 公司， 企业','Issues like food additives do concern me.  食品添加剂这类事情确实使我很担心。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_256','circulate','''sɝkjəlet','''sɜːrkjəleɪt','[v] 循环； 流通； 传播， 流传','Swimming helps to get the blood circulating through the muscles.  游泳有助于肌肉的血液循环。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_257','incubate','''ɪŋkjubet','''ɪŋkjubeɪt','[v] 孵化； 培育； 潜伏','The birds returned to their nests and continued to incubate the eggs.  那些鸟儿返巢继续孵卵。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_258','rectify','''rɛktɪfaɪ','''rektɪfaɪ','[vt] 矫正， 纠正； 整顿','I did my best to rectify the situation, but the damage was already done.  我竭尽全力去挽回局面，但损害已经造成了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_259','antonym','''æntənɪm','''æntənɪm','[n] 反义词','a dictionary of synonyms and antonyms  同义词和反义词词典'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_260','integrity','ɪn''tɛɡrəti','ɪn''tegrəti','[n] 正直； 完整','the territorial integrity of the country  国家的领土完整'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_261','refrain','rɪ''fren','rɪ''freɪn','[v] 抑制； 戒除; [n] 反复句，副歌','Mrs. Hardie refrained from making any comment.  哈迪太太忍住了没做任何评论。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_262','pact','pækt','pækt','[n] 协议， 条约， 公约','the Warsaw pact  华沙条约'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_263','notation','no''teʃən','nou''teɪʃn','[n] 符号， 记号','Musical notation was conceived for the C major scale and each line and space represents a note in this scale.  乐谱为C大音阶而构思，在这个音阶中的每一个线和间都代表一个音符。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_264','liable','''laɪəbl','''laɪəbl','[adj] 有责任的， 有义务的； 易于…的','The car is liable to overheat on long trips.  这辆汽车跑长途容易过热。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_265','homing','''homɪŋ','''houmɪŋ','[adj] 有返回原地本能的','Then the pigeons flew into thick fog, and the famous homing instinct failed.  然后这些鸽子飞进浓雾中，著名的归巢本能失灵了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_266','state','stet','steɪt','[v] 陈述， 说明， 声明； 规定; [n] 情况，状况；国家；州','Please state your name and address.  请说出你的姓名和地址。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_267','cargo','''kɑrɡo','''kɑːrgou','[n] 货物','a cargo plane  货机'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_268','press','prɛs','pres','[v] 压， 按， 挤； 压榨， 压迫； 催促， 逼迫; [n] 报刊；新闻界，新闻工作者；报道，评论；出版社；印刷厂；压，按，挤','Manville kept his back pressed flat against the wall.  曼维尔后背紧紧地贴在墙上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_269','jumble','''dʒʌmbl','''dʒʌmbl','[vt] 混杂，掺杂; [n] 杂乱的一堆， 混乱的一团','The photographs were all jumbled up.  照片乱七八糟地堆在一起。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_270','element','''ɛləmənt','''elɪmənt','[n] 元素，要素，组成部分；','Business and management elements are built into the course.  本课程加入了商务和管理方面的内容。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_271','environmental','ɪn,vaɪrən''mɛntl','ɪnˌvaɪrən''mentl','[adj] 有关环境的， 自然环境的， 生态环境的； 环境的','the environmental damage caused by the chemical industry  化学工业对环境造成的破坏'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_272','picky','''pɪki','''pɪki','[adj] 挑剔的， 难以取悦的','He’s a very picky eater .  他很挑食。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_273','crustacean','krʌ''steʃən','krʌ''steɪʃn','[adj] 甲壳类的; [n] 甲壳类动物','Glucosamine can help to synthesize chitin in crustacean shells, which aids growth.  葡萄糖氨是甲壳类动物帮助壳中几丁质的生成，可促进生长。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_274','exclaim','ɪk''sklem','ɪk''skleɪm','[v] 惊叫， 呼喊','‘No!’ she exclaimed in shock.  “不！”她惊呼道。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_275','opposite','ˈɑpəzɪt; ˈɑpəsɪt','''ɑːpəzət','[adj] 对面的；对立的；相反的; [prep] 在…对面; [n] 对立面；对立物','I thought the medicine would make him sleep, but it had the opposite effect.  我以为这药会让他睡觉，但是它却起了反作用。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_276','pack','pæk','pæk','[v] 收拾，打包；捆扎；塞满; [n] 包， 包裹','I forgot to pack my razor.  我忘记把剃须刀放入行李包了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_277','restraint','rɪ''strent','rɪ''streɪnt','[n] 抑制， 克制； 限制； 约束力； 管制措施','The police were praised for their restraint in handling the demonstrators.  警方因对待示威者时所表现出的克制而受到赞扬。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_278','aftermath','''æftəmæθ','''æftərmæθ','[n] 后果， 余波','In the aftermath of the coup, the troops opened fire on the demonstrators.  在那次政变的余波之中，军队向示威者开了枪。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_279','pollutant','pə''lutənt','pə''luːtənt','[n] 污染物质， 有害物质','a dumping ground for toxic pollutants  有毒污染物堆放场'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_280','untapped',',ʌn''tæpt','ˌʌn''tæpt','[adj] 未开发的， 未使用的','Older people are an untapped resource in the employment market.  年龄较大的人是就业市场中有待利用的资源。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_281','cue','kju','kjuː','[n] 暗示， 提示','She stood nervously in the wings waiting for her cue.  她紧张地站在台侧等待出场的提示。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_282','effluent','''ɛflʊənt','''efluənt','[n] 流出物， 废水， 污水','The effluent from the factory was dumped into the river.  那家工厂的污水被排到了河里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_283','untamed',',ʌn''temd','ˌʌn''teɪmd','[adj] 未驯服的， 难驾驭的','This is the issue for Socrates, how to channel this wild and untamed passion of spirit or heart, how to channel this to some kind of common good.  这是苏格拉底面临的难题，如何引导，这野性不驯的精神或内心热情，如何将其引导至某种共同的良善。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_284','stereotype','''stɛrɪətaɪp','''steriətaɪp','[n] 陈规；固定形式，老套；刻板印象; [vt] 对…形成固定看法','There''s always been a stereotype about successful businessmen.  对成功的商人们总有一种成见。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_285','enroll','ɪn''rol','ɪn''roul','[v] 登记， 注册； 招收',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_286','sweeping','''swipɪŋ','''swiːpɪŋ','[adj] 彻底的，广泛的；〈贬〉笼统的，一概而论的; [n] 清扫， 扫除； 垃圾','sweeping generalizations about women drivers  对女性司机一概而论的看法'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_287','ardent','''ɑrdnt','''ɑːrdnt','[adj] 热心的， 热情洋溢的','an ardent supporter of free trade  自由贸易的热心支持者'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_288','cohesive','ko''hisɪv','kou''hiːsɪv','[adj] 黏着的； 使凝结的， 使内聚的','a cohesive community  团结的社区'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_289','battery','''bæt(ə)rɪ','''bætri','[n] 电池； 排炮； 一系列， 一批','You have to take the top off to change the batteries .  你得把顶盖拿掉才能更换电池。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_290','clay','kle','kleɪ','[n] 泥土， 黏土','...the heavy clay soils of Georgia.  …佐治亚州厚重的黏土的土壤。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_291','irreverent','ɪ''rɛvərənt','ɪ''revərənt','[adj] 不敬的','his irreverent sense of humour  他失礼的幽默感'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_292','promote','prə''mot','prə''mout','[vt] 促进； 提升； 宣传， 推销','You don''t have to sacrifice environmental protection to promote economic growth.  你们没有必要牺牲环保来促进经济增长。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_293','façade','','fə''sɑːd','[n] 正面； 表面','The volume and the façade are the only territories of design freedom, along with some decisions with respect to finishes in the lobbies and the parking areas.  建筑体量与立面是建筑师唯一可自由发挥的地方，以及关于大堂和停车场装饰装修方面的某些决策，也可以自行决定。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_294','divorce','dɪ''vɔrs','dɪ''vɔːrs','[v] 与…离婚； 使分离， 使脱离; [n] 离婚；分离，脱离','David’s parents divorced when he was six.  戴维的父母在他六岁时离婚了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_295','distribute','dɪ''strɪbjut','dɪ''strɪbjuːt','[vt] 分配， 分发； 散布','a man distributing leaflets to passers-by  一个向路人派发传单的男子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_296','attach','ə''tætʃ','ə''tætʃ','[vt] 连接； 依附于； 系， 贴， 连接； 使依恋， 使喜爱 ； 认为有','It’s easy to become attached to the children you work with.  你很容易就会喜欢上工作中接触到的孩子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_297','cornerstone','''kɔrnɚston','''kɔːrnərstoun','[n] 墙角石， 奠基石； 基础','Research is the cornerstone of the profession.  研究是该职业的基石。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_298','quiz','kwɪz','kwɪz','[n] 小测验；智力竞赛; [vt] 测验； 盘问， 查问， 询问','a love quiz in a magazine  杂志上的爱情问答'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_299','inclination','''ɪnklə''neʃən','ˌɪnklɪ''neɪʃn','[n] 爱好， 意愿； 趋向， 趋势； 倾斜度','My natural inclination was to say no.  我生性爱说“不”。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_300','participate','pɑr''tɪsə''pet','pɑːr''tɪsɪpeɪt','[vi] 参与， 参加','Some members refused to participate.  有些会员拒绝参加。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_301','ingredient','ɪn''ɡridɪənt','ɪn''griːdiənt','[n] 成分， 要素； 原料','Combine all the ingredients in a large bowl.  把所有食材都放在一个大碗里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_302','consolidate','kən''sɑlɪdet','kən''sɑːlɪdeɪt','[v] 巩固； 合并','The company has consolidated its position as the country’s leading gas supplier.  这家公司巩固了作为该国主要煤气供应商的地位。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_303','biochemical','''baɪo''kɛmɪkl','ˌbaɪou''kemɪkl','[adj] 生物化学的， 生化的','Starvation brings biochemical changes in the body.  饥饿引起体内的生化变化。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_304','librarian','laɪ''brɛrɪən','laɪ''breriən','[n] 图书馆馆长； 图书管理员','The new librarian is a friend of mine.  这位新来的图书管理员是我的朋友。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_305','contour','''kɑntʊr','''kɑːntur','[n] 等高线； 轮廓','the contours of the hills  群山的轮廓'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_306','lyric','''lɪrɪk','''lɪrɪk','[adj] 抒情的; [n] 抒情诗；','Wordsworth was one of the greatest lyric poets of his time.  华兹华斯是他那个时代最伟大的抒情诗人之一。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_307','suborn','sə''bɔrn','sə''bɔːrn','[vt] 收买， 买通， 唆使','an attempt to suborn a witness  收买证人的企图'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_308','clan','klæn','klæn','[n] 家族， 宗族， 氏族； 帮派','the Campbell clan  坎贝尔家族'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_309','purple','''pɝpl','''pɜːrpl','[adj] 紫色的; [n] 紫色','His face turned purple with rage.  他气得脸色发紫。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_310','quit','kwɪt','kwɪt','[v] 停止； 放弃； 离开； 辞','The landlord gave them notice to quit the premises within seven days.  房东通知他们七天之内搬出去。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_311','clam','klæm','klæm','[n] 蛤， 蛤肉； 〈口〉守口如瓶的人， 寡言的人','clam chowder (= a type of soup )  蛤蜊杂烩汤'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_312','economical',',ɛkə''nɑmɪkl','ˌiːkə''nɑːmɪkl','[adj] 经济的， 实惠的； 节俭的， 节约的； 精打细算的','A small car is more economical to run.  开小型汽车比较省油。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_313','polish','''pɑlɪʃ','''pɑːlɪʃ','[v] 磨光， 擦亮； 修改， 润色; [n] 上光剂','I spent all afternoon polishing the silver.  我整个下午都在擦拭银器。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_314','cabinet','''kæbɪnət','''kæbɪnət','[n] 内阁； 储藏柜， 陈列柜','a cabinet meeting  内阁会议'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_315','ordinal','''ɔrdənl','''ɔːrdənl','[adj] 序数的；顺序的; [n] 序数词','Net of all the other variables included in the ordinal multiple regression equations, education is not significantly correlated with the frequency of binge drinking and getting drunk.  与多重序数回归中的其他变量交互比较后发现，受教育水平与狂欢式饮酒及醉酒频率的相关并不显著。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_316','insurance','ɪn''ʃʊrəns','ɪn''ʃurəns','[n] 保险； 保险费； 保险业','Your father took out insurance to cover the mortgage.  你父亲购买了抵押借款保险。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_317','principle','''prɪnsəpl','''prɪnsəpl','[n] 原则； 原理； 道德准则， 行为规范； 信念','Schools try to teach children a set of principles.  学校设法教给孩子们一套道德准则。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_318','tedious','''tidɪəs','''tiːdiəs','[adj] 单调乏味的， 令人厌烦的','The work was tiring and tedious.  这工作既累人又枯燥。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_319','source','sɔrs','sɔːrs','[n] 源， 源泉； 来源， 出处； 信息来源','They get their money from various sources.  他们从各种途径弄到钱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_320','telecommunication',',tɛlɪkə,mjʊnə''keʃən','ˌtelikəˌmjuːnɪ''keɪʃn','[n] 电信','Connect wires and pipes for water, power and telecommunication from outside to the site specified in special terms to meet construction demands.  将施工所需水、电、电讯线路从施工场地外部接至专用条款约定地点，保证施工期间的需要； ；'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_321','participant','pɑr''tɪsəpənt','pɑːr''tɪsɪpənt','[n] 参与者； 参赛者','40 of the course participants are offered employment with the company.  参加课程学习的人中有40名得到了在该公司工作的机会。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_322','initiate','ɪ''nɪʃɪet','ɪ''nɪʃɪeɪt','[vt] 发起， 开始， 创始； 接纳， 让…加入; [n] 新加入组织的人','They have decided to initiate legal proceedings against the newspaper.  他们决定向该报提起法律诉讼。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_323','domestic','də''mɛstɪk','də''mestɪk','[adj] 国内的； 家庭的； 驯养的','Unfortunately his domestic life wasn’t very happy.  不幸的是，他的家庭生活并不幸福。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_324','detergent','dɪ''tɝdʒənt','dɪ''tɜːrdʒənt','[adj] 净化的， 清洁的; [n] 清洁剂','During dry place, keep within the new air circulation, avoid rain and insolate, also can use some detergent to remove odor.  在晾置期间，要保持新居内空气的流通，避免雨淋及曝晒，还可采用一些去除气味的清洁剂。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_325','glare','ɡlɛr','gler','[v] 怒目而视； 发出刺眼的光; [n] 耀眼的光；怒视，瞪眼','The sun glared down on us.  刺眼的阳光照在我们身上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_326','terrestrial','tə''rɛstrɪəl','tə''restriəl','[adj] 陆地的， 陆生的， 陆栖的； 地球的','...terrestrial life forms.  …地球上的生命形态。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_327','deception','dɪ''sɛpʃən','dɪ''sepʃn','[n] 骗局； 诡计； 欺骗， 欺诈','She didn’t have the courage to admit to her deception.  她没有勇气承认自己的欺骗行为。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_328','compile','kəm''paɪl','kəm''paɪl','[vt] 汇编； 编辑， 编纂','The document was compiled by the Department of Health.  这份文件是由卫生部汇编的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_329','bias','''baɪəs','''baɪəs','[n] 偏见，偏心; [vt] 使有偏见， 使偏心','Students were evaluated without bias.  对学生的评估都是公正的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_330','fume','fjum','fjuːm','[vi] 冒烟； 大为恼火',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_331','budget','''bʌdʒɪt','''bʌdʒɪt','[v] 做预算; [adj] 价格低廉的; [n] 预算','We’ll have to budget more carefully.  我们必须更仔细地安排开支。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_332','radiate','''redɪet','''reɪdieɪt','[v] 辐射， 发射； 流露， 显示； 自中心向各方伸展','He radiated calm confidence.  他身上散发着沉稳自信的气质。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_333','tension','''tɛnʃən','''tenʃn','[n] 紧张； 拉紧； 张力','The tension was becoming unbearable, and I wanted to scream.  这种紧张变得难以忍受，我真想大声尖叫。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_334','tenuous','''tɛnjuəs','''tenjuəs','[adj] 纤细的； 稀薄的； 脆弱的','For now, the band’s travel plans are tenuous.  乐队的巡演计划暂时还没确定。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_335','reflection','rɪ''flɛkʃən','rɪ''flekʃn','[n] 反映； 映像； 深思， 考虑； 回忆； 记录， 描述','Can you see your reflection in the glass?  你能看到玻璃里你的影像吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_336','campus','''kæmpəs','''kæmpəs','[n] 校园','a beautiful campus in New England  新英格兰的一个美丽校园'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_337','ultimate','ˈʌltəmɪt','''ʌltɪmət','[adj] 最后的，最终的；根本的; [n] 最好的事物； 最大的或最先进的事物','The ultimate outcome of the experiment cannot be predicted.  试验的最后结果无法预测。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_338','prosecute','''prɑsɪ''kjʊt','''prɑːsɪkjuːt','[v] 起诉， 控告， 检举； 担任控方律师； 继续从事','Shoplifters will be prosecuted.  在商店行窃者将被起诉。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_339','verbal','''vɝbl','''vɜːrbl','[adj] 口头的； 言辞的； 动词的','verbal skills  语言技能'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_340','district','''dɪstrɪkt','''dɪstrɪkt','[n] 地区， 区域； 管区， 行政区','a postal district  邮政区'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_341','arboreal','ɑr''bɔrɪəl','ɑːr''bɔːriəl','[adj] 树栖的； 树木的','...arboreal marsupials which resemble monkeys.  ...类猴树栖有袋动物。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_342','overall',',ovə''rɔl','''əʊvərɔːl','[adv] 总共; [adj] 全面的，综合的; [n] 工作服， 工装裤','Williams came fifth overall.  威廉斯的总排名是第五。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_343','assume','ə''sum','ə''suːm','[vt] 假定； 承担','I think we can safely assume (=  it is almost certain  ) that interest rates will go up again soon.  我想我们几乎可以肯定，利率很快会再次上调。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_344','pepper','''pɛpɚ','''pepər','[n] 胡椒；辣椒; [vt] 撒胡椒粉； 大量给予','salt and pepper  盐和胡椒粉'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_345','mellow','''mɛlo','''melou','[adj] 醇香的；柔和的；成熟的; [v] 醇香； 柔和； 成熟','the mellow golden light of early evening  傍晚时分柔和的金色光线'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_346','concept','''kɑnsɛpt','''kɑːnsept','[n] 概念， 观念； 设想','a new concept in business travel  商务旅行的新理念'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_347','impersonal','ɪm''pɝsnl','ɪm''pɜːrsənl','[adj] 没有人情味的， 冷淡的； 客观的','Business letters do not have to be impersonal and formal.  商业信函并非一定要刻板而缺乏人情味。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_348','millennium','məˈlɛniəm','mɪ''leniəm','[n] 一千年，千年期','people who have inhabited this land for millennia  在这片土地上已经居住了数千年的人们'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_349','resistant','rɪ''zɪstənt','rɪ''zɪstənt','[adj] 抵抗的， 有抵抗力的； 抵制的； 抗…的， 耐…的','Some people are very resistant to the idea of exercise.  一些人对锻炼的主意非常抵制。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_350','salamander','''sæləmændɚ','''sæləmændər','[n] 火蜥蜴； 火蛇',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_351','disaster','dɪ''zæstɚ','dɪ''zæstər','[n] 灾难； 彻底的失败','One hundred and twenty people died in China’s worst air disaster .  有120人在中国这起最惨烈的空难事故中丧生。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_352','stark','stɑrk','stɑːrk','[adv] 十足; [adj] 赤裸的；严酷的，严峻的；明显的，鲜明的；十足的，极端的','The movie shows the stark realities of life in the ghetto.  这部影片展示了贫民区生活的严酷现实。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_353','hitch','hɪtʃ','hɪtʃ','[v] 搭便车；提起，拉起；拴住; [n] 故障， 障碍','There was no garage in sight, so I hitched a lift into town.  附近没有汽车修理厂，于是我搭便车进了城。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_354','perceptual','pɚ''sɛptʃuəl',' pər ''septʃʊəl ','[adj] 感知的， 知觉的','Some children have more finely trained perceptual skills than others.  一些孩子比其他孩子具备更为训练有素的感知技能。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_355','furry','ˈfɜri','''fɜːri','[adj] 毛皮似的； 盖着毛皮的； 生苔的','furry kittens  毛茸茸的小猫'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_356','enhance','ɪn''hæns','ɪn''hæns','[vt] 提高； 增强','Good lighting will enhance any room.  良好的照明能给房间增色不少。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_357','convention','kən''vɛnʃən','kən''venʃn','[n] 会议； 习俗， 惯例； 公约','a teachers’ convention  教师大会'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_358','cranial','''krenɪəl','''kreɪniəl','[n] 头盖骨的， 颅骨的','Methods: The location of bony "window" and mastoid foramen were studied , and the distance from bony "window" to cerebellopontine angle was measured on 18 dry and 12 wet cranial bones.  方法：采用干性颅骨18具，福尔马林固定的头颅标本12具分别进行骨窗及乳突孔的定位测量和桥小脑角结构距骨窗的距离测定。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_359','purchase','''pɝtʃəs','''pɜːrtʃəs','[n] 购买；购买的物品; [vt] 购买','She paid for her purchases and left.  她付钱买好东西离开了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_360','shore','ʃɔr','ʃɔːr','[n] 滨，岸; [vt] 支撑， 支持','We could see a boat about a mile from shore.  我们看见离岸边大约一英里的地方有一艘船。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_361','teem','tim','tiːm','[vi] 充满， 到处都是','For most of the year, the area is teeming with tourists.  一年的大部分时间里这个地方都挤满了游客。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_362','anomie','''ænəmi','''ænəmi','[n] 社会道德沦丧， 失范； 混乱','The moral management is a new concept derived from the social management. But which it faces is still the old problems of moral anomie and reconstruction of social order.  道德治理是由社会治理衍生的新概念，但面对的依然是社会道德秩序失范与重建的老问题。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_363','chlorine','''klɔrin','''klɔːriːn','[n] 氯','One of the products of this breakdown is the element chlorine.  这种分解过程的产物之一是元素氯。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_364','manage','''mænɪdʒ','''mænɪdʒ','[v] 勉力完成； 应付； 操纵， 控制； 管理','He was asked to manage a new department.  他被要求去管理一个新的部门。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_365','equal','''ikwəl','''iːkwəl','[adj] 相同的; [vt] 等于；相当于; [n] 同等的人； 相等的事物','Investors can borrow an amount equal to the property''s purchase price.  投资者可以借与房地产购买价相等数额的款项。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_366','stylish','''staɪlɪʃ','''staɪlɪʃ','[adj] 漂亮的， 时髦的； 高雅的， 有格调的','a stylish woman in her forties  一名40多岁的时髦女子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_367','marvel','''mɑrvl','''mɑːrvl','[v] 对…感到惊异，大为赞叹; [n] 令人惊异的人， 奇迹； 不凡的成果','‘The man is a genius,’ marvelled Claire.  “这人是个天才。”克莱尔赞叹道。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_368','silicon','''sɪlɪkən','''sɪlɪkən','[n] 硅','But the brittleness of silicon limits its uses.  但是，硅的脆性也限制了其应用范围。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_369','silicate','''sɪlɪket','''sɪlɪkeɪt','[n] 硅酸盐','Beryl is a beryllium-aluminum silicate, and its color comes from small amounts of chromium.  绿宝石其实是一种铍铝硅酸盐，而它的颜色则来自于微量的铬元素。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_370','fund','fʌnd','fʌnd','[n] 基金，专款；储备，蕴藏；; [vt] 为…提供资金','The fund was set up to try to save the cathedral.  设立基金以挽救大教堂。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_371','gravity','ˈɡrævətɪ','''grævəti','[n] 重力； 严重性； 严肃， 庄严','the force of gravity  重力'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_372','recipient','rɪ''sɪpɪənt','rɪ''sɪpiənt','[n] 接受者， 收受者','...the largest recipient of U.S. foreign aid.  …最大的美国对外援助接受方。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_373','mesmerize','''mɛzməraɪz','''mezməraɪz','[vt] 施催眠术； 使入迷， 迷住','The first time I saw Diana I was mesmerized by her beauty.  我第一次见到戴安娜就被她的美貌迷住了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_374','finance','''faɪnæns','''faɪnæns','[vt] 给…提供资金; [n] 财政，金融；','The concerts are financed by the Arts Council.  音乐会由艺术协会出资举办。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_375','stash','stæʃ','stæʃ','[vt] 隐藏，藏匿; [n] 贮藏物','We went for the bottle of whisky that we had stashed behind the bookcase.  我们去取那瓶我们藏在书柜后面的威士忌。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_376','parking','''pɑrkɪŋ','''pɑːrkɪŋ','[n] 机动车停放； 停车场','No Parking (= used on signs )  禁止停车'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_377','studio','''studɪo','''stjuːdiou','[n] 工作室， 画室； 摄影室， 演播室， 录音室； 练习室； 电影公司','a TV studio  电视演播室'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_378','incur','ɪn''kɝ','ɪn''kɜːr','[vt] 招致， 招惹， 遭受','The government had also incurred huge debts.  政府也已承受了大笔债务。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_379','downward','''daʊnwɚd','''daunwərd','[adv] 向下，往下; [adj] 向下的','...from the president downward.  …自总经理而下。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_380','plump','plʌmp','plʌmp','[adj] 微胖的； 丰满的','The nurse was a cheerful plump woman.  那护士是个性格开朗、体形丰满的女人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_381','abreast','ə''brɛst','ə''brest','[adv] 并列地， 并排地','As the car drew abreast of him, Jack suddenly recognised the driver.  那辆车追上来与杰克并行时，他一下子就认出了驾车的人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_382','recoil','''rikɔɪl','rɪ''kɔɪl','[vi] 弹回；后退，退缩；产生后坐力; [n] 后退， 退缩； 反冲， 后坐力','We recoil in horror from the thought of subjecting someone to extreme pain.  想到要让一个人经受极度的痛苦，我们就会恐惧地退缩。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_383','regulate','''rɛɡjulet','''regjuleɪt','[v] 管理， 控制； 调整， 调节； 校准','strict rules regulating the use of chemicals in food  限制化学品在食物中使用的严格规定'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_384','interactive',',ɪntɚ''æktɪv','ˌɪntər''æktɪv','[adj] 交互式的； 合作的， 互相配合的','interactive computer systems  交互式电脑系统'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_385','listless','''lɪstləs','''lɪstləs','[adj] 倦怠的， 没精打采的','The heat was making me listless.  炎热的天气使我懒洋洋的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_386','gland','ɡlænd','glænd','[n] 腺','the pituitary gland  脑垂体腺'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_387','complementary','''kɑmplə''mɛntri','ˌkɑːmplɪ''mentri','[adj] 补充的； 互补的','The computer and the human mind have different but complementary abilities.  电脑与人脑各不相同，却又互为补充。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_388','consistency','kən''sɪstənsi','kən''sɪstənsi','[n] 浓度， 密度； 一致性， 协调； 连接， 结合','She scores goals with remarkable consistency.  她以非凡的连贯性进球得分。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_389','ordeal','ɔr''dil','ɔːr''diːl','[n] 折磨； 严峻考验','He was beginning to wonder if he would survive the ordeal.  他开始怀疑自己能否熬过这场磨难。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_390','primate','''praɪmet','''praɪmeɪt','[n] 灵长类， 灵长目动物； 大主教','The woolly spider monkey is the largest primate in the Americas.  绒毛蛛猴是美洲最大的灵长目动物。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_391','wispy','','''wɪspi','[adj] 成束的； 纤细的','The white floodlight shines through the wispy tule and makes thin shadows.  白色的灯光透过一缕缕的湖藨草，投下纤细的影子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_392','premise','ˈpremɪs','''premɪs','[n] 房屋和地基， 经营场址； 前提， 假设','Schools may earn extra money by renting out their premises.  学校通过出租房屋场地可以获取额外收入。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_393','colonize','''kɑlənaɪz','''kɑːlənaɪz','[vt] 聚居于， 大批生长于； 开拓殖民地， 移居于','a dead tree that has been colonized by ants  被蚂蚁占据的一棵死树'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_394','season','''sizn','''siːzn','[n] 季节； 时节； 时期','the effect on plants as the seasons start to change  换季对植物的影响'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_395','controversial',',kɑntrə''vɝʃl','ˌkɑːntrə''vɜːrʃl','[adj] 引起争论的， 有争议的','the controversial issue of welfare reform  福利改革这一有争议的话题'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_396','attain','ə''ten','ə''teɪn','[vt] 达到； 获得','More women are attaining positions of power.  越来越多的女性获得要职。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_397','tenant','''tɛnənt','''tenənt','[n] 房客，承租人; [vt] 居住','The desk was left by the previous tenant.  书桌是上一个房客留下来的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_398','gallery','''gæləri','''gæləri','[n] 画廊， 美术馆','an exhibition of African art at the Hayward Gallery  海沃德美术馆的非洲艺术展览'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_399','restoration','''rɛstə''reʃən','ˌrestə''reɪʃn','[n] 恢复； 整修， 修复； 复位， 复原； 归还','Major restoration work will begin in May.  大规模的修复工作将在5月开始。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_400','pale','pel','peɪl','[vi] 变得苍白， 变得暗淡; [adj] 苍白的；淡色的；暗淡的，微弱的','Kent’s face paled when he saw that Rob had a knife.  肯特看到罗布拿着把刀子，顿时面无血色。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_401','hardware','''hɑrdwɛr','''hɑːrdwer','[n] 五金制品， 金属制品； 硬件','...a shop from which an uncle had sold hardware and timber.  …一家叔叔曾经在那里卖五金器具和木材的店铺。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_402','batter','''bætɚ','''bætər','[v] 连续猛击; [n] 击球手； 面糊','He was battered to death .  他被殴打致死。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_403','wretch','rɛtʃ','retʃ','[n] 不幸的人； 恶棍， 无赖','He was a lonely, miserable wretch.  他是一个孤独的可怜虫。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_404','priority','praɪ''ɔrəti','praɪ''ɔːrəti','[n] 优先权， 优先； 优先考虑的事， 最重要的事','I want to start work on the garden but the house must take priority .  我想开始整修花园，不过还是先得打扫屋子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_405','metallic','mə''tælɪk','mə''tælɪk','[adj] 金属般的； 金属制的； 含金属的','The key turned in the lock with a loud metallic click.  钥匙在锁里转动发出金属撞击的咔嗒声。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_406','creative','krɪ''etɪv','kri''eɪtɪv','[adj] 有创造力的， 创造性的','This job is so boring. I wish I could do something more creative.  这工作太单调了，我希望能做些更有创造性的事情。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_407','mythology','mɪ''θɑlədʒi','mɪ''θɑːlədʒi','[n] 神话； 神话学； 虚幻的想法','characters from classical mythology  古典神话中的人物'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_408','shuttle','''ʃʌtl','''ʃʌtl','[v] 穿梭往返；短程往返运送; [n] 航天飞机； 梭子； 航班','The passengers were shuttled to the hotel by bus.  旅客由班车送到酒店。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_409','allocate','''æləket','''æləkeɪt','[vt] 分配， 分派， 把…拨给','Tickets are limited and will be allocated to those who apply first.  票数有限，将分配给那些先申请的人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_410','bagel','''beɡl','''beɪgl','[n] 硬面包圈','Imagine the economy is a bagel bakery struggling through a slow week.  设想经济是一家百吉饼面包店正挣扎着度过一个低潮期。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_411','primary','''praɪmɛri','''praɪmeri','[adj] 最初的； 首要的； 基本的','Our primary concern is to provide the refugees with food and health care.  我们的头等大事是向难民提供食品和医疗。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_412','log','lɔɡ','lɔːg','[n] 原木，木材；日志，航海日志，飞行日志; [vt] 记录； 伐木','a roaring log fire  原木燃烧的熊熊大火'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_413','enterprise','''ɛntɚ''praɪz','''entərpraɪz','[n] 企业， 公司； 事业','commercial enterprises such as banks and food manufacturers  银行和食品制造厂等商业企业'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_414','falcon','''fælkən','''fælkən','[n] 猎鹰， 隼',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_415','ventilation',',vɛntl''eʃən','ˌventɪ''leɪʃn','[n] 通风设备； 空气流通','I see no ventilation to speak of, none from a window or a ventilator at least.  我看不到通风设备，连窗户或至少一个通风扇也没有。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_416','solar','''solɚ','''soulər','[adj] 太阳的， 日光的； 太阳能的','a solar eclipse  日食'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_417','consume','kənˈsum','kən''suːm','[vt] 消耗， 损耗； 消费； 吃， 喝； 使充满； 烧毁， 毁灭','Only 27% of the paper we consume is recycled.  我们消耗的纸张只有 27% 得到回收利用。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_418','formation','fɔr''meʃən','fɔːr''meɪʃn','[n] 形成， 构成； 形成物； 编队','We now know a lot more about the early stages of planetary formation.  我们现在对行星形成过程的早期阶段有了更多的了解。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_419','psychoanalysis','''saɪkoə''næləsɪs','ˌsaɪkouə''næləsɪs','[n] 心理分析， 精神分析','In theory, psychoanalysis is the philosophy of the unconscious mind; in practice it is a means by which mental disorders can be cured.  在理论上，精神分析是一门关于无意识心理的哲学；在实践上，它又是一种治愈心理紊乱的方法。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_420','bilingualism','baɪ''lɪŋgwəlɪzəm','ˌbaɪ''lɪŋgwəlɪzəm','[n] 双语现象','I recently had the pleasure of conducting an interview with him on bilingualism, translation, and interpreting.  我最近有幸就双语教育，笔译和口译方面的有关问题对他进行了一次采访。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_421','competence','''kɑmpɪtəns','''kɑːmpɪtəns','[n] 能力， 胜任； 权限； 技能','Typing is considered by most employers to be a basic competence.  大多数雇主认为打字是一项基本技能。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_422','fuse','fjuz','fjuːz','[v] 融合；熔接；熔化；因保险丝烧断而断电；合并; [n] 保险丝； 引信； 导火线','Their music fuses elements as diverse as Cajun, bebop and Cuban waltzes.  他们的音乐融合了卡津音乐、博普爵士乐和古巴华尔兹等不同元素。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_423','frivolous','''frɪvələs','''frɪvələs','[adj] 琐碎的， 无关紧要的； 愚蠢的， 可笑的； 无聊的， 不严肃的， 轻佻的','The court discourages frivolous law suits.  法院不鼓励随意上诉。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_424','pretext','''pritɛkst','''priːtekst','[n] 借口， 托词','He’ll phone on some pretext or other.  他会以这样或那样的理由打电话的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_425','emergent','ɪ''mɝdʒənt','i''mɜːrdʒənt','[adj] 突现的； 新兴的； 紧急的','...an emergent state.  ...一个新兴国家。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_426','assure','ə''ʃʊr','ə''ʃur','[vt] 确保； 使确信','The document is genuine, I can assure you .  我能向你保证，这文件是真的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_427','consult','kən''sʌlt','kən''sʌlt','[v] 请教； 商议； 参考， 翻阅','If symptoms persist, consult a doctor without delay.  如果症状持续的话，马上咨询医生。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_428','funding','''fʌndɪŋ','''fʌndɪŋ','[n] 基金， 资金； 提供资金','They hope for government funding for the programme.  他们希望得到政府为这一计划提供的资金。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_429','survive','sɚ''vaɪv','sər''vaɪv','[v] 幸免， 幸存； 继续存在， 存货； 艰难度过； 比…长命','...the sequence of events that left the eight pupils battling to survive in icy seas for over four hours.  …使4名小学生在冰冷的海洋中挣扎求生超过4个小时的一连串事件。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_430','initial','ɪ''nɪʃəl','ɪ''nɪʃl','[adj] 开始的，最初的; [n] 词首大写字母','an initial investment of £5,000  5,000英镑的初始投资'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_431','rudimentary',',rudɪ''mɛntri','ˌruːdɪ''mentri','[adj] 未充分发展的， 原始的； 基本的， 基础的','Gradually, I acquired a rudimentary knowledge of music.  我逐渐掌握了基本的音乐知识。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_432','adversary','''ædvɚsɛri','''ædvərseri','[n] 对手， 敌手','his old adversary  他的老对手'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_433','postulate','''pɑstʃəlet','''pɑːstʃəleɪt','[vt] 假定， 假设','He dismissed arguments postulating differing standards for human rights in different cultures and regions.  他无法接受的是假定人权标准在不同文化和地区有所不同。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_434','infest','ɪn''fɛst','ɪn''fest','[vt] 大批滋生， 大批出没于','...pests like aphids which infest cereal crops.  …像蚜虫那样大肆侵害谷类作物的害虫。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_435','satiric','sə''tɪrɪk','sə''tɪrɪk','[adj] 讽刺的， 嘲讽的','Among her early works is a satiric portrayal of the upper-middle class imagery of a woman working within the peach trees, or in a flower garden.  梁缨早期的作品当中的意境饱含对中产及以上阶级的讽刺与挖苦，例如描绘桃树下或花园中散步的女人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_436','eternal','ɪ''tɝnl','ɪ''tɜːrnl','[adj] 永恒的， 不朽的','the Christian promise of eternal life  基督教承诺的永生'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_437','crumple','''krʌmpl','''krʌmpl','[v] 变皱， 起皱； 破裂； 崩溃， 垮台','She crumpled the paper in her hand.  她把手中的纸揉成了一团。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_438','satire','''sætaɪɚ','''sætaɪər','[n] 讽刺文学， 讽刺作品； 讽刺','the characteristic use of satire in Jonson’s work  琼森作品中讽刺手法的独到运用'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_439','prevalent','''prɛvələnt','''prevələnt','[adj] 流行的， 普遍的','the prevalent belief in astrology  对占星术的普遍相信'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_440','cling','klɪŋ','klɪŋ','[vi] 附着， 黏住； 紧紧抓住； 挨近','Some children tend to cling on their first day at school.  有些小孩在上学第一天往往会有恋家的情绪。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_441','clip','klɪp','klɪp','[v] 夹住，扣住；修剪；剪下; [n] 夹子， 回形针， 别针； 弹夹， 弹仓； 电影片段， 剪报','a stack of bills clipped together  夹在一起的一沓钞票'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_442','oasis','o''esɪs','ou''eɪsɪs','[n] 绿洲； 避风港','The immaculately tended gardens are an oasis in the midst of Cairo''s urban sprawl.  那些打理得非常整洁的花园是杂乱扩张的开罗市区中的一片绿洲。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_443','nutrient','''nutrɪənt','''nuːtriənt','[adj] 滋养的， 有营养的; [n] 滋养物，营养品','To examine the global impact of acidification, the researchers developed a series of world maps to show current coal use, nutrient consumption, and copper production and smelting by country.  为检验酸性化过程对全球的影响，研究者们描绘出一系列世界地图来展示近期煤炭利用、营养消费和铜矿生产、冶炼的国家。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_444','compact','''kɑmpækt','kəm''pækt','[adj] 紧凑的；简洁的; [vt] 压缩','The bushes grew in a compact mass.  灌木长成茂密的一片。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_445','outlaw','''aʊtlɔ','''autlɔː','[vt] 宣布…为非法; [n] 罪犯， 歹徒， 亡命之徒； 被剥夺法律权益者','The bill would have outlawed several types of guns.  这项法案将全面禁用几种枪支。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_446','irrigate','''ɪrəget','''ɪrɪgeɪt','[vt] 灌溉； 冲洗','The water in Lake Powell is used to irrigate the area.  包尔湖的水被用来灌溉该地区。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_447','shrivel','''ʃrɪvl','''ʃrɪvl','[v] 枯萎','The leaves change colour, then shrivel.  树叶变了颜色，然后干枯了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_448','encrust','','ɪn''krʌst','[v] 在表面形成硬壳， 结壳； 用…装饰外层',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_449','upsurge','''ʌpsɝdʒ','''ʌpsɜːrdʒ','[n] 高涨； 激增','...the upsurge in oil prices.  …油价的暴涨。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_450','dam','dæm','dæm','[n] 坝，堤; [vt] 筑坝； 控制','Before the dam was built, Campbell River used to flood in the spring.  大坝建好之前，坎贝尔河常在春季发大水。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_451','bloom','blum','bluːm','[v] 开花; [n] 花；开花；青春焕发','These plants bloom in spring.  这些植物在春天开花。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_452','denote','dɪ''not','dɪ''nout','[v] 表示， 意指； 标示， 预示， 象征','What does the word ‘curriculum’ denote that ‘course’ does not?  curriculum一词的哪些含义是course没有的？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_453','zone','zon','zoun','[vt] 将…划做特殊区域；分区，划分地带; [n] 地区， 地域， 地带； 气候带','The land is currently zoned for residential use.  这片土地目前被划为住宅用地。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_454','audible','''ɔdəbl','''ɔːdəbl','[adj] 听得见的','His voice was barely audible (=  could only just be heard  ) above the roar of the crowd.  人声嘈杂，几乎听不见他的说话声。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_455','exhort','ɪɡ''zɔrt','ɪg''zɔːrt','[vt] 劝告， 规劝， 告诫','Kennedy exhorted his listeners to turn away from violence.  肯尼迪劝告他的听众要远离暴力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_456','propagate','''prɑpə''get','''prɑːpəgeɪt','[v] 繁殖； 散布， 传播','The group launched a website to propagate its ideas .  这个团体建了一个网站来宣扬他们的主张。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_457','checked','tʃɛkt','tʃekt','[adj] 格子花纹的； 棋盘状的','He was wearing blue jeans and a checked shirt.  他穿着蓝色牛仔裤和一件格子衬衫。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_458','necessitate','nə''sɛsɪtet','nə''sesɪteɪt','[vt] 需要， 使成为必要','Lack of money necessitated a change of plan.  由于缺乏资金，只能改变计划。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_459','orthodox','''ɔrθədɑks','''ɔːrθədɑːks','[adj] 传统的； 正统的','orthodox medical treatments  传统疗法'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_460','depredation',',dɛprə''deʃən','ˌdeprə''deɪʃn','[n] 劫掠， 掠夺， 破坏','Much of the region''s environmental depredation is a result of poor planning.  这个地区的环境破坏大都是规划不周的结果。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_461','combination',',kɑmbɪ''neʃən','ˌkɑːmbɪ''neɪʃn','[n] 结合， 混合； 化合； 组合','a combination nightclub and café  夜总会兼咖啡馆'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_462','ambush','''æmbʊʃ','''æmbuʃ','[n&vt] 埋伏， 伏击','The soldiers were killed in an ambush.  那些士兵遭伏击身亡。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_463','jewelry','''dʒʊəlri','''dʒuːəlri','[n] 〈总称〉首饰； 珠宝',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_464','obtain','əb''ten','əb''teɪn','[v] 获得； 通用， 流行','These conditions no longer obtain.  这些状况已不复存在。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_465','statesman','''stetsmən','''steɪtsmən','[n] 政治家','a respected elder statesman  一位受人尊敬的政界元老'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_466','quadruple','kwɑ''drupl','kwɑː''druːpl','[v] 成四倍; [adj] 四部分组成的；四倍的; [n] 四倍','Food prices quadrupled during the war.  战争期间食品价格翻了两番。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_467','adept','ə''dɛpt','ə''dept','[adj] 熟练的，精通的，内行的; [n] 行家， 熟手','I’m afraid she’s also an adept liar.  恐怕她还是一个撒谎专家。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_468','curiosity',',kjʊrɪ''ɑsəti','ˌkjuri''ɑːsəti','[n] 好奇心， 求知欲； 罕见而有趣之物， 珍品','I opened the packet just to satisfy my curiosity .  我打开包裹只是为了满足我的好奇心。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_469','repute','rɪ''pjut','rɪ''pjuːt','[v] 称为，认为; [n] 名声， 名誉','Under his leadership, the U.N.''s repute has risen immeasurably.  在他的领导下，联合国的名望得到了极大提升。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_470','nimble','''nɪmbl','''nɪmbl','[adj] 敏捷的， 灵活的','nimble fingers  灵巧的手指'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_471','amiable','''emɪəbl','''eɪmiəbl','[adj] 可爱的； 友好的， 和蔼的， 亲切的','The driver was an amiable young man.  司机是位友善的年轻人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_472','format','''fɔrmæt','''fɔːrmæt','[n] 设计，安排；格式，样式; [vt] 使格式化','The courses were run to a consistent format.  这些课程的编排是有连续性的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_473','sacrifice','''sækrɪfaɪs','''sækrɪfaɪs','[v] 牺牲，献出；以…做祭献; [n] 牺牲， 献身； 献祭， 祭品','The priest sacrificed a chicken.  牧师献祭了一只鸡。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_474','particular','pɚ''tɪkjəlɚ','pər''tɪkjələr','[adj] 特定的；独特的；详细的；挑剔的; [n] 详情， 细目','In this particular case, no one else was involved.  这件事没有其他人牵涉其中。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_475','corps','kɔrz','kɔːr','[n] 军团， 兵团； 特种部队； 一群人， 一组人','the medical corps  医疗部队'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_476','pause','pɔz','pɔːz','[n&v] 中止， 暂停','There was a pause while Alice changed the tape.  艾丽斯换磁带的时候出现了短暂的停顿。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_477','formal','''fɔrml','''fɔːrml','[adj] 正规的， 正式的； 形式的','formal recognition of the reformed church  改革后的教会所获得的官方承认'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_478','rainbow','''renbo','''reɪnbou','[n] 彩虹','...silk and satin in every shade of the rainbow.  …如彩虹般五颜六色的丝绸与锦缎。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_479','instructor','ɪn''strʌktɚ','ɪn''strʌktər','[n] 导师， 讲师； 教练， 指导员','a driving instructor  驾驶教练'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_480','fervor','''fə:və','''fɜːrvər','[n] 热情， 热烈','He took up the cause with evangelical fervor .  他以传道者般的热情投身于这一事业。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_481','ample','''æmpl','''æmpl','[adj] 富足的， 充足的， 丰富的； 宽敞的','an ample bosom  丰满的胸部'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_482','cohesion','ko''hiʒən','kou''hiːʒn','[n] 内聚力； 凝聚力； 团结， 结合','a sense of community and social cohesion  社区意识和社会凝聚力'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_483','entertain',',ɛntɚ''ten','ˌentər''teɪn','[v] 招待， 款待； 使快乐， 娱乐','Mark usually does the cooking when we entertain.  我们招待客人时通常都是马克下厨。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_484','ease','iz','iːz','[v] 缓和， 减轻; [n] 不费力，容易；悠闲，自在','measures to ease congestion in the city  改善城市拥堵状况的措施'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_485','condiment','''kɑndɪmənt','''kɑːndɪmənt','[n] 调味品','Friendship is not only the condiment but also the anodyne of life.  友谊是人生的调味品，也是人生的止痛药。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_486','certitude','''sə:titju:d','''sɜːrtɪtuːd','[n] 确定， 确信； 必然性',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_487','overrun','''ovərʌn','ˌouvə''rʌn','[v] 超过，溢出；泛滥；横行; [n] 泛滥； 超出的部分','The final speaker overran by at least half an hour.  最后一名发言人至少超时半小时。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_488','deceptive','dɪ''sɛptɪv','dɪ''septɪv','[adj] 欺骗性的， 导致误解的','misleading and deceptive adverts  误导人且带有欺骗性的广告'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_489','mathematics',',mæθə''mætɪks','ˌmæθə''mætɪks','[n] 数学','...a professor of mathematics at Boston College.  …一位波士顿大学的数学教授。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_490','reactor','rɪ''æktɚ','ri''æktər','[n] 反应堆','Where do you all live? Do you live near a reactor?  你们都住在哪，你们接近一个反应堆吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_491','cookout','''kuk,aut','''kukaut','[n] 野外烧烤宴会','a cookout on the beach  海滩上的露天烧烤'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_492','envision','ɪn''vɪʒn','ɪn''vɪʒn','[vt] 想象， 展望， 预想','I envisioned a future of educational excellence.  我展望了一个有着优质教育的未来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_493','outcry','''aʊtkraɪ','''autkraɪ','[n] 大声疾呼， 强烈的抗议','The closure of the local hospital has caused a huge public outcry.  当地医院的关闭激起了大规模的公众抗议。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_494','penetrate','''pɛnətret','''penətreɪt','[v] 刺穿； 渗透； 洞察','bullets that penetrate thick armour plating  穿过厚装甲的子弹'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_495','paddle','''pædl','''pædl','[v] 用桨划船； 涉水， 戏水; [n] 桨；桡足','children paddling in the sea  在海边蹚水嬉戏的孩子们'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_496','reschedule',',ri''skɛdʒul','ˌriː''skedʒuːl','[vt] 重新计划， 重订…的时间表','Since I''ll be away, I''d like to reschedule the meeting.  既然我将要离开，我想重新安排一下这次会议的时间。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_497','principal','''prɪnsəpl','''prɪnsəpl','[adj] 主要的，最重要的; [n] 校长； 资本； 主角','His principal reason for making the journey was to visit his family.  他那次旅程的首要目的是探访家人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_498','tend','tɛnd','tend','[v] 趋于， 易于； 照料， 看护','Sofia was in the bedroom tending to her son.  索菲娅在卧室里照料她的儿子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_499','somber','ˈsɑːmbər','''sɑːmbər','[adj] 昏暗的； 忧郁的','In the somber archives of a sedate museum a large archaic volume is somewhat conspicuously displayed.  在一个平静的博物馆中昏暗的档案室里，一本厚厚的古书被摆在了很显著的位置。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_500','synonym','ˈsɪnənɪm','''sɪnənɪm','[n] 同义词','The term "industrial democracy" is often used as a synonym for worker participation.  “工业民主”这一词语常被用作“工人参与”的同义词。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_501','equitable','''ekwitəbl','''ekwɪtəbl','[adj] 公平的， 公正的','an equitable distribution of food supplies  所供应食品的合理分配'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_502','inconspicuous','''ɪnkən''spɪkjʊəs','ˌɪnkən''spɪkjuəs','[adj] 不引人瞩目的， 不显眼的','an inconspicuous little restaurant  一家不起眼的小饭店'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_503','specimen','''spɛsəmən','''spesɪmən','[n] 标本， 样本； 范例； 抽样','a blood specimen  血样'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_504','exotic','ɪɡ''zɑtɪk','ɪg''zɑːtɪk','[adj] 外来的， 来自异国的； 奇异的','exotic birds  外国的奇异鸟类'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_505','relief','rɪ''lif','rɪ''liːf','[n] 缓解， 减轻， 轻松； 援救， 救济； 宽慰； 浮雕','I felt a huge surge of relief and happiness.  我如释重负，大感欣慰。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_506','boycott','''bɔɪkɑt','''bɔɪkɑːt','[vt] 联合抵制， 拒绝购买','We boycott all products tested on animals.  我们抵制所有拿动物做试验的产品。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_507','introduction',',ɪntrə''dʌkʃən','ˌɪntrə''dʌkʃn','[n] 介绍； 传入， 引进； 导言， 绪论','Pete, are you going to make the introductions?  皮特，你来作一下介绍吧。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_508','subscribe','səb''skraɪb','səb''skraɪb','[v] 订购， 订阅； 申请， 预订； 捐助， 赞助','My main reason for subscribing to New Scientist is to keep abreast of advances in science.  我订阅《新科学家》的主要原因是要跟上科学的进步。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_509','therapy','''θɛrəpi','''θerəpi','[n] 治疗， 疗法','new drug therapies  新的药物疗法'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_510','chromosome','''kroməsom','''krouməsoum','[n] 染色体','Do we have a chromosome like that?  那么我们真的有那么一条染色体么？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_511','concentration','''kɑnsn''treʃən','ˌkɑːnsn''treɪʃn','[n] 专注， 专心； 浓度， 含量； 集中， 聚集','She needed all her powers of concentration to stop herself from slipping on the icy road.  她需要集中全部注意力才能不让自己在结冰的路上滑倒。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_512','velocity','vəˈlɑsəti','və''lɑːsəti','[n] 速度， 速率； 迅速','the velocity of light  光速'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_513','fellowship','''fɛloʃɪp','''felouʃɪp','[n] 友谊； 奖学金； 团体， 协会','Regular outings contribute to a sense of fellowship among co-workers.  经常外出游玩可以增进同事之间的友谊。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_514','colleague','''kɑliɡ','''kɑːliːg','[n] 同事， 同僚','a colleague of mine from the bank  我在银行的一位同事'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_515','unadorned','''ʌnə''dɔ:nd','ˌʌnə''dɔːrnd','[adj] 未装饰的， 朴实的','They liked their churches to be unadorned.  他们希望他们的教堂朴素无华。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_516','confession','kən''fɛʃən','kən''feʃn','[n] 供认， 招供， 坦白； 供词； 承认','Sanchez’s confession was read out to the court.  桑切斯的供词在法庭上宣读了出来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_517','meridian','mə''rɪdɪən','mə''rɪdiən','[n] 子午线， 经线','Yes this is the…is the prime meridian if you like.  是的，这就是本初子午线，它把地球分为东半球和西半球。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_518','interfere',',ɪntɚ''fɪr','ˌɪntər''fɪr','[vi] 干涉， 干扰， 妨碍','My daughter-in-law said that I was interfering, but I was only trying to help.  我的儿媳说我多管闲事，但我只是想帮忙。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_519','apartment','ə''pɑrtmənt','ə''pɑːrtmənt','[n] 公寓套房； 房间','She lives in a small apartment.  她住在一套小公寓里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_520','tolerate','''tɑləret','''tɑːləreɪt','[vt] 忍受； 容许， 承认','We simply will not tolerate vigilante groups on our streets.  我们决不容许有自行惩办犯罪的组织出现在我们的街头。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_521','stack','stæk','stæk','[v] 堆积， 堆放; [n] 堆','Mrs. Cathiard was stacking the clean bottles in crates.  卡提亚夫人当时正在把干净的瓶子堆放到板条箱里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_522','resent','rɪ''zɛnt','rɪ''zent','[v] 憎恶， 愤恨， 怨恨','She resents her mother for being so tough on her.  她恨她的妈妈对她如此苛刻。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_523','fiery','''faɪəri','''faɪəri','[adj] 似火的； 易怒的， 暴躁的','He has a fiery temper .  他脾气火爆。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_524','mime','maɪm','maɪm','[v] 模拟，模仿; [n] 喜剧； 哑剧； 哑剧演员； 模拟表演','The children learn through role-play, dance and mime.  儿童通过角色表演、舞蹈和哑剧来学习。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_525','ambiguous','æm''bɪɡjuəs','æm''bɪgjuəs','[adj] 不明确的， 模棱两可的','The language in the Minister’s statement is highly ambiguous.  部长的声明措辞很含糊。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_526','parliament','''pɑrləmənt','''pɑːrləmənt','[n] 国会， 议会','They demanded a free parliament and press.  他们要求议会自由和新闻自由。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_527','allay','ə''le','ə''leɪ','[vt] 减轻， 减少','The president made a statement to allay public anxiety.  总统发表了一项声明以缓解公众的忧虑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_528','path','pæθ','pæθ','[n] 道路； 路线； 小路， 小径','I walked nervously up the garden path towards the front door.  我提心吊胆地沿着花园的小道向前门走去。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_529','crack','kræk','kræk','[v] 破裂，断裂；发出爆裂声；重击，猛击；崩溃，','Don’t put boiling water in the glass or it will crack.  不要把沸水倒进这个玻璃杯里，否则它会破裂的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_530','dote','dot','dout','[vi] 溺爱','He dotes on his nine-year-old son.  他对自己9岁的儿子十分溺爱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_531','retrieval','rɪ''trivl','rɪ''triːvl','[n] 数据检索； 取回， 索回','a new system that should speed up information retrieval  能加速信息检索的新系统'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_532','conceivable','kən''sivəbl','kən''siːvəbl','[adj] 可能的； 可信的， 可想象的','It is conceivable that you may get full compensation, but it’s not likely.  你可能会得到全额赔偿，但可能性不大。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_533','cube','kjʊb','kjuːb','[n] 立方体； 立方形的东西； 立方','a sugar cube  一块方糖'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_534','synchronize','''sɪŋkrənaɪz','''sɪŋkrənaɪz','[v] 同步， 同时发生','It was virtually impossible to synchronize our lives so as to take vacations and weekends together.  为了一起度假和过周末而要让我们的生活同步几乎是不可能的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_535','sequoia','sɪ''kwɔɪə','sɪ''kwɔɪə','[n] 美洲杉， 红杉','...a grove of majestic sequoias.  ...一片高大的红杉树林。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_536','impact','ɪm''pækt','''ɪmpækt','[v] 影响； 冲击， 撞击; [n] 影响； 冲击， 撞击','Such schemes mean little unless they impact people.  除非能对人们造成影响，否则这样的计划意义不大。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_537','mild','maɪld','maɪld','[adj] 轻微的； 温和的； 随和的','We had an exceptionally mild winter last year.  去年冬天我们这里异常暖和。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_538','profile','''profaɪl','''proufaɪl','[n] 人物专访；概述，传略，人物简介；面部的侧影；轮廓，外形; [vt] 扼要介绍， 概述','Dani has a lovely profile.  达尼的侧面轮廓很好看。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_539','bill','bɪl','bɪl','[n] 账单；纸币，钞票；议案，法案；节目单；招贴，海报; [vt] 用招贴宣布； 给…开账单','Have you paid the phone bill?  电话费你付了吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_540','tributary','''trɪbjə''tɛri','''trɪbjəteri','[n] 支流；','...the Napo river, a tributary of the Amazon.  ...纳波河，亚马孙河的一条支流。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_541','clog','klɑg','klɑːg','[v] 堵塞，阻塞; [n] 障碍','tourists whose cars clog the roads each summer  每年夏天开着汽车堵塞道路的游客'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_542','senior','''sinɪɚ','''siːniər','[adj] 地位较高的；','the senior Democrat on the House committee  众议院委员会中的资深民主党人'),
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO words (book_slug, slug, word, phonetic_us, phonetic_uk, meaning, example) VALUES,
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_543','dilate','daɪˈlet','daɪ''leɪt','[v] 膨胀， 扩大； 详述','dilated pupils  扩大的瞳孔'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_544','domain','do''men','dou''meɪn','[n] 领土； 领域','Looking after the house was viewed as a woman’s domain.  料理家务被认为是女性的份内之事。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_545','census','''sɛnsəs','''sensəs','[n] 人口普查， 人口统计','a traffic census  交通状况调查'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_546','smear','smɪr','smɪr','[v] 胡乱涂抹；弄脏；诽谤，诋毁; [n] 污迹， 污斑； 诽谤， 诋毁； 涂片','an attempt to smear the party leadership  污蔑党领导的 企图'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_547','willful','''wɪlfəl','''wɪlfl','[adj] 成心的， 有意的； 任性的','The green eyes in the carefully sweet face were turbulent, willful, lusty with life, distinctly at variance with her decorous demeanor .  那双绿色的眼睛生在一张甜美的脸上，却仍然是任性的，充满活力的，与她的装束仪表很不相同。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_548','relative','''rɛlətɪv','''relətɪv','[adj] 相对的；有关的; [n] 亲属， 亲戚','The relative merits of both approaches have to be considered.  两种方法的相对优点都得考虑在内。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_549','average','''ævərɪdʒ','''ævərɪdʒ','[adj] 平均的；一般的；平庸的; [v] 平均为; [n] 平均水平；平均数','The age of the candidates ranged from 29 to 49 with an average age of 37.  候选人的年龄29岁至49岁不等，平均37岁。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_550','compare','kəm''pɛr','kəm''per','[v] 比较， 相比， 对比','The report compares the different types of home computer available.  这份报告比较了市场上不同类型的家用计算机。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_551','pluralism','''plʊər(ə)lɪz(ə)m','''plurəlɪzəm ','[n] 多元化， 多元性； 多元主义','a nation characterized by cultural pluralism  以多元文化为特色的国家'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_552','influential',',ɪnflu''ɛnʃl','ˌɪnflu''enʃl','[adj] 有影响力的； 有权势的','He had influential friends.  他有一些有影响力的朋友。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_553','amenity','ə''mɛnəti','ə''menəti','[n] 生活设施；便利设施','The hotel is in the city centre, close to shops and local amenities.  该酒店位于市中心，紧邻商店和当地的便利设施。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_554','bequeath','bɪ''kwið','bɪ''kwiːð','[vt] 遗赠； 流传','He bequeathed all his silver to his children.  他把所有的银币都留给了他的孩子们。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_555','transparent','træns''pærənt','træns''pærənt','[adj] 透明的； 明显的， 显而易见的； 直率的','a transparent plastic container  透明的塑料容器'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_556','adaptive','ə''dæptɪv','ə''dæptɪv','[adj] 适合的， 有适应性的','Societies need to develop highly adaptive behavioural rules for survival.  社会要生存需要建立有高度适应性的行为准则。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_557','mint','mɪnt','mɪnt','[v] 铸造; [n] 薄荷； 造币厂； 大量的钱','Only 2,000 of the special commemorative coins are being minted.  这种特别纪念币只有2,000枚在铸造中。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_558','grasp','ɡræsp','græsp','[vt&n] 抓住； 掌握， 理解， 领会','I grasped his arm firmly and led him away.  我紧紧抓住他的胳膊把他带走。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_559','journal','''dʒɝnl','''dʒɜːrnl','[n] 期刊， 杂志； 日记， 日志','the British Medical Journal  《英国医学杂志》'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_560','pave','pev','peɪv','[v] 铺； 密布','The avenue had never been paved, and deep mud made it impassable in winter.  这条大街从来没有铺过，深泥使其在冬天无法通行。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_561','distinctive','dɪ''stɪŋktɪv','dɪ''stɪŋktɪv','[adj] 出众的， 有特色的','a rock band with a distinctive sound  音色独特的摇滚乐队'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_562','chaotic','ke''ɑtɪk','keɪ''ɑːtɪk','[adj] 混乱的， 无秩序的','a chaotic mixture of images  杂乱无章的各种图像'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_563','brag','bræɡ','bræg','[v] 吹嘘， 自夸， 自吹自擂','‘I came out top in the test,’ he bragged.  “我测验得了最高分。”他吹嘘道。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_564','annoyed','ə''nɔɪd','ə''nɔɪd','[adj] 生气的','I’ll be annoyed if we don’t finish by eight.  如果我们8点还未完成，我会生气的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_565','chimpanzee',',tʃɪmpæn''zi','ˌtʃɪmpæn''ziː','[n] 黑猩猩','And in the other room another chimpanzee is placed.  而在那个房间里有另一只黑猩猩。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_566','term','tɝm','tɜːrm','[n] 学期；期限，期间；条件，条款；术语; [vt] 把…称为','Teachers often feel overworked in term time (= during the term ) .  教师在学期内经常觉得工作担子过重。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_567','volcano','vɑl''keno','vɑːl''keɪnou','[n] 火山','Pompeii was destroyed when the volcano erupted in 79 AD.  庞贝城于公元79年在火山爆发中毁灭。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_568','acquisition',',ækwɪ''zɪʃən','ˌækwɪ''zɪʃn','[n] 习得， 获得； 收购， 购置','the acquisition of language  语言的习得'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_569','rigid','''rɪdʒɪd','''rɪdʒɪd','[adj] 严格的； 刚硬的， 不易弯曲的； 死板的， 刻板的； 僵硬的','rigid and authoritarian methods of education  死板、专断的教育方法'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_570','deadline','ˈdedlaɪn','''dedlaɪn','[n] 最后期限， 截止时间','I’m always working under pressure to meet deadlines (= finish something on time ) .  我总是在赶工期的压力下工作。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_571','so-called',',so''kɔld','ˌsou''kɔːld','[adj] 所谓的','The so-called experts couldn’t tell us what was wrong.  那些所谓的专家说不出问题出在哪里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_572','mine','maɪn','maɪn','[pron] 我的; [v] 开矿，采矿；在…布雷; [n] 矿， 矿井； 地雷， 水雷','It was Glen’s idea, not mine.  这是格伦的主意，不是我的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_573','advent','','''ædvent','[n] 到来， 来临； 出现','The advent of the computer has brought this sort of task within the bounds of possibility.  电脑的出现使这种任务的完成成为可能。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_574','medieval',',midɪ''ivəl','ˌmiːd''iːvl','[adj] 中世纪的， 中古的','These spices were first brought to Italy from the East in medieval times.  这些香料最早是在中世纪时从东方被带到了意大利。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_575','staff','stæf','stæf','[n] 全体职工；行政人员；棍棒; [vt] 为…配备人员； 任职于','The entire staff has done an outstanding job this year.  今年全体员工工作都非常出色。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_576','involve','ɪn''vɑlv','ɪn''vɑːlv','[vt] 包含； 牵涉， 牵连； 使参加','What will the job involve?  这份工作包括什么？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_577','stage','stedʒ','steɪdʒ','[n] 阶段；步骤；舞台；戏剧; [vt] 上演； 筹划','We’re getting to the stage where we hardly ever go out together.  我们快要到几乎不一起外出的地步了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_578','complicated','''kɑmplɪketɪd','''kɑːmplɪkeɪtɪd','[adj] 难懂的， 复杂的','a complicated voting system  复杂的选举制度'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_579','maximum','ˈmæksəməm','''mæksɪməm','[adj] 最大的，最大限度的; [n] 最大量， 极限','The car has a maximum speed of 120 mph.  这辆汽车的最高时速为120英里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_580','finch','fɪntʃ','fɪntʃ','[n] 雀类','We wake every morning to the sound of a finch singing.  每天早晨醒来时还能听到燕雀的歌唱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_581','syllabus','''sɪləbəs','''sɪləbəs','[n] 教学大纲， 课程提纲','The course syllabus consisted mainly of novels by African-American authors, male and female.  该课程的教学大纲主要包括了非裔美国男女作家的小说。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_582','fragrant','''fregrənt','''freɪgrənt','[adj] 芬芳的， 香的','fragrant flowers  芳香的花朵'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_583','tolerant','''tɑlərənt','''tɑːlərənt','[adj] 宽容的； 容忍的','a tolerant society  宽容的社会'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_584','dialect','''daɪə''lɛkt','''daɪəlekt','[n] 方言， 土话','the local dialect  当地方言'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_585','rigor','''rɪgɚ','''rɪgər','[n] 严格； 严酷','They apply project management knowledge, skills, and processes in different orders and degrees of rigor to achieve the desired project performance.  他们通过应用不同顺序与严格程度的项目管理知识、技能和过程，来达到项目理想的效果。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_586','dim','dɪm','dɪm','[adj] 模糊的；暗淡的；朦胧的；不乐观的; [v] 变暗淡； 变冷漠','in the dim light of the early dawn  在微弱的晨曦里'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_587','impel','ɪm''pɛl','ɪm''pel','[vt] 驱使， 促使','...the courage and competitiveness which impels him to take risks.  ...驱策他冒险的勇气和竞争精神。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_588','lichen','''laɪkən','''laɪkən','[n] 青苔， 地衣','Dickinsonia, for example, has been interpreted as being a relative of jellyfish, a marine worm, a lichen, or even as a member of a completely extinct kingdom.  例如，狄更逊水母，有的说是水母的近亲，有的说是海底蠕虫，有的说是地衣，有的甚至说它属于一个已经完全灭绝的物种。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_589','paralyze','''pærə,laɪz','''pærəlaɪz','[vt] 使瘫痪， 使麻痹； 使无效','It might paralyze me, cause me to forget what I am here for, create so much pain I am distracted, or render me incapable in some other way.  它大概会使我瘫痪，使我忘记我到这里来的目的，使我感到极度痛苦，无法集中意念，或者以其他方式使我丧失能力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_590','besiege','bɪ''sidʒ','bɪ''siːdʒ','[vt] 包围； 使应接不暇','Miller was besieged by press photographers.  米勒被摄影记者团团围住。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_591','exemplary','ɪɡ''zɛmpləri','ɪg''zempləri','[adj] 模范的； 典型的','a company with an exemplary record on environmental issues  在处理环境问题方面可作为楷模的公司'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_592','faculty','''fæklti','''fæklti','[n] 学院； 全体教职员工； 能力','Both faculty and students oppose the measures.  教师和学生都反对这些措施。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_593','photodissociation',',fotodɪ,sosi''eʃɪn','ˌfoutou''dɪˌsouʃi''eɪʃn','[n] 光解',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_594','adamant','''ædəmənt','''ædəmənt','[adj] 坚定不移的， 坚决的； 固执的','She begged me to change my mind, but I remained adamant .  她求我改变主意，但我坚决不肯。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_595','hydraulic','haɪ''drɔlɪk','haɪ''drɔːlɪk','[adj] 水力的， 液压的； 液压驱动的； 与水力系统有关的','a hydraulic pump  水压泵，液压泵'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_596','habit','''hæbɪt','''hæbɪt','[n] 习惯； 习性， 脾性','Regular exercise is a good habit.  经常锻炼是个好习惯。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_597','limestone','''laɪmston','''laɪmstoun','[n] 石灰石','...high limestone cliffs.  …高耸的石灰岩峭壁。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_598','considerate','kənˈsɪdərɪt','kən''sɪdərət','[adj] 考虑周到的， 体贴的， 体谅的','I think he''s the most charming, most considerate man I''ve ever known.  我觉得他是我所认识的最有魅力、最体贴的男士。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_599','livestock','''laɪvstɑk','''laɪvstɑːk','[n] 〈总称〉家畜， 牲畜','The heavy rains and flooding killed scores of livestock.  大雨和洪水淹死了许多家畜。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_600','clue','klʊ','kluː','[n] 线索； 提示','Police have found a vital clue .  警方发现了至关重要的线索。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_601','meteorite','''mitɪəraɪt','''miːtiəraɪt','[n] 陨石','While flying over the Channel, the pilot saw what he thought to be a meteorite.  飞过英吉利海峡时，驾驶员认为他看见了一颗陨星。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_602','molten','''moltən','''moultən','[adj] 熔化的， 熔融的','molten iron  熔铁'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_603','radius','''redɪəs','''reɪdiəs','[n] 半径； 周围， 范围','The shock of the explosion was felt over a radius of forty miles.  爆炸引起的剧烈震动在方圆40英里内都能感觉得到。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_604','signal','''sɪgnl','''sɪgnəl','[v] 发信号，示意；标志; [adj] 显要的， 重大的; [n] 信号，暗号；标志','She signalled, and the waiter brought the bill.  她打了个手势，侍者就拿来了账单。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_605','scruffy','''skrʌfi','''skrʌfi','[adj] 不整洁的， 邋遢的','a scruffy old pair of jeans  一条不干净的旧牛仔裤'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_606','impair','ɪm''pɛr','ɪm''per','[vt] 削弱； 损害','The illness had impaired his ability to think and concentrate.  这种疾病损害了他的思维能力和注意力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_607','sumptuous','''sʌmptʃuəs','''sʌmptʃuəs','[adj] 奢华的， 豪华的','a sumptuous feast  盛宴'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_608','stray','stre','streɪ','[vi] 迷路；分心，走神；离题; [adj] 迷路的；','Tourists often get lost and stray into dangerous areas.  旅游者们经常迷路走进一些危险区域。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_609','static','''stætɪk','''stætɪk','[adj] 静态的， 静止的； 静电的； 静力的; [n] 静电噪音；静电；[-s]静力学','The number of young people obtaining qualifications has remained static or decreased.  获得各种资格证书的年轻人的数量一直保持不变或者已经减少。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_610','kinship','''kɪnʃɪp','''kɪnʃɪp','[n] 血缘关系， 亲属关系','the ties of kinship  亲属关系'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_611','exhaust','ɪɡ''zɔst','ɪg''zɔːst','[n] 废气；排气管; [vt] 用尽， 耗尽； 使非常疲倦； 详尽讨论','exhaust fumes  排出的废气'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_612','soluble','''sɑljəbl','''sɑːljəbl','[adj] 可溶的； 可解决的','soluble aspirin  可溶性阿司匹林'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_613','varied','''vɛrɪd','''verid','[adj] 各式各样的','a varied diet  丰富多样的饮食'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_614','intriguing','ɪn''triɡɪŋ','ɪn''triːgɪŋ','[adj] 引起兴趣的， 吸引人的','The magazine carries an intriguing mixture of high fashion, gossip and racing.  这本杂志内容丰富有趣，有关时尚、花边新闻和赛马的内容都有。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_615','strap','stræp','stræp','[n] 带; [vt] 用带捆扎， 束牢； 用绷带包扎','a bra strap  胸罩肩带'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_616','diversify','daɪˈvɜrsəˌfaɪ','daɪ''vɜːrsɪfaɪ','[v] 多样化， 不同','We need to diversify the economy.  我们要使经济多元化。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_617','graph','ɡræf','græf','[n] 图表','Martin showed me a graph of their recent sales.  马丁给我看了他们最近销售情况的图表。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_618','feast','fist','fiːst','[v] 尽情享用; [n] 节日；盛宴，宴会','We feasted on chicken and roast potatoes.  我们饱餐了一顿鸡肉和烤土豆。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_619','sodium','''sodɪəm','''soudiəm','[n] 钠','The fish or seafood is heavily salted with pure sodium chloride.  鱼或海产品以厚厚的纯氯化钠盐腌制。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_620','imbibe','ɪm''baɪb','ɪm''baɪb','[v] 喝； 吸收， 接受','Both men imbibed considerable quantities of gin.  这两个男人都喝了大量的杜松子酒。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_621','impermeable','ɪm''pɝmɪəbl','ɪm''pɜːrmiəbl','[adj] 不可渗透的， 不透水的','No paint is impermeable to water vapour.  没有哪种涂料是不透水汽的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_622','precautionary','prɪ''kɔʃən,ɛri','prɪ''kɔːʃənerɪ','[adj] 预防的','More troops were sent to the area as a precautionary measure .  为谨慎起见，更多的军队被派往该地区。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_623','pretentious','prɪ''tɛnʃəs','prɪ''tenʃəs','[adj] 自负的','a pretentious film  矫饰的电影'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_624','tackle','''tækl','''tækl','[v] 对付，处理；阻截；抢球; [n] 拦截； 用具','There is more than one way to tackle the problem.  解决这个问题不止一个办法。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_625','solvent','''sɑlvənt','''sɑːlvənt','[adj] 有溶解力的； 有偿付能力的; [n] 溶剂','They''re going to have to show that the company is now solvent.  他们将不得不证明公司现在是具备偿债能力的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_626','nude','nud','nuːd','[adj] 裸体的','I did some work as a nude model when I was in college.  我上大学的时候当过裸体模特。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_627','distract','dɪ''strækt','dɪ''strækt','[vt] 分散注意力， 使分心','Try not to distract the other students.  尽量不要让其他学生分心。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_628','palate','''pælət','''pælət','[n] 上腭； 味觉， 品尝力','It tasted very strange, at least to my untrained palate.  这东西尝起来怪怪的，至少对于我这未经训练的味觉来说是如此。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_629','influenza',',ɪnflu''ɛnzə','ˌɪnflu''enzə','[n] 流行性感冒','All the medical workers in the region helped to put down the influenza epidemic.  这个地区的所有医务工作者参加了消灭流行性感冒的工作。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_630','loan','lon','loun','[n] 贷款；出借，借出；暂借的东西; [vt] 借出； 贷给','I had to take out a loan to buy my car.  我只得贷款买车。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_631','virtual','ˈvɝ​tʃʊəl','''vɜːrtʃuəl','[adj] 模拟的， 虚拟的； 实际上的， 事实上的','The website allows you to take a virtual tour of the art gallery.  这个网站可让你对美术馆作一番虚拟参观。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_632','squeeze','skwiz','skwiːz','[v] 挤压；挤入；挤过，塞入；压榨，榨取；','She smiled as he squeezed her hand.  他捏了捏她的手，她笑了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_633','endless','ˈɛndlɪs','''endləs','[adj] 无止境的， 无穷尽的','an endless stream of visitors  川流不息的游客'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_634','pound','paʊnd','paund','[v] 猛击；捣碎；怦怦跳; [n] 磅； 英镑','She pounded the corn kernels.  她捣碎了玉米粒。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_635','load','lod','loud','[n] 负荷，负担；装载; [vt] 装载， 使负担','The lorry hadshed its load(= the load had fallen off ).  卡车上的货掉下来了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_636','plantation','plæn''teʃən','plæn''teɪʃn','[n] 种植园； 人造林','a rubber plantation  橡胶园'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_637','ignore','ɪɡ''nɔr','ɪg''nɔːr','[vt] 忽视； 不顾， 不理','You can’t ignore the fact that many criminals never go to prison.  你不能无视很多罪犯从未获刑的事实。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_638','hemisphere','''hɛmɪsfɪr','''hemɪsfɪr','[n] 半球； 大脑半球','the Northern hemisphere  北半球'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_639','continuation','kən''tɪnjʊ''eʃən','kənˌtɪnju''eɪʃn','[n] 延长， 延续， 持续； 延长物， 扩建物； 延续部分','It''s the coalition forces who are to blame for the continuation of the war.  是联军应对战争的持续负责。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_640','applaud','ə''plɔd','ə''plɔːd','[v] 鼓掌， 喝彩； 称赞','The audience applauded loudly.  观众掌声雷动。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_641','lunar','''lunɚ','''luːnər','[adj] 月亮的','studies of the lunar surface  对月球表面的研究'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_642','poetry','''poətri','''pouətri','[n] 诗歌； 诗集； 诗意','He reads a lot of poetry.  他大量阅读诗歌。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_643','arrogant','''ærəɡənt','''ærəgənt','[adj] 傲慢的， 自大的','He was unbearably arrogant.  他的傲慢让人无法忍受。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_644','relay','rɪ''le','''riːleɪ','[vt] 转播； 传达， 转述; [n] 接替人员， 轮换者； 接力赛； 中继设备','The broadcasts were relayed by satellite.  这些电视节目通过卫星进行转播。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_645','permission','pɚ''mɪʃən','pər''mɪʃn','[n] 允许， 同意； 许可证， 书面许可','He asked permission to leave the room.  他请求离开房间的许可。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_646','permeate','''pɝmɪet','''pɜːrmieɪt','[v] 弥漫； 渗透','The smell of diesel oil permeated the air.  空气里充斥着柴油的气味。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_647','monogamous','mə''nɑɡəməs','mə''nɑːgəməs','[adj] 一夫一妻制的； 单配的','Do you believe that men are not naturally monogamous?  你相信男人天生就不是单一性伴侣的吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_648','schedule','ˈskedʒʊl; skɛdʒʊl','''skedʒuːl','[vt] 安排，预定; [n] 时刻表， 日程表； 清单， 明细表','We will not cancel your holiday less than eight weeks before the scheduled departure date .  离预定出发日期少于八周，度假行程将不能取消。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_649','apprehend',',æprɪ''hɛnd','ˌæprɪ''hend','[vt] 逮捕； 领会， 理解','The police have failed to apprehend the culprits.  警方未能拘捕罪犯。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_650','crippling','''krɪplɪŋ','''krɪplɪŋ','[adj] 令人震惊的； 严重损害身体的； 极其有害的','the crippling effects of war on the economy  战争给经济造成的毁灭性影响'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_651','inherit','ɪn''hɛrɪt','ɪn''herɪt','[v] 继承， 遗传而得','inherited wealth  继承的财富'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_652','arduous','''ɑrdʒuəs','''ɑːrdʒuəs','[adj] 费力的， 艰巨的','...a long, hot and arduous trip.  …一段漫长、灼热、艰难的旅程。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_653','interpret','ɪn''tɝprɪt','ɪn''tɜːrprɪt','[v] 解释， 说明； 理解； 翻译','They spoke good Spanish, and promised to interpret for me.  他们西班牙语说得很好，答应替我翻译。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_654','faction','''fækʃən','''fækʃn','[n] 派别， 派系， 小集团； 派系斗争','struggles between the different factions within the party  党内的派系斗争'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_655','beach','bitʃ','biːtʃ','[n] 海滩， 湖滩， 河滩','a sandy beach  沙滩'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_656','universe','''junɪvɝs','''juːnɪvɜːrs','[n] 宇宙； 世界','Einstein''s equations showed the universe to be expanding.  爱因斯坦的方程式表明宇宙正在扩大。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_657','blanket','''blæŋkɪt','''blæŋkɪt','[n] 毯子； 覆盖物','The mud disappeared under a blanket of snow.  泥地在一层白雪的覆盖下消失不见了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_658','grant','ɡrænt','grænt','[v] 给予，授予；允许，同意；承认; [n] 拨款； 津贴； 授予物','Britain could grant Spain’s request .  英国可能会同意西班牙的请求。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_659','recoup','ri''ku:p','rɪ''kuːp','[vt] 收回， 弥补','The movie will have to be a huge hit to recoup its cost.  这部电影必须大获成功才能收回成本。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_660','aquifer','''ækwɪfɚ','''ækwɪfər','[n] 含水土层','A long-term maintenance regime relies solely on natural methods to protect the watershed and aquifer.  而对于流域及蓄水层的长期性维护制度将仅依靠自然实现。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_661','append','ə''pɛnd','ə''pend','[vt] 附加， 增补','She appended a note at the end of the letter.  她在信件尾部附加了一个说明。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_662','newsletter','''nuzlɛtɚ','''njuːzletər','[n] 时事通讯','The society publishes a newsletter twice a year.  该社团一年出版两次简报。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_663','copilot','''ko,paɪlət','''kouˌpaɪlət','[n] 副驾驶员','That''s me, the copilot, and one of the air stewardesses.  那是我、副驾驶员还有我们的一名女乘务员。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_664','frigid','''frɪdʒɪd','''frɪdʒɪd','[adj] 寒冷的； 冷淡的','The guard looked at us with a frigid stare.  守卫冷冷地盯着我们。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_665','relic','''rɛlɪk','''relɪk','[n] 遗物， 遗迹， 遗风','Roman relics found in a field  在野外发现的古罗马遗迹'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_666','bellows','''bɛloz','''belouz','[n] 风箱','Music bellows from his insides.  来自他的肚子的音乐风箱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_667','discount','dɪs''kaʊnt','''dɪskaʊnt','[n] 折扣; [vt] 把…打折扣； 不全信， 漠视， 低估','They are often available at a discount.  它们经常可以以折扣价买到。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_668','convert','kən''vɝt','kən''vɜːrt','[v] 改变； 转变， 转化','a 19th-century converted barn  由19世纪谷仓改建的房子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_669','construct','kən''strʌkt','kən''strʌkt','[vt] 建造； 创立; [n] 构想， 观念','There are plans to construct a new road bridge across the river.  有计划要建造一条新的跨河公路桥。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_670','attempt','ə''tɛmpt','ə''tempt','[n&vi] 尝试； 努力','Weather conditions prevented them from attempting the jump.  天气状况使他们无法尝试跳伞。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_671','rivalry','''raɪvlri','''raɪvlri','[n] 竞争 ； 敌对','The two players have developed a friendly rivalry .  这两名选手之间已形成一种友好的竞争关系。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_672','charisma','kə''rɪzmə','kə''rɪzmə','[n] 超凡魅力； 感召力； 号召力','He lacks charisma.  他缺乏个人魅力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_673','division','də''vɪʒən','dɪ''vɪʒn','[n] 除， 除法； 分开， 分隔； 分配； 部分； 分歧， 分裂； 部门','the traditional division of labour (= the way that particular tasks are shared ) between husband and wife  夫妻之间传统的分工'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_674','balance','''bæləns','''bæləns','[vt] 使平衡，使均衡; [n] 天平， 秤； 平衡； 差额； 余款','Job losses in manufacturing were balanced by job increases in the service sector.  制造业职位减少了，而服务行业就业机会却增加了，正好相抵。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_675','stalk','stɔk','stɔːk','[v] 偷偷接近； 跟踪； 趾高气扬地走; [n] 茎，梗，柄','a tiger stalking its prey  一只悄悄跟踪猎物的老虎'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_676','pancreas','''pæŋkrɪəs','''pæŋkriəs','[n] 胰腺','Tuberous sclerosis can lead to the formation of fibroids or tumors in the pancreas, bone, and liver.  结节性硬化症可以导致患者的胰腺、骨骼和肝脏发生纤维瘤或其他肿瘤。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_677','supplier','sə''plaɪɚ','sə''plaɪər','[n] 供应者， 供应商， 供货方','...one of the country''s biggest food suppliers.  …该国最大的食品供应商之一。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_678','patriarchic',',peitri''a:kik','''peɪtriɑːrkɪk','[adj] 家长的， 族长的； 德高望重的',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_679','mimic','''mɪmɪk','''mɪmɪk','[adj] 模仿的， 模拟的; [vt] 模仿；像; [n] 模仿者；小丑','Second, funds that mimic indexes will almost always have lower fees because of the passive investment strategy of managers of index funds.  第二，因为指数基金管理者的被动式投资策略，那些模仿指数的基金的运营费用总是更低廉。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_680','pitch','pɪtʃ','pɪtʃ','[n] 音高，音调；倾斜度；沥青，柏油；','The night was as black as pitch (= very dark ) .  夜晚一片漆黑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_681','feat','fit','fiːt','[n] 功绩， 壮举','A racing car is an extraordinary feat of engineering.  赛车是工程学的一项非凡业绩。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_682','incessant','ɪn''sɛsnt','ɪn''sesnt','[adj] 不断的， 不停的','The child’s incessant talking started to irritate her.  这孩子喋喋不休，她开始烦躁起来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_683','torrent','''tɔrənt','''tɔːrənt','[n] 洪流， 急流； 爆发， 迸发','After five days of heavy rain the Telle river was a raging torrent (= a very violent torrent ) .  下了五天的大雨之后，泰勒河急流汹涌。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_684','appreciation','ə,priʃɪ''eʃən','əˌpriːʃi''eɪʃn','[n] 欣赏； 理解， 体谅； 感激； 鉴定， 评价','He was presented with a watch in appreciation of his long service.  他获赠一块手表，作为对其长期服务的感谢。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_685','statue','''stætʃu','''stætʃuː','[n] 雕像','Churchill’s statue stands outside the parliament building.  丘吉尔的塑像矗立在议会大厦外。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_686','sense','sɛns','sens','[v] 觉得， 意识到; [n] 感官，官能；感觉；判断力；意义，意思','Perhaps he sensed your distrust.  也许他感觉到了你的不信任。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_687','brew','brʊ','bruː','[v] 酿造；冲泡；酝酿，行将发生; [n] 冲泡的饮料； 啤酒','Every beer on the menu was brewed locally.  酒单上的所有啤酒都是本地酿造的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_688','pretension','prɪ''tɛnʃən','prɪ''tenʃn','[n] 要求， 主张； 自命不凡； 虚饰','the humbleness and lack of pretension of Jordan’s cafe  乔丹的咖啡馆的朴实和低调'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_689','deflect','dɪ''flɛkt','dɪ''flekt','[v] 偏斜， 转向','He deflected the blow with his forearm.  他用前臂挡开了打来的一拳。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_690','virtuous','''vɝtʃuəs','''vɜːrtʃuəs','[adj] 有道德的， 品行端正的， 品德高的； 〈贬〉自命清高的， 自以为是的','a virtuous man  品行端正的男子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_691','invalid','ˈɪnvəlɪd；ɪnˈvælɪd','ˈɪnvəlɪd；ɪnˈvælɪd','[adj] 无效的； 无可靠根据的， 站不住脚的; [n] 病弱者， 残疾者','Without the right date stamped on it, your ticket will be invalid.  票上若没有加盖正确日期就是废票。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_692','legitimate','ləˈdʒɪtəmɪt','lɪ''dʒɪtɪmət','[adj] 合法的， 法定的； 正当合理的， 合情合理的','That’s a perfectly legitimate question.  那个问题完全合乎情理。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_693','interval','''ɪntɚvl','''ɪntərvl','[n] 间隔时间； 间距； 幕间休息','He left the room, returning after a short interval with a message.  他离开房间，过了一会儿就带回来一条消息。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_694','whereby','wɛr''bai','wer''baɪ','[ad&conj] 借以， 凭','We need this system whereby a new plan may arise.  我们需要这种可能借以产生新计划的制度。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_695','evaluate','ɪ''væljʊ''et','ɪ''væljueɪt','[vt] 评价， 估计','You should be able to evaluate your own work.  你应该能够评估自己的工作。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_696','status','ˈstetəs','''steɪtəs','[n] 身份， 地位； 情况','These documents have no legal status in Britain.  这些文件在英国并无法律效力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_697','ooze','uz','uːz','[v] 渗出，慢慢流出；洋溢着，充满; [n] 泥浆； 缓慢渗出','A cut on his cheek was still oozing blood.  他脸上的伤口还在渗血。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_698','renown','rɪ''naʊn','rɪ''naun','[n] 名望， 声誉','He achieved some renown as a football player.  作为足球运动员，他小有名气。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_699','semantic','sɪ''mæntɪk','sɪ''mæntɪk','[adj] 语义的','He did not want to enter into a semantic debate.  他不想卷入一场关于语义的争论。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_700','upset','ʌp''sɛt','ʌp''set','[adj] 心烦意乱的； 不适的; [vt] 使心烦意乱； 颠覆， 推翻； 搅乱; [n] 困扰， 麻烦； 出乎意料的结局； 苦恼','You’re not still upset with me, are you?  你不是还在生我的气吧？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_701','diffusion','dɪ''fjʊʒən','dɪ''fjuːʒn','[n] 散布， 扩散； 传播','Dissemination, as of news; diffusion.  散布，如消息的传开；扩散。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_702','curve','kɝv','kɜːrv','[v] 弄弯，成曲线形; [n] 曲线； 曲线图； 弯曲','The track curved round the side of the hill.  小路弯弯曲曲，依山盘旋。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_703','dot','dɑt','dɑːt','[v] 星罗棋布于；打点于；点缀; [n] 点， 圆点； 小数点','Poppies dotted the field.  田野里遍布着星星点点的罂粟花。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_704','skim','skɪm','skɪm','[v] 撇去； 掠过， 擦过； 浏览， 略读','Julie skimmed the sports page.  朱莉浏览了体育版。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_705','skip','skɪp','skɪp','[v] 跳；跳过，略过，漏过；不出席; [n] 跳； 跳过','She skipped lunch in order to go shopping.  为了去购物，她没有吃午饭。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_706','disseminate','dɪ''sɛmɪnet','dɪ''semɪneɪt','[v] 散布， 传播','Her findings have been widely disseminated .  她的发现已广为传播。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_707','liquefy','''lɪkwɪfaɪ','''lɪkwɪfaɪ','[v] 溶解， 液化','A process that is used to liquefy nitrogen.  用来使氮液化的过程。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_708','exodus','''ɛksədəs','''eksədəs','[n] 大批离去， 成群外出','The medical system is facing collapse because of an exodus of doctors.  由于医生大批离去，该医疗体系正面临崩溃。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_709','mention','''mɛnʃən','''menʃn','[v] 提及， 说起','Was my name mentioned at all?  我的名字被提到过吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_710','stream','strim','striːm','[v] 涌; [n] 溪流； 串， 股','A stream of cold air rushed through the open door.  一股冷气穿过敞开的门直冲进来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_711','laundry','''lɔndri','''lɔːndri','[n] 洗衣店， 洗衣房； 洗好的衣服； 待洗的衣服','She did the laundry (= washed the clothes etc ) and hung it out to dry.  她洗了衣服，然后挂出去晾干。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_712','digression','daɪ''grɛʃən','daɪ''greʃn','[n] 离题， 扯到枝节上； 题外话， 枝节内容',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_713','grudge','ɡrʌdʒ','grʌdʒ','[v] 勉强做； 不情愿地给; [n] 怨恨，积怨','Mr Gillis was not normally a man to bear grudges .  吉利斯先生通常不是那种会积怨的人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_714','herald','''hɛrəld','''herəld','[vt] 预示；宣布，宣告; [n] 信使； 预示， 预兆','A flash of lightning heralded torrential rain.  一道闪电预示着暴雨即将来临。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_715','accumulate','ə''kjumjəlet','ə''kjuːmjəleɪt','[v] 积累， 积聚， 堆积','It is unjust that a privileged few should continue to accumulate wealth.  少数特权阶级继续积聚财富，这是不公平的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_716','coalition','ˌkoʊəˈlɪʃn','ˌkouə''lɪʃn','[n] 联盟， 同盟； 结合， 联合','the centre-right coalition government  政治上中间偏右的联合政府'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_717','dwarf','dwɔrf','dwɔːrf','[adj] 矮小的; [vt] 使显得矮小，使相形见绌; [n] 侏儒， 矮人','a dwarf conifer  矮生针叶树'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_718','crime','kraɪm','kraɪm','[n] 犯罪； 罪行','We moved here because there was very little crime.  我们搬到这里来是因为这里的犯罪率很低。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_719','leisure','''liʒɚ','''liːʒər','[n] 空闲， 闲暇','Most people now enjoy shorter working hours and more leisure time.  现在大多数人都喜欢工作时间短些，闲暇时间多些。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_720','surround','sə''raʊnd','sə''raund','[v] 包围， 圈住； 围绕， 环绕','He glared at the people who surrounded the tent.  他怒视着围住帐篷的那些人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_721','mar','mɑr','mɑːr','[vt&n] 损坏， 损毁','Their wedding was marred by the death of Jenny’s mother a week earlier.  一周之前珍妮母亲的过世使他们的婚礼蒙上了一层阴影。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_722','mat','mæt','mæt','[n] 垫子','Wipe your feet on the mat.  在地垫上蹭蹭你的鞋底。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_723','forward','''fɔrwɚd','''fɔːrwərd','[adv] 向前；; [vt] 发送；转交，转递','He leaned forward , his elbows resting on the table.  他身体前倾，胳膊肘撑在桌子上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_724','melanin','''mɛlənɪn','''melənɪn','[n] 黑色素','If cure is undeserved, activationed its melanin cell, sequential meeting is more serious ah.  假如治疗不当，激活了它的黑色素细胞，后果会更严重的啊。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_725','assimilate','ə''sɪməlet','ə''sɪməleɪt','[v] 透彻理解， 吸收， 消化； 同化','It will take time to assimilate all these facts.  充分掌握所有这些情况需要时间。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_726','ethical','''ɛθɪkl','''eθɪkl','[adj] 道德的','I don’t think it’s ethical for you to accept a job you know you can’t do.  我觉得接受一份自知无法胜任的工作是不道德的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_727','zealous','''zɛləs','''zeləs','[adj] 狂热的， 热烈的， 充满激情的','a zealous preacher  热心的讲道者'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_728','comparable','''kɑmpərəbl','''kɑːmpərəbl','[adj] 可比较的， 类似的； 比得上的','A car of comparable size would cost far more abroad.  同样大小的汽车在国外要贵得多。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_729','bait','bet','beɪt','[n] 鱼饵，诱饵; [vt] 下诱饵； 激怒','We used worms as bait.  我们用小虫子作诱饵。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_730','mail','mel','meɪl','[n] 邮件; [vt] 邮寄','You shouldn’t read other people’s mail.  你不应该看别人的信件。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_731','dimensional','dɪ''menʃənəl','daɪ''menʃənl','[adj] …度空间的','Of particular note is the deviation threshold parameter and the dimensional shift parameters.  需要特别注意的是偏差阈值参数和空间移位参数。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_732','subject','ˈsʌbdʒɪkt;(for adj.)ˈsʌbdʒɪkt;(for v.)səbˈdʒɛkt','ˈsʌbdʒɪkt;(for adj.)ˈsʌbdʒɪkt;(for v.)səbˈdʒekt','[adj] 受…支配的; [n] 主题；对象; [vt] 使服从','All flights are subject to delay.  所有航班都有可能延误。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_733','recognition',',rɛkəɡ''nɪʃən','ˌrekəg''nɪʃn','[n] 承认， 认同； 认出， 识别， 辨认； 赏识','He stared at her, but there was no sign of recognition .  他盯着她看，但似乎没认出她来。'),
