('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_743','oxygen','''ɑksɪdʒən','''ɑːksɪdʒən','[n] 氧， 氧气','The human brain needs to be without oxygen for only four minutes before permanent damage occurs.  人脑缺氧只需4分钟就会造成永久性损伤。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_744','combine','kəm''baɪn','kəm''baɪn','[v] 联合， 结合','Diets are most effective when combined with exercise.  节食和锻炼相结合是最有效的。'),
