('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_748','approximation','ə''prɑksə''meʃən','əˌprɑːksɪ''meɪʃn','[n] 接近； 近似值','That is a fair approximation of the way in which the next boss is being chosen.  那是一个挑选下任老板的大体近似方式。'),
