('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_765','nonsense','''nɑnsɛns','''nɑːnsens','[n] 胡说， 废话； 冒失的行为','‘I’m a prisoner in my own home.’ ‘Nonsense!’  “我在自己家里就像个囚犯。”“胡说！”'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_766','stain','sten','steɪn','[v] 沾污；留下污渍; [n] 污点， 污渍','Be careful you don’t stain the carpet.  当心别把地毯弄脏了。'),
