('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_774','oratorio',',ɔrə''tɔrɪo','ˌɔːrə''tɔːriou','[n] 清唱剧， 宗教剧','Its peaks are the symphony and the oratorio.  其顶峰为交响乐和清唱剧。'),
