('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_786','stake','stek','steɪk','[n] 股份；赌注；利害关系; [vt] 以…打赌， 拿…冒险','Young people don’t feel they have a stake in the country’s future.  年轻人觉得自己与国家的未来没有关系。'),
