('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_805','presidency','''prɛzɪdənsi','''prezɪdənsi','[n] 职位； 任期','Roosevelt was elected four times to the presidency of the US.  罗斯福四次当选美国总统。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_806','scurry','''skɝi','''skɜːri','[vi&n] 急跑， 疾行','People were scurrying off to work.  人们急匆匆赶着去上班。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_807','scornful','''skɔ:nful','''skɔːrnfl','[adj] 轻蔑的， 鄙视的','a scornful look  轻蔑的表情'),
