('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_809','magnetic','mæg''nɛtɪk','mæg''netɪk','[adj] 磁的， 磁石的； 有磁性的； 有吸引力的','magnetic forces  磁力'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_810','stick','stɪk','stɪk','[v] 刺，戳，插；粘住，粘贴；放置；卡住; [n] 棍， 棒； 手杖','This stamp won’t stick properly.  这张邮票贴不牢。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_811','orbit','''ɔrbɪt','''ɔːrbɪt','[v] 作轨道运行; [n] 轨道；势力范围','The satellite orbits the Earth every 48 hours.  这颗人造卫星每48小时绕地球运行一周。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_812','band','bænd','bænd','[vi] 联合，集合; [n] 乐队； 群， 伙； 带； 波段， 频带','We band together to resist our enemy.  我们联合起来抵抗我们的敌人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_813','beneficent','bɪ''nɛfɪsnt','bɪ''nefɪsnt','[adj] 有益的； 行善的， 慈善的','the beneficent properties of natural remedies  自然疗法的益处'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_814','comprise','kəm''praɪz','kəm''praɪz','[vt] 包含； 由…组成','The house comprises two bedrooms, a kitchen, and a living room.  这座房子有两间卧室、一间厨房和一间起居室。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_815','moderate','ˈmɑdərɪt; (for v.,) ˈmɑdərˌeɪt','''mɒd(ə)rət','[adj] 适度的； 温和的； 普通的; [v] 缓和，使适中; [n] 持温和意见的人','Even moderate amounts of alcohol can be dangerous.  喝酒即使不多也会有危险。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_816','resident','''rɛzɪdənt','''rezɪdənt','[adj] 常驻的；居住的; [n] 居民； 住宿者， 旅客； 住院实习医生','a resident tutor  住校辅导老师'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_817','upheaval','ʌp''hivl','ʌp''hiːvl','[n] 剧变， 动乱， 大变动','political upheaval  政治剧变'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_818','receiver','rɪ''sivɚ','rɪ''siːvər','[n] 接收器； 听筒； 接收者； 官方接管人','The business is in the hands of the receivers .  公司现在由破产管理人接管。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_819','gilding','''ɡɪldɪŋ','''gɪldɪŋ','[n] 镀金； 贴金层， 镀金层； 金色涂层','A thin layer of gold or something simulating gold that is applied in gilding.  镀金，包金一层薄的涂金层或其适用于镀金的仿金物。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_820','execute','''ɛksɪkjut','''eksɪkjuːt','[vt] 执行， 履行， 实施； 将…处死， 处决； 完成','13 people were summarily executed (= killed without any trial or legal process ) by the guerrillas.  有13人被游击队员就地处决。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_821','substantial','səbˈstænʃəl','sʌb''stænʃl','[adj] 实质的； 坚固的； 可观的， 大量的','We have the support of a substantial number of parents.  我们有相当多家长的支持。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_822','balm','bɑm','bɑːm','[n] 香脂油， 药膏； 镇痛剂， 安慰剂','lip balm  润唇膏'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_823','Paleolithic',',pelɪo''lɪθɪk','ˌpæliə''lɪθɪk','[adj] 旧石器时代的; [n] 旧石器时代','Paleolithic man could only make the most basic stone tools.  旧石器时代的人类只能制造最简单的石器。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_824','benefit','''bɛnɪfɪt','''benɪfɪt','[v] 受益； 得益于; [n] 益处，好处；恩惠；津贴','They are working together to benefit the whole community.  他们在为整个社区的利益共同努力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_825','quality','''kwɑləti','''kwɑːləti','[adj] 优良的， 优质的; [n] 质，质量；品德，品质；性质，特性','quality childcare at prices people can afford  人们负担得起的优质儿童护育服务'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_826','unique','jʊ''nik','ju''niːk','[adj] 唯一的； 独特的， 罕见的； 特有的','Each person’s fingerprints are unique.  每个人的指纹都是独一无二的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_827','boost','bʊst','buːst','[vt] 提高，推进；替…做广告，宣扬; [n] 增加， 帮助','The new resort area has boosted tourism.  新的度假区促进了旅游业的发展。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_828','sober','''sobɚ','''soubər','[adj] 清醒的，未醉的；持重的，冷静的；素净的; [v] 清醒； 变得冷静','He’s a nice guy when he’s sober.  他没喝醉时是个不错的家伙。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_829','male','mel','meɪl','[adj] 雄的，公的；','adult male bears  成年公熊'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_830','maternal','mə''tɝnl','mə''tɜːrnl','[adj] 母亲的， 母系的','Annie was wonderfully warm and maternal.  安妮非常亲切慈爱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_831','prolific','prə''lɪfɪk','prə''lɪfɪk','[adj] 多产的； 富有创造力的','Handel’s prolific output of opera  韩德尔丰富的歌剧作品'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_832','expel','ɪk''spɛl','ɪk''spel','[vt] 开除； 驱逐； 排出','More than five-thousand high school students have been expelled for cheating.  五千多名中学生因考试作弊而被开除。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_833','shelter','''ʃɛltɚ','''ʃeltər','[n] 掩蔽处，庇护所；居所，住所；掩蔽，保护; [vt] 保护， 掩蔽； 躲避','The men took shelter in a bombed-out farmhouse.  那些男人躲在一间被炸毁的农舍里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_834','externality',',ɛkstɚ''næləti','ˌekstɜːr''næləti','[n] 外部性， 外界效应',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_835','latitude','''lætɪtud','''lætɪtjuːd','[n] 纬度；','The birds breed in northern latitudes.  这些鸟在北纬地区繁殖。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_836','vigor','''vɪgɚ','''vɪgər','[n] 活力， 精力','They are here to drink in vigor from the youth.  他们来这里是想从年轻人身上得到活力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_837','scan','skæn','skæn','[vt] 细察，审视；扫描；粗略地看，浏览; [n] 扫描检查； 浏览','He scanned the horizon, but there was no sign of the ship.  他朝地平线处仔细眺望，但是找不到那艘船的踪影。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_838','industry','''ɪndəstri','''ɪndəstri','[n] 勤劳， 勤奋； 工业， 行业','I work in the oil industry.  我在石油行业工作。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_839','eliminate','ɪ''lɪmɪnet','ɪ''lɪmɪneɪt','[vt] 消除； 淘汰','Our team was eliminated in the first round.  我们队第一轮就被淘汰了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_840','augment','ɔɡ''mɛnt','ɔːg''ment','[vt] 增加， 提高','Any surplus was sold to augment their income.  所有多余的东西被售卖一空来增加他们的收入。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_841','tangent','''tændʒənt','''tændʒənt','[adj] 切线的， 相切的; [n] 切线；正切','Both of approaching and returning movements are along the tangent of the circle.  绕转之后移动方向为自南向北，也是沿圆周的切线运动。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_842','benign','bɪ''naɪn','bɪ''naɪn','[adj] 良性的； 有利的； 善良的， 和蔼的','He shook his head in benign amusement.  他被逗乐了，和蔼地摇了摇头。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_843','destruction','dɪ''strʌkʃən','dɪ''strʌkʃn','[n] 毁坏， 毁灭','{"COLLOINEXA":["weapons of mass destruction"]}  大规模杀伤性武器'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_844','acquit','ə''kwɪt','ə''kwɪt','[vt] 宣告无罪； 表现','All the defendants were acquitted.  所有被告都被判无罪。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_845','stiff','stɪf','stɪf','[adv] 极其， 非常； 僵硬地; [adj] 硬的，僵直的；呆板的；拘谨的；艰难的，费劲的；强烈的','Anna tried to look interested. Actually, she was bored stiff.  安娜试图装出感兴趣的样子。实际上她都厌烦透了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_846','prosper','''prɑspɚ','''prɑːspər','[vi] 繁荣， 兴旺； 成功','Businesses across the state are prospering.  整个州的企业都很景气。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_847','blizzard','''blɪzɚd','''blɪzərd','[n] 暴风雪， 大风雪','We got stuck in a blizzard.  我们被暴风雪困住了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_848','appeal','ə''pil','ə''piːl','[vi] 上诉，起诉；呼吁，恳求；吸引; [n] 上诉， 申诉； 呼吁， 恳求； 感染力， 吸引力','She is not happy with the decision and plans to appeal.  她不服判决，打算上诉。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_849','swamp','swɑmp','swɑːmp','[n] 沼泽地，湿地; [vt] 使陷入， 淹没； 使应接不暇， 使疲于应对','I spent one whole night by a swamp behind the road listening to frogs.  我整个晚上都在这条路后面的一个沼泽地旁听蛙鸣。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_850','entrepreneur','ˌɑntrəprəˈnɝ​','ˌɑːntrəprə''nɜːr','[n] 企业家； 承包人','How would you define personal growth as an entrepreneur?  你会如何定义，一个企业家的个人成长？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_851','transportation',',trænspɔr''teʃən','ˌtrænspɔːr''teɪʃn','[n] 运输； 运输系统， 运输工具','The city needs to improve its public transportation (= buses, trains etc ) .  这座城市需要改善公共交通。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_852','dedicate','''dɛdɪket','''dedɪkeɪt','[vt] 致力于， 奉献给； 题献词于上','She dedicated her first album to Woody Allen, who she says understands her obsession.  她把她的第一张唱片献给伍迪·艾伦，她说艾伦理解她的痴迷。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_853','dye','daɪ','daɪ','[v] 染色; [n] 颜料，染料','The women prepared, spun, and dyed the wool.  妇女们将羊毛预备、纺线并染色。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_854','extensive','ɪk''stɛnsɪv','ɪk''stensɪv','[adj] 广大的， 广阔的； 广泛的， 大量的','The house stands in extensive grounds.  这栋房子占地面积很大。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_855','monotonous','mə''nɑtənəs','mə''nɑːtənəs','[adj] 单调的， 无聊的','a monotonous diet  单调的饮食'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_856','negate','nɪˈɡet','nɪ''geɪt','[vt] 取消； 否定','Efforts to expand the tourist industry could be negated by reports that the sea is highly polluted.  有关海洋受到严重污染的报道可能会使拓展旅游业的努力完全白费。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_857','impart','ɪm''pɑrt','ɪm''pɑːrt','[vt] 传授； 传达； 给予','She had information that she couldn’t wait to impart.  她得到了消息，迫不及待地想告诉别人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_858','inspire','ɪn''spaɪɚ','ɪn''spaɪər','[vt] 鼓舞， 激励； 给…以灵感','We need someone who can inspire the team.  我们需要一个能鼓舞团队士气的人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_859','bureaucracy','bjʊ''rɑkrəsi','bju''rɑːkrəsi','[n] 官僚主义， 官僚作风； 政府机构， 官僚机构','the reduction of unnecessary bureaucracy  消除不必要的官僚体制'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_860','geometry','dʒɪ''ɑmətri','dʒi''ɑːmətri','[n] 几何， 几何学','...the very ordered way in which mathematics and geometry describe nature.  …数学和几何学描述自然的条理性。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_861','devote','dɪ''vot','dɪ''vout','[vt] 为…付出； 献身于','He decided to devote the rest of his life to scientific investigation.  他决定把余生奉献给科学研究。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_862','delectable','dɪ''lɛktəbl','dɪ''lektəbl','[adj] 美味可口的； 有吸引力的； 令人喜爱的， 赏心悦目的','Delectable smells rose from the kitchen.  厨房里传来诱人的香味。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_863','barb','bɑrb','bɑːrb','[n] 鱼钩， 倒钩； 挖苦的话','The barb stung her exactly the way he hoped it would.  他的讽刺如期伤到了她。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_864','alumnus','ə''lʌmnəs','ə''lʌmnəs','[n] 校友，毕业生','President Kennedy was an alumnus of Harvard University.  肯尼迪总统是哈佛大学的毕业生。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_865','far-fetched','''fɑ:''fetʃt','fɑːr''fetʃt','[adj] 牵强的','All this may sound a bit far-fetched, but companies are already developing ‘intelligent’ homes.  这一切听起来也许有点难以置信，但的确有一些公司已经在开发“智能”房屋了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_866','approximate','ə''prɑksɪmət','ə''prɒksɪmət','[adj] 大约的， 近似的; [vt] 接近， 近似','What is the approximate number of students in each class?  每个班大致有多少学生？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_867','craftsman','''kræftsmən','''kræftsmən','[n] 能工巧匠， 手艺人， 工艺师','The table in the kitchen was made by a local craftsman.  厨房里的桌子是当地一名工匠做的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_868','project','prəˈdʒɛkt; prɑdʒɛkt','prəˈdʒekt; ˈprɒdʒekt','[v] 放映； 规划； 预测， 推想; [n] 方案； 课题， 项目； 工程','The company projected an annual growth rate of 3%.  该公司预计每年的增长率为3%。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_869','aberrant','æ''bɛrənt','æ''berənt','[adj] 越轨的； 异常的','aberrant behaviour  异常行为'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_870','lope','lop','loup','[vi] 轻松地大步跑; [n] 轻快的步伐','He was loping across the sand toward Nancy.  他正穿过沙滩轻快地向南希跑去。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_871','lateral','''lætərəl','''lætərəl','[adj] 侧面的， 旁边的； 横向的','The wall is weak and requires lateral support.  墙体不坚固，需要从侧面加以支撑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_872','hinterland','''hɪntɚlænd','''hɪntərlænd','[n] 内地， 腹地； 内地贸易区','the rural hinterland  内地乡村'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_873','nominate','''nɑmɪnet','''nɑːmɪneɪt','[vt] 任命， 指定； 提名， 推荐','This week one of them will be nominated by the Democratic Party for the presidency of the United States.  本周他们中的一人将被民主党提名为美国总统职位的候选人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_874','tread','trɛd','tred','[v] 踏，践踏；行走; [n] 轮胎面； 脚步声； 步法','If I wanted to keep my job, I knew I’d have to tread lightly.  我知道我要是想保住工作，就得小心谨慎。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_875','diameter','daɪ''æmɪtɚ','daɪ''æmɪtər','[n] 直径','...a tube less than a fifth of the diameter of a human hair.  …一根直径不到头发五分之一的微管。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_876','stationary','''steʃənɛri','''steɪʃəneri','[adj] 静止的； 固定的， 稳定的， 不变的','How did you manage to drive into a stationary vehicle?  你是怎么开车的，竟会撞上一辆停着的车子？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_877','barn','bɑrn','bɑːrn','[n] 谷仓； 牲口棚',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_878','bark','bɑrk','bɑːrk','[v] 吠叫； 厉声质问; [n] 树皮；犬吠声','Don''t let the dogs bark.  别让狗叫。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_879','kennel','''kɛnl','''kenl','[n] 狗窝； 养狗场','Once you have chosen a kennel, make a booking for your pet.  一旦您选定了养狗场，请为您的宠物预约。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_880','ellipse','ɪ''lɪps','ɪ''lɪps','[n] 椭圆， 椭圆形','The Earth orbits in an ellipse.  地球沿椭圆形轨道运动。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_881','bare','bɛr','ber','[adj] 赤裸的；光秃的，无遮盖的；最基本的; [vt] 脱掉； 显露','a ragged child with bare feet  一个衣衫褴褛、光着脚的小孩'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_882','sidewalk','''saɪdwɔk','''saɪdwɔːk','[n] 人行道','She walked along the sidewalk.  她沿着人行道走着。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_883','formidable','''fɔrmɪdəbl','''fɔːmɪdəb(ə)l; fɔː''mɪd-','[adj] 难对付的； 强大的； 令人敬畏的','The building is grey, formidable, not at all picturesque.  那幢建筑呈灰色，气势凛然，与漂亮沾不上边。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_884','abound','ə''baʊnd','ə''baund','[vi] 富于； 大量存在； 充满','Rumours abound as to the reasons for his resignation.  有关他辞职的原因有各种各样的谣传。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_885','suitcase','''sutkes','''suːtkeɪs','[n] 手提箱， 衣箱','It did not take Andrew long to pack a suitcase.  安德鲁没有用多长时间就整理好了手提箱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_886','invert','''ɪnvɝt','ɪn''vɜːrt','[vt] 使倒转， 使倒置， 使颠倒','Invert the cake onto a serving plate.  把蛋糕倒扣过来放到一个盘子上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_887','discrete','dɪ''skrit','dɪ''skriːt','[adj] 分离的， 个别的； 离散的','The change happens in a series of discrete steps.  这个变化在一系列分离的步骤中发生。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_888','temperate','''tɛmpərət','''tempərət','[adj] 气候温和的， 温带的； 温和的， 自我克制的','The Nile Valley keeps a temperate climate throughout the year.  尼罗河流域全年气候温和。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_889','immutable','ɪ''mjutəbl','ɪ''mjuːtəbl','[adj] 不可改变的， 永恒不变的','This decision should not be seen as immutable.  不该把这个决定看成是不可改变的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_890','disrupt','dɪs''rʌpt','dɪs''rʌpt','[vt] 使中断； 扰乱； 使分裂， 使瓦解','Traffic was disrupted by a hoax bomb.  有人虚报有炸弹，造成了交通混乱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_891','scar','skɑr','skɑːr','[vt] 给…留下疤痕；给…留下精神创伤；损害…的外观; [n] 疤痕； 创伤','His hands were badly scarred by the fire.  他的双手被那次大火烧得疤痕累累。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_892','abort','ə''bɔrt','ə''bɔːrt','[v] 夭折， 中止； 使流产','The rescue mission had to be aborted.  救援任务不得不停止。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_893','hypothetical',',haɪpə''θɛtɪkl','ˌhaɪpə''θetɪkl','[adj] 假设的','The question is purely hypothetical .  这个问题完全基于假设。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_894','coefficient',',koɪ''fɪʃnt','ˌkouɪ''fɪʃnt','[n] 系数','In 8pq, the coefficient of pq is 8.  在8pq中pq的系数为8。'),
