('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1242','compose','kəm''poz','kəm''pouz','[v] 创作； 组成； 使安定','Barrington has composed the music for a new production of ‘A Midsummer Night’s Dream’.  巴林顿为新版的《仲夏夜之梦》谱了曲。'),
