('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1289','bureau','''bjʊro','''bjurou','[n] 局， 署； 办公室； 机构','an employment bureau  职业介绍所'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1290','moist','mɔɪst','mɔɪst','[adj] 潮湿的； 多雨的','Make sure the soil is moist before planting the seeds.  播种之前要确保土壤湿润。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1291','cable','''kebl','''keɪbl','[v] 给…发电报， 用电报传送; [n] 缆绳，钢索；电缆；电报','cables and switches for computers  电脑的缆线和开关'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1292','intense','ɪn''tɛns','ɪn''tens','[adj] 强烈的； 热切的； 激烈的','Young people today are under intense pressure to succeed.  如今的年轻人面临要出人头地的巨大压力。'),
