('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1305','secular','''sɛkjəlɚ','''sekjələr','[adj] 现世的； 世俗的； 非宗教的','secular education  世俗教育'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1306','activate','''æktə''vet','''æktɪveɪt','[vt] 刺激， 使活动','Cooking fumes may activate the alarm.  烹调时的油烟可能会触发警报器。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1307','strenuous','''strɛnjuəs','''strenjuəs','[adj] 费劲的， 费力的， 艰苦的； 精力充沛的； 奋力的','a strenuous climb  艰难的攀登'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1308','lethargy','''lɛθɚdʒi','''leθərdʒi','[n] 死气沉沉； 无精打采， 倦怠','New mothers often complain of lethargy and mild depression.  初为人母者经常抱怨说身体疲倦乏力，有轻微的抑郁。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1309','amusement','ə''mjuzmənt','ə''mjuːzmənt','[n] 可笑； 娱乐， 消遣','What do you do for amusement in this town?  你们镇上有什么消遣？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1310','boundary','''baʊndri','''baundri','[n] 分界线； 边界','National boundaries are becoming increasingly meaningless in the global economy.  在全球经济中，国界已经变得越来越没有意义。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1311','shame','ʃem','ʃeɪm','[n] 羞耻，羞愧，耻辱；可耻的人; [vt] 使羞愧； 玷辱','He felt a deep sense of shame.  他深深地感到羞愧。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1312','endow','ɪn''daʊ','ɪn''dau','[vt] 使天生具有， 赋予； 资助， 捐赠','You are endowed with wealth, good health and a lively intellect.  你天生赋有财富、健康，和敏锐的智力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1313','precipitate','prɪ''sɪpɪtet','prɪ''sɪpɪteɪt','[v] 使…突然降临；加速；降水；使突然陷入；; [adj] 仓促的， 鲁莽的','The riot was precipitated when four black men were arrested.  这场骚乱是因为四名黑人男子的被捕而突然引发的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1314','centric','''sɛntrɪk','''sentrɪk','[adj] 以…为中心的','That culture was characterized by fear, intimidation, favoritism, a very ego-centric CEO.  之前那种文化的特征是：敬畏、威胁、徇私，还有一位以自我为中心的首席执行官。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1315','mandate','''mændet','''mændeɪt','[v] 强制执行； 授权; [n] 授权；委托书，授权令；任期','The committee was mandated to co-ordinate measures to help Poland.  这个委员会受命协调援助波兰的方案。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1316','slog','slɑɡ','slɑːg','[v] 艰难行进； 埋头苦干； 猛击','He’s been slogging round the streets delivering catalogues.  他奔波在街头递送商品目录。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1317','financial','faɪˈnænʃəl;fəˈnæ-','faɪ''nænʃl','[adj] 财政的， 财务的， 金融的','financial transactions  财务往来'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1318','respective','rɪ''spɛktɪv','rɪ''spektɪv','[adj] 分别的， 各自的','We all went back to our respective homes to wait for news.  我们都各自回家等待消息。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1319','inactivate','ɪn''æktə,vet','ɪn''æktɪveɪt','[vt] 使不活动， 使不活跃',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1320','media','','''miːdiə','[n] 媒介， 媒体','The scandal was widely reported in the national media .  这一丑闻在全国媒体上被广泛报道。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1321','plaudit','''plɔ:dit','''plɔːdɪt','[n] 喝彩；赞美',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1322','exalt','ɪɡ''zɔlt','ɪg''zɔːlt','[vt] 高度赞扬， 褒扬； 提升， 提拔','Exalt ye the Lord.  赞美你，我的主。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1323','reversible','rɪ''vɝsəbl','rɪ''vɜːrsəbl','[adj] 可逆的， 可翻转的； 正反两用的； 可恢复原状的','A lot of chemical reactions are reversible.  很多化学反应都是可逆的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1324','define','dɪ''faɪn','dɪ''faɪn','[vt] 定义， 解释； 限定','I’ll now try to define the term ‘popular culture’.  我现在来试试给 “通俗文化” 这个词下定义。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1325','dictate','''dɪktet','''dɪkteɪt','[v] 规定；决定；口述；支配; [n] 命令， 规定','Federal funds have to be used as dictated by Washington.  联邦款项得按照华盛顿规定的途径使用。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1326','flick','flɪk','flɪk','[v] 轻拍；移动; [n] 轻拍； 浏览','His tongue flicked across his lips.  他的舌头在双唇间快速移动。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1327','memorize','''mɛmə''raɪz','''meməraɪz','[vt] 记住， 记忆， 熟记','He studied his map, trying to memorize the way to Rose''s street.  他研究了地图，努力记住去罗丝家那条街的路。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1328','render','''rɛndɚ','''rendər','[vt] 给予， 提供； 致使； 递交， 呈献； 表达； 翻译','an obligation to render assistance to those in need  为有困难的人提供援助的义务'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1329','haven','''hevn','''heɪvn','[n] 港口； 庇护所， 避难所； 栖息处','...Lake Baringo, a freshwater haven for a mixed variety of birds.  …百瑞高湖，一个适合各种鸟类的淡水栖息地。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1330','neon','''niɑn','''niːɑːn','[n] 氖； 霓虹灯','Inert gases like neon and argon have eight electrons in their outer shell.  像氖和氩这样的惰性气体，在它们的外电子层有8个电子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1331','manifest','''mænɪfɛst','''mænɪfest','[adj] 明显的; [vt] 表明，显示; [n] 货物清单','a manifest error of judgment  明显的判断错误'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1332','relieve','rɪ''liv','rɪ''liːv','[vt] 缓解， 减轻； 使轻松， 使宽慰； 调剂； 接替， 换班','Drugs helped to relieve the pain.  药物有助于舒缓疼痛。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1333','buffalo','''bʌfəlo','''bʌfəlou','[n] 水牛； 野牛','The hunter trailed the wounded buffalo through the bush.  猎人在灌木丛中追踪那只受伤的美洲野牛。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1334','endeavor','ɪn''dɛvɚ','ɪn''devər','[vi&n] 努力， 尽力','All accomplishments and success come from sustained endeavor.  所有的成就都来自于不懈的努力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1335','quartz','kwɔrts','kwɔːrts','[n] 石英','quartz crystals  石英晶体'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1336','prelude','''prɛljud','''preluːd','[n] 前奏曲， 序幕','Chopin’s Preludes  肖邦的前奏曲'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1337','adjacent','ə''dʒesnt','ə''dʒeɪsnt','[adj] 邻近的， 毗连的','We stayed in adjacent rooms.  我们住在毗连的房间里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1338','transport','''trænspɔrt','træn''spɔːt; trɑːn-','[n] 运输； 运输系统， 运载工具; [vt] 运输； 传播','commuters who travel on public transport  乘坐公共交通车辆上下班的人'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1339','grump','ɡrʌmp','grʌmp','[vi] 发脾气，发牢骚; [n] 脾气不好的人',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1340','specific','spɪ''sɪfɪk','spə''sɪfɪk','[adj] 明确的， 具体的； 特定的， 特有的','games suitable for specific age groups  适合特定年龄组的游戏'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1341','sprain','spren','spreɪn','[n&vt] 扭伤','I fell down the steps and sprained my ankle .  我从台阶上摔下来，扭伤了脚踝。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1342','prioritize','praɪ''ɔrətaɪz','praɪ''ɔːrətaɪz','[v] 划分优先顺序； 优先处理','You need to prioritize your tasks.  你需要按照轻重缓急安排自己的工作。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1343','engage','ɪn''ɡedʒ','ɪn''geɪdʒ','[v] 从事于， 忙于； 吸引； 订婚； 聘用','I have never engaged in drug trafficking.  我从来没有从事过贩毒。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1344','adroit','ə''drɔɪt','ə''drɔɪt','[adj] 精明的， 干练的； 熟练的， 灵巧的','She is a remarkably adroit and determined politician.  她是一个相当干练而果断的政治家。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1345','appetite','''æpəˌtaɪt','''æpɪtaɪt','[n] 胃口， 食欲； 欲望','Her husband always had a huge appetite.  她丈夫向来胃口极大。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1346','frivolity','fri''vəliti','frɪ''vɑːləti','[n] 轻浮； 愚蠢的行为','I don’t think such frivolity helps the organization’s public image.  我认为这种愚蠢的行为无益于这个组织的公众形象。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1347','strategy','''strætədʒi','''strætədʒi','[n] 战略， 策略','the government’s long-term economic strategy  政府的长期经济策略'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1348','remainder','rɪ''mendɚ','rɪ''meɪndər','[n] 剩余物， 残余； 其他的人； 差数， 余数','The remainder must be paid by the end of June.  剩余款项必须在6月底之前支付。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1349','clumsy','''klʌmzi','''klʌmzi','[adj] 笨拙的； 不得体的， 冒犯人的； 复杂难懂的， 难处理的','A clumsy waiter spilled wine all over her new skirt.  一名笨手笨脚的服务员把葡萄酒洒得她新裙子上到处都是。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1350','territory','''tɛrətɔri','''terətɔːri','[n] 领土， 版图； 领域， 地盘','Hong Kong is a Chinese territory.  香港是中国的领土。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1351','summon','''sʌmən','''sʌmən','[v] 传唤， 传讯； 召集， 召开； 鼓起， 振作','Robert summoned the waiter for the bill.  罗伯特召唤服务员结账。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1352','grovel','''ɡrɑvl','''grɑːvl','[vi] 摇尾乞怜， 奴颜婢膝',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1353','maintain','men''ten','meɪn''teɪn','[vt] 维持， 保持； 维修， 保养； 主张， 坚持； 赡养， 负担','Careers Officers maintain contact with young people when they have left school.  年轻人离开学校以后，职业指导员和他们保持联系。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1354','shift','ʃɪft','ʃɪft','[v] 转移；改变; [n] 转移； 改变； 轮班','Attitudes to mental illness have shifted in recent years.  对精神病的态度近年来已稍微有所改变。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1355','implore','ɪm''plɔr','ɪm''plɔːr','[v] 哀求， 恳求','‘Don’t go,’ I implored her.  “不要走。”我哀求她。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1356','rehabilitate',',riə''bɪlə,tet','ˌriːə''bɪlɪteɪt','[vt] 使恢复原状， 修复； 改造， 使恢复正常生活； 恢复…的名誉','The Prime Minister seems to be trying to rehabilitate the former defence secretary.  首相似乎在努力为前国防大臣恢复名誉。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1357','expertise','''ɛkspɝ''tiz','ˌekspɜːr''tiːz','[n] 专门知识， 专长','She was not an accountant and didn''t have the expertise to verify all of the financial details.  她不是会计，不具有核查所有这些财政细目的专业知识。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1358','bargain','ˈbɑrɡɪn','''bɑːrgən','[vi] 讨价还价; [n] 特价商品，廉价货；协议；交易','They prefer to bargain with individual clients, for cash.  他们更愿意同个人客户洽谈，做现金交易。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1359','elective','ɪ''lɛktɪv','ɪ''lektɪv','[adj] 选举的； 可选择的； 选修的','the 34 elective seats in the National Assembly  国民议会中的34个选举席位'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1360','pivot','''pɪvət','''pɪvət','[v] 在枢轴上旋转; [n] 枢轴；中心点；核心','Magee pivoted and threw the ball to first base.  马吉转身把球投到了一垒。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1361','dissuade','dɪ''swed','dɪ''sweɪd','[vt] 劝阻， 阻止','Doctors had tried to dissuade patients from smoking.  医生曾试图说服病人不要抽烟。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1362','sneaker','''snikɚ','''sniːkər','[n] 鬼鬼祟祟的人， 卑鄙者； 运动鞋','a pair of white sneakers  一双白色的运动鞋'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1363','conclusive','kən''klusɪv','kən''kluːsɪv','[adj] 确定的， 确凿的， 不容置疑的； 结论性的','Her attorneys claim there is no conclusive evidence that any murders took place.  她的律师们声称没有任何发生过谋杀的确凿证据。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1364','encompass','ɪn''kʌmpəs','ɪn''kʌmpəs','[vt] 包含； 环绕','The study encompasses the social, political, and economic aspects of the situation.  这项研究涵盖了这一局势的社会、政治和经济三方面。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1365','sustenance','''sʌstənəns','''sʌstənəns','[n] 食物； 生计； 维持','Without sustenance, the animals will soon die.  没有食物，动物很快就会死亡。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1366','allergy','''ælɚdʒi','''ælərdʒi','[n] 过敏性反应','a food allergy  食物过敏'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1367','disinterested','dɪs''ɪntərɪsɪd','dɪs''ɪntrəstɪd','[adj] 客观的， 无私的， 公正的； 无兴趣的， 不关心的','A lawyer should provide disinterested advice.  律师应该提供客观公正的建议。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1368','envelope','','''envəloup','[n] 信封','envelopes and stamps  信封和邮票'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1369','deposit','dɪ''pɑzɪt','dɪ''pɑːzɪt','[v] 沉淀；堆积；储蓄；','As the river slows down, it deposits a layer of soil.  河水流速变慢时，一层泥土便沉积下来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1370','dissipate','''dɪsɪpet','''dɪsɪpeɪt','[v] 消散， 消失； 挥霍， 浪费','As he thought it over, his anger gradually dissipated.  他想明白后，怒气就渐渐消了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1371','recount','rɪ''kaʊnt','rɪ''kaunt','[v] 讲述， 描述； 重新清点， 重计','He then recounted the story of the interview for his first job.  他然后叙述了有关他第一份工作面试的故事。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1372','flask','flæsk','flɑːrsk','[n] 细颈瓶； 烧瓶','He took out a metal flask from a canvas bag.  他从帆布袋里拿出了一个金属水瓶。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1373','fluctuation',',flʌktʃʊ''eʃən','ˌflʌktʃu''eɪʃn','[n] 波动， 起伏','Prices are subject to fluctuation.  价格可能会有波动。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1374','pliable','''plaɪəbl','''plaɪəbl','[adj] 易弯曲的， 柔韧的； 易受影响的； 顺从的','a shoe made of soft pliable leather  柔韧的皮革做成的鞋子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1375','flash','flæʃ','flæʃ','[vi] 闪光； 反射; [n] 闪光；闪现','Lightning flashed overhead.  头顶上电光闪闪。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1376','continent','''kɑntɪnənt','''kɑːntɪnənt','[n] 大陆， 陆地； 洲','the continents of Asia and Africa  亚洲及非洲大陆'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1377','disturbance','dɪ''stɝbəns','dɪ''stɜːrbəns','[n] 打扰； 骚动； 心神不安， 烦恼','There were disturbances in the crowd as fans left the stadium.  球迷离开体育场时，人群中发生了骚乱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1378','confidant','''kɑnfɪdænt','''kɑːnfɪdænt','[n] 知己， 密友','...a close confidant of the president.  ...总统的一位亲密心腹。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1379','simultaneous',',saɪml''tenɪəs','ˌsaɪml''teɪniəs','[adj] 同时的， 同步的','They grabbed each other’s hands in simultaneous panic.  他们俩同时惊慌起来，相互抓住对方的手。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1380','guarantee',',ɡærən''ti','ˌgærən''tiː','[v] 保证；担保; [n] 保证， 担保； 保证书','The bank will only lend me money if my parents guarantee the loan.  只有我父母作担保，银行才会给我贷款。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1381','improvise','''ɪmprəvaɪz','''ɪmprəvaɪz','[v] 即兴创作； 临时准备','I forgot to bring my notes, so I had to improvise.  我忘了带笔记，只好临时发挥。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1382','predation','prɪ''deʃən','prɪ''deɪʃn','[n] 掠夺； 掠食','The importance of predation as an exploitation strategy may be summarized under four main categories.  捕食作用作为一种掠夺性的对策其重要意义可归纳为四个主要方面。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1383','recommend','''rɛkə''mɛnd','ˌrekə''mend','[vt] 推荐； 建议','Doctors strongly recommend that fathers should be present at their baby’s birth.  医生极力建议孩子出生时父亲应该在场。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1384','demobilize','di''mobəlaɪz','diː''moubəlaɪz','[vt] 遣散； 使复员','programmes to help demobilized soldiers fit into civilian life  帮助复员军人适应平民生活的方案'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1385','leach','litʃ','liːtʃ','[v] 过滤；溶解; [n] 过滤器； 过滤剂','The manufacturers say that there is no danger of the aluminium leaching into the water.  生产厂家说不会有铝渗入水中的危险。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1386','prodigious','prə''dɪdʒəs','prə''dɪdʒəs','[adj] 巨大的','the artist’s prodigious output  那位艺术家惊人的高产'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1387','lost-and-found','','ˌlɔːstənd''faund','[n] 失物招领','Please look for it in the hotel lost-and-found office.  请到酒店失物招领处找找。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1388','knack','næk','næk','[n] 诀窍； 技能， 本领； 习惯， 癖好','He has a knack of saying the wrong thing.  他总爱说一些不合时宜的话。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1389','default','dɪ''fɔlt','dɪ''fɔːlt','[vi] 不履行义务， 违约; [n] 违约；弃权；缺省','The credit card business is down, and more borrowers are defaulting on loans.  信用卡生意正在走下坡路，更多的借贷人不履行还贷责任。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1390','indolent','''ɪndələnt','''ɪndələnt','[adj] 懒惰的， 懒散的； 不活跃的',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1391','tropic','''trɑpɪk','''trɑːpɪk','[adj] 热带的; [n] 回归线；热带地区','The tropic sun glared down on us all day.  热带的太阳整日灼晒着我们。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1392','beverage','''bɛvərɪdʒ','''bevərɪdʒ','[n] 饮料','alcoholic beverages  含酒精的饮料'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1393','diction','''dɪkʃən','''dɪkʃn','[n] 措辞， 用语',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1394','ripe','raɪp','raɪp','[adj] 熟的； 成熟的','Those tomatoes aren’t ripe yet.  那些番茄还没熟。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1395','attribute','ə''trɪbjut','ə''trɪbjuːt','[n] 属性， 特征; [vt] 把…归于','What attributes should a good manager possess?  一名优秀的经理应该具备哪些素质？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1396','genetic','dʒə''nɛtɪk','dʒə''netɪk','[adj] 基因的， 遗传的','genetic defects  遗传性缺陷'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1397','triumph','ˈtraɪəmf','''traɪʌmf','[v] 获胜， 成功; [n] 狂喜；胜利，成功','All her life, Kelly had stuck with difficult tasks and challenges, and triumphed.  凯利在一生中遭遇了种种艰巨任务与挑战，但成功了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1398','slumber','''slʌmbɚ','''slʌmbər','[vi] 睡眠， 安睡','The older three girls are still slumbering peacefully.  稍大些的3个女孩仍在平静地睡着。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1399','arouse','ə''raʊz','ə''rauz','[vt] 唤醒， 唤起； 激起， 引起','Matt’s behavior was arousing the interest of the neighbors.  马特的行为渐渐引起了邻居的兴趣。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1400','nest','nɛst','nest','[v] 做窝，筑巢; [n] 巢， 窝','They say eagles used to nest in those rocks.  他们说以前常有老鹰在那些岩石中筑巢。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1401','tout','taʊt','taut','[v] 吹捧； 兜售','his much touted musical  他那出备受推崇的音乐剧'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1402','expropriate','ɛks''proprɪet','eks''prouprieɪt','[vt] 征用， 没收','The Bolsheviks expropriated the property of the landowners.  布尔什维克征收了地主的土地。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1403','consensus','kən''sɛnsəs','kən''sensəs','[n] 共识， 一致同意； 舆论','The EU Council of Finance Ministers failed to reach a consensus on the pace of integration.  欧盟财政部长会议未能就一体化的进度达成共识。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1404','classic','''klæsɪk','''klæsɪk','[adj] 经典的；典型的; [n] 经典作品；','The Coca-Cola bottle is one of the classic designs of the last century.  可口可乐瓶是上个世纪的经典设计之一。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1405','embellish','im''beliʃ','ɪm''belɪʃ','[vt] 装饰； 对…添枝加叶， 渲染','She gave an embellished account of what had happened.  她添油加醋地把发生的事描述了一番。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1406','metric','''mɛtrɪk','''metrɪk','[adj] 米制的； 公制的','a metric tonne  一公吨'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1407','absolute','''æbsəlut','''æbsəluːt','[adj] 完全的， 绝对的； 地道的； 无疑的， 确凿的； 不受限制的， 不受约束的','I have absolute confidence in her.  我对她充满信心。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1408','retract','rɪ''trækt','rɪ''trækt','[v] 收回， 撤销； 缩回','He confessed to the murder but later retracted his statement.  他承认谋杀，但后来又翻供了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1409','gossip','''ɡɑsɪp','''gɑːsɪp','[vi] 传播流言飞语， 说长道短; [n] 闲话，流言飞语；爱说长道短的人','We spoke, debated, gossiped into the night.  我们交谈、争论、闲聊到夜间。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1410','technological','tɛknə''lɑdʒɪkl','ˌteknə''lɑːdʒɪkl','[adj] 技术的， 工艺的','The steam engine was the greatest technological advance of the 19th century.  蒸汽机是19世纪最伟大的技术进步。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1411','grab','ɡræb','græb','[v] 拿， 抓， 夺','I managed to grab her hand.  我设法抓住了她的手。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1412','silversmith','''sɪlvɚsmɪθ','''sɪlvərsmɪθ','[n] 银匠； 银器商人','For familial reputation, the old madam of wooden elegant you home paid the silversmith Li Yinshan that comes from Chinese ground Kangzhutuo in the dark.  为了家族的名誉，木雅府上的老夫人暗中把康珠托付给了从汉地来的银匠李银山。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1413','antecedent','''æntə''sidnt','ˌæntɪ''siːdnt','[adj] 先行的; [n] 祖先，先辈','Some patients state that lesions develop at the site of antecedent trauma.  一些患者指出，病灶出现在先前的创伤部位。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1414','remains','rɪ''menz','rɪ''meɪnz','[n] 剩余物， 残留物； 古代遗物， 遗迹， 遗址； 遗骸','extensive Roman remains (= of ancient buildings ) at Arles  阿尔勒的一大片古罗马遗迹'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1415','granular','''grænjəlɚ','''grænjələr','[adj] 粒状的； 含颗粒的','...a granular fertilizer.  ...一种粒状化肥。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1416','incorporate','','ɪn''kɔːrpəreɪt','[vt] 纳入， 合并； 包含； 吸收； 注册成立','The new cars will incorporate a number of major improvements.  这种新型汽车将包含许多重大的改进。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1417','graphite','ˈɡræfˌaɪt','''græfaɪt','[n] 石墨','The nation boasts veins of coal, iron ore, limestone, magnesite, graphite, copper, zinc, lead and precious metals.  这个国家拥有煤炭、铁矿石、石灰石、菱镁矿、石墨、铜、锌、铅和贵金属等矿脉。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1418','boast','bost','boust','[v&n] 自我夸耀','‘I wouldn’t be afraid,’ she boasted.  “我才不怕呢。”她吹嘘道。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1419','reiterate','rɪ''ɪtəret','ri''ɪtəreɪt','[vt] 反复说， 重申','Let me reiterate the most important points.  我来把最重要的几点重申一遍。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1420','flank','flæŋk','flæŋk','[n] 肋腹；侧面；侧翼; [vt] 位于…的侧面','We were attacked on our left flank.  我们的左翼受到攻击。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1421','counterpart','''kaʊntɚpɑrt','''kauntərpɑːrt','[n] 相对物； 职位相当的人； 副本','As soon as he heard what was afoot, he telephoned his German and Italian counterparts to protest.  他一听到在进行中的事，马上就给德国和意大利相应人员打电话抗议。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1422','segment','''sɛɡmənt','''segmənt','[n] 音段； 段， 部分','Decorate with orange segments.  用几瓣橙子作点缀。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1423','stripe','straɪp','straɪp','[n] 条纹， 斑纹','a shirt with black and white stripes  黑白条纹衬衫'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1424','sovereign','sɑvrɪn','''sɑːvrən','[adj] 君主的；至高无上的；独立自主的; [n] 君主， 元首， 最高统治者','Lithuania and Armenia signed a treaty in Vilnius recognizing each other as independent sovereign states.  立陶宛和亚美尼亚在维尔纽斯签订了一份互相承认各自为独立主权国家的协定。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1425','gourd','ɡʊrd','gurd','[n] 葫芦； 葫芦制成的容器',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1426','attractive','ə''træktɪv','ə''træktɪv','[adj] 吸引人的， 有魅力的； 引起注意的','an attractive young woman  妩媚动人的年轻女子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1427','cater','''ketɚ','''keɪtər','[v] 迎合； 提供饮食','We cater to an exclusive clientele.  我们满足一个特殊客户群的需求。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1428','superb','/suːˈpɜːrb/','suː''pɜːrb','[adj] 极好的， 高质量的， 上乘的； 华丽的','The food was superb.  食物好吃极了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1429','engineering','''ɛndʒə''nɪrɪŋ','ˌendʒɪ''nɪrɪŋ','[n] 工程； 工程学','...graduates with degrees in engineering.  …获得工程学学位的毕业生。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1430','duplicate','''duplɪket','ˈdjuːplɪkeɪt','[adj] 完全相同的；副本的; [n] 复制品； 副本; [vt] 复写； 复制； 使加倍','A duplicate copy should be made for the county record office.  应该制作一个副本呈交县档案室。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1431','affable','''æfəbl','''æfəbl','[adj] 和蔼可亲的， 易于交谈的， 友善的','an affable guy  一个平易近人的人'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1432','decrease','dɪ''kris','dɪ''kriːs','[v] 减少; [n] 减少','The number of people who have the disease has decreased significantly in recent years.  近年来，这种病的患者人数明显下降。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1433','surmise','sɝ''maɪz','sə''maɪz','[v] 推测， 猜测; [n] 推测， 猜测','There''s so little to go on, we can only surmise what happened.  几乎没有什么可继续进行的，我们只能猜测发生过的事。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1434','eradicate','ɪ''rædɪket','ɪ''rædɪkeɪt','[vt] 根除， 灭绝','an attempt to eradicate inflation  为消除通货膨胀所作的努力'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1435','germinate','''dʒɝmɪnet','''dʒɜːrmɪneɪt','[v] 发芽， 萌芽； 发展','The idea of setting up his own company began to germinate in his mind.  他萌生了自己开公司的想法。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1436','trumpet','''trʌmpɪt','''trʌmpɪt','[v] 鼓吹，宣扬; [n] 小号， 喇叭','They are proudly trumpeting the fact that they are creating more jobs.  他们得意地宣扬他们是在创造更多的工作岗位。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1437','conservationist',',kɑnsɚ''veʃənɪst','ˌkɑːnsər''veɪʃənɪst','[n] 自然环境保护论者','Conservationists say the law must be strengthened.  环保主义者称必须加强法制。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1438','despondent','dɪ''spɑndənt','dɪ''spɑːndənt','[adj] 垂头丧气的， 沮丧的','Gill had been out of work for a year and was getting very despondent.  吉尔失业一年了，开始变得非常消沉。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1439','trifle','''traɪfl','''traɪfl','[vi] 不认真对待， 怠慢; [n] 少许；琐事，小事；无价值的东西','There’s no point in arguing over trifles.  为琐事争吵毫无意义。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1440','migrate','''maɪɡret','''maɪgreɪt','[v] 迁徙； 移居','People migrate to cities like Jakarta in search of work.  人们移居到雅加达这样的城市找工作。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1441','Easter','istəʳ','''iːstər','[n] 复活节','on Easter Sunday  在复活节星期日'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1442','string','strɪŋ','strɪŋ','[v] 用线串； 悬挂; [n] 细绳，带子；一串；一系列；弦','beads strung on a silver chain  穿在银链上的珠子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1443','submit','səb''mɪt','səb''mɪt','[v] 提交， 呈递； 屈从； 主张， 建议','In desperation, Mrs. Jones submitted to an operation on her right knee to relieve the pain.  绝望中，琼斯夫人不得已接受了一次她右膝的手术以减轻疼痛。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1444','occupy','''ɑkjupaɪ','''ɑːkjupaɪ','[vt] 占用； 占据， 占领； 使忙于','He occupies the house without paying any rent.  他住在这幢房子里，没有付一分钱房租。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1445','import','''ɪmpɔt','ɪm''pɔːt; ''ɪm-','[n] 进口， 输入； 意义， 要旨， 重要性; [vt] 进口， 输入','The beetle is thought to be a European import.  这种甲虫被认为是从欧洲传入的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1446','affluent','''æfluənt','''æfluənt','[adj] 丰富的； 富裕的','affluent families  富裕的家庭'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1447','indigestion',',ɪndɪ''dʒɛstʃən','ˌɪndɪ''dʒestʃən','[n] 消化不良','These pills are for your fever and indigestion.  这些药丸是治你的发烧和消化不良的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1448','intrude','ɪn''trʊd','ɪn''truːd','[vi] 侵入， 闯入； 打扰， 侵扰','Would I be intruding if I came with you?  我要是和你一起去，会不会打扰你？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1449','simplicity','sɪm''plɪsəti','sɪm''plɪsəti','[n] 简单， 容易； 朴素， 质朴','Mona wrote with a beautiful simplicity of style.  莫娜的文笔朴实优美。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1450','blink','blɪŋk','blɪŋk','[v] 眨眼睛；闪亮，闪烁; [n] 眨眼睛','I blinked as I came out into the sunlight.  我走出来，在太阳光下直眨眼睛。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1451','summit','''sʌmɪt','''sʌmɪt','[n] 最高点， 峰顶， 极点； 峰会','the European summit  欧洲首脑会议'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1452','perfume','pɚ''fjum','pər''fjuːm','[n] 香味；香水; [vt] 使充满香气； 洒香水于','She was wearing the perfume that he’d bought her.  她擦了他买给她的香水。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1453','magnify','''mæɡnɪfaɪ','''mægnɪfaɪ','[vt] 放大， 扩大； 夸大','At the Sheffield arena, the speakers were magnified ten times on a giant screen.  在谢菲尔德体育馆，演讲者在一个巨大的屏幕上被放大了十倍。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1454','redundant','rɪ''dʌndənt','rɪ''dʌndənt','[adj] 多余的； 累赘的','the removal of redundant information  多余信息的删除'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1455','durable','''dʊrəbl','''durəbl','[adj] 持久的， 耐用的','Wood is a durable material.  木头是耐用材料。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1456','impose','ɪm''poz','ɪm''pouz','[v] 把…强加于； 征； 处以','Parents should beware of imposing their own tastes on their children.  父母应该提防把自己的兴趣强加给孩子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1457','mammal','''mæml','''mæml','[n] 哺乳动物','The more you follow the fear, the more you live like a lower mammal.  你越是追随恐惧行为，就越会活得像个低级哺乳动物。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1458','preliterate','pri''lɪtərɪt','ˌpriː''lɪtərət','[adj] 文字出现以前的， 没有文字的','Similar tales were told by various preliterate peoples in Asia, Africa, and the Americas.  在亚洲、非洲和美洲各国，文字出现之前，也有相似的传说。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1459','factor','''fæktɚ','''fæktər','[n] 要素， 因素； 因数； 系数','The rise in crime is mainly due to social and economic factors.  犯罪率上升主要由社会和经济因素造成。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1460','rite','raɪt','raɪt','[n] 仪式， 典礼','funeral rites  殡葬仪式'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1461','pinch','pɪntʃ','pɪntʃ','[v] 捏，掐；夹痛；偷窃；逮捕; [n] 捏， 掐； 一撮， 微量','We have to stop her pinching her baby brother.  我们不能让她再掐她小弟弟了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1462','mischievous','''mɪstʃɪvəs','''mɪstʃɪvəs','[adj] 恶作剧的， 顽皮的， 淘气的； 恶意的','Their sons are noisy and mischievous.  他们的几个儿子又吵又淘气。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1463','conquer','''kɑŋkɚ','''kɑːŋkər','[vt] 战胜， 征服； 克服','The Normans conquered England in 1066.  诺曼人于 1066 年征服英格兰。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1464','wan','wɑn','wæn','[adj] 苍白的， 无血色的； 憔悴的','She gave a wan smile.  她无力地笑了一下。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1465','continuity','''kɑntə''nʊəti','ˌkɑːntə''njuːəti','[n] 连贯性， 连续性','We should ensure continuity of care between hospital and home.  我们应当保证医院护理和家庭护理的连续性。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1466','sculpture','''skʌlptʃɚ','''skʌlptʃər','[n] 雕像， 雕塑品； 雕刻术','...stone sculptures of figures and animals.  …人物及动物石雕。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1467','realization',',riələ''zeʃən','ˌriːəlaɪ''zeɪʃn','[n] 实现； 意识','the realization of assets  资产变现'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1468','wax','waks','wæks','[v] 给…打蜡；渐满; [n] 蜡； 蜡状物','wax crayons  蜡笔'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1469','contamination','kən,tæmi''neiʃən','kənˌtæmɪ''neɪʃn','[n] 污染； 玷污','Inspect the regulator. Check the regulator for evidence of damage or contamination.  检查调整器。检查调整器是否有损伤或污染的迹象。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1470','arable','''ærəbl','''ærəbl','[adj] 可耕作的，适于耕作的; [n] 可耕地','arable farming  耕作农业'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1471','gist','dʒɪst','dʒɪst','[n] 主旨， 要点， 大意','Don’t worry about all the details as long as you get the gist (= understand the main meaning ) of it.  不要去管各个细节，只要理解主要意思就行了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1472','urban','''ɝbən','''ɜːrbən','[adj] 城市的， 市内的','unemployment in urban areas  城市地区的失业状况'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1473','refer','rɪ''fɝ','rɪ''fɜːr','[v] 提到， 谈及； 查阅， 参考','In his speech, he referred to a recent trip to Canada.  在他的讲话中，他提到了最近的加拿大之行。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1474','stellar','ˈstelər','''stelər','[adj] 星的， 恒星的， 星球的； 精彩的； 优秀的','the company’s stellar growth  这家公司辉煌的发展'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1475','flame','flem','fleɪm','[v] 燃烧； 闪耀; [n] 火舌，火焰；光芒，光辉；强烈的感情','A great fire flamed in an open fireplace.  敞开的壁炉里火烧得很旺。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1476','discard','dɪsˈkɑːrd','dɪs''kɑːrd','[vt] 丢弃','Discard any old cleaning materials.  把所有旧清洁用品都扔掉。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1477','subsidy','''sʌbsədi','''sʌbsədi','[n] 补助金， 津贴','European farmers are planning a massive demonstration against farm subsidy cuts.  欧洲的农场主们正在策划一场反对削减农场补贴的大游行。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1478','criteria','kraɪ''tɪrɪə','kraɪ''tɪriə','[n] [criterion的复数形式]标准， 准则','The most important criterion for entry is that applicants must design and make their own work.  参加的最重要标准就是申请人必须设计并制作自己的作品。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1479','obscene','əb''sin','əb''siːn','[adj] 淫秽的， 下流的； 骇人听闻的； 可憎的， 可恶的','Bradford made an obscene gesture.  布拉德福德做了个下流手势。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1480','raft','ræft','ræft','[v] 用筏运送； 乘筏渡河; [n] 筏，木排；充气船','...a river trip on bamboo rafts through dense rainforest.  …一次乘着竹筏穿过茂密雨林的河上旅行。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1481','attentive','ə''tɛntɪv','ə''tentɪv','[adj] 注意的， 专心的； 关心的','an attentive audience  聚精会神的听众'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1482','prohibitive','prə''hɪbətɪv','prə''hɪbətɪv','[adj] 禁止的， 抑制的； 高得令人难以承受的','The cost of land in Tokyo is prohibitive.  东京地价令人望而却步。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1483','flair','flɛr','fler','[n] 才能， 本领； 天资','Jo has a flair for languages.  乔有语言天赋。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1484','modest','''mɑdɪst','''mɑːdɪst','[adj] 谦虚的； 适度的','You’re too modest! You’ve been a huge help to us.  你太谦虚了！你帮了我们大忙呢。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1485','crush','krʌʃ','krʌʃ','[vt] 碾碎； 使变形； 镇压','Andrew crushed his empty can.  安德鲁压扁了他的空罐子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1486','electron','ɪ''lɛktrɑn','ɪ''lektrɑːn','[n] 电子','Most things are balanced - with equal numbers of electrons and protons.  大部分物体都是电荷平衡的——含等量的电子和质子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1487','embed','ɪm''bɛd','ɪm''bed','[vt] 把…嵌入； 使深留脑中','One of the bullets passed through Andrea''s chest before embedding itself in a wall.  其中一颗子弹穿过安德烈亚的胸膛然后嵌入一面墙中。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1488','citadel','ˈsɪtədəl','''sɪtədəl','[n] 堡垒， 要塞','The citadel at Besançon towered above the river.  贝桑松城堡高过河面。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1489','promising','''prɑmɪsɪŋ','''prɑːmɪsɪŋ','[adj] 有希望的； 有前途的','a promising career in law  很有前途的法律职业'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1490','ambivalent','æm''bɪvələnt','æm''bɪvələnt','[adj] 对立的， 感情矛盾的','When it comes to love, we''re ambivalent about "opposites attract".  说到“爱情”，我们对“异性相吸”怀有矛盾的看法。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1491','practicable','''præktɪkəbl','''præktɪkəbl','[adj] 能实行的， 可行的， 适用的','The only practicable course of action is to sell the company.  唯一可行的做法是把公司卖掉。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1492','physiology','''fɪzɪ''ɑlədʒi','ˌfɪzi''ɑːlədʒi','[n] 生理学； 生理机能','a book on biochemistry and physiology  一本关于生物化学和生理学的书'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1493','lofty','''lɔfti','''lɔːfti','[adj] 高耸的； 崇高的； 高傲的','He stayed at the Four Seasons Hotel, from whose lofty heights he could see across New York.  他住在四季酒店，从酒店高处可以看到纽约的全景。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1494','explicit','ɪk''splɪsɪt','ɪk''splɪsɪt','[adj] 清楚的； 直率的','The contrast could not have been made more explicit.  这个对比再清楚不过了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1495','utilize','''juːtəlaɪz','''juːtəlaɪz','[vt] 利用','We must consider how best to utilize what resources we have.  我们必须考虑怎样充分利用现有的资源。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1496','prevail','pri''vel','prɪ''veɪl','[vi] 盛行， 流行； 战胜， 压倒； 劝说','Justice will prevail.  正义终将获胜。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1497','flake','flek','fleɪk','[v] 使成薄片；雪片般落下; [n] 薄片','The paint is beginning to flake off.  油漆开始剥落了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1498','browse','braʊz','brauz','[v] 吃嫩叶或草；浏览; [n] 嫩叶； 浏览','a feature that allows you to browse your hard drive and choose the graphic you want to display  让你可以浏览硬盘驱动器选择自己想要显示的图像的一个功能'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1499','implicit','ɪm''plɪsɪt','ɪm''plɪsɪt','[adj] 含蓄的； 绝对的； 内含的','...an implicit warning to the Moroccans not to continue or repeat the military actions they began a week ago.  …叫摩洛哥人不要继续或重复一周前开始的军事行动的含蓄警告。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1500','purity','''pjʊrəti','''pjurəti','[n] 纯度； 纯洁， 纯净， 纯粹','the purity of tap water  自来水的纯净度'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1501','portion','''pɔrʃən','''pɔːrʃn','[n] 部分；一份; [vt] 划分， 分配','Do you have any children’s portions?  你们有儿童餐吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1502','futile','''fjʊtaɪl','''fjuːtl','[adj] 无效的， 无用的， 无意义的； 琐细的； 没出息的','My efforts to go back to sleep proved futile.  我努力想再次入睡，但怎么也睡不着。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1503','pensive','''pɛnsɪv','''pensɪv','[adj] 沉思的； 忧虑的','Jan looked pensive.  简神情忧伤。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1504','reliever','rɪ''livɚ','rɪ''liːvər','[n] 救济者； 缓解物',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1505','acumen','əˈkjumən','''ækjəmən','[n] 敏锐， 聪明','His business acumen helped him to succeed where others had failed.  他在商业上的敏锐帮他在其他人失败的地方获得成功。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1506','abate','ə''bet','ə''beɪt','[v] 减少， 减轻','We waited for the storm to abate.  我们等风暴减弱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1507','tragic','''trædʒɪk','''trædʒɪk','[adj] 悲惨的； 悲剧的','The parents were not to blame for the tragic death of their son.  儿子的惨死不是他父母的错。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1508','eschew','ɪsˈtʃuː','ɪs''tʃuː','[vt] 避开， 戒除， 回避','I had eschewed politics in favour of a life practising law.  我选择从事律师职业，有意避开了政治。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1509','physician','fɪ''zɪʃən','fɪ''zɪʃn','[n] 内科医生','...your family physician.  …你的家庭医生。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1510','stardom','''stɑrdəm','''stɑːrdəm','[n] 明星的身份','his rapid rise to stardom  他的迅速走红'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1511','amass','ə''mæs','ə''mæs','[vt] 积聚','For 25 years, Darwin amassed evidence to support his theories.  25年间，达尔文收集了大量证据来支持自己的理论。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1512','venturesome','''vɛntʃɚsəm','''ventʃərsəm','[adj] 敢于冒险的； 有危险的','...the venturesome graduate who is determined to succeed.  ...敢闯敢干、下决心要成功的毕业生。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1513','souvenir',',suvə''nɪr','ˌsuːvə''nɪr','[n] 纪念品， 纪念物','a souvenir shop  纪念品商店'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1514','quaint','kwent','kweɪnt','[adj] 古色古香的； 离奇有趣的','a quaint little village in Yorkshire  约克郡一个古色古香的小村庄'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1515','grip','ɡrɪp','grɪp','[v] 控制；紧握；吸引住…的注意; [n] 控制， 影响力； 紧握； 理解','I gripped the rail and tried not to look down.  我紧紧抓住栏杆，尽量不往下看。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1516','tornado','tɔr''nedo','tɔːr''neɪdou','[n] 飓风， 龙卷风','Python: how to return from generator function using tornado?  如何从生成器函数返回使用龙卷风?。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1517','explore','ɪk''splɔr','ɪk''splɔːr','[v] 探索， 勘探； 探险； 探究','Management need to explore ways of improving office security.  管理层需要探讨如何加强办事处的安全措施。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1518','acronym','''ækrənɪm','''ækrənɪm','[n] 首字母缩写词','Every new acronym I hear turns out to be another dirty trick designed to allow rich countries to go on with business as usual.  我所听到的每个新缩写词原来都是另一个鬼把戏，旨在允许富裕国家照常进行一切活动。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1519','noteworthy','''notwɝði','''noutwɜːrði','[adj] 显著的， 值得注目的','a noteworthy achievement  显著的成就'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1520','shirk','ʃə:k','ʃɜːrk','[v] 逃避， 规避','He was fired for shirking.  他因偷懒被解雇了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1521','electricity','ɪ''lɛk''trɪsəti','ɪˌlek''trɪsəti','[n] 电； 电流','The farm was very isolated, but it had electricity.  那个农场非常偏远，但有电力供应。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1522','tentative','''tɛntətɪv','''tentətɪv','[adj] 试验性的； 不确定的， 暂定的； 犹豫的','I passed on my tentative conclusions to the police.  我把我的初步结论递交给了警方。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1523','cosmos','''kɑzmos','''kɑːzmous','[n] 宇宙','...the natural laws of the cosmos.  …宇宙的自然法则。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1524','climate','ˈklaɪmɪt','''klaɪmət','[n] 气候； 气候区， 地带； 风气， 氛围； 思潮','Los Angeles’ warm dry climate  洛杉矶温暖干燥的气候'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1525','staggering','''stæɡərɪŋ','''stægərɪŋ','[adj] 巨大的； 势不可挡的； 惊人的， 令人吃惊的','The cost was a staggering $10 million.  费用竟高达 1,000 万美元。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1526','crust','krʌst','krʌst','[n] 地壳； 外壳； 硬的表面； 面包片','sandwiches with the crusts cut off  切去边皮的三明治'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1527','criticize','''krɪtə''saɪz','''krɪtɪsaɪz','[v] 批评； 吹毛求疵， 非难； 评论','Ron does nothing but criticize and complain all the time.  罗恩什么也不干，只是一味指责和抱怨。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1528','incredulous','ɪn''krɛdʒələs','ɪn''kredʒələs','[adj] 怀疑的， 不轻信的','‘You sold the car?’ she asked, incredulous.  “你把车卖了？”她难以置信地问道。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1529','condole','kən''dəul','kən''doul','[vi] 向…吊唁； 慰问',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1530','grid','ɡrɪd','grɪd','[n] 格子， 栅格； 地图上的坐标方格， 网格； 输电网， 煤气输送网','Its streets were laid out in a grid pattern.  那里的街道是棋盘式的布局。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1531','circumference','sɚ''kʌmfərəns','sər''kʌmfərəns','[n] 周围， 周边； 圆周； 周长','...a scientist calculating the Earth''s circumference.  …一位正在计算地球周长的科学家。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1532','rage','redʒ','reɪdʒ','[v] 猛烈地继续，激烈进行；发怒，怒斥；迅速蔓延，猖獗; [n] 风靡一时的事物， 时尚； 狂怒','‘How was I to know!’ Jenny raged.  “我怎么会知道！”珍妮怒道。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1533','finalize','''faɪnəlaɪz','''faɪnəlaɪz','[vt] 使完成； 把…最后定下来； 定稿','Jo flew out to Thailand to finalize the details of the deal.  乔乘飞机去往泰国，敲定这笔生意的具体事宜。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1534','hull','','hʌl','[n] 外壳；船身，船体; [vt] 给…去外壳','The hull had suffered extensive damage to the starboard side.  船体右舷遭到大面积损坏。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1535','preside','prɪ''zaɪd','prɪ''zaɪd','[vi] 担任主席； 主持； 掌管','I shall be pleased to preside at your meetings.  我很高兴主持你们的会议。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1536','board','bɔrd','bɔːrd','[v] 登机， 上船； 搭伙， 寄宿; [n] 膳食费用；委员会，董事会；板，木板','The couple boarded the train for New York.  夫妻俩登上了开往纽约的列车。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1537','economic','ˌikəˈnɑmɪk, ˌɛkəˈ-nɑmɪk','ˌiːkə''nɑːmɪk','[adj] 经济的； 经济上的； 经济学的； 合算的','Economic growth is slow.  经济增长缓慢。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1538','stuff','stʌf','stʌf','[n] 原料，材料; [vt] 填满， 塞满； 让…吃饱','Volunteers were busy stuffing envelopes.  志愿者正忙着装信封。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1539','offspring','''ɔfsprɪŋ','''ɔːfsprɪŋ','[n] 子孙， 后代； 崽','a young mother trying to control her offspring  一个想管住自己孩子的年轻妈妈'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1540','whim','wɪm','wɪm','[n] 一时的兴致， 冲动； 怪念头， 奇想','We decided, more or less on a whim, to sail to Morocco.  我们多少有些心血来潮地决定乘船去摩洛哥。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1541','arrest','ə''rɛst','ə''rest','[n&vt] 逮捕， 拘留； 停止， 阻止； 吸引','He was arrested and charged with murder.  他遭到逮捕并被指控谋杀。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1542','assortment','ə''sɔrtmənt','ə''sɔːrtmənt','[n] 分类； 各种各样','They are all perforated by openings of their own, but few line up, meaning passersby are faced with an assortment of opaque surfaces.  它们都是由自己的洞口穿孔，很少排列起来，意味着路人面对着各式各样的不透明表面。'),
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO words (book_slug, slug, word, phonetic_us, phonetic_uk, meaning, example) VALUES,
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1543','section','''sɛkʃən','''sekʃn','[n] 部分； 地区； 部门； 段落， 章节； 截面， 剖面','The plane’s tail section was found in a cornfield.  飞机的尾部在玉米田里找到了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1544','rumor','''rʊmɚ','''ruːmər','[n] 传闻， 谣言','In fact the rumor is without foundation.  事实上，这个谣传没有根据。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1545','overflow',',ovɚ''flo','əʊvə''fləʊ','[v] 泛滥， 溢出; [n] 溢出； 容纳不下的物','The drains flooded and water overflowed down the main street.  下水道被淹，水溢到了大街上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1546','provoke','prə''vok','prə''vouk','[vt] 挑动， 激怒， 挑衅； 引发， 引起','The novel has provoked fierce debate in the US.  那部小说在美国引发了激烈的争论。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1547','enrich','ɪn''rɪtʃ','ɪn''rɪtʃ','[vt] 使充实； 使肥沃； 使富裕， 使富有','Add fertilizer to enrich the soil.  施上肥料使土壤肥沃。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1548','strain','stren','streɪn','[n] 拉力，压力，张力；','These four posts take the strain of the whole structure.  这四根柱子承受着整个结构的压力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1549','otherwise','''ʌðɚwaɪz','''ʌðərwaɪz','[adv] 另样，用别的方法；在其他方面; [conj] 要不然， 否则','He was tired but otherwise in good health.  他除了累身体很好。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1550','marked','mɑrkt','mɑːrkt','[adj] 显著的； 有记号的； 被监视的','a marked lack of enthusiasm  明显缺乏热情'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1551','pathological','''pæθə''lɑdʒɪkl','ˌpæθə''lɑːdʒɪkl','[adj] 病态的； 病理学的； 不理智的， 无道理的','a pathological hatred of women  对女人的病态憎恨'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1552','recital','rɪ''saɪtl','rɪ''saɪtl','[n] 音乐演奏会； 诗歌朗诵会； 赘述','a piano recital  钢琴独奏会'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1553','visible','''vɪzəbl','''vɪzəb','[adj] 看得见的， 明显的','The comet is visible to the naked eye (= can be seen without using special equipment ).  这颗彗星肉眼看得见。'),
