('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1571','embarrass','ɪm''bærəs','ɪm''bærəs','[vt] 使尴尬， 使困窘； 使困惑','He didn’t want to embarrass her by asking questions.  他不想提问让她尴尬。'),
