('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1576','silica','''sɪlɪkə','''sɪlɪkə','[n] 硅石， 硅土； 二氧化硅','For the water features of electronics industry , enhanced to removal silica, heavy metals and organic carbon in water.  对于电子行业用水的特性，增强了对水中二氧化硅、重金属和有机碳的脱除；'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1577','crucial','''krʊʃəl','''kruːʃl','[adj] 至关重要的， 决定性的','The conservation of tropical forests is of crucial importance .  保护热带雨林至关重要。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1578','contribute','kən''trɪbjut','kən''trɪbjuːt','[v] 贡献， 捐赠； 有助于； 投稿','The three sons also contribute to the family business.  3个儿子也为家族企业做贡献。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1579','remark','rɪ''mɑrk','rɪ''mɑːrk','[v] 评论；谈论；察觉; [n] 评论， 评语； 注释','‘This house must be very old,’ he remarked.  “这幢房子一定很古老了。”他说道。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1580','microscope','''maɪkrəskop','''maɪkrəskəup','[n] 显微镜','Can I borrow your microscope?  可以借你的显微镜吗?。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1581','dissenter','di''sentə','dɪ''sentər','[n] 不同意者， 反对者','Political dissenters were imprisoned.  持不同政见者遭到监禁。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1582','strive','straɪv','straɪv','[vi] 奋斗， 努力； 力求','He strives hard to keep himself very fit.  他努力使自己保持非常的健康。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1583','candidate','ˈkændɪˌdet, -dɪt','''kændɪdət','[n] 候选人； 投考者','a presidential candidate  总统候选人'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1584','fungus','''fʌŋɡəs','''fʌŋgəs','[n] 真菌','The roses have fungus.  玫瑰花长了真菌。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1585','intelligible','ɪn''tɛlɪdʒəbl','ɪn''telɪdʒəbl','[adj] 聪明的， 理智的； 易懂的， 易理解的','His reply was barely intelligible.  他的回复几乎让人听不懂。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1586','along','ə''lɔŋ','ə''lɔːŋ','[adv] 向前；一起; [prep] 沿着','I was driving along, thinking about Chris.  我一边开车，一边想着克里斯。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1587','parallel','''pærəlɛl','''pærəlel','[adj] 平行的；相似的; [n] 相似处；','Lines AB and CD are parallel. AB  线与CD线平行。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1588','cashier','kæ''ʃɪr','kæ''ʃɪr','[n] 收银员， 出纳员','Do you have any experience as a cashier?  你是否有出纳员的工作经验？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1589','inert','ɪ''nɝt','ɪ''nɜːrt','[adj] 无活动的， 惰性的； 不活泼的， 迟钝的','inert gases  惰性气体'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1590','diet','''daɪət','''daɪət','[vi] 节食; [n] 饮食，食物；规定饮食','I''ve been dieting ever since the birth of my fourth child.  自从我第4个孩子出生以后，我就一直在节食。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1591','dissimulate','di''simjuleit','dɪ''sɪmjuleɪt','[v] 掩盖， 掩饰， 假装','This man was too injured to dissimulate well.  这个男人伤得太重，不可能掩盖得住。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1592','enzyme','''ɛnzaɪm','''enzaɪm','[n] 酶， 酵素',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1593','soccer','''sɑkɚ','''sɑːkər','[n] 足球','Shall we play soccer?  我们踢足球好吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1594','breach','britʃ','briːtʃ','[n] 违背；破裂；缺口; [vt] 打破； 违反','She wanted to help heal the breach between them.  她想帮助他们修复破裂的关系。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1595','butter','''bʌtɚ','''bʌtər','[n] 黄油; [vt] 涂黄油于','Can I have some bread and butter?  能给我一些面包和黄油吗?。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1596','wit','wɪt','wɪt','[n] 智力， 才智； 风趣； 机智幽默的人','a woman of great wit and charm  说话风趣、风韵动人的女人'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1597','respire','rɪ''spaɪɚ','rɪ''spaɪər','[v] 呼吸','Fish generally respire through gills.  一般是经由鳃呼吸。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1598','selective','sɪ''lɛktɪv','sɪ''lektɪv','[adj] 选择的， 选择性的； 精挑细选的','selective schools  择优录取学生的学校'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1599','handful','''hænd,fʊl','''hændful','[n] 一把； 少数人','There were only a handful of people there.  那里只有几个人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1600','rebate','''ribet','''riːbeɪt','[n] 回扣， 折扣； 退还款','You may be entitled to a tax rebate.  你也许可以享受退税。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1601','stimulus','''stɪmjələs','''stɪmjələs','[n] 刺激（物）；促进因素','Tax cuts provided the stimulus which the slow economy needed.  减税为不景气的经济带来了其所需的刺激。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1602','systematize','''sɪstəmətaɪz','''sɪstəmətaɪz','[vt] 使系统化， 使条理化， 使成体系','You need to systematize your approach to problem solving.  你需要用有条理的方法解决问题。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1603','barter','''bɑrtɚ','''bɑːrtər','[n&v] 实物交易， 以物易物','Trading was carried out under a barter system.  当时的贸易是物物交换。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1604','bewilder','bɪ''wɪldɚ','bɪ''wɪldər','[vt] 使迷惑， 使不知所措','He was bewildered by his daughter’s reaction.  他被女儿的反应弄糊涂了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1605','regiment','''rɛdʒɪmənt','''redʒɪmənt','[n] 团；','They deserted from their regiment.  他们从团里开了小差。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1606','terminal','tɝ​mənl','''tɜːrmɪnl','[adj] 末端的; [n] 终点站；终点；航站楼','...terminal cancer.  …晚期癌症。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1607','kerosene','''kɛrəsin','''kerəsiːn','[n] 煤油， 火油','a kerosene lamp  煤油灯'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1608','diminish','dɪ''mɪnɪʃ','dɪ''mɪnɪʃ','[v] 降低， 贬低； 减少， 减弱','The party’s share of the electorate has diminished steadily.  支持这个政党的选民比例持续下降。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1609','surpass','sə''pæs','sər''pæs','[vt] 超过， 超越， 胜过','He had surpassed all our expectations .  他超越了我们所有的预期。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1610','linguist','''lɪŋgwɪst','''lɪŋgwɪst','[n] 语言学家； 通晓数国语言的人','He had a scholarly air and was an accomplished linguist.  他有一种学者的风度，而且是个熟练掌握多国语言的人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1611','oyster','''ɔɪstɚ','''ɔɪstər','[n] 牡蛎， 蚝','He had two dozen oysters and enjoyed every one of them.  他吃了两打牡蛎，每一个都吃得津津有味。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1612','aloof','ə''luf','ə''luːf','[adj] 远离的； 冷淡的， 冷漠的','Beneath that aloof exterior, Gayle is a warm, sympathetic person.  在冷漠的外表下，盖尔是个有同情心的热心人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1613','idealize','aɪ''diə''laɪz','aɪ''diːəlaɪz','[vt] 将…理想化','Society continues to idealize the two-parent family.  社会依然把双亲家庭视为理想家庭。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1614','gouge','ɡaʊdʒ','gaudʒ','[vt] 挖出；敲竹杠; [n] 凿子','He heard the heavy rounds gouge the ancient concrete, followed by the panicked cries of Grunts in the distance as they dove for cover—and into the semi-gelatinous, ankle-deep liquid.  子弹凿击古老混凝土的声音清晰可辨，接着远处传来了野猪兽卧倒在深及脚踝的半凝胶状液体中隐蔽时恐慌的呼喊声。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1615','attention','ə''tɛnʃən','ə''tenʃn','[n] 注意， 留心； 立正','My attention wasn’t really on the game.  我的注意力其实不在比赛上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1616','succumb','sə''kʌm','sə''kʌm','[vi] 屈服， 屈从； 死亡','Don''t succumb to the temptation to have just one cigarette.  不要屈服于只抽一支烟的诱惑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1617','disproportionate','disprə''pɔ:ʃənət','ˌdɪsprə''pɔːrʃənət','[adj] 不成比例的','the disproportionate amount of money being spent on defence  比例失衡的国防开支'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1618','extent','ɪk''stɛnt','ɪk''stent','[n] 程度， 范围','They examined the extent to which (= how much ) age affected language-learning ability.  他们调查了年龄会在多大程度上影响语言学习能力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1619','translucent','træns''lusnt','træns''luːsnt','[adj] 半透明的','Blue veins showed through her translucent skin.  她半透明的皮肤下青筋显现。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1620','magma','''mæɡmə','''mægmə','[n] 岩浆','The volcano threw new showers of magma and ash into the air.  这座火山向空气中喷发了新的岩浆和火山灰。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1621','fin','fɪn','fɪn','[n] 鳍； 鳍状物； 翼',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1622','sauce','sɔs','sɔːs','[n] 调味汁， 佐料','spaghetti sauces  意大利面酱'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1623','husk','hʌsk','hʌsk','[n] 外壳，外皮; [vt] 去壳， 削皮','How can we remove the husk of the grains?  我们怎样去掉谷物的外皮？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1624','fix','fɪks','fɪks','[v] 修理；使固定，安装；安排；找到，确定; [n] 解决方法； 困境， 窘境','He’s outside fixing the brakes on the car.  他在外面修理汽车的刹车。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1625','colonial','kə''lonɪəl','kə''louniəl','[adj] 殖民的； 殖民国家的','the struggle against colonial rule  反抗殖民统治的斗争'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1626','rank','ræŋk','ræŋk','[v] 属于某等级， 归类; [n] 等级；头衔','A general ranks a captain.  上将的级别高于上尉。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1627','giant','''dʒaɪənt','''dʒaɪənt','[adj] 巨大的；超群的; [n] 巨大的动物； 才智超群的人','a giant electronics company  一家电子产品巨头'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1628','perch','pɝtʃ','pɜːrtʃ','[v] 栖息，停留；把…置于较高处；坐于; [n] 栖息处， 栖木； 高处， 较高的位置； 鲈鱼','...the vast slums that perch precariously on top of the hills around which the city was built.  …摇摇欲坠地坐落于城市中心群山之顶的大片贫民窟。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1629','ablaze','ə''blez','ə''bleɪz','[adj] 着火的， 燃烧的； 闪耀的； 情绪激动的','Within minutes the whole house was ablaze.  几分钟内，整座房子就成了一片火海。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1630','grouse','ɡraʊs','graus','[v] 发牢骚，抱怨; [n] 松鸡； 怨言','"How come we never know what''s going on?" he groused.  “我们怎么会不知道发生了什么事？”他抱怨道。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1631','addition','ə''dɪʃən','ə''dɪʃn','[n] 加， 加法； 添加， 增加','This is a fine book; a worthy addition to the series.  这是一本好书——是对这套丛书有价值的增补。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1632','overcharge',',ovɚ''tʃɑrdʒ','ˌouvər''tʃɑːrdʒ','[v] 讨价过高，索价过高；过量装填；渲染，夸张; [n] 过高的要价； 超载','They were being overcharged for cheap beer.  他们买的是便宜的啤酒，却被收取了高价。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1633','saucy','''sɔsi','''sɔːsi','[adj] 无礼的； 俏皮的； 漂亮的','saucy postcards  不雅的明信片'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1634','neglect','nɪ''glɛkt','nɪ''glekt','[vt&n] 忽略， 忽视； 疏忽','Many of these ideas have been neglected by modern historians.  这些观点有许多都被现代的历史学家忽略了。'),
