('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1651','canyon','''kænjən','''kænjən','[n] 峡谷','As I relayed the yoga teacher incident, my voice echoed across the canyon between who I was and what I was saying.  我跟她说了瑜伽老师的事情之后，我感觉的声音像环绕在峡谷里，在我是谁和我在说什么之间回荡着。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1652','impenetrable','ɪm''pɛnɪtrəbl','ɪm''penɪtrəbl','[adj] 不能穿透的； 不可理解的， 高深莫测的','impenetrable legal jargon  费解的法律术语'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1653','hurl','hɝl','hɜːrl','[v] 猛投； 大声斥责','How would you handle being locked in the back of a cab while the driver hurled abuse at you?  如果你被锁在出租车后座又遭司机谩骂，你会怎么办？'),
