('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1656','frank','fræŋk','fræŋk','[adj] 坦白的， 直率的','To be perfectly frank, I think it’s a bad idea.  老实说，我认为这个主意不好。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1657','inscribe','ɪn''skraɪb','ɪn''skraɪb','[v] 写、 题、 铭刻； 铭记','Inside the cover someone had inscribed the words ‘To Thomas, with love’.  在书的内封上，有人题写了“托马斯惠存”几个字。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1658','admire','ədˈmaɪr','əd''maɪər','[vt] 钦佩， 仰慕； 欣赏','I really admire the way she brings up those kids all on her own.  我十分佩服她独力把那些孩子抚养大。'),
