('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1669','unbridgeable','','ʌn''brɪdʒəbl','[adj] 不能架桥的； 不能逾越的','...the so-called unbridgeable gap between the world of humans and that of chimpanzees.  ...人类社会和黑猩猩社会间所谓的不可逾越的鸿沟。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1670','infuriate','ɪn''fjʊrɪet','ɪn''fjurieɪt','[vt] 激怒','Her actions infuriated her mother.  她的举动使她母亲极为生气。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1671','flu','flu','fluː','[n] 流行性感冒','Steven’s still in bed with flu .  史蒂文患了流感，仍卧病在床。'),
