('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1673','skeptical','''skɛptɪkl','''skeptɪkl','[adj] 怀疑的','I think going in they were very skeptical we would get to this point given our history in Seattle.  我想鉴于西雅图过去的历史，在开始的时候他们对我们能达到这个地步还是有怀疑的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1674','decipher','dɪ''saɪfɚ','dɪ''saɪfər','[vt] 破译','I''m still no closer to deciphering the code.  破译这个密码我还是没有进展。'),
