('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1702','unpredictable',',ʌnprɪ''dɪktəbl','ˌʌnprɪ''dɪktəbl','[adj] 不可预知的； 无法预言的','unpredictable weather  难以预测的天气'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1703','topography','tə''pɑgrəfi','tə''pɑːgrəfi','[n] 地形学； 地形， 地貌','The topography of the river''s basin has changed significantly since the floods.  洪水过后，这条河的流域地形已经明显改变了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1704','ribbon','''rɪbən','''rɪbən','[n] 带状物； 丝带， 缎带； 绶带； 色带','little girls with ribbons in their hair  头发上系着丝带的小姑娘们'),
