('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1717','vocal','''vokl','''voukl','[adj] 声音的，嗓音的，发声的；直言不讳的','vocal music  声乐'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1718','origin','''ɔrɪdʒɪn','''ɔːrɪdʒɪn','[n] 起源，由来；','The tradition has its origins in the Middle Ages.  这一传统源于中世纪。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1719','plow','plaʊ','plau','[v] 耕田， 犁田， 耕作; [n] 犁',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1720','clasp','klæsp','klæsp','[n] 搭扣，扣环；紧抱；紧握; [vt] 握紧； 抱紧； 扣住， 扣牢','the firm clasp of her hand  她有力的握手'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1721','hover','''hʌvɚ','''hʌvər','[vi] 徘徊， 彷徨； 翱翔， 盘旋','Beautiful butterflies hovered above the wild flowers.  美丽的蝴蝶在野花上方盘旋。'),
