('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1808','draw','drɔ','drɔː','[v] 吸引，招引；画，描绘；拖，拉；引起，激起；拨出，抽出；提取，支取；推断出；打成平局; [n] 平局， 和局； 抽签','Katie had drawn a cottage with a little stream running next to it.  凯蒂画了一间小茅舍，旁边流淌着一条小溪。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1809','contender','kən''tɛndɚ','kən''tendər','[n] 竞争者， 争夺者， 对手','Her trainer said yesterday that she would be a strong contender for a place on the Olympic team.  她的教练昨天说，她会是取得奥运代表队里一个席位的一名强有力的竞争者。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1810','slender','''slɛndɚ','''slendər','[adj] 细长的； 苗条的， 纤细的； 微薄的， 不足的','She is slender and stylish.  她身材修长，穿着时髦。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1811','terminus','''tɝmɪnəs','''tɜːrmɪnəs','[n] 终点站','What time does the train reach the terminus?  火车什么时间到达终点站?。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1812','oral','''ɔrəl','''ɔːrəl','[adj] 口头的， 口述的； 口腔的','oral history  口述的历史'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1813','compensate','''kɑmpɛnset','''kɑːmpenseɪt','[v] 赔偿， 弥补','Because my left eye is so weak, my right eye has to work harder to compensate.  因为我左眼视力差，右眼就要辛苦点来弥补一下。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1814','conscious','''kɑnʃəs','''kɑːnʃəs','[adj] 自觉的， 意识到的； 有知觉的， 有意识的； 有意的， 刻意的','The driver was still conscious when the ambulance arrived.  救护车赶到时，司机仍然神志清醒。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1815','transaction','træn''zækʃən','træn''zækʃn','[n] 交易， 业务； 办理， 处理','The bank charges a fixed rate for each transaction.  银行对每一笔业务收取固定费用。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1816','accomplishment','ə''kɑmplɪʃmənt','ə''kɑːmplɪʃmənt','[n] 成就； 完成； 才艺， 技艺','It was a major accomplishment for a player who had been injured so recently.  对于一个刚受过伤的选手来说，这是很好的成绩。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1817','pants','pænts','pænts','[n] 内裤， 短裤； 裤子','She was wearing dark blue pants and a white sweater.  她穿着深蓝色长裤和白色毛衣。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1818','placid','''plæsɪd','''plæsɪd','[adj] 平静的， 安静的； 温和的， 文静的','a large, placid baby  一个胖胖的、安静的婴儿'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1819','solitary','''sɑlətɛri','''sɑːləteri','[adj] 孤独的； 单独的， 独自的； 单个的； 唯一的， 仅有的','the solitary goal of the match  这场比赛的唯一入球'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1820','second','''sɛkənd','''sekənd','[adj] 第二的；次等的，二等的; [v] 赞成，附和; [num] 第二; [n] 秒；瞬间，片刻','the Second World War  第二次世界大战'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1821','laudable','''lɔdəbl','''lɔːdəbl','[adj] 值得赞美的， 值得称赞的','a laudable attempt  值得称道的尝试'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1822','edge','ɛdʒ','edʒ','[v] 徐徐移动； 略为增加； 给…加边; [n] 边，边缘；刀口，刃；优势','Tim was edging away from the crowd.  蒂姆慢慢地从人群中走开。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1823','orchestra','''ɔrkɪstrə','''ɔːrkɪstrə','[n] 管弦乐队','the Berlin Symphony Orchestra  柏林交响乐团'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1824','sufficient','səˈfɪʃənt','sə''fɪʃnt','[adj] 足够的， 充分的','We can only prosecute if there is sufficient evidence.  有了足够的证据，我们才能提出起诉。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1825','glaze','ɡlez','gleɪz','[v] 上釉； 给…装玻璃; [n] 釉料；糖浆','Glaze the pie with beaten egg.  把打好的蛋汁浇在馅饼上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1826','claim','klem','kleɪm','[v&n] 声称， 断言； 要求； 索赔','I don’t claim to be a feminist, but I’d like to see more women in top jobs.  我不会自称是女权主义者，但我希望看到更多的女性担任高职。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1827','widespread','ˈwʌɪdsprɛd','''waɪdspred','[adj] 分布广泛的， 普遍的','the widespread use of chemicals in agriculture  化学品在农业中的广泛使用'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1828','antique','æn''tik','æn''tiːk','[n] 古物，','The palace is full of priceless antiques.  宫殿里到处都是价值连城的古董。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1829','thaw','θɔ','θɔː','[v] 融化，解冻；化冻；变暖；变得友善; [n] 解冻时期； 缓和','The lake thawed in March.  3月里，湖水解冻了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1830','fasten','''fæsən','''fæsn','[v] 使固定； 系牢， 扎牢； 握住， 抓牢','Make sure all the windows are securely fastened before you leave.  离开前要确保所有的窗子都已关严。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1831','toxic','''tɑksɪk','''tɑːksɪk','[adj] 有毒的； 中毒的','fumes from a toxic waste dump  有毒废料堆产生的毒气'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1832','contest','kən''tɛst','''kɒntest','[vt] 竞争； 争辩， 就…提出异议; [n] 竞赛； 辩论； 争夺','His brothers are contesting the will.  他的兄弟们对遗嘱提出质疑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1833','asymmetrical',',esɪ''mɛtrɪkl','ˌeɪsɪ''metrɪkl','[adj] 不均匀的， 不对称的','asymmetrical patterns  不对称图案'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1834','turmoil','''tɝmɔɪl','''tɜːrmɔɪl','[n] 骚动， 混乱； 焦虑','She lived through the turmoil of the French Revolution.  她经历过法国大革命的混乱之后仍旧活着。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1835','clench','klɛntʃ','klentʃ','[v&n] 握紧， 抓牢； 咬紧','Jody was pacing the sidelines, her fists clenched.  乔迪在球场的边线上紧握着拳头来回踱步。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1836','modernity','mə''dɝnəti','mə''dɜːrnəti','[n] 现代性','a conflict between tradition and modernity  传统与现代的冲突'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1837','schematic','ski''mætɪk','skiː''mætɪk','[adj] 图解的； 纲要的； 严谨的','a schematic diagram of DNA  脱氧核糖核酸结构简图'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1838','rekindle',',ri''kɪndl','ˌriː''kɪndl','[vt] 重新点燃； 使振作','There are fears that the series could rekindle animosity between the two countries.  有人担心这一系列的事情可能会重新引发两国之间的敌意。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1839','expansion','ɪk''spænʃən','ɪk''spænʃn','[n] 扩张； 膨胀','The industry underwent a period of rapid expansion.  该产业经历了一轮快速扩张。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1840','wrench','rɛntʃ','rentʃ','[v] 扭伤；猛拉，猛扭；使痛苦; [n] 扭伤； 痛苦， 难受； 扳手','I wrenched the packet from his grasp.  我用力夺过他攥在手里的纸袋。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1841','license','''laɪsns','''laɪsns','[n] 许可证，执照; [vt] 批准， 许可','To help lower costs, IBM offers flexible virtualization license costs, where you pay only for the number of virtual resources that you have deployed.  为了帮助降低成本，IBM 提供灵活的虚拟化许可证费用机制，您只需根据已经部署的虚拟资源数量付费。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1842','puff','pʌf','pʌf','[v] 喘气，喘息；喷出; [n] 吸； 一缕； 喘息','George puffed and panted and he tried to keep up.  乔治喘着粗气想跟上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1843','expand','ɪk''spænd','ɪk''spænd','[v] 扩张； 膨胀； 伸展， 伸开','The computer industry has expanded greatly over the last decade.  计算机行业在过去十年间大大地发展起来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1844','squander','''skwɑndɚ','''skwɑːndər','[vt] 浪费， 挥霍','The home team squandered a number of chances in the first half.  主队在上半场浪费了几次机会。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1845','synchronizer','','''sɪŋkrənaɪzər','[n] 同步装置','I created a background synchronizer that used RestKit as it seemed to have everything I needed.  我创建了一个背景同步，用restkit好像有我需要的一切。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1846','perimeter','pə''rɪmɪtɚ','pə''rɪmɪtər','[n] 周长； 外缘， 边缘','...the perimeter of the airport.  …机场周边。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1847','essay','''ɛse','''eseɪ','[n] 散文， 随笔； 短文； 评论','We asked Jason to write an essay about his hometown.  我们让杰森写一篇关于他家乡的短文。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1848','retrieve','rɪ''triv','rɪ''triːv','[vt] 取回， 索回； 挽回， 扭转颓势； 检索','She bent down to retrieve her earring.  她俯身去捡回耳环。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1849','survey','ˈsɝˌve; (for v.) sɝˈve','ˈsəːveɪ; (for v.) səˈveɪ','[v] 调查； 概述; [n] 调查； 概述','Of the 100 companies surveyed, 10% had a turnover of £50 m to £99 m.  被调查的 100 家公司中，10% 的公司营业额在 5,000 万到 9,900 万英镑之间。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1850','malice','''mælɪs','''mælɪs','[n] 恶意， 怨恨','James bore her no malice (= did not feel any malice towards her ) .  詹姆斯对她并无恶意。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1851','postpone','po''spon','ˌpoust''poun','[v] 延期， 推迟','The match had to be postponed until next week.  比赛不得不推迟到下周举行。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1852','codify','''kɔdifai','''koudɪfaɪ','[vt] 把…编成法典， 使法律成文化； 整理， 系统化','The latest draft of the agreement codifies the panel''s decision.  该协议的最新草案将专家小组的决定编篡成了法规条款。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1853','dorsal','''dɔrsl','''dɔːrsl','[adj] 背部的， 背脊的','a shark’s dorsal fin  鲨鱼的背鳍'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1854','code','kod','koud','[vt] 编纂；把…编码; [n] 法典， 法规； 密码， 代码','Each path is coded to show the level of difficulty.  每条路线都按难度编了号。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1855','potassium','pə''tæsɪəm','pə''tæsiəm','[n] 钾','They are aluminosilicates of sodium, potassium and calcium.  它们都是钾和钙的铝硅酸盐类。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1856','displace','dɪs''ples','dɪs''pleɪs','[vt] 取代； 撤职； 迫使…离开家园','Coal has been displaced by natural gas as a major source of energy.  作为一种主要能源，煤的地位已为天然气所取代。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1857','hammer','''hæmɚ','''hæmər','[v] 锤打; [n] 锤， 槌； 锤子','the sound of hammering and sawing  锤打和拉锯的声音'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1858','ideology',',aidi''ɔlədʒi, ,idi-','ˌaɪdi''ɑːlədʒi','[n] 思想体系； 意识形态','the ideologies of fascism and terrorism  法西斯主义和恐怖主义的意识形态'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1859','seal','sil','siːl','[vt] 密封；确定，使成定局; [n] 海豹； 封铅， 封条； 印， 图章','Smith’s goal sealed the victory.  史密斯的入球锁定了胜局。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1860','investigate','ɪn''vɛstɪɡet','ɪn''vestɪgeɪt','[v] 研究， 调查','The state police are investigating the incident.  州警察正调查此事。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1861','storage','''stɔrɪdʒ','''stɔːrɪdʒ','[n] 库房； 贮藏； 存储','the storage of highly radioactive material  高放射性材料的存放'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1862','troposphere','''tropəsfɪr','''troupəsfɪr','[n] 对流层','The orange layer is known as the troposphere, where all of the weather and clouds are generated and contained.  橘黄色的那一层被称为“对流层”，那里是所有的气候状况和云层形成和演变的地方。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1863','swindle','swɪndl','''swɪndl','[vt&n] 诈骗， 骗取','a big tax swindle  巨额税款诈骗'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1864','illusion','ɪ''luʒn','ɪ''luːʒn','[n] 幻觉， 错觉； 幻想中的事物','She was under no illusion that he loved her.  她不再幻想他爱她了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1865','productivity',',prodʌk''tɪvəti','ˌprɑːdʌk''tɪvəti','[n] 生产力， 生产率','high productivity levels in manufacturing  制造业中的高生产率'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1866','reserve','rɪ''zɝv','rɪ''zɜːrv','[n] 储备；自然保护区；谨慎；替补队员；后备部队; [vt] 保留； 预订','$10 million in cash reserves  1,000万美元的现金储备'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1867','subsist','səb''sɪst','səb''sɪst','[vi] 存活， 生存','The prisoners subsisted on one mug of the worst quality porridge three times a day.  犯人一天三次靠一杯最差的粥维持生活。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1868','invertebrate','ɪn''vɝtɪbret','ɪn''vɜːrtɪbrət','[adj] 无脊椎的; [n] 无脊椎动物','...invertebrate creatures.  ...无脊椎动物。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1869','dive','daɪv','daɪv','[vi&n] 跳水； 潜水','Diving off the cliffs is dangerous.  从悬崖上跳水是很危险的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1870','sympathy','''sɪmpəθi','''sɪmpəθi','[n] 同情， 同情心； 赞同， 支持','Our sympathies are with the families of the victims.  我们向受害者家庭表示慰问。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1871','rescue','''rɛskju','''reskjuː','[vt&n] 营救， 搭救','Survivors of the crash were rescued by helicopter.  空难的生还者被直升机救了出来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1872','brief','brif','briːf','[adj] 简短的，短暂的；简洁的','We stopped by Alice’s house for a brief visit.  我们顺路在艾丽斯家小坐片刻。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1873','recover','rɪ''kʌvɚ','rɪ''kʌvər','[v] 复原， 恢复； 重新获得； 收回','After a few days of fever, she began to recover.  发烧几天之后，她开始恢复。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1874','influx','''ɪnflʌks','''ɪnflʌks','[n] 注入， 涌入','...problems caused by the influx of refugees.  …难民大量涌入所造成的问题。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1875','determine','dɪ''tɝmɪn','dɪ''tɜːrmɪn','[v] 查明， 确定； 决心， 决定； 支配， 影响','Investigators are still trying to determine the cause of the fire.  调查人员仍在设法弄清失火的原因。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1876','devastate','''dɛvəstet','''devəsteɪt','[vt] 破坏， 毁坏； 令人震惊， 使难以承受','Rob was devastated by the news of her death.  罗布听到她死去的消息悲痛欲绝。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1877','embark','ɪm''bɑrk','ɪm''bɑːrk','[v] 上船','They embarked on a ship bound for Europe.  他们登上了一艘去欧洲的船。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1878','cousin','''kʌzn','''kʌzn','[n] 堂兄弟， 堂姐妹','My cousin Mark helped me to bring in the bags.  我表弟马克帮我把包提了进来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1879','intelligent','ɪn''tɛlɪdʒənt','ɪn''telɪdʒənt','[adj] 有才智的， 聪明的','a group of highly intelligent (= very intelligent )students  一组聪明异常的学生'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1880','confer','kən''fɝ','kən''fɜːr','[v] 授予； 协商， 商讨','He conferred with Hill and the others in his office.  他和希尔以及他办公室里的其他人进行了商议。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1881','friction','''frɪkʃən','''frɪkʃn','[n] 摩擦； 摩擦力； 矛盾， 冲突','Putting oil on both surfaces reduces friction.  两面都上油可减小摩擦力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1882','walnut','''wɔlnət','''wɔːlnʌt','[n] 胡桃； 胡桃木','coffee and walnut cake  咖啡核桃蛋糕'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1883','incessantly','in''sesntli','ɪn''sesntlɪ','[adv] 不断地','It rained incessantly for the whole two weeks.  雨不间断地下了整整两个星期。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1884','imagist','','''ɪmɪdʒɪst','[adj] 意象派的; [n] 意象派诗人','Much subsequent poetry in england was influenced by imagist lord and practice .  后来的英国诗歌中有许多诗受到了意象主义的箴言和实践的影响。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1885','radiation',',redɪ''eʃən','ˌreɪdi''eɪʃn','[n] 放射； 辐射； 放射物， 放射线； 辐射的热','An accident at the power station could result in large amounts of radiation being released.  发电站事故会造成大量核辐射泄漏。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1886','luxury','''lʌɡʒəri','''lʌkʃəri','[adj] 奢华的; [n] 奢侈， 奢华； 奢侈品','He could not afford luxury food on his pay.  凭他的薪水，他吃不起奢侈的食品。'),
