('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1933','disturb','dɪ''stɝb','dɪ''stɜːrb','[vt] 打扰； 搅乱， 弄乱； 使烦恼， 使不安','My hormone balance is disturbed by my pregnancy.  怀孕打乱了我的荷尔蒙平衡。'),
