('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1935','pump','pʌmp','pʌmp','[n] 泵; [vt] 抽','...pumps that circulate the fuel around in the engine.  …使燃料在发动机内循环的压泵。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1936','pierce','pɪrs','pɪrs','[v] 刺穿， 刺破； 穿孔， 打眼','Steam the corn until it can easily be pierced with a fork.  把玉米蒸到用叉子可以轻易扎透。'),
