('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1938','patriarch','''petrɪɑrk','''peɪtriɑːrk','[n] 家长， 族长','The patriarch of the house, Mr. Jawad, rules it with a ferocity renowned throughout the neighbourhood.  那户人家的家长贾瓦德先生治家严苛，名闻乡里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1939','intern','''ɪntɝn','''ɪntɜːn','[n] 实习生; [vt] 拘禁， 软禁','...a medical intern.  …一位实习医生。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1940','sensual','''sɛnʃuəl','''senʃuəl','[adj] 感觉的， 感官的； 肉欲的； 耽于感官享受的','the sensual pleasure of good food  美食的感官享受'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1941','righteous','''raɪtʃəs','''raɪtʃəs','[adj] 正直的， 公正的； 正义的， 正当的','He was full of righteous indignation about the attack.  他对这次袭击事件义愤填膺。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1942','speculate','''spɛkjə''let','''spekjuleɪt','[v] 推测； 深思， 沉思； 投机， 做投机买卖','She refused to speculate.  她拒绝猜测。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1943','closet','''klɑzət','''klɑːzət','[adj] 隐蔽的； 私下的， 秘密的; [vt] 把…关在房间里; [n] 橱，壁橱','Don’t let her closet herself away in her room.  别让她把自己关在房间里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1944','heed','hid','hiːd','[n&v] 注意， 留心','If she had only heeded my warnings , none of this would have happened.  要是她当初听从我的警告，这一切都不会发生。'),
