('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1946','monster','''mɑnstɚ','''mɑːnstər','[adj] 巨大的， 庞大的; [n] 怪物；庞然大物；恶魔','a monster cat  巨型猫'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1947','cement','sə''mɛnt','sɪ''ment','[n] 水泥；胶合剂; [vt] 巩固； 使团结','a bag of cement  一袋水泥'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1948','subway','''sʌbwe','''sʌbweɪ','[n] 地铁','the New York City subway  纽约市的地铁'),
