('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1950','acquaint','ə''kwent','ə''kweɪnt','[vt] 使认识； 使熟悉','I need to acquaint myself with the new regulations.  我得熟悉一下新的规章制度。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1951','atrophy','''ætrəfi','''ætrəfi','[n] 萎缩','More exercises can avoid atrophy of cartilage.  多加锻炼可以避免软骨萎缩。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1952','pulp','pʌlp','pʌlp','[vt] 使成浆状; [n] 纸浆； 浆状物','pulped apples  苹果泥'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1953','undergraduate',',ʌndɚ''ɡrædʒuət','ˌʌndər''grædʒət','[n] 大学肄业生； 大学本科生','second-year undergraduates  大学二年级学生'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1954','antibiotic',',æntɪbaɪ''ɑtɪk; ˌæntaɪ-','ˌæntibaɪ''ɑːtɪk','[adj] 抗菌的','Thatreally sped up the development of penicillin as an antibiotic.  这确实加快了青霉素作为抗生素的发展。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1955','joint','dʒɔɪnt','dʒɔɪnt','[adj] 连接的； 共同的， 共有的， 联合的; [n] 关节，骨节；接头，接合处','The two ministers have issued a joint statement.  两位部长发布了一项联合声明。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1956','separate','(for v.) sɛpəˌret; (for adj.) sɛprɪt','(for v.) ˈsepəreɪt; (for adj.) ˈseprət','[v] 分离； 划分； 区别； 分居; [adj] 分离的； 个别的','This will keep your dressing from separating.  这样可以防止调味汁分层。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_1957','reasonable','''riznəbl','''riːznəbl','[adj] 合理的， 适当的； 通情达理的； 公道的','a reasonable request  合情合理的要求'),
