('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2085','simmer','''sɪmɚ','''sɪmər','[vi] 充满；煨，炖; [n] 煨， 炖','Bring the soup to the boil and allow it to simmer gently for about half an hour.  把汤煮开，然后用文火炖半小时左右。'),
