('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2109','scale','skel','skeɪl','[n] 鳞；规模；比例；刻度；【音】音阶；等级，级别; [vt] 攀登','A structural survey revealed the full scale of the damage.  结构检验揭示了实际受损程度。'),
