('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2124','prose','proz','prouz','[n] 散文','Shute''s prose is stark and chillingly unsentimental.  舒特的散文刻板而冷峻。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2125','inverse',',ɪn''vɝs','ˌɪn''vɜːrs','[adj] 相反的，反向的; [n] 反面； 倒数','Clearly, the amount of money people save increases in inverse proportion to the amount they spend.  显然，人们储蓄的增加与消费成反比。'),
