('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2127','confidence','''kɑnfɪdəns','''kɑːnfɪdəns','[n] 信任； 信心','I felt I was doing well and my confidence began to grow.  我觉得自己干得不错，自信心就开始增加了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2128','cuisine','kwɪ''zin','kwɪ''ziːn','[n] 烹饪； 烹调法， 烹调风格','French cuisine  法式烹饪'),
