('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2130','intent','ɪn''tɛnt','ɪn''tent','[adj] 专心的， 专注的； 急切的; [n] 意图，目的','his intent gaze  他专注的凝视'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2131','readability','','ˌriːdə''bɪləti','[n] 可读性','Embrace brevity, but do not sacrifice readability.  拥抱简洁，但不要牺牲可读性。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2132','interrogate','ɪn''tɛrəɡet','ɪn''terəgeɪt','[vt] 审问， 讯问， 盘问','The police interrogated the suspect for several hours.  警察盘问了这名嫌疑犯好几个小时。'),
