('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2168','dawn','dɔn','dɔːn','[n] 破晓， 黎明； 开始， 发端','When dawn broke (= the first light of the day appeared ) , we were still 50 miles from Calcutta.  破晓的时候，我们离加尔各答还有50英里。'),
