('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2185','audition','ɔ''dɪʃən','ɔː''dɪʃn','[n] 旁听； 试演','...an audition for a Broadway musical.  …一部百老汇歌舞剧的试演。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2186','editorial',',ɛdɪ''tɔrɪəl','ˌedɪ''tɔːriəl','[adj] 社论的； 编辑的; [n] 社论，重要评论','an editorial assistant  编辑助理'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2187','sharpen','''ʃɑrpən','''ʃɑːrpən','[v] 削尖， 磨快； 使敏锐； 变得清晰','Her gaze sharpened, as if she had seen something unusual.  她眼睛一亮，好像看到了不寻常的东西。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2188','sedimentary',',sɛdɪ''mɛntri','ˌsedɪ''mentri','[adj] 沉积的， 沉淀性的','sedimentary rock  沉积岩'),
