('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2204','disguise','dɪs''ɡaɪz','dɪs''gaɪz','[vt&n] 掩饰； 伪装， 假装','He escaped across the border disguised as a priest.  他装扮成神父越境逃走了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2205','imperial','ɪm''pɪrɪəl','ɪm''pɪriəl','[adj] 帝国的， 帝王的； 至尊的； 专横的','Britain’s imperial expansion in the 19th century  19世纪英帝国的扩张'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2206','wrap','ræp','ræp','[vt] 包，裹; [n] 披肩， 围巾； 包装材料','I’ve still got a few Christmas presents to wrap up.  我还有一些圣诞礼物要包起来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2207','prehistoric',',prihɪ''stɔrɪk','ˌpriːhɪ''stɔːrɪk','[adj] 史前的； 陈旧的','prehistoric burial grounds  史前墓地'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2208','facet','''fæsɪt','''fæsɪt','[n] 小平面； 方面','The issues are complex and multi-faceted.  这些问题很复杂，涉及诸多方面。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2209','novel','ˈnɑːvl','''nɑːvl','[adj] 新颖的; [n] 小说','Protesters found a novel way of demonstrating against steeply rising oil prices.  抗议者们找到一种新奇的示威方式来反对石油价格的飙升。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2210','tedium','''tidɪəm','''tiːdiəm','[n] 单调， 乏味','We sang while we worked, to relieve the tedium .  我们边唱歌边干活来排遣无聊。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2211','liberal','''lɪbərəl','''lɪbərəl','[adj] 自由的， 开明的； 慷慨的； 不严格的； 人文的','a more liberal attitude towards sexuality  对两性关系比较开通的态度'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2212','standard','''stændɚd','''stændərd','[adj] 标准的; [n] 标准，准则','We paid them the standard rate.  我们付给他们标准工资。'),
