('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2219','dominate','''dɑmɪnet','''dɑːmɪneɪt','[v] 支配， 统治； 控制； 盛行','The industry is dominated by five multinational companies.  这个行业受五家跨国公司控制。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2220','imitate','''ɪmɪtet','''ɪmɪteɪt','[vt] 模仿， 效仿； 仿制， 仿造','She was a splendid mimic and loved to imitate Winston Churchill.  她是个出色的模仿者，喜欢模仿温斯顿·丘吉尔。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2221','compute','kəm''pjʊt','kəm''pjuːt','[v] 计算， 估算','Final results had not yet been computed.  最终的结果还未计算出来。'),
