('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2306','even','''ivən','''iːvn','[adv] 甚至，连；甚至可以说; [adj] 平滑的，平坦的；平稳的，均匀的；均衡的；平均的；偶数的; [v] 平坦； 相等','Most companies have suffered a drop in their profits, even very large companies.  大多数公司的利润都出现下滑，甚至连很大的公司也不例外。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2307','ambience','''æmbɪəns','''æmbiəns','[n] 周围环境， 气氛','The overall ambience of the room is cosy.  这个房间的整体氛围是舒适的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2308','install','ɪn''stɔl','ɪn''stɔːl','[vt] 安置， 安装','They’ve installed the new computer network at last.  他们终于安装了新电脑网络。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2309','analyze','''ænə,laɪz','''ænəlaɪz','[vt] 分析， 研究','We have to analyze and solve problems.  我们要分析问题，解决问题。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2310','cuneiform','''kjʊnɪə,fɔrm','''kjuːnɪfɔːrm','[adj] 〔古代美索不达米亚人使用的〕楔形文字的','The chicken scratch is cuneiform.  鸡爪印是楔形文字。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2311','bulk','bʌlk','bʌlk','[n] 容积， 体积； 主体， 大部分','The bulk of consumers are based in towns.  大多数消费者都是城镇居民。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2312','vacancy','''vekənsi','''veɪkənsi','[n] 空房间； 空位， 空缺； 空虚','There are still two vacancies on the school board.  学校董事会还有两个职位空缺。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2313','champion','''tʃæmpɪən','''tʃæmpiən','[n] 冠军；拥护者; [vt] 声援','the world heavyweight boxing champion  世界重量级拳击冠军'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2314','ceramic','sə''ræmɪk','sə''ræmɪk','[adj] 陶器的， 瓷器的','I make ceramic cups there. Do you remember the gift I gave you for your last birthday? Those two cups?  在那里，我可以自己制作陶瓷茶杯。还记得你上次生日时我送你的礼物吗？那两个茶杯？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2315','plumage','''plumɪdʒ','''pluːmɪdʒ','[n] 鸟类羽毛','the parrot’s brilliant blue plumage  那只鹦鹉亮丽的蓝色羽毛'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2316','circuit','''sɝkɪt','''sɜːrkɪt','[n] 电路； 线路； 巡回； 环行； 环行路线','We did a circuit of the old city.  我们绕着老城走了一圈。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2317','piracy','''paɪrəsi','''paɪrəsi','[n] 海盗行为； 抢劫行为； 剽窃行为','software piracy  软件盗版'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2318','locomotion',',lokə''moʃən','ˌloukə''mouʃn','[n] 移动； 运动','Flight is the form of locomotion that puts the greatest demands on muscles.  飞行是对肌肉要求最高的运动形式。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2319','magnificent','mæg''nɪfəsnt','mæg''nɪfɪsnt','[adj] 极好的； 宏伟的， 华丽的； 崇高的， 高尚的','a magnificent performance  气势恢宏的演出'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2320','irregular','ɪ''rɛɡjəlɚ','ɪ''regjələr','[adj] 不规则的， 无规律的； 不整齐的； 不合常规的','a jagged, irregular coastline  锯齿状不规则的海岸线'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2321','restrict','rɪ''strɪkt','rɪ''strɪkt','[vt] 限制， 约束','The new law restricts the sale of hand guns.  新法规限制手枪的销售。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2322','mason','''mesn','''meɪsn','[n] 石匠， 泥瓦匠',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2323','recharge','ri:''tʃɑ:dʒ, ''ri:tʃɑ:dʒ','ˌriː''tʃɑːrdʒ','[v] 充电； 休整； 再装弹药','The device can recharge a battery in about 25 minutes.  该充电器可在约25分钟内完成给电池充电。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2324','legislate','''lɛdʒɪslet','''ledʒɪsleɪt','[v] 制定法律； 通过立法','Most member countries have already legislated against excessive overtime.  大部分成员国已经立法禁止过度加班。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2325','imperative','ɪm''pɛrətɪv','ɪm''perətɪv','[adj] 迫切的，重要紧急的；必要的；命令的；','It is imperative that politicians should be good communicators.  政治家应该是很好的沟通者，这很重要。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2326','documentary','''dɑkjə''mɛntri','ˌdɑːkju''mentri','[adj] 文件的，文献的；记录的，纪实的; [n] 纪录片','documentary films  纪录影片'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2327','hitherto',',hɪðɚ''tu','ˌhɪðər''tuː','[adv] 迄今， 至今','a species of fish hitherto unknown in the West  迄今在西方还不为人知的一种鱼'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2328','consequence','''kɑnsəkwɛns','''kɑːnsəkwens','[n] 结果； 影响； 推理； 重要， 重大','I don’t suppose it is of any consequence now.  现在我觉得这事一点都无所谓了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2329','linear','''lɪnɪɚ','''lɪniər','[adj] 线的， 直线的； 线性的； 长度的','a linear diagram  线形图'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2330','robust','ro''bʌst','rou''bʌst','[adj] 健壮的， 强壮的','a robust man of six feet four  一个身高六英尺四英寸的壮汉'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2331','raven','''revən','''reɪvn','[adj] 乌黑光亮的; [n] 渡鸦','Which waves in every raven tress .  美波动在她乌黑的发上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2332','dominant','''dɑmɪnənt','''dɑːmɪnənt','[adj] 统治的， 支配的， 占优势的； 有统治权的','The dominant male gorilla is the largest in the group.  领头的公猩猩是这群大猩猩中体形最大的一个。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2333','heading','''hɛdɪŋ','''hedɪŋ','[n] 标题； 主题','chapter headings  章节标题'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2334','denounce','dɪ''naʊns','dɪ''nauns','[vt] 谴责， 公开指责， 抨击； 告发','The group denounced the failure by the authorities to take action.  该团体谴责当局没有采取行动。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2335','swampy','''swɔmpi','''swɑːmpi','[adj] 沼泽的， 湿地的； 松软的','The hurricane first hit land in remote swampy areas of the miskito coast and moved through villages further inland.  飓风首次登陆的地点为米斯基托海岸偏僻的沼泽地区，并越过村庄向内陆深入。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2336','verge','vɝdʒ','vɜːrdʒ','[vi] 接近，濒临; [n] 草地','to verge on chaos'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2337','framework','''fremwɝk','''freɪmwɜːrk','[n] 框架， 构架； 原则， 准则； 机制， 结构','We have to act within the existing legal framework.  我们必须在现行的法律框架下行事。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2338','milieu','mi''ljɜː','miː''ljɜː','[n] 出身背景； 社会环境','Proust’s work reflected his own social and cultural milieu.  普鲁斯特的作品反映了其所在的社会和文化背景。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2339','microorganism',',maɪkro''ɔrgən,ɪzəm','ˌmaɪkrou''ɔːrgənɪzəm','[n] 微生物','Observe microorganism in the water and in the sediment by a microscope.  用显微镜观察水样本和基质样本中的微生物。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2340','entity','''ɛntəti','''entəti','[n] 实体， 独立存在物','The mind exists as a separate entity.  思想作为一个独立的实体存在。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2341','chronicle','''krɑnɪkl','''krɑːnɪkl','[vt] 把…载入编年史; [n] 编年史， 年代记','His life is chronicled in a new biography published last week.  他的生平被写成一本新传记，于上周出版。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2342','tide','taɪd','taɪd','[v] 涨落; [n] 潮， 潮汐； 潮流， 趋势','Is the tide going out or coming in ?  现在是退潮还是涨潮？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2343','prohibit','prə''hɪbɪt','prə''hɪbɪt','[v] 禁止， 阻止','Smoking is strictly prohibited inside the factory.  厂区严禁吸烟。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2344','frugal','''fruɡl','''fruːgl','[adj] 节约的， 节俭的； 少量的','As children we were taught to be frugal and hard-working.  我们小时候被教育要节俭和勤劳。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2345','franchise','''fræntʃaɪz','''fræntʃaɪz','[n] 特权，特许；特许经销权；选举权; [vt] 赋予特权； 赋予选举权','...fast-food franchises.  …快餐特许经营权。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2346','replica','''rɛplɪkə','''replɪkə','[n] 复制品','replica guns  仿真枪'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2347','bacteria','bæk''tɪrɪə','bæk''tɪriə','[n] 细菌','Some of these bacteria are actually good for you.  实际上，这些细菌有的对你是很有好处的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2348','laureate','''lɔrɪət','''lɔːriət','[adj] 享有殊荣的; [n] 桂冠诗人；荣誉获得者','Nigeria’s Nobel laureate, Wole Soyinka  尼日利亚的诺贝尔奖获得者沃莱·索因卡'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2349','reign','ren','reɪn','[n] 统治，支配；','...Queen Victoria''s reign.  …维多利亚女王的统治时期。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2350','infirm','ɪn''fɝm','ɪn''fɜːrm','[adj] 虚弱的； 不坚定的','...her aging, infirm husband.  …她那年迈体弱的丈夫。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2351','tempo','''tɛmpo','''tempou','[n] 速度， 节奏； 行进速度','the easy tempo of island life  岛上生活的轻松节奏'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2352','manner','''mænɚ','''mænər','[n] 方式，风格；','He felt some guilt over the manner of her death.  她以这种方式死去，他心里有些内疚。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2353','associate','ə''soʃɪet','ə''səʊʃɪeɪt; -sɪeɪt','[v] 结交； 关联; [adj] 副的；合伙的; [n] 伙伴','I haven''t been associated with the project over the last year.  我过去一年不曾跟这个项目有关联。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2354','scrupulous','''skrupjələs','''skruːpjələs','[adj] 多顾虑的， 谨慎的； 一丝不苟的， 严谨的； 审慎正直的， 恪守道德规范的','Not all lawyers are as scrupulous as she is.  并不是所有的律师都像她那样正直。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2355','gleam','ɡlim','gliːm','[vi] 闪光， 闪烁； 流露出; [n] 微光；一丝，一线；表露','His teeth gleamed under his moustache.  他的八字须下面，牙齿晶莹发亮。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2356','glean','ɡlin','gliːn','[vt] 点滴搜集， 四处收集','At present we''re gleaning information from all sources.  目前我们正从所有渠道慢慢收集信息。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2357','detract','dɪ''trækt','dɪ''trækt','[v] 减损； 贬低， 诋毁','They feared that the publicity surrounding him would detract from their own election campaigns.  他们担心围绕他的宣传会有损他们自已的竞选活动。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2358','pin','pɪn','pɪn','[vt] 钉住；固定; [n] 大头针； 钢钉； 胸针； 徽章','They pinned a notice to the door.  他们把通知钉在门上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2359','pit','pɪt','pɪt','[vt] 使有坑，使…表面有斑点; [n] 大坑， 深坑； 矿井； 陷阱','Dad first went down the pit (= worked in a coal mine ) when he was 15 years old.  爸爸第一次下煤矿井时才15岁。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2360','motif','mo''tif','mou''tiːf','[n] 主题， 主旨； 图形','The theme of creation is a recurrent motif in Celtic mythology.  天地万物的创造是凯尔特神话中反复出现的主题。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2361','stock','stɑk','stɑːk','[vt] 储备，储存; [n] 库存，现货；备用物；股份，股票；世系，血统；家畜，','We stock a wide range of kitchen equipment.  我们备有各种厨房用品。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2362','suspend','sə''spɛnd','sə''spend','[vt] 吊， 悬挂； 暂缓， 暂停， 中止','Sales of the drug will be suspended until more tests are completed.  这种药品在完成进一步检验之前将暂停销售。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2363','swap','swɑp','swɑːp','[v] 交换，掉换; [n] 交换， 掉换； 交换物， 被调换者','Do you want to swap umbrellas?  你想交换雨伞吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2364','ritual','''rɪtʃuəl','''rɪtʃuəl','[adj] 仪式的； 习惯的， 例行的; [n] 典礼，仪式；例行公事，老规矩','The police issued the usual ritual apology.  警方发表了例行公事式的道歉。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2365','surge','sɝdʒ','sɜːrdʒ','[v] 涌动；蜂拥而出；飞涨，','She could feel anger surging inside her.  她感到怒火中烧。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2366','basin','''besn','''beɪsn','[n] 盆， 脸盆； 盆地； 流域','a wash basin  洗脸盆'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2367','resolute','''rɛzəlut','''rezəluːt','[adj] 坚决的， 果断的','resolute opposition  坚决的反对'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2368','tutor','''tʊtɚ','''tuːtər','[v] 辅导; [n] 导师；家庭教师','He was privately tutored.  他是由家庭教师教的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2369','senator','''sɛnətɚ','''senətər','[n] 参议员','Senator Kennedy  肯尼迪参议员'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2370','reconcile','''rɛkənsaɪl','''rekənsaɪl','[vt] 使协调； 使和解； 使顺从','Jonah and his youngest son were, on the surface at least, reconciled.  乔纳和他小儿子和好了，至少表面上如此。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2371','quantify','''kwɑntɪfaɪ','''kwɑːntɪfaɪ','[vt] 以数量表示， 量化','an attempt to quantify the region’s social and economic decline  对该地区社会和经济衰退进行量化的尝试'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2372','annul','ə''nʌl','ə''nʌl','[vt] 宣布无效， 取消， 废除','Their marriage was annulled last year.  他们的婚姻关系去年宣告解除。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2373','tempt','tɛmpt','tempt','[vt] 引诱， 诱惑； 吸引','If you leave valuables in your car it will tempt thieves.  如果把贵重物品留在车上，会招来小偷的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2374','ethic','''ɛθɪk','''eθɪk','[n] 伦理；道德体系','The old ethic of hard work has given way to a new ethic of instant gratification.  旧有的崇尚勤勉的道德观已被及时行乐的新观念所取代。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2375','basic','''besɪk','''beɪsɪk','[adj] 基本的， 基础的； 初步的， 初级的','the basic principles of chemistry  化学的基本原理'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2376','twist','twɪst','twɪst','[v] 缠绕，扭曲；曲解，歪曲; [n] 转折， 突然变化； 卷曲物','Her hands began to twist the handles of the bag she carried.  她的双手开始拧她拎着的那个包的拎柄。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2377','absolve','əb''zɑlv','əb''zɑːlv','[vt] 赦免； 免除； 宽恕','A police investigation yesterday absolved the police of all blame in the incident.  警方昨天的调查为其开脱了在这件事故中所有的责任。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2378','seclusion','sɪ''klʊʒən','sɪ''kluːʒn','[n] 独处， 隐居； 隔离； 与世隔绝， 归隐','They enjoyed ten days of peace and seclusion.  他们享受了十天与世隔绝的宁静生活。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2379','boulder','''boldɚ','''bouldər','[n] 巨石， 巨砾','It is thought that the train hit a boulder that had fallen down a cliff on to the track.  人们认为这列火车撞到了从悬崖滚到铁轨上的大圆石。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2380','locate','ˈloˌket; loˈket','''loukeɪt','[vt] 使坐落于； 找出， 定位','The scientists want to locate the position of the gene on a chromosome.  科学家们想找到该基因在染色体上的位置。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2381','Mesolithic','ˌmiːzə(ʊ)ˈlɪθɪk','ˌmesə''liθik','[adj] 中石器时代的; [n] 中石器时代',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2382','bush','','buʃ','[n] 灌木； 荒野','a rose bush  玫瑰丛'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2383','muse','mjuz','mjuːz','[v] 沉思， 冥想; [n] 灵感','‘Somewhere,’ he mused, ‘I’ve heard your name before.’  “我以前在哪里，”他沉思着说，“听说过你的名字。”'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2384','combat','''kɑmbæt','''kɑːmbæt','[v&n] 战斗， 格斗','We flew over 200 combat missions in the war.  我们在战争中执行过两百多次战斗飞行任务。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2385','despise','dɪ''spaɪz','dɪ''spaɪz','[vt] 鄙视， 看不起','She despised her neighbours.  她看不起她的邻居。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2386','dioxide','daɪ''ɑksaɪd','daɪ''ɑːksaɪd','[n] 二氧化物','She is your indispensable oxygen, carbon dioxide is not essential you me.  她是你不可缺少的氧气，我是你可有可无的二氧化碳。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2387','grievous','''ɡrivəs','''griːvəs','[adj] 令人忧伤的； 极严重的','a grievous shortage of hospital beds  医院床位的严重短缺'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2388','oblong','''ɑblɔŋ','''ɑːblɔːŋ','[adj] 矩形的，长方形的；椭圆形的; [n] 矩形， 长方形； 椭圆形','an oblong table  长方形桌子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2389','unity','''junəti','''juːnəti','[n] 团结一致， 统一， 联合； 协调； 统一体','economic unity  经济统一'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2390','genetics','dʒə''nɛtɪks','dʒə''netɪks','[n] 遗传学','Genetics is also bringing about dramatic changes in our understanding of cancer.  遗传学也正使我们对癌症的理解发生巨大的变化。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2391','pursue','pə''sʊ','pər''sjuː','[v] 继续； 从事于； 追击， 追踪； 追求','She plans to pursue a career in politics.  她计划从政。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2392','vulgar','''vʌlɡɚ','''vʌlgər','[adj] 下流的， 粗俗的； 普通的， 通俗的','vulgar behaviour  粗俗的行为'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2393','catastrophe','kə''tæstrəfi','kə''tæstrəfi','[n] 灾难， 灾祸； 困难','From all points of view, war would be a catastrophe.  从各个方面来看，战争都会是一场灾难。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2394','convey','kən''ve','kən''veɪ','[vt] 运送， 运输； 传达， 表达','All this information can be conveyed in a simple diagram.  所有这些信息可以通过一张简单的图表来表示。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2395','convex','''kɑnvɛks','''kɑːnveks','[adj] 凸出的','a convex lens  凸透镜'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2396','redeem','rɪ''dim','rɪ''diːm','[vt] 赎回； 偿清， 付清； 兑换； 弥补， 补偿； 履行， 遵守','Olivier’s performance redeemed an otherwise second-rate play.  奥利维尔的表演补救了一出本是二流水平的戏。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2397','skull','skʌl','skʌl','[n] 颅骨， 头骨； 脑袋； 头脑','He can’t seem to get it into his skull that I’m just not interested in him.  他这个笨蛋好像无法明白我根本对他不感兴趣。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2398','rationality',',ræʃən''æləti','ˌræʃə''næləti','[n] 理性； 合理性','Organizational effectiveness does not lie in that narrow minded concept called rationality. It lies in the blend of clearheaded logic and powerful intuition.  组织的有效性并不在于那个称为合理性的坐井观天的概念。它是清晰的逻辑和强有力的直觉的融合。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2399','monogamy','mə''nɑɡəmi','mə''nɑːgəmi','[n] 一夫一妻制','People still opt for monogamy and marriage.  人们还是选择单一配偶制和婚姻。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2400','contaminate','kən''tæmɪnet','kən''tæmɪneɪt','[vt] 污染','Drinking water supplies are believed to have been contaminated.  据信饮用水已受到污染。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2401','allude','ə''lʊd','ə''luːd','[vi] 暗指， 影射， 间接提到','With friends, she sometimes alluded to a feeling that she herself was to blame for her son''s predicament.  和朋友们一起时，她有时暗示她感到儿子的困境要怪她自己。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2402','torpor','''tɔrpɚ','''tɔːrpər','[n] 迟钝； 死气沉沉',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2403','chagrin','ʃə''ɡrɪn','ʃə''grɪn','[n] 懊恼， 失望','To the chagrin of their parents, neither Phil nor Pam went to church anymore.  令父母失望的是，菲尔和帕姆都再也不去教堂了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2404','predator','''prɛdətɚ','''predətər','[n] 捕食性动物， 食肉动物； 掠夺者， 剥削者','With no natural predators on the island, the herd increased rapidly.  由于岛上没有天然食肉动物，牧群的数量迅速增加。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2405','chief','tʃif','tʃiːf','[adj] 主要的；总的；首席的; [n] 首领； 酋长， 族长','He was recently appointed chief economist at the Bank of Scotland.  他最近被任命为苏格兰银行的首席经济学家。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2406','accord','ə''kɔrd','ə''kɔːrd','[v] 与…一致， 符合; [n] 协议，条约','The punishments accorded with the current code of discipline.  处罚与现行的纪律规则一致。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2407','forfeit','''fɔrfət','''fɔːrfət','[vt] 被没收，丧失; [n] 罚款； 没收物','By being absent from the trial, he forfeited the right to appeal.  因缺席审判，他丧失了上诉权。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2408','foremost','''fɔr''most','''fɔːrmoust','[adj] 最先的； 最著名的， 最重要的','one of the country’s foremost authorities on chemical warfare  该国化学战方面的最高权威之一'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2409','automatic','''ɔtə''mætɪk','ˌɔːtə''mætɪk','[adj] 自动的；无意识的；必然的，自然的; [n] 自动手枪； 自动换挡汽车','an automatic weapon  自动武器'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2410','disintegrate','dɪs''ɪntɪɡret','dɪs''ɪntɪgreɪt','[v] 瓦解； 碎裂','The plane just disintegrated in mid-air.  飞机就在半空中解体了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2411','consecutive','kən''sɛkjətɪv','kən''sekjətɪv','[adj] 连续不断的， 连贯的','It had rained for four consecutive days.  雨接连下了四天。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2412','assimilation','əˌsɪməˈleʃən','əˌsɪmə''leɪʃn','[n] 同化； 吸收','Process of soaking up or assimilation of one substance by another.  一种介质向另一种介质渗透和同化的过程。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2413','quotient','''kwoʃnt','''kwouʃnt','[n] 商； 份额',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2414','groan','ɡron','groun','[vi] 呻吟；叹息；发出呻吟般的声音; [n] 呻吟； 抱怨； 呻吟声， 叹息声','The kids all groaned when I switched off the TV.  我关掉电视时，孩子们都发出不满的抱怨声。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2415','merchandise','''mɝtʃəndaɪs','''mɜːrtʃəndaɪs','[n] 商品，货物; [vt] 买卖， 经营','A range of official Disney merchandise was on sale.  一系列正版的迪士尼商品在出售。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2416','pebble','''pɛbl','''pebl','[n] 小圆石， 鹅卵石','The beach was covered with smooth white pebbles.  海滩上布满了光滑的白色卵石。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2417','conduct','kən''dʌkt','''kɒndʌkt','[v] 引导； 传导； 进行； 管理， 指挥； 表现; [n] 行为； 管理， 实施','Who will be conducting?  由谁来指挥？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2418','livelihood','''laɪvlɪhʊd','''laɪvlihud','[n] 生计， 谋生手段','It’s difficult to earn a livelihood as an artist.  搞艺术很难谋生。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2419','reunion','','ˌriː''juːniən','[n] 团圆， 重聚','an annual reunion  一年一度的聚会'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2420','fantastic','fæn''tæstɪk','fæn''tæstɪk','[adj] 荒诞的， 奇异的； 极好的； 极大的','You look fantastic!  你看上去棒极了！'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2421','semiotics','','ˌsemi''ɑːtɪks','[n] 符号学','This paper approaches English euphemisms from Peirce s semiotics.  英语委婉语作为一种语言符号，也具有这些性质。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2422','indecipherable','''ɪndɪ''saɪfrəbl','ˌɪndɪ''saɪfrəbl','[adj] 无法破译的； 难以领悟的','Majid''s writing was virtually indecipherable.  玛吉的笔迹几乎无法辨认。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2423','immigrate','''ɪmɪɡret','''ɪmɪgreɪt','[vi] 移居入境','His father and mother immigrated when he was two.  他的父母在他两岁时移民到这里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2424','apparatus','ˌæpəˈrætəs','ˌæpə''rætəs','[n] 器械， 器具， 设备， 装置； 机构， 组织； 器官','Astronauts have special breathing apparatus.  航天员有专门的呼吸装装备。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2425','decay','dɪ''ke','dɪ''keɪ','[v&n] 腐烂， 腐朽； 衰退， 衰落','Her body was already starting to decay.  她的尸体已经开始腐烂。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2426','incidental','''ɪnsə''dɛntl','ˌɪnsɪ''dentl','[adj] 偶然的； 附带发生的， 伴随而来的','Increased motivation is more than an incidental benefit of reward schemes.  积极性提高不仅仅是奖励计划附带的益处。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2427','induct','ɪn''dʌkt','ɪn''dʌkt','[vt] 使正式就任； 使了解， 传授； 使入伍','In 1987, he was inducted into the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame.  1987年他被正式授予‘摇滚名人堂’的奖项。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2428','fracture','''fræktʃɚ','''fræktʃər','[v] 断裂， 折断； 分裂; [n] 骨折；断裂；破裂','The immense pressure causes the rock to fracture.  巨大的压力造成岩石断裂。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2429','lessen','''lɛsn','''lesn','[v] 变小， 变少， 减轻','Gradually her anxiety lessened.  她的焦虑慢慢减轻了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2430','championship','''tʃæmpɪənʃɪp','''tʃæmpiənʃɪp','[n] 锦标赛，冠军赛','the women’s figure skating championships  女子花样滑冰锦标赛'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2431','recycle',',ri''saɪkl','ˌriː''saɪkl','[vt] 回收利用， 再应用','We take all our bottles to be recycled.  我们把我们所有的瓶子都回收利用。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2432','marsh','mɑrʃ','mɑːrʃ','[n] 沼泽， 湿地','We gonna mosh through the marsh, take us right through the doors.  我们要在这沼泽中前进， 使我们的权利通过这些门。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2433','sapphire','''sæfaɪɚ','''sæfaɪər','[adj] 天蓝色， 蔚蓝色的; [n] 蓝宝石，青石；蔚蓝色','...a sapphire engagement ring.  …一枚蓝宝石订婚戒指。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2434','drift','drɪft','drɪft','[v] 漂流，漂移；漂泊，游荡; [n] 漂流； 漂泊； 大意， 主旨； 倾向， 趋势','Smoke drifted up from the jungle ahead of us.  我们前方的丛林里有烟升起。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2435','anthropology','''ænθrə''pɑlədʒi','ˌænθrə''pɑːlədʒi','[n] 人类学','When I was a student at Cambridge I remember an anthropology professor holding up a picture of a bone with 28 incisions carved in it.  当我还在剑桥读书的时候，我记得有一位人类学的教授拿出一张照片，上面是一根有28个切口的骨头。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2436','chaos','''keɑs','''keɪɑːs','[n] 混乱','The country was plunged into economic chaos.  这个国家陷入了经济大混乱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2437','abundant','ə''bʌndənt','ə''bʌndənt','[adj] 大量的， 充足的， 丰富的','an abundant supply of fresh water  充足的淡水供应'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2438','absorption','əbˈsɔrpʃən, -ˈzɔrp-','əb''sɔːrpʃn','[n] 吸收； 全神贯注， 专心致志','This controls the absorption of liquids.  这可以控制液体的吸收。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2439','pigment','''pɪgmənt','''pɪgmənt','[n] 颜料； 色素','Melanin is the dark brown pigment of the hair, skin and eyes.  黑色素是头发、皮肤以及眼睛中的深棕色色素。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2440','forecast','''fɔrkæst','''fɔːrkæst','[vt&n] 预报； 预测， 预料','The weather forecast is good for tomorrow.  天气预报说明天是晴天。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2441','deteriorate','dɪ''tɪrɪəret','dɪ''tɪriəreɪt','[v] 变坏， 恶化； 变质','Ethel’s health has deteriorated.  埃塞尔的健康状况恶化了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2442','recognize','ˈrɛkəɡˌnaɪz','''rekəgnaɪz','[vt] 认出， 识别； 认可','I didn’t recognize you in your uniform.  你穿上制服我认不出你了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2443','warehouse','''wɛrhaʊs','''werhaus','[n] 仓库， 货栈','The building opposite us is the warehouse.  我们对面的那个建筑是仓库。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2444','bisect','baɪ''sɛkt','baɪ''sekt','[vt] 把…二等分， 对半分','A long cobbled street bisects the town from east to west.  一条长长的鹅卵石街道从东向西把小镇一分为二。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2445','induce','ɪn''dus','ɪn''djuːs','[vt] 引起， 导致； 诱使， 劝诱； 感应','She had to be induced because the baby was four weeks late.  她的孩子晚了四星期仍未出生，因此要给她引产。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2446','abnormal','æbˈnɔːrml','æb''nɔːrml','[adj] 反常的， 变态的','abnormal behaviour  反常行为'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2447','wane','wen','weɪn','[vi] 衰退，减弱；减少；亏，缺; [n] 月亏； 衰落','My enthusiasm for the project was waning.  我对这个项目的热情逐渐减退了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2448','shrewd','ʃrud','ʃruːd','[adj] 敏捷的， 机灵的； 精明的','Malcolm is a shrewd businessman.  马尔科姆是个精明的商人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2449','baffle','''bæfl','''bæfl','[vt] 使困惑， 难住','The question baffled me completely.  这个问题把我彻底难倒了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2450','molecule','''mɑlɪkjul','''mɑːlɪkjuːl','[n] 分子','The molecules of oxygen gas contain just two atoms.  氧分子中只有两个原子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2451','sewerage','''suərɪdʒ','''suːərɪdʒ','[n] 排水系统； 污水处理； 污水','...without access to any services such as water or sewerage.  ...不能享受任何如供水或污水处理的服务。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2452','resign','rɪ''zaɪn','rɪ''zaɪn','[v] 辞去， 辞职； 放弃； 顺从， 听从','Josh resigned himself to the long walk home.  乔希只好走很长的路回家。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2453','diligent','''dɪlɪdʒənt','''dɪlɪdʒənt','[adj] 勤奋的， 刻苦的， 勤勉的','a diligent student  勤勉的学生'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2454','seasoning','''sizənɪŋ','''siːzənɪŋ','[n] 调味品， 调料','Mix the meat with the onion, carrot, and some seasoning.  将肉、洋葱、胡萝卜及一些佐料拌在一起。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2455','sophisticated','sə''fɪstɪketɪd','sə''fɪstɪkeɪtɪd','[adj] 老练的， 见多识广的； 精密的； 复杂的， 先进的； 高雅的， 有教养的','a sophisticated, witty American  一个见多识广、机智风趣的美国人'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2456','anomaly','ə''nɑməli','ə''nɑːməli','[n] 反常， 异常； 异常的人','In those days, a woman professor was still an anomaly.  那个时候，女教授仍旧十分稀罕。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2457','chivalrous','''ʃɪvəlrəs','''ʃɪvlrəs','[adj] 有骑士精神的； 彬彬有礼的， 殷勤的','He was handsome, upright, and chivalrous.  他英俊、正直、对女士彬彬有礼。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2458','dateline','''det,laɪn','''deɪtlaɪn','[n] 日期栏； 国际日期变更线','Countries are free to choose whether the dateline passes to the east or west, and Samoa''s decision will mean all new maps will need to change.  国家可自由选择是位于国际日期变更线的东侧还是西侧，萨摩亚的这一决定意味着所有的新地图将需要做出变动。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2459','grazing','''ɡrezɪŋ','''greɪzɪŋ','[n] 放牧； 牧场','He had nearly a thousand acres of grazing and arable land.  他拥有近千亩的牧场和可耕地。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2460','reside','rɪ''zaɪd','rɪ''zaɪd','[vi] 居住于， 定居； 存在， 在于','He spent most of his time in Rutherglen, where his family resided.  他大部分时间都在拉瑟格伦度过，他的家人就在那里居住。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2461','ware','wer','wer','[n] 陶器；器皿；','The donkey can break wares in a second, but it can not make a ware in one hundred years.  这驴子能在顷刻之间打破窑器， 但它却一百年也做不成一个窑器呀！'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2462','aluminum','ə''lʊmɪnəm','ˌæljə''mɪniəm','[n] 铝','We take all our aluminum cans for recycling.  我们将所有的铝罐回收再利用。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2463','prize','praɪz','praɪz','[adj] 应获奖的； 优秀的， 典范性的; [vt] 珍视; [n] 奖品；奖金；难能可贵的东西','He has spent months cultivating what he hopes are prize flowers.  他花了几个月培育他认为有望获奖的花卉品种。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2464','accident','''æksədənt','''æksɪdənt','[n] 意外事件， 事故','Over 70,000 people are seriously injured every year in road accidents.  每年在道路事故中受重伤的有七万多人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2465','marine','mə''rin','mə''riːn','[adj] 海的；海生的；海上贸易的; [n] 海军陆战队士兵','the enormous variety of marine life  海洋生物繁多的种类'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2466','ravine','rə''vin','rə''viːn','[n] 沟壑， 溪谷','The bus overturned and fell into a ravine.  这辆公共汽车翻了车，掉进了一处深谷。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2467','incompatible',',ɪnkəm''pætəbl','ˌɪnkəm''pætəbl','[adj] 不兼容的； 不协调的， 合不来的','I don’t know why they ever got married. They’re totally incompatible.  我不知道他们为什么结婚，他们根本合不来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2468','routine','rʊ''tin','ruː''tiːn','[adj] 例行的； 常规的; [n] 例行公事；惯例，常规','You mustn’t worry. These are just routine enquiries.  你不必担心，这只是例行的询问。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2469','distasteful','dɪs''testfl','dɪs''teɪstfl','[adj] 令人反感的， 讨厌的； 味道不佳的','What follows is John’s story. Parts of it may seem distasteful, even shocking.  接下来是约翰的叙述，其中有些部分也许令人不快，甚至令人震惊。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2470','defense','dɪ''fɛns','dɪ''fens','[n] 防御， 防卫','Of course, we''ll consult closely with our allies every step of the way, because the security and defense of our allies, both in Europe and Asia, is not negotiable.  当然，我们将在前行道路上就每一步骤与我们的盟国密切磋商，因为我们欧洲和亚洲盟国的安全与防卫是不容讨价还价的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2471','tariff','''tærɪf','''tærɪf','[n] 关税； 价目表， 收费表','America wants to eliminate tariffs on items such as electronics.  美国想要取消电子类产品的关税。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2472','canal','kə''næl','kə''næl','[n] 运河，沟渠; [vt] 开运河','We walked along by the side of the canal.  我们沿着运河边往前走。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2473','enlist','ɪn''lɪst','ɪn''lɪst','[v] 征募； 从军， 参军； 谋取',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2474','convict','kən''vɪkt','kən''vɪkt','[vt] 定罪，宣告…有罪; [n] 服刑囚犯','a convicted murderer  已定罪的谋杀犯'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2475','validate','''vælɪdet','''vælɪdeɪt','[vt] 使有效， 使生效； 证实','The Supreme Court has validated the lower court’s interpretation of the law.  最高法院已经认可下级法院对这条法规的阐释。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2476','dynamical','','daɪ''næmɪkl','[adj] 动态的； 动力的； 充满活力的',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2477','surplus','''sɝpləs','''sɜːrpləs','[adj] 过剩的， 多余的; [n] 过剩，剩余；盈余，顺差','Ethiopia has no surplus food.  埃塞俄比亚没有多余的食物。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2478','grading','''ɡredɪŋ','''greɪdɪŋ','[n] 评分； 等级','...a good grade of plywood.  …高品质的胶合板。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2479','decadent','''dɛkədənt','''dekədənt','[adj] 堕落的， 颓废的','Pop music was condemned as decadent and crude.  流行音乐被指责为堕落而又粗俗。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2480','gradient','''ɡredɪənt','''greɪdiənt','[n] 坡度； 倾斜度， 斜率； 梯度','a steep gradient  陡坡'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2481','inhibit','ɪn''hɪbɪt','ɪn''hɪbɪt','[vt] 阻碍， 抑制','An unhappy family life may inhibit children’s learning.  不幸福的家庭生活可能会阻碍儿童的学习。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2482','weathering','''wɛðərɪŋ','''weðərɪŋ','[n] 侵蚀， 风化','Certain plants play an additional role in weathering .  某些植物起了风化作用的辅助作用。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2483','intimate','ˈɪntəmɪt','''ɪntɪmət','[adj] 亲密的，密切的；详尽的，精通的；个人隐私的; [v] 暗示， 透露; [n] 至交， 密友','an intimate friend of Picasso’s  毕加索的一个密友'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2484','disclose','dɪs''kloz','dɪs''klouz','[vt] 泄露， 透露； 揭发','Some companies have already voluntarily disclosed similar information .  一些公司已经主动透露了类似的信息。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2485','religion','rɪ''lɪdʒən','rɪ''lɪdʒən','[n] 宗教； 宗教信仰； 宗派， 教派','The U.S. Constitution promises freedom of religion.  美国宪法保证宗教信仰自由。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2486','diagram','''daɪəɡræm','''daɪəgræm','[n] 图表； 图解','This diagram will illustrate what I mean.  这个图表可说明我的意思。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2487','disparate','''dɪspərət','''dɪspərət','[adj] 迥然不同的','a meeting covering many disparate subjects  涉及许多不同议题的会议'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2488','defiant','dɪ''faɪənt','dɪ''faɪənt','[adj] 反叛的， 挑衅的， 公然违抗的','Mark smashed a fist on the desk in a defiant gesture.  马克一拳砸在书桌上以示反抗。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2489','tragedy','''trædʒədi','''trædʒədi','[n] 惨事， 灾难； 悲剧','The tragedy happened as they were returning home from a night out.  悲剧发生在他们夜里外出归来的路上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2490','oxide','''ɑksaɪd','''ɑːksaɪd','[n] 氧化物','iron oxide  氧化铁'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2491','startling','''stɑrtlɪŋ','''stɑːrtlɪŋ','[adj] 惊人的， 令人吃惊的','Paddy’s words had a startling effect on the children.  帕迪的话在孩子们身上产生了惊人的效果。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2492','bison','''baɪsn','''baɪsn','[n] 美洲野牛','Nature and fertility would have been all-important; they would have worshipped sun gods, water gods, moon gods and doubtless bison gods.  最重要的一点肯定是自然资源的丰饶多产，他们崇拜太阳神、水神、月亮神，无疑还有野牛神。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2493','chart','tʃɑrt','tʃɑːrt','[vt] 用图说明；制图；记录，跟踪；计划; [n] 图表； 航海图','Scientists have been charting temperature changes in the oceans.  科学家们一直在记录海洋温度的变化。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2494','evoke','ɪ''vok','ɪ''vouk','[vt] 唤起， 引起， 激起','The photographs evoked strong memories of our holidays in France.  那些照片勾起了我们到法国度假的深刻回忆。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2495','attend','ə''tɛnd','ə''tend','[v] 出席， 参加； 照料， 看管； 专心， 注意； 陪同','Only 12 people attended the meeting.  只有12个人出席了会议。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2496','shovel','''ʃʌvl','''ʃʌvl','[vt] 铲；把…大量投入; [n] 铲， 铁铲； 挖掘机','The workmen shovelled gravel onto the road.  工人们把碎石铲到路面上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2497','embryo','''ɛmbrɪo','''embriou','[n] 胚， 胚胎； 雏形','The system already exists in embryo.  该体系已具雏形。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2498','accounting','ə''kaʊntɪŋ','ə''kauntɪŋ','[n] 会计学； 会计','...the accounting firm of Leventhal & Horwath.  …利文撒尔与霍瓦特会计事务所。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2499','align','ə''laɪn','ə''laɪn','[v] 结盟； 排整齐； 校准； 使一致','a country closely aligned with the West  与西方亲近的一个国家'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2500','secure','sə''kjʊr','sə''kjur','[adj] 安全的，有保障的；可靠的；确定的；','There are no secure jobs these days.  如今已经没有铁饭碗了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2501','intoxication','ɪn,tɑksə''keʃən','ɪnˌtɑːksɪ''keɪʃn','[n] 醉， 醉酒； 极度兴奋','Intoxication interferes with memory and thinking, speech and coordination.  醉酒影响记忆、思考，讲话和协调性。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2502','wasp','wɑsp','wɑːsp','[n] 黄蜂','We can see the wasp to penetrate glass.  透过玻璃我们可以看到黄蜂。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2503','canopy','''kænəpi','''kænəpi','[n] 天篷； 罩盖， 遮篷； 天蓬似的树阴','the forest canopy  森林的树冠层'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2504','neutron','''nʊtrɑn','''njuːtrɑːn','[n] 中子','Each atomic cluster is made up of neutrons and protons.  每个原子团簇是由中子和质子组成的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2505','locomotive',',lokə''motɪv','ˌloukə''moutɪv','[adj] 运动的； 移动的; [n] 机车，火车头','an increase in locomotive power  运动力的增加'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2506','tile','taɪl','taɪl','[vt] 铺瓦；铺地砖; [n] 瓦片； 地砖','Floors are either hardwood or slate tile.  地面铺着硬木地板或石板瓷砖。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2507','immense','ɪ''mɛns','ɪ''mens','[adj] 巨大的， 极大的','People who travel by rail still read an immense amount.  人们坐火车旅行时仍然会读很多书。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2508','avenue','''ævənu','''ævənjuː','[n] 途径， 手段； 大街','Fifth Avenue  第五大街'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2509','vacate','ˈveɪˌkeɪt; veɪˈkeɪt','və''keɪt','[vt] 腾出， 空出； 离， 退','Guests must vacate their rooms by 11:00.  房客必须于11点前腾出房间。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2510','inherent','ɪn''hɪrənt','ɪn''hɪrənt','[adj] 固有的； 内在的','Every business has its own inherent risks.  每笔生意本身都有风险。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2511','brush','brʌʃ','brʌʃ','[v] 刷，拂；轻碰; [n] 画笔； 刷子； 轻碰； 小冲突','Don’t forget to brush your teeth.  不要忘记刷牙。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2512','advantageous','''ædvən''tedʒəs','ˌædvən''teɪdʒəs','[adj] 有利的','He was now in a more advantageous position.  他现在的位置更有利。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2513','given','''ɡɪvn','''gɪvn','[adj] 规定的，特定的；假定的; [prep] 考虑到， 鉴于','On any given day in the Houston area, half the hospital beds are empty.  在休斯敦地区，任何一天医院的床位都有一半是空的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2514','hay','','heɪ','[n] 干草','...bales of hay.  …一捆捆的干草。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2515','encroach','ɪn''krotʃ','ɪn''kroutʃ','[vi] 侵占； 侵蚀， 蚕食','The shrubs encroached ever more on the twisting drive.  灌木丛蚕食了越来越多蜿蜒的车道。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2516','pronounced','prə''naʊnst','prə''naunst','[adj] 显著的； 明确的','a pronounced Polish accent  明显的波兰口音'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2517','perish','''pɛrɪʃ','''perɪʃ','[v] 灭亡； 湮灭， 毁灭； 老化','Hundreds perished when the ship went down.  轮船沉没，数百人罹难。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2518','definite','''dɛfɪnət','''defɪnət','[adj] 清楚的， 确切的； 肯定的','It’s impossible for me to give you a definite answer.  我不可能给你明确的答复。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2519','stipulate','''stɪpjulet','''stɪpjuleɪt','[v] 规定， 明确要求； 约定','Laws stipulate the maximum interest rate that banks can charge.  法律对银行可以收取的最高利率作了规定。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2520','wary','''wɛri','''weri','[adj] 小心翼翼的， 留神的， 警惕的','Keep a wary eye on the weather before you set sail.  出航前要密切注意天气。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2521','adapt','ə''dæpt','ə''dæpt','[v] 适合； 适应； 调整； 改编， 改写','The ability to adapt is a definite asset in this job.  适应能力是做这份工作的绝对有利条件。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2522','batch','bætʃ','bætʃ','[v] 分批处理; [n] 一批，一组，一群；一批生产的量','an overnight batch file  夜间批处理文件'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2523','stagecoach','''stedʒkotʃ','''steɪdʒkoutʃ','[n] 公共马车， 驿站马车','You know, sometimes, Ward, I think we should just hop onto a stagecoach and go out west, Missouri territory or some place like that.  你知道，有时，沃德，我觉得我们应该跳上驿站马车去西部，密苏里地区或者和那里相似的某个地方。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2524','insufficient',',ɪnsə''fɪʃnt','ˌɪnsə''fɪʃnt','[adj] 不足的， 不够的','Insufficient resources have been devoted to the health service.  用于医疗保健服务的资源不足。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2525','intrinsic','ɪn''trɪnsɪk','ɪn''trɪnsɪk','[adj] 固有的， 本质的， 内在的','the intrinsic interest of the subject  该话题本身的趣味'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2526','guilty','''ɡɪlti','''gɪlti','[adj] 有罪的， 犯罪的； 内疚的','She looked self-conscious and guilty.  她看上去很不自然，很内疚的样子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2527','measure','''mɛʒɚ','''meʒər','[v] 量，测量; [n] 措施，办法','The rainfall was measured over a three-month period.  对三个月内的降雨量进行了测量。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2528','vestige','''vɛstɪdʒ','''vestɪdʒ','[n] 遗迹， 残余； 丝毫， 一点儿','We represent the last vestige of what made this nation great – hard work.  我们代表了曾经使这个国家伟大的仅存的品质–勤奋。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2529','interstellar',',ɪntɚ''stɛlɚ','ˌɪntər''stelər','[adj] 星际的','...interstellar space.  ...星际空间。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2530','luminous','''lʊmənəs','''luːmɪnəs','[adj] 发光的， 明亮的','luminous paint  发光涂料'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2531','lash','læʃ','læʃ','[v] 将系牢，捆绑；猛烈打击；鞭打；猛烈抨击，严厉斥责; [n] 鞭打； 睫毛','Giant waves lashed the sea wall.  巨浪拍打着海堤。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2532','maritime','''mærɪtaɪm','''mærɪtaɪm','[adj] 海的， 海事的； 航海的','San Francisco has lost nearly all of its maritime industry.  旧金山几乎失去了所有海运业。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2533','rattle','''rætl','''rætl','[v] 发出咔嗒声；使紧张，使恐惧; [n] 咔嗒声； 拨浪鼓','His mocking smile rattled her more than his anger.  他那种嘲讽的微笑比他的愤怒更让她慌乱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2534','warp','wɔrp','wɔːrp','[v] 扭曲，弯曲，变形；','The door must be warped. It won’t close properly.  这门肯定是变形了，关不严。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2535','basement','''besmənt','''beɪsmənt','[n] 地下室， 地窖； 建筑物的底部','They bought an old schoolhouse to live in and built a workshop in the basement.  他们买了座旧校舍居住，还在地下室建了个作坊。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2536','injurious','ɪn''dʒʊrərɪəs','ɪn''dʒurəriəs','[adj] 侮辱的， 诽谤的； 造成伤害的， 有害的','...substances that are injurious to health.  ...有害健康的物质。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2537','chant','tʃænt','tʃænt','[v] 唱圣歌； 反复呼喊; [n] 圣歌；单调的吟唱；反复呼喊的话语','protesters chanting anti-government slogans  反复呼喊反政府口号的抗议者'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2538','commune','kə''mju:n, ''kɔmju:n','''kɒmjuːn','[vi] 与…亲密地交谈; [n] 群体， 公社','a hippie commune  嬉皮士群体'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2539','babble','''bæbl','''bæbl','[v] 胡言乱语； 含糊不清地说； 喋喋不休','I have no idea what he was babbling on about.  我不知道他在唠叨些什么。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2540','focalize','''fokəlaɪz','''foukəlaɪz','[v] 调节焦距； 使聚焦； 使集中',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2541','ceremonial',',sɛrɪ''monɪəl','ˌserɪ''mouniəl','[adj] 礼仪的，礼节的; [n] 礼仪， 礼节','the Mayor’s ceremonial duties  市长的礼仪职责'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2542','toady','''todi','''toudi','[vi] 谄媚，奉承; [n] 谄媚者， 马屁精','Hypocrite and toady and inebriate!  伪君子谄媚者和醉鬼。'),
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO words (book_slug, slug, word, phonetic_us, phonetic_uk, meaning, example) VALUES,
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2543','squabble','''skwɑbl','''skwɑːbl','[vi] 发生口角，','Then, seemingly on the spur of the moment, Morty started a squabble.  后来，似乎一时冲动，莫迪和我发生口角。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2544','rustic','''rʌstɪk','''rʌstɪk','[adj] 乡村的； 淳朴的； 用粗糙木材制作的','The village had a certain rustic charm .  这个村庄有一种迷人的田园风情。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2545','lava','''lɑvə','''lɑːvə','[n] 岩浆， 熔岩','Mexico''s Mount Colima began spewing lava and ash last night.  墨西哥科利马山昨晚开始喷发熔岩和火山灰。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2546','minimal','''mɪnɪməl','''mɪnɪməl','[adj] 最小的； 最低限度的','The storm caused only minimal damage.  暴风雨只造成了轻微破坏。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2547','ecology','ɪ''kɑlədʒi','i''kɑːlədʒi','[n] 生态； 生态学； 生态环境','the natural ecology of the Earth  地球的自然生态'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2548','venomous','''vɛnəməs','''venəməs','[adj] 有毒的， 分泌毒液的； 恶意的， 狠毒的','Lisa shot him a venomous glance.  莉萨恶狠狠地瞪了他一眼。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2549','courageous','kə''redʒəs','kə''reɪdʒəs','[adj] 勇敢的， 有胆量的','He was wrong, and courageous enough to admit it.  他是错了，而且有勇气承认自己错了。'),
