('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2564','typical','''tɪpɪkl','''tɪpɪkl','[adj] 典型的， 有代表性的','typical British weather  典型的英国天气'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2565','embargo','ɪm''bɑrɡo','ɪm''bɑːrgou','[n] 禁止贸易令；','The United Nations imposed an arms embargo against the country.  联合国对该国施行了武器贸易禁运。'),
