('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2569','corrosion','kə''roʒən','kə''rouʒn','[n] 腐蚀， 侵蚀','They are sprayed with oil to prevent corrosion.  它们被喷了油以防腐蚀。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2570','notorious','no''tɔrɪəs','nou''tɔːriəs','[adj] 臭名昭著的， 声名狼藉的','a notorious computer hacker  声名狼藉的电脑黑客'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2571','illustrative','ɪ''lʌstrətɪv','ɪ''ləstrətɪv','[adj] 作为例证的； 用做说明的； 解释性的','graphics and other illustrative material  图表和其他图解材料'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2572','hydrogen','''haɪdrədʒən','''haɪdrədʒən','[n] 氢','At the South Pole, in a region of continuous darkness, humans could access water to produce hydrogen and oxygen.  月球南极是一个持续黑暗的区域，在这里，人类能够接触到水，以生产氢和氧。'),
