('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2574','infant','''ɪnfənt','''ɪnfənt','[adj] 婴儿的； 初期的; [n] 婴儿，幼儿','infant formula milk  婴(幼)儿配方奶'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2575','artifact','''ɑrtə,fækt','''ɑːrtɪfækt','[n] 人工制品， 手工艺品','In the wrong hands this powerful artifact has the ability to unravel the soul.  在错误手这强有力的人工制品有能力解开灵魂。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2576','carbon','''kɑrbən','''kɑːrbən','[n] 碳','They degrade into carbon and oxygen.  他们能被降解成碳和氧。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2577','dinosaur','ˈdaɪnəˌsɔr','''daɪnəsɔːr','[n] 恐龙','My dinosaur and I go to school.  我的恐龙和我去上学。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2578','turnpike','''tɝn''paɪk','''tɜːrnpaɪk','[n] 收费公路','the New Jersey Turnpike  新泽西付费高速公路'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2579','deprive','dɪ''praɪv','dɪ''praɪv','[vt] 使失去， 剥夺','They''ve been deprived of the fuel necessary to heat their homes.  他们无法得到住房取暖必需的燃料。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2580','tantalizing','''tæntəlaɪzɪŋ','''tæntəlaɪzɪŋ','[adj] 诱人的','the tantalizing smell of fried bacon  诱人的煎熏猪肉的味道'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2581','swoop','swup','swuːp','[v] 猛扑； 突然袭击; [n] 突然行动','The eagle hovered, ready to swoop at any moment.  鹰在天空盘旋，随时准备俯冲下来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2582','floral','''flɔrəl','''flɔːrəl','[adj] 花的， 像花的； 饰以花的， 绘有花的','a scarf with a bold floral pattern  印有鲜艳花卉图案的围巾'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2583','pest','pɛst','pest','[n] 害虫； 令人讨厌的人','a chemical used in pest control  用于防治虫害的一种化学品'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2584','swoon','','swuːn','[vi&n] 昏厥， 昏倒； 痴迷','Virtually every woman in the ''20s swooned over Valentino.  在20年代，几乎每位女性都痴迷于华伦天奴这个品牌。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2585','magnesium','mæg''nizɪrm','mæg''niːziəm','[n] 镁','Plus, it has abundant fiber and magnesium.  而且，它还有丰富的纤维和镁。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2586','infancy','''ɪnfənsi','''ɪnfənsi','[n] 幼年； 初期','the infancy of radio broadcasting  无线电广播的初期阶段'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2587','heritage','''hɛrɪtɪdʒ','''herɪtɪdʒ','[n] 遗产； 传统','the importance of preserving the national heritage  保护民族遗产的重要性'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2588','supreme','suˈprim','suː''priːm','[adj] 至高无上的','the Supreme Allied Commander in Europe  欧洲盟军最高指挥官'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2589','philosophy','fə''lɑsəfi','fə''lɑːsəfi','[n] 哲学； 哲学体系， 思想体系； 人生观， 人生哲学','Emma studies philosophy at university.  埃玛在大学攻读哲学。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2590','slope','slop','sloup','[v] 倾斜; [n] 斜坡，斜面；斜度','The bank sloped down sharply to the river.  那座堤岸陡峭地朝着那条河倾斜下去。'),
