('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2594','latent','''letnt','''leɪtnt','[adj] 潜在的， 隐伏的； 潜伏的； 休眠的','latent aggression  潜在的侵略'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2595','forestall','','fɔːr''stɔːl','[vt] 预防， 预先阻止； 先发制人','a measure intended to forestall further attacks  意在预先阻止进一步攻击的措施'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2596','terrific','tə''rɪfɪk','tə''rɪfɪk','[adj] 极好的； 非常的， 极度的； 可怕的','That’s a terrific idea!  这个主意真棒！'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2597','stanza','''stænzə','''stænzə','[n] 节， 段','The poem''s first stanza tells how the speaker meets a fellow "nobody" — a friend.  这首诗的第一段描写诗人如何遇到了另一位“无名小卒”-- 一位朋友。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2598','niche','niʃ','niːʃ','[n] 生态位； 壁龛','Above him, in a niche on the wall, sat a tiny veiled Ganesh, the elephant god.  在他头顶上方一个壁龛里，坐着一尊极小的蒙着面纱的象神伽内什。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2599','worship','''wɝʃɪp','''wɜːrʃɪp','[n&v] 祭拜； 崇拜， 崇敬','They all worship the same god.  他们都信奉同一个神。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2600','lawn','lɔn','lɔːn','[n] 草地， 草坪； 操场','I spent all morning mowing the lawn (= cutting the grass ).  我整个上午都在修剪草坪。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2601','infection','ɪn''fɛkʃən','ɪn''fekʃn','[n] 传染， 感染； 传染病','The baby had an ear infection.  宝宝耳朵感染了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2602','ponderous','''pɑndərəs','''pɑːndərəs','[adj] 笨重的； 笨拙的； 沉闷的','an elephant’s ponderous walk  大象笨拙的步态'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2603','stubborn','''stʌbɚn','''stʌbərn','[adj] 顽固的， 倔强的； 难对付的','Why are you so stubborn?  你怎么这么固执？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2604','imprecise','''ɪmprɪ''saɪs','ˌɪmprɪ''saɪs','[adj] 不精确的； 不严密的','vague imprecise estimates  粗略的、不精确的估计'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2605','formulate','''fɔrmjə''let','''fɔːrmjuleɪt','[vt] 阐明， 确切表达； 规划， 构想； 制定','We are studying the situation but have not formulated any response yet.  我们正在研究形势，但尚未考虑好如何回应。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2606','glorify','''ɡlɔrɪfaɪ','''glɔːrɪfaɪ','[vt] 吹捧， 美化； 赞美， 赞扬','films which glorify violence  美化暴力的影片'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2607','emigrate','''ɛmɪɡret','''emɪgreɪt','[v] 移民， 移居国外','He emigrated to Belgium.  他移民去了比利时。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2608','sinuous','''sɪnjʊəs','''sɪnjuəs','[adj] 蜿蜒的； 迂回的','They followed the sinuous trail deep into the mountains.  他们沿着弯弯曲曲的小径进入深山。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2609','triangle','''traɪæŋɡl','''traɪæŋgl','[n] 三角形； 三角形物体','a triangle of land  一块三角地'),
