('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2638','beak','bik','biːk','[n] 鸟嘴， 喙','...a black bird with a yellow beak.  …一只有着黄喙的黑鸟。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2639','fiction','''fɪkʃən','''fɪkʃn','[n] 小说； 虚构， 编造','romantic fiction  爱情小说'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2640','bead','bid','biːd','[n] 珠子； 小滴','She wore a string of green glass beads around her neck.  她脖子上戴着一串绿色的玻璃珠子。'),
