('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2643','appointment','ə''pɔɪntmənt','ə''pɔɪntmənt','[n] 约会， 约定； 任命， 委派； 职位','All consultations are by appointment only .  就诊必须预约。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2644','synthesize','''sɪnθəsaɪz','''sɪnθəsaɪz','[vt] 合成； 综合','DDT is a pesticide that was first synthesized in 1874.  滴滴涕是最初合成于1874年的杀虫剂。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2645','trek','trɛk','trek','[n&v] 艰苦跋涉','a lonely trek through the forest  穿越森林的孤独跋涉'),
