('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2653','proofread','''prufrid','''pruːfriːd','[v] 校对， 校正','I didn''t even have the chance to proofread my own report.  我甚至没有机会校对自己的报告。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2654','potential','pə''tɛnʃl','pə''tenʃl','[adj] 潜在的； 可能的; [n] 潜能，潜力','The company has identified 60 potential customers.  该公司已确定了60位潜在的客户。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2655','lounge','laʊndʒ','laundʒ','[vi] 懒洋洋地站; [n] 等候室，休息室','Nathan was lounging on the grass bank outside the cottage.  内森正懒洋洋地躺在小屋外的草堤上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2656','gross','ɡros','grous','[adj] 总的，毛的；粗俗的，粗野的；令人不快的; [vt] 总收入为; [n] 一罗；','a gross profit of $5 million  500万美元的毛利'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2657','resist','rɪ''zɪst','rɪ''zɪst','[v] 抵抗； 耐， 抗','He resisted pressure to resign.  他顶住压力，没辞职。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2658','archive','''ɑrkaɪv','''ɑːrkaɪv','[n] 档案室; [vt] 存档','an archive of the writer’s unpublished work  那位作家未发表作品的档案'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2659','disarm','dɪs''ɑrm','dɪs''ɑːrm','[v] 解除武装； 裁军； 消除， 消解','Getting the rebels to disarm will not be easy.  要让叛乱分子解除武装并非易事。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2660','extrapolate','ɪk''stræpə''let','ɪk''stræpəleɪt','[v] 外推； 推断， 推知','Extrapolating from his latest findings, he reckons about 80% of these deaths might be attributed to smoking.  从他最近的发现推断，他估计大约80%的这类死亡可能归因于吸烟。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2661','stimulate','''stɪmjə''let','''stɪmjuleɪt','[vt] 刺激； 激励， 激发','Her interest in art was stimulated by her father.  她对艺术的兴趣是她父亲激发的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2662','reciprocity',',rɛsɪ''prɑsəti','ˌresɪ''prɑːsəti','[n] 互惠， 互助； 互惠主义','They said they would press for reciprocity with Greece in the issuing of visas.  他们说，他们将会对希腊施压，以达成签证发放的互惠。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2663','eclipse','ɪ''klɪps','ɪ''klɪps','[vt] 遮住光；使相形见绌; [n] 日食， 月食','an eclipse of the sun  日食'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2664','square','skwɛr','skwer','[adj] 正方形的；成直角的，方的；平方的; [n] 正方形；广场；平方; [vt] 使成正方形； 求平方； 使打成平局','a large square room  一个正方形的大房间'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2665','careless','''kɛrləs','''kerləs','[adj] 粗心的， 疏忽的； 无忧无虑的； 不关心的， 冷漠的','It was careless of him to leave the door unlocked.  他忘了锁门，真是粗心大意。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2666','soak','sok','souk','[v] 浸泡， 浸湿， 浸透','Soak the clothes in cold water.  把衣服浸泡在冷水里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2667','counteract',',kaʊntɚ''ækt','ˌkauntər''ækt','[vt] 消除； 抵消','They gave him drugs to counteract his withdrawal symptoms.  他们给他服药以消除他的脱瘾症状。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2668','deserted','dɪ''zɝtɪd','dɪ''zɜːrtɪd','[adj] 荒废的， 空无一人的； 被离弃的， 被遗弃的','The streets were deserted.  街上空无一人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2669','commute','kə''mjʊt','kə''mjuːt','[v] 上下班往返， 经常往返； 代偿； 减刑','Baldry’s 20-year prison sentence was commuted to three years.  鲍德里二十年的刑期被减至三年。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2670','sustain','sə''sten','sə''steɪn','[vt] 保持， 维持； 支持， 支撑； 经受， 承受','She found it difficult to sustain the children’s interest.  她发现很难保持孩子们的兴趣。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2671','anarchist','''ænɚkɪst','''ænərkɪst','[n] 无政府主义者','West Berlin always had a large anarchist community.  西柏林一直存在一个大的无政府主义群体。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2672','classify','''klæsɪfaɪ','''klæsɪfaɪ','[vt] 分类； 分等','We’d classify Drabble’s novels under ‘Romance’.  我们把德拉布尔的小说归类为“言情小说”。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2673','altitude','''æltɪtud','''æltɪtjuːd','[n] 海拔，高度；','The aircraft had reached its cruising altitude of about 39,000 feet.  那架飞机已经达到了大约三万九千英尺的巡航高度。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2674','request','rɪ''kwɛst','rɪ''kwest','[n&vt] 要求， 请求','To request more information, please call our toll free number.  欲知详情，请拨打我们的免费电话。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2675','colony','''kɑləni','''kɑːləni','[n] 群， 群体； 殖民地； 聚居地','Algeria was formerly a French colony.  阿尔及利亚以前是法国的殖民地。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2676','wagon','''wægən','''wægən','[n] 四轮马车； 货车','In the wagon.  在货车里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2677','numeric','nuː''merɪk','njuː''merɪk','[adj] 数字的','Explanation: Significant digits truncated during CAST from numeric to character.  说明：在从数字到字符科协截断有效数字。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2678','debut','de''bju','deɪ''bjuː','[n] 首次演出； 初次亮相','She made her debut in a 1937 production of "Hamlet."  她在1937年《哈姆雷特》的演出中首次登台。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2679','uphold','ʌpˈhoʊld','ʌp''hould','[vt] 支持， 维护； 维持','a committee that aims to uphold educational standards  旨在保持教育水准的委员会'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2680','dimension','dəˈmɛnʃən, daɪ-','dɪ''menʃn','[n] 维，元；尺寸；方面；特点；','You can have a spiritual dimension to your life without being religious.  即使你不信宗教，也可以在生命中拥有精神层面的内容。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2681','nostalgia','nə''stældʒə','nə''stældʒə','[n] 思乡病， 乡愁； 怀旧之情， 恋旧','He might be influenced by nostalgia for the surroundings of his happy youth.  他也许被他对快乐青年时代的环境的怀念影响了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2682','deserve','dɪ''zɝv','dɪ''zɜːrv','[v] 应得， 值得','What have I done to deserve this?  我做了什么事，要得到这样的报应？'),
