('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2684','artisan','''ɑrtəzn','''ɑːrtəzn','[n] 工匠， 手艺人',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2685','sprout','spraʊt','spraut','[v] 发芽，抽条，生长；迅速出现，涌现出; [n] 新芽， 嫩枝， 苗','Move the pots outside when the seeds begin to sprout.  种子开始发芽时把盆搬到外面去。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2686','restore','rɪ''stɔr','rɪ''stɔːr','[vt] 恢复； 修复； 归还， 交还','She was hoping that the Mediterranean climate would restore her to full health.  她希望地中海的气候能使她的身体完全复原。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2687','viscous','''vɪskəs','''vɪskəs','[adj] 黏滞的， 黏性的','As the liquid cools, it becomes viscous.  这液体冷却后会变黏稠。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2688','nostalgic','nɒ''stældʒɪk','nə''stældʒɪk','[adj] 思乡的； 怀旧的','Seeing those old school photographs has made me feel quite nostalgic.  看到那些学生时代的旧照片，我不禁产生了怀旧之情。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2689','alternative','ɔl''tɝnətɪv','ɔːl''tɜːrnətɪv','[adj] 可供替代的； 非传统的; [n] 可供选择的事物；选择的自由，选择的余地','An alternative route is along the Via Unione.  另一条路线是沿着联合路走。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2690','banner','''bænɚ','''bænər','[n] 横幅','The onlookers were shouting, cheering, and waving banners.  观众挥动着横幅，又是叫喊又是欢呼。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2691','encounter','ɪn''kaʊntɚ','ɪn''kauntər','[vt&v] 偶然碰到； 遭遇','The doctor had encountered several similar cases in the past.  那位医生过去曾碰到过好几个类似病例。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2692','soda','''sodə','''soudə','[n] 苏打， 纯碱','a Scotch and soda  一杯加苏打水的苏格兰威士忌'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2693','landslide','''lændslaɪd','''lændslaɪd','[n] 山崩， 塌方； 压倒性胜利','a landslide election victory   压倒性的选举胜利'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2694','prairie','''prɛri','''preri','[n] 大草原','About 160 species of rare birds live in the swamps and prairie there.  大约有160种珍稀鸟类栖息在这里的沼泽地和大草原上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2695','approve','ə''prʊv','ə''pruːv','[v] 批准； 赞成','The conference approved a proposal for a referendum.  会议通过了举行全民公决的提议。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2696','chafe','tʃef','tʃeɪf','[v] 擦破， 擦痛； 恼怒， 焦躁','Wear a T-shirt under your wet suit to stop it chafing.  在潜水服里面穿一件T恤防止蹭痛皮肤。'),
