('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2698','domicile','''dɑmɪsaɪl','''dɑːmɪsaɪl','[n] 住处， 住所','Military service entails frequent changes of domicile.  服兵役需要频繁更换住所。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2699','pedestrian','pə''dɛstrɪən','pə''destriən','[adj] 徒步的； 缺乏想象力的; [n] 步行者，行人','a painting that is pedestrian and unimaginative  乏味又缺乏想象力的画作'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2700','hurry','''hɝrɪ','''hɜːri','[v] 使加快，催促；赶快，匆忙; [n] 急忙， 匆忙， 仓促','If we hurry, we’ll get there in time.  要是赶紧的话，我们能及时到那里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2701','account','ə''kaʊnt','ə''kaunt','[v] 说明，解释；占; [n] 解释， 描述， 叙述； 账目； 账户','Chomsky’s account of how children learn their first language  乔姆斯基关于儿童如何学习第一语言的描述'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2702','radioactive','''redɪo''æktɪv','''reɪdiou''æktɪv','[adj] 放射性的， 有辐射的','the problem of how to dispose of radioactive waste  如何处理放射性废物的问题'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2703','innocent','''ɪnəsnt','''ɪnəsnt','[adj] 天真的； 清白的； 无恶意的','Nobody would believe that I was innocent.  没人肯相信我是清白的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2704','alphabet','''ælfə''bɛt','''ælfəbet','[n] 字母表','The modern Russian alphabet has 31 letters.  现代俄语字母表有31个字母。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2705','stride','straɪd','straɪd','[n] 大步；步法；','Paco reached the door in only three strides.  帕科三大步就走到了门口。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2706','advance','əd''væns','əd''væns','[v] 前进，向前移动；发展，进步；促进；预付; [adj] 预先的； 先头的; [n] 前进；进展；预付','A line of US tanks slowly advanced.  一列美军坦克缓缓前进。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2707','appreciate','ə''priʃɪet','ə''priːʃieɪt','[vt] 赏识； 鉴赏， 欣赏； 感激','Thanks ever so much for your help, I really appreciate it.  多谢你的帮助，我真的很感激。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2708','bleach','blitʃ','bliːtʃ','[v] 变白， 漂白; [n] 漂白剂','She bleached her hair blonde.  她把头发漂成了金黄色。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2709','diverse','daɪ''vɝs','daɪ''vɜːrs','[adj] 不同的； 多样的','subjects as diverse as pop music and archaeology  像流行音乐和考古学这样各不相同的学科'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2710','rally','''ræli','''ræli','[v] 集合，召集；恢复，重新振作; [n] 集会， 大会','an attempt to rally support for the party  为政党争取支持的努力'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2711','soft','sɔft','sɔːft','[adj] 柔软的； 柔和的； 不强烈的； 心肠软的； 软性的','a baby’s soft skin  婴儿细嫩的皮肤'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2712','fictitious','fɪk''tɪʃəs','fɪk''tɪʃəs','[adj] 虚构的； 假的； 假装的， 虚伪的','a fictitious address  杜撰的地址'),
