('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2714','intellect','''ɪntəlɛkt','''ɪntəlekt','[n] 智力， 理解力； 知识分子','Do the emotions develop in parallel with the intellect?  情感与智力同步发展吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2715','amble','''æmbl','''æmbl','[vi] 缓行， 漫步','An old man came out and ambled over for a chat.  一个老人出来，缓步走过去聊天。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2716','loyal','''lɔɪəl','''lɔɪəl','[adj] 忠诚的， 忠贞的','a loyal supporter of the team  球队的忠实支持者'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2717','preference','''prɛfrəns','''prefrəns','[n] 偏爱； 优先','Do you have a colour preference ?  你有什么颜色上的偏好吗？'),
