('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2720','dissolute','''dɪsəlut','''dɪsəluːt','[adj] 放荡的， 放纵的， 道德沦丧的',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2721','court','kɔrt','kɔːrt','[n] 法院，法庭；宫廷，朝廷；球场; [vt] 献殷勤， 讨好； 招致； 求爱','It could not be proved in a court of law.  这无法在法庭上证实。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2722','chapel','''tʃæpl','''tʃæpl','[n] 教堂； 祈祷室','Bethan goes to chapel every Sunday.  贝唐每个星期天都去教堂做礼拜。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2723','distort','dɪ''stɔrt','dɪ''stɔːrt','[vt] 弄歪； 扭曲， 歪曲','His account was badly distorted by the press.  他的话被报界严重歪曲。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2724','subsidiary','səb''sɪdɪɛri','səb''sɪdieri','[adj] 次要的； 辅助的， 附设的； 附属的; [n] 子公司；附属机构；支流','a subsidiary hypothesis  一个附带假设'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2725','venture','''vɛntʃɚ','''ventʃər','[v] 敢于去； 冒险; [n] 冒险，投机；投机活动，风险项目','When darkness fell, he would venture out.  天黑以后，他就会壮着胆子出去。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2726','interrelate','''ɪntɚrɪ''let','ˌɪntərɪ''leɪt','[v] 相互关联， 紧密联系','We will be discussing how the interests of state, parent and child interrelate.  我们将讨论国家、父母和儿童之间的利益是如何相互关联的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2727','corrosive','kə''rosɪv','kə''rousɪv','[adj] 腐蚀的','a highly corrosive substance  一种腐蚀性很强的物质'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2728','enthusiasm','ɪn''θuzɪæzəm','ɪn''θuːziæzəm','[n] 热情； 积极性； 热衷的事物','Gillian and Darren greeted the speakers with great enthusiasm.  吉利恩和达伦非常热情地接待了演讲者。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2729','discern','dɪ''sɝn','dɪ''sɜːrn','[vt] 洞悉； 识别','You need a long series of data to be able to discern such a trend.  你需要一大串数据才能认清这一趋势。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2730','propensity','prə''pɛnsəti','prə''pensəti','[n] 倾向， 癖好','Mr. Bint has a propensity to put off decisions to the last minute.  宾特先生有一种将决定拖到最后一分钟的倾向。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2731','entreat','ɪn''trit','ɪn''triːt','[v] 乞求， 恳求， 请求','He entreated them to delay their departure.  他恳求他们晚些再走。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2732','flexible','''flɛksəbl','''fleksəbl','[adj] 易弯曲的； 柔韧的； 灵活的， 可变通的','We can be flexible about your starting date.  你具体从哪天开始，我们可以灵活一点。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2733','agile','''ædʒl','''ædʒl','[adj] 敏捷的， 灵活的','Dogs are surprisingly agile.  狗出奇地敏捷。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2734','replenish','rɪ''plɛnɪʃ','rɪ''plenɪʃ','[vt] 添加， 补充','More vaccines are needed to replenish our stocks.  还需要更多的疫苗来补充我们的储备。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2735','hoe','ho','hou','[vt] 用锄头锄; [n] 锄头','I have to feed the chickens and hoe the potatoes.  我必须喂鸡，还得给土豆除草松土。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2736','amenable','ə''minəbl','ə''miːnəbl','[adj] 顺从的， 服从劝导的； 有服从义务的','She was always a very amenable child.  她一向是个很听话的孩子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2737','depict','dɪ''pɪkt','dɪ''pɪkt','[vt] 描写， 描述， 描绘','a book depicting life in pre-revolutionary Russia  描写革命前俄国人生活的一本书'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2738','sustainable','sə''stenəbl','sə''steɪnəbl','[adj] 不破坏生态平衡的， 可持续的； 足可支撑的； 可忍受的','The government should do more to promote sustainable agriculture.  政府应该做更多工作来推动可持续农业的发展。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2739','hop','hɑp','hɑːp','[v] 单足跳行；齐足跳行；跳上; [n] 蹦跳； 短程旅行','a little girl hopping and skipping  一个蹦蹦跳跳的小女孩'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2740','secede','sɪ''sid','sɪ''siːd','[vi] 正式脱离， 退出','Singapore seceded from the Federation of Malaysia and became an independent sovereign state.  新加坡脱离马来西亚联邦成为一个独立的主权国家。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2741','characteristic',',kærəktə''rɪstɪk','ˌkærəktə''rɪstɪk','[adj] 特有的； 典型的; [n] 特性，特征','the highly characteristic (= very typical ) flint walls of the local houses  当地房子非常有特色的燧石墙'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2742','interior','ɪn''tɪrɪɚ','ɪn''tɪriər','[adj] 内部的；内地的; [n] 内部； [the ～]内陆','The interior walls are all painted white.  室内墙壁都粉刷成了白色。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2743','interweave',',ɪntɚ''wiv','ˌɪntər''wiːv','[v] 交织， 编结','For these people, land is inextricably interwoven with life itself.  对那些人来说，土地和生活本身紧密交织在一起。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2744','rouse','raʊz','rauz','[vt] 唤起， 唤醒； 激起， 鼓舞； 激怒','His banging roused the neighbours.  他重重的关门声把邻居都吵醒了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2745','capability','ˌkepəˈbɪlətɪ','ˌkeɪpə''bɪləti','[n] 能力； 性能； 容量； 潜质','the country’s manufacturing capability  该国的生产能力'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2746','spark','spɑrk','spɑːrk','[v] 激发，引发，触发；','A dropped cigarette may have sparked the fire.  一支丢弃的香烟可能引发了这场火灾。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2747','integral','''ɪntɪɡrəl','''ɪntɪgrəl','[adj] 构成整体所必需的， 不可或缺的； 完整的','Vegetables are an integral part of our diet.  蔬菜是我们膳食中不可缺少的一部分。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2748','comet','''kɑmət','''kɑːmət','[n] 彗星','Halley’s comet  哈雷彗星'),
