('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2750','smelting','','''smeltɪŋ','[n] 冶炼， 熔炼','You see he mentioned smelting.  你看他提到了熔炼。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2751','spare','spɛr','sper','[adj] 备用的；空闲的; [vt] 抽出；免除; [n] 备用品','Have you got any spare boxes?  你有没有多余的盒子？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2752','chip','tʃɪp','tʃɪp','[v] 削下; [n] 碎片； 芯片','Archaeologists were carefully chipping away at the rock.  考古学家正小心地在岩石上铲凿。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2753','replicate','''rɛplɪket','''replɪkeɪt','[v] 复制； 再制， 再生','There is a need for further research to replicate these findings.  需要进一步的研究来验证这些结果。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2754','emotional','ɪ''moʃənl','ɪ''mouʃənl','[adj] 感情的， 情绪的； 引起情感的； 易动感情的','She provided emotional support at a very distressing time for me.  在我非常痛苦的时候，她是我的情感支柱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2755','noticeable','''notɪsəbl','''noutɪsəbl','[adj] 明显的， 值得注意的','Alcohol has a noticeable effect on the body.  酒精对身体有明显的影响。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2756','assemble','ə''sɛmbl','ə''sembl','[v] 集合； 装配','A large crowd had assembled outside the American embassy.  一大群人聚集在美国大使馆外。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2757','hibernation','','ˌhaɪbər''neɪʃn','[n] 冬眠； 休眠， 蛰伏',''),
