('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2800','session','''sɛʃən','''seʃn','[n] 会议； 开庭； 开庭期； 一节','After two late night sessions, the Security Council has failed to reach agreement.  开过两次深夜会议之后，安理会仍未能达成协议。'),
