('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2803','bland','blænd','blænd','[adj] 平淡的， 乏味的； 清淡的； 沉稳的','a few bland comments  不痛不痒的几句评语'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2804','microbe','''maɪkrob','''maɪkroub','[n] 微生物， 细菌','...a type of bacteria that include the microbes responsible for tuberculosis and leprosy.  …包括引起结核病和麻风病的微生物在内的一类细菌。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2805','reception','rɪ''sɛpʃən','rɪ''sepʃn','[n] 招待会； 反响； 接纳， 接待； 接收','She was unsure of her reception after everything that had happened.  发生了这些事后，她对自己是否还受欢迎没把握。'),
