('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2810','monitor','''mɔnɪtɚ','''mɑːnɪtər','[vt] 监控；调节; [n] 显示器； 监视器； 班长','He suspected that his phone calls were being monitored.  他怀疑他的电话被人监听。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2811','tuition','tʊ''ɪʃən','tu''ɪʃn','[n] 学费； 教学， 讲授','I had to have extra tuition in maths.  我不得不上数学补习课。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2812','Fahrenheit','''færən''haɪt','''færənhaɪt','[adj] 华氏温度的; [n] 华氏温度计','By mid-morning, the temperature was already above 100 degrees Fahrenheit.  到上午10点左右，气温已超过华氏100度了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2813','tangible','''tændʒəbl','''tændʒəbl','[adj] 可触摸的， 可感知的； 明确的， 确凿的； 有形的， 实际的','The scheme must have tangible benefits for the unemployed.  这个计划一定要对失业者有实实在在的好处。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2814','congest','kən''dʒɛst','kən''dʒest','[v] 充满， 拥塞； 充血',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2815','postage','''postɪdʒ','''poustɪdʒ','[n] 邮资， 邮费','How much is the postage for a postcard?  寄一张明信片的邮资是多少？'),
