('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2819','adjoin','ə''dʒɔɪn','ə''dʒɔɪn','[v] 贴近， 紧挨， 毗连','A vacant plot of land adjoins his house.  有一块空地紧挨着他家。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2820','spectacular','spɛk''tækjəlɚ','spek''tækjələr','[adj] 壮观的，引人注目的; [n] 壮观的场面； 壮观的演出','a mountainous area with spectacular scenery  景色壮丽的山区'),
