('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2822','hue','','hjuː','[n] 颜色； 色度， 色调； 信仰， 观点； 形式， 样子','a golden hue  一种金黄色调'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2823','idiom','''ɪdɪəm','''ɪdiəm','[n] 习惯用语； 术语； 风格， 特色','the new musical idiom  新的音乐风格'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2824','diplomat','''dɪpləmæt','''dɪpləmæt','[n] 外交官； 有手腕的人','French diplomats  法国外交官'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2825','landmass','''lændmæs','''lændmæs','[n] 大片陆地','Antarctica is the earth''s coldest landmass.  南极洲是地球上最冷的大陆。 。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2826','president','''prɛzɪdənt','''prezɪdənt','[n] 总统， 校长， 主席','President Bush  布什总统'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2827','muscular','''mʌskjəlɚ','''mʌskjələr','[adj] 肌肉的； 肌肉发达的； 强健的， 强壮的','She was fast and strong, with a slender, muscular body.  她动作敏捷，身体强壮，身材苗条，肌肉结实。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2828','staple','''stepl','''steɪpl','[n] 主要产品；原材料；主食；订书钉','staples like flour and rice  面粉和大米等主食'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2829','memo','''mɛmo','''memou','[n] 备忘录','I sent him a memo reminding him about the meeting.  我发给他一个通知，提醒他开会的事。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2830','artifice','''ɑrtɪfɪs','''ɑːrtɪfɪs','[n] 诡计， 奸计； 策略','Weegee''s photographs are full of artfulness, and artifice.  维加的照片充满了奇技妙想。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2831','collaborate','kə''læbəret','kə''læbəreɪt','[v] 协作， 合作； 勾结， 通敌','Much later he collaborated with his son Michael on the English translation of a text on food production.  后来他和儿子迈克尔合作，把一个有关食品生产的文本翻译成英语。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2832','collaborator','kə''læbə''retɚ','kə''læbəreɪtər','[n] 合作者， 协作者； 通敌者','Their job was to identify enemy collaborators.  他们的工作是找出通敌者。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2833','superficial',',supɚ''fɪʃl','ˌsuːpər''fɪʃl','[adj] 肤浅的， 浅薄的； 表面的， 外表的， 外层的','They only have the most superficial understanding of prison life.  他们对监狱生活只有最粗浅的了解。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2834','executive','ɪɡ''zɛkjətɪv','ɪg''zekjətɪv','[adj] 执行的， 实施的； 行政的; [n] 执行者；管理人员；行政负责人','a commission with executive powers  有执行权的委员会'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2835','melt','mɛlt','melt','[v] 融化， 熔化； 溶化； 消散','It was warmer now, and the snow was beginning to melt.  现在天气暖和了，雪开始融化。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2836','hook','hʊk','huk','[v] 连接到无线电设备；勾住; [n] 钩， 吊钩； 钩状物','We’ve got a CD player, but it’s not hooked up yet.  我们有一台激光唱片播放机，不过还没有接通电源。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2837','stadium','''stedɪəm','''steɪdiəm','[n] 竞走场； 运动场','the new Olympic Stadium  新的奥林匹克体育场'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2838','refrigerate','rɪ''frɪdʒəret','rɪ''frɪdʒəreɪt','[vt] 冷冻， 冷藏； 使冷却， 使变冷','Refrigerate the mixture overnight.  把混合物冷藏过夜。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2839','casualty','''kæʒuəlti','''kæʒuəlti','[n] 伤亡事故； 伤亡','Our aim is to reduce road casualties .  我们的目标是减少交通事故的伤亡人数。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2840','spatial','''speʃl','''speɪʃl','[adj] 空间的','...the spatial distribution of black employment and population in South Africa.  …南非黑人就业和人口的空间分布。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2841','gauge','gedʒ','geɪdʒ','[n] 标准，规格；测量仪表，计量器; [vt] 测量， 度量','a 27-gauge needle  一根27号针'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2842','belt','bɛlt','belt','[n] 地带， 地区； 腰带， 皮带； 带状物','He unbuckled his leather belt.  他解开皮带。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2843','ridicule','''rɪdɪ''kjʊl','''rɪdɪkjuːl','[vt] 嘲笑，奚落; [n] 嘲笑， 奚落','At the time, his ideas were ridiculed.  当时他的观点被人讥笑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2844','protest','prəˈtɛst;protɛst','prəˈtest;ˈprəʊtest','[v] 抗议， 反对; [n] 抗议， 反对','‘I don’t see why I should take the blame for this!’ she protested.  “我不明白为什么我要对此承担责任！”她抗议道。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2845','sensitive','''sɛnsətɪv','''sensətɪv','[adj] 敏感的； 灵敏的','a very sensitive child  一个很敏感的小孩'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2846','vacant','''vekənt','''veɪkənt','[adj] 空的； 闲置的； 茫然的， 空虚的','Only a few apartments were still vacant.  只有几套公寓仍然空着。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2847','hoof','huf','huːf','[n] 蹄','The horses'' hooves often could not get a proper grip.  这些马的蹄子经常踩不稳。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2848','afford','ə''fɔrd','ə''fɔːrd','[v] 买得起， 担负得起； 冒险做； 提供， 给予','The room affords a beautiful view over the city.  这房间可以俯瞰城市美景。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2849','underground','ʌndɚˈɡraʊnd','ʌndə''graʊnd','[adv] 在地下， 往地下； 秘密地， 不公开地; [adj] 地下的； 秘密的， 不公开的 记 组合词： under + ground → 地下的','This animal spends most of its life underground.  这种动物一生中的大部分时间都待在地下。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2850','sieve','sɪv','sɪv','[n] 筛子；漏勺; [vt] 筛， 滤','We can separate the stones out with a sieve.  我们可以用一个筛子把石头分离出来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2851','appease','ə''piz','ə''piːz','[vt] 平息； 安抚， 抚慰； 绥靖','They attempted to appease international opposition by promising to hold talks.  他们答应举行会谈，试图以此平息国际上的反对声音。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2852','reddish','''rɛdɪʃ','''redɪʃ','[adj] 微红的','reddish-brown lipstick  红棕色唇膏'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2853','impede','ɪm''pid','ɪm''piːd','[vt] 妨碍， 阻碍， 阻止','Storms at sea impeded our progress.  海上风暴阻碍了我们的航程。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2854','acting','''æktɪŋ','''æktɪŋ','[adj] 代理的; [n] 演戏， 表演','The new acting president has a reputation of being someone who is independent.  这位新的临时代理总裁有极有主见的名声。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2855','machinery','mə''ʃinəri','mə''ʃiːnəri','[n] 〈总称〉机器， 机械； 机构','...quality tools and machinery.  …优质工具和机械。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2856','shield','ʃild','ʃiːld','[n] 防护物；盾; [vt] 保护','He used his left hand as a shield against the reflecting sunlight.  他用左手遮挡反射过来的阳光。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2857','anatomy','ə''nætəmi','ə''nætəmi','[n] 解剖； 解剖构造； 剖析','a professor of anatomy  解剖学教授'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2858','deliver','dɪ''lɪvɚ','dɪ''lɪvər','[v] 传送， 传递； 发表， 宣布； 履行诺言； 移交， 交出； 接生','The morning mail has just been delivered.  早晨的邮件刚送到。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2859','instantaneous',',ɪnstən''tenɪəs','ˌɪnstən''teɪniəs','[adj] 瞬间的， 即刻的， 立即的','modern methods of instantaneous communication  现代的即时通信方法'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2860','phenomenon','fə''nɑmɪnən','fə''nɑːmɪnən','[n] 现象， 迹象； 非凡的人','Homelessness is not a new phenomenon .  无家可归已不是什么新现象。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2861','quarterly','''kwɔrtɚli','''kwɔːrtərli','[adv] 按季度，一季一次; [adj] 季度的， 每季一次的; [n] 季刊','It makes no difference whether dividends are paid quarterly or annually.  红利是按季度还是按年度支付没有区别。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2862','notify','''notə''fai','''noutɪfaɪ','[vt] 通报','The skipper notified the coastguard of the tragedy.  船长通知了海岸警卫队这一灾难。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2863','smirk','smɝk','smɜːrk','[vi] 假笑， 得意地笑','The boys tried not to smirk.  男孩们强忍住得意的笑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2864','barbecue','''bɑrbɪkju','''bɑːrbɪkjuː','[v] 在烤架上烧烤; [n] 烧烤野餐；金属烤架','barbecued chicken  〔用烤架烧的〕烤鸡'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2865','abbey','''æbi','''æbi','[n] 修道院； 大教堂','Once upon a time, there was an abbess in a small abbey .  很久以前，一个小修道院里有一个女修道院院长。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2866','alienable','''elɪənəbl','''eɪliənəbl','[adj] 可转让的','At common law, the right of re - entry is not alienable, assignable, or devisable.  普通法上， 收回权是不可流转、 转让或遗赠的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2867','buoyant','''bujənt','''bɔɪənt','[adj] 有浮力的， 漂浮的； 轻快的， 快乐的； 繁荣的； 看涨的','Cork is very buoyant.  软木浮性很好。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2868','intrepid','ɪn''trɛpɪd','ɪn''trepɪd','[adj] 勇敢的， 无畏的','intrepid explorers  勇敢的探险家'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2869','generalize','''dʒɛnrəlaɪz','''dʒenrəlaɪz','[v] 概括， 归纳； 推广','Can we generalise this principle?  这个原理可以推而广之吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2870','accredit','ə''krɛdɪt','ə''kredɪt','[vt] 委任， 授权； 把…归于； 正式认可','This degree programme is fully accredited by the Institution of Electrical Engineers.  这个学位课程是经英国电机工程师学会完全认可的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2871','nourish','''nɜrɪʃ','''nɜːrɪʃ','[vt] 滋养； 养育','The cream contains vitamin A to nourish the skin.  这种护肤霜含有滋养肌肤的维生素A。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2872','faucet','''fɔsɪt','''fɔːsɪt','[n] 龙头， 旋塞','If God turns off one faucet, he can turn on another.  如果上帝关上你的一个水龙头，他能开启另一个。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2873','lengthen','''lɛŋθən','''leŋθən','[v] 延长， 变长','Can you lengthen this skirt for me?  你能不能帮我把这条裙子改长？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2874','unconsolidated','','ˌʌnkən''sɑːlɪdeɪtɪd','[adj] 松散的， 疏松的','A series of defects exist in the cup circulation pack sand control tools and slip filling sand control tools currently used in Binnan unconsolidated sandstone reservoir.  针对滨南采油厂疏松砂岩出砂油藏所用皮碗式循环充填防砂工具和卡瓦式充填防砂工具存在的一系列弊端，研制应用了新型无卡瓦胶筒式循环充填工具。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2875','strike','straɪk','straɪk','[v] 碰，撞，撞击；侵袭；突然想到；给…以深刻印象；罢工；敲响; [n] 罢工； 袭击','She fell heavily, striking her head against the side of the boat.  她重重地摔倒，头撞在船舷上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2876','subdue','səb''du','səb''duː','[vt] 制服， 征服； 抑制， 克制','Police managed to subdue the angry crowd.  警察设法控制住了愤怒的人群。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2877','allege','ə''lɛdʒ','ə''ledʒ','[vt] 断言， 宣称','She alleged that there was rampant drug use among the male members of the group.  她指称该组织中有大量的男性成员吸毒。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2878','positive','''pɑzətɪv','''pɑːzətɪv','[adj] 肯定的； 积极的； 确凿的； 自信的， 乐观的； 正电的','the power of positive thinking  正向思考的力量'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2879','trigger','''trɪɡɚ','''trɪgər','[vt] 引发，导致; [n] 扳机','The assassination triggered off a wave of rioting.  这次暗杀事件引发了一阵骚乱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2880','segregate','''sɛɡrɪɡet','''segrɪgeɪt','[vt] 隔离， 使分开','A large detachment of police was used to segregate the two rival camps of protesters.  一大队分遣警察被派来隔离两群敌对的抗议者。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2881','maize','mez','meɪz','[n] 玉米','But why did maize become the favoured food and the revered grain of the Americas?  但为什么唯独玉米成为所有美洲人最为青睐的食品与崇敬的谷物？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2882','meticulous','mə''tɪkjələs','mə''tɪkjələs','[adj] 细心的， 小心翼翼的','He was so meticulous about everything.  他对任何事情都很小心谨慎。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2883','rental','''rɛntl','''rentl','[adj] 租用的；出租的; [n] 租金额； 租赁， 出租','A friend drove her to Atlanta, where she picked up a rental car.  一个朋友开车送她去了亚特兰大，在那里她租到了一辆车。'),
