('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2886','withhold','wɪð''hold','wɪð''hould','[vt] 拒绝给， 不给； 抑制； 忍住','I withheld payment until they had completed the work.  我扣着钱，直到他们完工。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2887','kinetic','kɪ''nɛtɪk','kɪ''netɪk','[adj] 运动的， 运动引起的； 动力学的','kinetic energy  动能'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2888','specialize','''spɛʃəlaɪz','''speʃəlaɪz','[v] 专攻； 专用于','...a University professor who specializes in the history of the Russian empire.  …一位专门研究沙俄历史的大学教授。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2889','rotate','''rotet','''routeɪt','[v] 转动， 旋转； 轮流','The Earth rotates on its axis once every 24 hours.  地球每24小时绕地轴自转一周。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2890','instance','''ɪnstəns','''ɪnstəns','[n] 例子， 事例','We need to rethink the way we consume energy. Take, for instance, our approach to transport.  我们需要重新考虑我们使用能源的方式，例如我们的运输方式。'),
