('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2895','cassette','kə''sɛt','kə''set','[n] 盒式录音带','His two albums released on cassette have sold 10 million copies.  他以磁带形式发行的两张专辑已售出1000万份。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2896','receptive','rɪ''sɛptɪv','rɪ''septɪv','[adj] 接受得快的； 善于接受的， 能接纳的','You might find them in a more receptive mood tomorrow.  也许他们明天会更乐于接受意见。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2897','blade','bled','bleɪd','[n] 刀刃， 刀片； 叶片； 草叶； 桨叶','a razor blade  剃刀刀片'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2898','solution','sə''luʃən','sə''luːʃn','[n] 溶液； 解答， 解决','The best solution would be for them to separate.  最好的解决方法是他们分开。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2899','foreshorten','','fɔːr''ʃɔːrtn','[vt] 用透视法缩小； 缩短， 节略','She could see herself in the reflecting lenses, which had grotesquely foreshortened her.  她可以在反射镜头中看到自己被怪异地缩短了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2900','diverge','daɪ''vɝdʒ','daɪ''vɜːrdʒ','[vi] 分开， 叉开； 分歧； 偏离','The two species diverged millions of years ago.  这两个物种从数百万年前开始朝不同方向演变。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2901','opponent','ə''ponənt','ə''pounənt','[adj] 对立的， 反对的， 对抗的; [n] 敌手，对手，反对者','Graf’s opponent in today’s final will be Sukova.  格拉芙今天的决赛对手将是苏科娃。'),
