('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2903','emblem','''ɛmbləm','''embləm','[n] 徽章； 标记， 象征','...the emblem of the Soviet Union.  …苏联的国徽。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2904','regardless','rɪ''ɡɑrdləs','rɪ''gɑːrdləs','[adv] 不顾， 不管','Despite her recent surgery she has been carrying on regardless.  尽管她最近动了手术，她却一直在不顾一切地继续工作。'),
