('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_2926','remodel',',ri''mɑdl','ˌriː''mɑːdl','[vt] 重新塑造， 改造； 改编； 改变','The airport terminals have been extensively remodelled.  航站楼已作了大规模的改建。'),
