('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3043','folkway','''fəukwei','''foukˌweɪ','[n] 社会风俗','The folkway and custom of Shijiazhuang Village, Anqiu City, are profound and famous.  安丘市石家庄村的民俗风情是很浓厚且著名的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3044','mountainous','''maʊntənəs','''mauntənəs','[adj] 多山的； 巨大的','the mountainous coast of Wales  威尔士多山的海岸'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3045','laboratory','ˈlæbrəˌtɔrɪ','''læbrətɔːri','[n] 实验室， 研究室','a research laboratory  研究实验室'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3046','geometric',',dʒiə''mɛtrɪk','ˌdʒiːə''metrɪk','[adj] 几何的， 几何学的','a geometric design  几何图形设计'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3047','Latin','''lætn','''lætn','[adj] 拉丁的；拉丁语的; [n] 拉丁语','a Latin inscription  拉丁语碑文'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3048','inspect','ɪn''spɛkt','ɪn''spekt','[vt] 检查， 视察','I got out of the car to inspect the damage.  我下车查看损坏情况。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3049','campaign','kæm''pen','kæm''peɪn','[vi] 竞选；参加战斗; [n] 竞选活动； 活动； 战役','Jones ran a good campaign.  琼斯的活动搞得很成功。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3050','vital','''vaɪtl','''vaɪtl','[adj] 生死攸关的； 至关重要的； 精力充沛的， 有活力的','Rodgers and Hart’s music sounds as fresh and vital as the day it was written.  罗杰斯与哈特的音乐现在听来还有刚写成时的那份清新和活力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3051','conflict','''kɑnflɪkt','''kɒnflɪkt','[vi] 冲突； 不一致； 争论; [n] 冲突； 争论','Personal ethics and professional ethics sometimes conflict.  个人道德与职业道德之间有时会相冲突。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3052','engraving','ɪn''ɡrevɪŋ','ɪn''greɪvɪŋ','[n] 雕刻术， 刻版术； 版画','...a colour engraving of oranges and lemons.  ...一副绘有橙子和柠檬的彩色版画。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3053','rough','rʌf','rʌf','[adj] 粗糙不平的；粗暴的；艰难的; [n] 高低不平的地面','Her hands were rough from hard work.  她的双手因为干重活而变得很粗糙。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3054','lawsuit','''lɔsut','''lɔːsuːt','[n] 诉讼','The dispute culminated last week in a lawsuit against the government.  这场针对政府诉讼案的争论在上星期达到了高潮。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3055','sequential','sɪ''kwɛnʃl','sɪ''kwenʃl','[adj] 序列的； 连续的； 随之而来的','...the sequential story of the universe.  ...宇宙的变迁史。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3056','detect','dɪ''tɛkt','dɪ''tekt','[vt] 发现， 察觉； 探测； 查明','Many forms of cancer can be cured if detected early.  如果发现得早，许多种癌症都可以治愈。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3057','derivative','də''rɪvətɪv','dɪ''rɪvətɪv','[adj] 派生的，引出的；无创意的; [n] 派生词， 衍生词； 派生物','a derivative text  依样画葫芦的文章'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3058','amateur','ˈæmətər','''æmətər','[adj] 业余爱好的； 业余的; [n] 业余爱好者；外行','...professional athletes and amateur runners.  …专业运动员和业余赛跑运动员。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3059','rodeo','''rodɪo','''roudiou','[n] 牛仔竞技表演','Welcome to English in a minute. This idiom makes it sound like you are at a rodeo.  欢迎来到一分钟英语。这个表达听起来我们在竞技比赛中。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3060','assistance','ə''sɪstəns','ə''sɪstəns','[n] 帮助， 援助','We offer financial assistance to students.  我们向学生提供经济援助。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3061','commerce','''kɑmɝs','''kɑːmɜːrs','[n] 贸易， 商业； 交往， 交流','measures promoting local commerce and industry  促进地方工商业发展的措施'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3062','canvass','''kænvəs','''kænvəs','[v] 游说， 拉选票； 细查','Candidates from all three parties were out canvassing in Darlington today.  三个政党的候选人今天都在达灵顿拉选票。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3063','gulf','ɡʌlf','gʌlf','[n] 海湾； 分歧， 隔阂， 鸿沟','the Gulf of Mexico  墨西哥湾'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3064','causal','''kɔzl','''kɔːzl','[adj] 原因的， 因果关系的','Rawlins stresses that it is impossible to prove a causal link between the drug and the deaths.  罗林斯强调说证实毒品与死亡之间的因果关系是不可能的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3065','tectonics','tɛk''tɑnɪks','tek''tɑːnɪks','[n] 构造地质学','Geologists describe the motion of the plates and the consequences of such motion as plate tectonics .  地质学家把板块运动及这种运动所造成的后果看作是板块构造运动。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3066','wonder','''wʌndɚ','''wʌndər','[v] 诧异；纳闷，想知道; [n] 惊奇， 惊异； 奇迹， 奇事','I was wondering if I could borrow your car?  请问我能否借一下你的汽车？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3067','mansion','''mænʃən','''mænʃn','[n] 公寓， 府邸； 大厦','a beautiful country mansion  漂亮的乡村宅第'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3068','gull','ɡʌl','gʌl','[n] 鸥， 海鸥','You have to practice and see the real gull, the good in every one of them, and to help them see it in themselves.  你应该通过练习去认识真正的海鸥，要看到每只海鸥的美德，并帮助他们去认识自己的美德。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3069','summary','''sʌməri','''sʌməri','[adj] 概括的， 概要的； 即刻的， 立即的; [n] 摘要，概要','a summary execution  立即处决'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3070','illusory','ɪ''lusəri','ɪ''luːsəri','[adj] 虚幻的， 幻觉的','First impressions can often prove illusory.  第一印象往往被证明是不真实的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3071','nickel','''nɪkl','''nɪkl','[n] 镍； 五分镍币','...a large glass jar filled with pennies, nickels, dimes, and quarters.  …一个装满1分、5分、10分和25分硬币的大玻璃罐。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3072','accustom','ə''kʌstəm','ə''kʌstəm','[vt] 使习惯于','She tried to accustom herself to the tight bandages.  她尝试着使自己习惯那些紧绷的绷带。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3073','entail','ɪn''tel','ɪn''teɪl','[vt] 牵涉； 使必要， 需要','A new computer system entails a lot of re-training.  使用新的计算机系统需要大量的再培训。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3074','inferior','ɪn''fɪrɪɚ','ɪn''fɪriər','[adj] 劣等的，较差的；次要的；级别低的; [n] 下级， 下属， 晚辈','I felt very inferior among all those academics.  与那些大学教师在一起，我自惭形秽。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3075','dramatic','drə''mætɪk','drə''mætɪk','[adj] 戏剧的； 引人注目的； 突然的， 巨大的； 戏剧性的','A superb goal by Owen earned United a dramatic victory yesterday.  昨天欧文的一个超级入球为联队赢得了激动人心的胜利。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3076','spinet','ˈspɪnɪt','''spɪnət','[n] 小型立式钢琴',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3077','mosquito','məˈskiːtoʊ','mə''skiːtou','[n] 蚊子','The use of mosquito lure female mosquitoes.  运用蚊子的趋光性引诱雌蚊。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3078','parasite','''pærəsaɪt','''pærəsaɪt','[n] 寄生物； 食客','Kangaroos harbour a vast range of parasites.  袋鼠身上有各种各样的寄生虫。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3079','artificial',',ɑrtɪ''fɪʃl','ˌɑːrtɪ''fɪʃl','[adj] 人工的， 人造的， 假的； 矫揉造作的， 假装','artificial flowers  假花'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3080','deficiency','dɪ''fɪʃənsi','dɪ''fɪʃnsi','[n] 不足， 缺乏','They did blood tests on him for signs of vitamin deficiency.  他们给他做了血检看是否有缺乏维生素的迹象。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3081','imaginary','ɪ''mædʒɪnɛri','ɪ''mædʒɪneri','[adj] 想象中的， 虚构的， 假想的','As she listened, she played an imaginary piano on her knees.  她边听边在膝盖上作弹钢琴状。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3082','removal','rɪ''muvl','rɪ''muːvl','[n] 除去； 移动， 搬迁','stain removal  去污'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3083','comment','''kɑmɛnt','''kɑːment','[v&n] 评论； 注释','He was fined for making abusive comments to the referee.  他因谩骂裁判而被罚款。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3084','vaporize','''vepə''raɪz','''veɪpəraɪz','[v] 蒸发， 汽化','The benzene vaporized and formed a huge cloud of gas.  苯蒸发形成了一大团气体。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3085','transcend','træn''sɛnd','træn''send','[vt] 超越','The desire for peace transcended political differences.  对和平的渴望超越了政治分歧。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3086','spiny','''spaɪni','''spaɪni','[adj] 长满刺的， 多刺的， 带刺的； 棘手的','spiny sea urchins  多刺的海胆'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3087','chronological',',krɑnə''lɑdʒɪkl','ˌkrɑːnə''lɑːdʒɪkl','[adj] 按年代顺序排列的， 年代学的','We arranged the documents in chronological order .  我们把这些文件按时序排列。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3088','humanitarian','hju,mænɪ''tɛrɪən','hjuːˌmænɪ''teriən','[adj] 人道主义的，慈善的; [n] 人道主义者， 博爱者， 慈善家','Air bombardment raised criticism on the humanitarian grounds that innocent civilians might suffer.  空袭遭到了非难，因为从人道主义的角度来看，无辜的平民可能会遭受伤害。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3089','employ','ɪm''plɔɪ','ɪm''plɔɪ','[vt] 用，使用；雇用; [n] 受雇， 雇用','The factory employs over 2,000 people.  这家工厂雇用了2,000多名员工。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3090','surcharge','''sɝtʃɑrdʒ','''sɜːrtʃɑːrdʒ','[n] 额外费用，增收费，附加费; [vt] 收取额外费用','No person shall prior to leaving the paid area fail or refuse to pay any fare surcharge or other sum leviable in accordance with these by-laws .  任何人不得在未付或拒付按照本附例可征收的任何车费、附加费或其它款项情况下离开已付车费区域。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3091','sturdy','''stɝdi','''stɜːrdi','[adj] 健壮的， 结实的； 稳固的； 顽强的','That chair doesn’t look very sturdy.  那把椅子看上去不太结实。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3092','fable','''febl','''feɪbl','[n] 寓言； 谎言','the fable of the fox and the crow  狐狸和乌鸦的寓言故事'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3093','balcony','''bælkənɪ','''bælkəni','[n] 阳台； 楼厅， 楼座','Has your flat got a balcony?  你的公寓有阳台吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3094','instill','ɪn''stɪl','ɪn''stɪl','[vt] 慢慢灌输； 逐渐培养',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3095','consist','kən''sɪst','kən''sɪst','[vi] 在于， 存在于； 由…组成， 由…构成','My diet consisted almost exclusively of chocolate-covered cookies and glasses of milk.  我的饮食几乎只包含裹上巧克力的曲奇饼和一杯杯牛奶。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3096','palatable','''pælətəbl','''pælətəbl','[adj] 美味的， 可口的； 合意的， 认可的','a very palatable wine  口感极佳的酒'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3097','compatible','kəm''pætəbl','kəm''pætəbl','[adj] 协调的， 一致的； 兼容的； 能和睦相处的','The new software is IBM compatible (= can be used with IBM computers ) .  这个新软件与IBM的计算机兼容。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3098','critic','''krɪtɪk','''krɪtɪk','[n] 评论家， 批评家； 吹毛求疵者','Mather was a film critic for many years.  马瑟做过多年的电影评论家。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3099','tenement','''tɛnəmənt','''tenəmənt','[n] 廉租公寓','...streets of low-cost tenements.  …低成本旧式公寓街。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3100','photosynthesis',',foto''sɪnθəsɪs','ˌfoutou''sɪnθəsɪs','[n] 光合作用','The belt of vegetation that crosses Africa below the Sahara is very dark because most of the sunlight is absorbed by plants for photosynthesis.  在撒哈拉沙漠下方，横贯非洲中部的植被带颜色非常深，因为植物由于光合作用吸收了大多数太阳光。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3101','sidebar','','''saɪdbɑːr','[n] 补充报道',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3102','crest','krɛst','krest','[v] 达到顶点; [n] 顶峰，顶点；浪尖；羽冠','They crested a wooded hill shortly before sunset.  太阳就要落山之前，他们登上了一座树木茂盛的小山巅。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3103','profession','prə''fɛʃən','prə''feʃn','[n] 职业； 同行； 专业； 宣称','people who work in the professions  从事专业性工作的人'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3104','deplore','dɪ''plɔr','dɪ''plɔːr','[vt] 悲叹， 哀叹， 公开谴责','Muslim and Jewish leaders have issued statements deploring the violence and urging the United Nations to take action.  伊斯兰教和犹太教领袖已经发表声明谴责该暴力行为，并敦促联合国采取行动。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3105','compress','kəm''prɛs','kəm''pres','[v] 压缩； 缩短； 浓缩','Light silk is best for parachutes, as it compresses well and then expands rapidly.  轻质丝绸最适合制作降落伞，因为这种面料便于压缩，而且展开迅速。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3106','grimly','''grɪmlɪ','''grɪmli','[adv] 冷酷地； 严肃地； 坚定地',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3107','cherish','''tʃɛrɪʃ','''tʃerɪʃ','[vt] 爱护， 珍爱； 怀有， 抱有','In marriage, a man promises to cherish his wife.  在婚姻中，男人承诺要爱护妻子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3108','outlive',',aʊt''lɪv','ˌaut''lɪv','[vt] 比…长命， 比…耐久','She outlived her husband by 20 years.  她比她丈夫多活了20年。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3109','patronize','ˈpeɪtrəˌnaɪz;ˈpætrənˌaɪz','''peɪtrənaɪz','[v] 以高人一等的态度对待； 光顾； 赞助， 资助','Don’t patronize me!  别对我摆出一副纡尊降贵的样子！'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3110','eminent','''ɛmɪnənt','''emɪnənt','[adj] 显著的， 杰出的','an eminent lawyer  杰出的律师'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3111','underneath',',ʌndɚ''niθ','ˌʌndər''niːθ','[adv] 在下面; [prep] 在…下面','He has on his jeans and a long-sleeved blue denim shirt with a white T-shirt underneath.  他身穿牛仔裤和一件蓝色长袖粗斜纹棉布衬衫，里面还有件白色T恤衫。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3112','spectrum','''spɛktrəm','''spektrəm','[n] 谱， 光谱， 频谱； 范围， 幅度','The two articles here represent opposite ends of the spectrum .  这里的两篇文章代表了两个极端的观点。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3113','prolong','prəˈlɑːŋ','prə''lɔːŋ','[vt] 拉长， 延长','I was trying to think of some way to prolong the conversation.  我在想方设法拖长这次谈话。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3114','refund','ˈrifʌnd','ˈriːfʌnd','[n] 偿还额； 退款; [vt] 退还， 偿付','They refused to give me a refund .  他们拒绝给我退款。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3115','distress','dɪ''strɛs','dɪ''stres','[n] 痛苦，忧伤；贫困，窘迫；遇难; [vt] 使痛苦， 使悲伤， 使忧虑','Luke’s behaviour caused his parents great distress.  卢克的行为使他的父母深感忧虑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3116','remnant','''rɛmnənt','''remnənt','[n] 残余物； 布头； 遗迹','Beneath the present church were remnants of Roman flooring.  在目前的这座教堂下面还有残余的古罗马地板。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3117','broadcast','''brɔdkæst','''brɔːdkæst','[v] 广播，播放; [n] 广播， 广播节目','The interview was broadcast live across Europe.  这次采访向整个欧洲进行了现场直播。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3118','compressible','','kəm''presbl','[adj] 可压缩的','As a group, multiplayer fabrics have the advantage of a large void volume in the non-compressible bade structure.  作为一个组织，多层面料的优点是无效体积大在非可压缩八德结构中。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3119','steep','stip','stiːp','[adj] 陡的，陡峭的；急剧的；过高的; [v] 浸泡； 沉浸','The road became rocky and steep.  路变得崎岖陡峭起来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3120','classical','''klæsɪkl','''klæsɪkl','[adj] 经典的， 古典的','the classical theory of relativity  经典相对论'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3121','immunity','ɪ''mjʊnəti','ɪ''mjuːnəti','[n] 免疫力； 保护； 免除， 豁免',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3122','privilege','ˈprɪvəlɪdʒ','''prɪvəlɪdʒ','[vt] 给予特权，特别优待; [n] 特权， 特殊待遇； 特殊利益， 优惠； 荣耀， 荣幸','He had no special privileges and was treated just like every other prisoner.  他不享受特权，待遇和任何其他犯人一样。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3123','shroud','ʃraʊd','ʃraud','[vt] 隐藏，遮蔽; [n] 裹尸布， 寿衣； 遮蔽物','Joseph was shrouded under a dark blanket.  约瑟夫身上裹着一条深色的毯子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3124','substitute','''sʌbstɪtut','''sʌbstɪtuːt','[v] 代替; [n] 代替者，代替品','Michael Owen had to be substituted after 20 minutes on the field.  迈克尔·欧文上场 20 分钟后，不得不被换下。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3125','criss-cross','''kris krɔs','''krɪsˌkrɔːs','[v] 构成十字形图案；交叉往来; [adj] 纵横交错的','They criss-crossed the country by bus.  他们乘坐公共汽车在乡间交叉往返。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3126','uniform','junəˌfɔrm','''juːnɪfɔːrm','[adj] 统一的； 均匀的; [n] 制服','Grade A eggs must be of uniform size.  A 级鸡蛋必须大小相同。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3127','choppy','''tʃɑpi','''tʃɑːpi','[adj] 波浪起伏的， 不平静的； 不连贯的， 支离破碎的','The small boat bobbed about on the choppy water.  小船在波浪起伏的水面上颠簸。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3128','blaze','blez','bleɪz','[vi] 燃烧， 着火； 发光， 放光彩； 怒视; [n] 火焰；光辉，强烈的光；迸发','The room was warm, with a fire blazing in the hearth.  房间里暖融融的，壁炉里的火熊熊燃烧。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3129','bountiful','''baʊntɪfl','''bauntɪfl','[adj] 慷慨的； 大量的， 充足的','bountiful harvests  大丰收'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3130','meager','''migɚ','''miːgər','[adj] 不足的， 贫乏的； 消瘦的','It was medieval European monks who introduced scientific brewing techniques in an effort to produce a nutritious beverage to supplement their meager diets.  正是中世纪欧洲的僧侣们引进科学的啤酒酿造技术，制造有营养的饮料，从而补充了他们贫乏的饮食。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3131','scatter','''skætɚ','''skætər','[v] 使分散， 驱散， 散开； 撒播','The sound of gunfire made the crowd scatter in all directions.  枪声使人群四散奔逃。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3132','violate','''vaɪəlet','''vaɪəleɪt','[vt] 违反， 违背； 亵渎； 侵犯， 干扰','34 protesters were arrested for violating criminal law.  34名抗议者因违反刑法而被逮捕。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3133','methanol','''mɛθənɔl','''meθənɔːl','[n] 甲醇','...so-called alternative fuels such as ethanol and methanol.  ...诸如乙醇和甲醇的所谓替代燃料。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3134','steer','stɪr','stɪr','[v] 驾驶，为…操舵；引导; [n] 食用公牛','He was steering with only one hand.  他只用一只手在驾驶。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3135','pheromone','''fɛrəmon','''ferəmoun','[n] 信息素','Effect on the controlling oriental tobacco budworm , Helicoverpa assulta by using sex pheromone.  与用性信息素诱剂防治烟青虫的效果>>相似的文献。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3136','collective','kə''lɛktɪv','kə''lektɪv','[adj] 集体的，共同的; [n] 集体， 共同体','a collective decision made by all board members  董事会所有成员作出的集体决定'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3137','buddy','''bʌdi','''bʌdi','[n] 密友； 搭档， 伙伴','We’re good buddies.  我们是好朋友。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3138','undergo',',ʌndɚ''ɡo','ˌʌndər''gou','[vt] 经历； 遭受','The country has undergone massive changes recently.  这个国家最近经历了巨大的变化。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3139','outlying','''aʊtlaɪɪŋ','''autlaɪɪŋ','[adj] 边远的， 偏僻的； 无关的， 题外的','Tourists can visit outlying areas like the Napa Valley Wine Country.  游客可以去纳帕谷酒乡这样的边远地区。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3140','delineate','dɪ''lɪnɪet','dɪ''lɪnieɪt','[vt] 描绘， 描述； 解释','The document delineates your rights and your obligations.  这份文件阐明了你的权利和义务。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3141','agency','''edʒənsi','''eɪdʒənsi','[n] 代理处， 经销机构； 专门机构','a UN agency responsible for helping refugees  负责为难民提供帮助的联合国机构'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3142','coupon','''kupɑn','''kuːpɑːn','[n] 礼券， 优惠券； 配给券， 票证','The coupon entitles you to ten cents off your next purchase.  这张优惠券可以让你在下次购物时节省10分钱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3143','multitude','ˈmʌltɪˌtud, -ˌtjud','''mʌltɪtjuːd','[n] 大量， 众多； 群众， 民众； 人群','Political power has been placed in the hands of the multitude.  政治权力已交到民众手中。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3144','inhabit','ɪn''hæbɪt','ɪn''hæbɪt','[vt] 居住于， 栖居于','The woods are inhabited by many wild animals.  很多野生动物栖居在这片森林里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3145','innate','ɪ''net','ɪ''neɪt','[adj] 天生的， 固有的； 内在的， 直觉的','Children have an innate ability to learn language.  儿童学习语言的能力是与生俱来的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3146','siege','sidʒ','siːdʒ','[n] 包围， 围困； 封锁','The siege lasted almost four months.  这次封锁历时近四个月。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3147','gratify','''grætə''fai','''grætɪfaɪ','[vt] 使满意， 使高兴； 满足','He was gratified by Lucy’s response.  他对露西的回答很满意。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3148','fascinating','''fæsɪnetɪŋ','''fæsɪneɪtɪŋ','[adj] 迷人的， 醉人的','a fascinating book  一本引人入胜的书'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3149','abstract','''æbstrækt','''æbstrækt','[adj] 抽象的；抽象派的; [n] 摘要， 梗概; [vt] 做…的摘要； 提取','By the age of seven, children are capable of thinking in abstract terms .  儿童到了七岁就具有抽象思维的能力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3150','agenda','ə''dʒɛndə','ə''dʒendə','[n] 议程， 议程表','The Republicans have stuck to their conservative agenda.  共和党人坚持自己的保守议题。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3151','liquid','''lɪkwɪd','''lɪkwɪd','[adj] 液体的，液态的，流体的；清澈的；流畅的; [n] 液体； 液态','Children take antibiotics in liquid form.  儿童服用液态抗生素。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3152','quasar','''kwezɑr','''kweɪzɑːr','[n] 类星体','This quasar was the only one without a known host galaxy.  这个类星体似乎无依无傍，不在任何一个星系当中。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3153','anonymous','ə''nɑnəməs','ə''nɑːnɪməs','[adj] 匿名的， 不具名的； 无特色的， 无个性特征的','the anonymous author of a collection of poems  一本诗集的佚名作者'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3154','fake','feɪk','feɪk','[v] 伪造； 伪装','She faked her father’s signature on the cheque.  她在支票上伪造了其父的签名。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3155','span','spæn','spæn','[n] 跨度；持续时间; [vt] 跨越； 持续， 贯穿； 包括','It’ll be difficult to hire that many new staff in such a short time span .  在这么短的时间里要想招聘到那么多新员工是很难的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3156','desegregate',',di''sɛɡrɪɡet','ˌdiː''segrɪgeɪt','[v] 废除种族隔离','The United States was working to desegregate the military, schools, and all public facilities.  美国当时正在着手废除对军队、学校和所有公共设施实施的种族隔离。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3157','girder','''ɡədɚ','''gɜːrdər','[n] 主梁， 大梁','The girder is square in cross-section.  这个大梁的截面是方形的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3158','bizarre','bɪ''zɑr','bɪ''zɑːr','[adj] 奇形怪状的， 古怪可笑的， 怪诞的','a bizarre coincidence  奇怪的巧合'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3159','perfect','ˈpɝfɪkt; (for v.) pɝˈfɛkt','ˈpɜ:fɪkt; (for v.) pəˈfekt','[adj] 完美的， 理想的； 完全的， 十足的; [vt] 使完美， 使熟练','His English was perfect.  他的英语很地道。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3160','prefer','prɪ''fɝ','prɪ''fɜːr','[v] 更喜欢， 宁愿','This type of owl prefers a desert habitat.  这种猫头鹰更喜欢沙漠的生活环境。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3161','astronomical',',æstrə''nɑmɪkl','ˌæstrə''nɑːmɪkl','[adj] 天文学的； 极大的， 庞大的','Houses in the subdivision are going for astronomical prices.  该小区里的房子在以天价出售。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3162','ascribe','ə''skraɪb','ə''skraɪb','[vt] 把…归于； 归咎于','An autopsy eventually ascribed the baby''s death to sudden infant death syndrome.  一次尸检最终把这名婴儿的死亡归因于婴儿猝死综合症。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3163','pole','pol','poul','[n] 地极； 磁极， 电极； 柱， 杆， 杖； 极端','a telephone pole  电话线杆'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3164','minority','maɪ''nɔrəti','maɪ''nɔːrəti','[n] 少数； 少数民族','Gaelic is still spoken in Ireland by a tiny minority.  爱尔兰仍有极少数人在说盖尔语。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3165','allure','əˈlʊr','ə''lur','[n&v] 诱惑， 吸引','At 50, she had lost none of her sexual allure.  50岁的她魅力丝毫未减。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3166','reference','''rɛfrəns','''refrəns','[n] 提到， 论及， 涉及； 引文， 参考； 介绍','He made no reference to any agreement.  他没有提到任何协议。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3167','conspiracy','kən''spɪrəsi','kən''spɪrəsi','[n] 密谋； 阴谋','There were many conspiracy theories (= beliefs that something is the result of a conspiracy ) surrounding Princess Diana’s death.  围绕戴安娜王妃之死有许多阴谋论。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3168','chamber','ˈtʃeɪmbər','''tʃeɪmbər','[n] 会议厅； 议院； 洞穴； 腔， 室； 房间','a combustion chamber  燃烧室'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3169','arrange','ə''rendʒ','ə''reɪndʒ','[v] 布置； 安排， 筹备','Contact your local branch to arrange an appointment.  请联络当地分部安排预约。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3170','aristocratic','ə,rɪstə''krætɪk','əˌrɪstə''krætɪk','[adj] 贵族的， 有贵族气派的','an aristocratic family  贵族家庭'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3171','trivialize','''trɪvɪəlaɪz','''trɪviəlaɪz','[vt] 使显得琐碎； 轻视','The article trivializes the whole issue of equal rights.  文章对平等权利这个大问题轻描淡写。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3172','depart','dɪ''pɑrt','dɪ''pɑːrt','[vi] 离开； 背离','Flights by Air Europe depart Gatwick on Tuesdays.  欧洲航空公司的航班每逢周二从盖特威克机场起飞。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3173','exponent','ɪk''sponənt','ɪk''spounənt','[n] 解释者； 倡导者， 拥护者； 指数， 幂','...a leading exponent of test-tube baby techniques.  …一位试管婴儿技术的主要倡导者。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3174','accordion','ə''kɔrdɪən','ə''kɔːrdiən','[n] 手风琴','Can I have your accordion?  我能要你的手风琴吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3175','incongruity',',ɪnkɑŋ''grʊəti','ˌɪnkɑːn''gruːəti','[n] 不一致， 不和谐','The incongruity of her situation struck Gina with unpleasant force.  吉娜猛然意识到自己处境尴尬，心里很不舒服。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3176','solicit','sə''lɪsɪt','sə''lɪsɪt','[v] 恳请； 乞求； 征求； 勾引； 招揽','Morgan is accused of illegally soliciting campaign contributions.  摩根被指控非法征募竞选捐款。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3177','rhyme','raɪm','raɪm','[v] 押韵；和…同韵; [n] 押韵； 同韵词， 押韵词','The song has rhyming couplets (= pairs of lines that end in words that rhyme ) .  这首歌有同韵的对句。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3178','fossil','''fɑsl','''fɑːsl','[adj] 化石的；陈腐的; [n] 化石； 老顽固','I wonder what environment of deposition was required to preserve this fossil so well.  我想知道是什么样的沉积环境才能将这个化石保存得这么好。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3179','disciple','dɪ''saɪpl','dɪ''saɪpl','[n] 门徒， 弟子， 追随者','...a major intellectual figure with disciples throughout Europe.  …一位信徒遍布欧洲的重要知识分子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3180','collision','kə''lɪʒən','kə''lɪʒn','[n] 碰撞； 冲突， 抵触','Two people were killed in a head-on collision (= between two vehicles that are moving directly towards each other ) on highway 218.  218号公路上有两辆汽车迎面相撞，两人死亡。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3181','manufacture','''mænjə''fæktʃɚ','ˌmænju''fæktʃər','[vt] 大量制造，成批生产；捏造; [n] 大量制造；','the company that manufactured the drug  生产这种药的公司'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3182','arthritis','ɑr''θraɪtɪs','ɑːr''θraɪtɪs','[n] 关节炎','I have a touch of arthritis in the wrist.  我的手腕有轻微关节炎。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3183','focal','''fokl','''foukl','[adj] 焦点的； 很重要的','This issue has now become the focal centre of interest.  这一问题现已成为关注的焦点。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3184','spinning','''spɪnɪŋ','''spɪnɪŋ','[adj] 旋转的; [n] 纺纱','Like Tony Montana on his toes. Up up and down your spinning round and round.  歌词大意： 像托尼蒙大拿州在他的脚趾上。向上向上和向下你旋转圆和圆。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3185','squid','skwɪd','skwɪd','[n] 鱿鱼， 枪乌贼','Add the prawns and squid and cook for 2 minutes.  加入虾和鱿鱼，煮2分钟。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3186','slogan','''slogən','''slougən','[n] 标语， 口号； 广告语','an advertising slogan  一句广告口号'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3187','bosom','''bʊzəm','''buzəm','[n] 胸部， 乳房； 胸怀， 内心','She cradled the child to her bosom.  她把那孩子抱入怀中。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3188','tract','trækt','trækt','[n] 地域； 领域； 传单， 小册子； 大片','vast tracts of woodland  大片大片的林地'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3189','mercury','','''mɜːrkjəri','[n] [M-]水星； 水银， 汞',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3190','interact',',ɪntɚ''ækt','ˌɪntər''ækt','[vi] 相互作用； 互相配合','While the other children interacted and played together, Ted ignored them.  当其他孩子们相互交往、一起玩耍时，泰德却不理他们。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3191','powder','''paʊdɚ','''paudər','[n] 粉， 粉末； 散剂； 火药， 炸药','curry powder  咖喱粉'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3192','bestow','bɪ''sto','bɪ''stou','[vt] 赠与， 授予， 献给','The United States bestowed honorary citizenship upon England''s World War II prime minister, Sir Winston Churchill.  美国授予了二战期间的英国首相温斯顿·丘吉尔爵士荣誉公民的称号。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3193','aggregate','''æɡrɪɡət; (for v.) æɡrɪˌɡet','''ægrɪgət; (for v.) ˈægrɪgeɪt','[n] 聚集物； 总计; [vt] 聚集； 总计','(=  as a group or in total  ) , women outlive men by 7 or more years.  总体来看，女性比男性多活七年或以上。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3194','differential','''dɪfə''rɛnʃəl','ˌdɪfə''renʃl','[adj] 差别的，有区别的；微分的; [n] 差别， 差异； 微分','differential rates of pay  工资级差'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3195','forsake','fɔrˈsek, fə-','fər''seɪk','[vt] 遗弃， 放弃， 抛弃','children forsaken by their parents  被父母遗弃的孩子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3196','rust','rʌst','rʌst','[v] 生锈; [n] 锈， 铁锈； 锈病','The metal had begun to rust.  金属开始生锈。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3197','trace','tres','treɪs','[vt] 查出，找到；追溯；探索；描摹；追述; [n] 痕迹； 微量， 少许； 扫描线','Sondheim’s book traces the changing nature of the relationship between men and women.  桑德海姆的这本书研究了男女关系性质的变化。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3198','stylized','''stailaizd','''staɪlaɪzd','[adj] 非写实的； 程式化的','a stylized picture of the sun  用非写实手法画的太阳'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3199','array','ə''re','ə''reɪ','[n] 一系列；阵列; [vt] 布置， 排列； 部署','We visited the local markets and saw wonderful arrays of fruit and vegetables.  我们参观了当地的市场，看到了漂亮地摆放着的水果蔬菜。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3200','terrorism','''tɛrərɪzəm','''terərɪzəm','[n] 恐怖主义','The government is doing everything possible to combat terrorism .  政府正在尽其所能打击恐怖主义。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3201','nominee',',nɑmɪ''ni','ˌnɑːmɪ''niː','[n] 被提名者， 被任命者','the Democratic Party presidential nominee  民主党被提名的总统候选人'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3202','discriminate','dɪ''skrɪmɪnet','dɪ''skrɪmɪneɪt','[v] 区别； 歧视','He is incapable of discriminating between a good idea and a terrible one.  他没能力在一个好主意和一个坏主意之间进行区分。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3203','camouflage','''kæmə''flɑʒ','''kæməflɑːʒ','[n&vt] 掩饰， 伪装','soldiers learning camouflage technique  在学习伪装技术的士兵'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3204','track','træk','træk','[v] 跟踪， 追踪; [n] 跑道；小路；轨迹；足迹','Police have been tracking the four criminals all over Central America.  警方一直在中美洲到处追捕这四名罪犯。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3205','annex','əˈnɛks; æˈnɛks; (for n.) ˈænˌɛks','''æneks','[vt] 兼并； 附加','The Baltic republics were annexed by the Soviet Union in 1940.  1940年，波罗的海各共和国被苏联吞并。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3206','enslave','ɪn''slev','ɪn''sleɪv','[vt] 奴役','They''d been enslaved and had to do what they were told.  他们已经沦为奴隶，不得不唯命是从。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3207','centennial','sɛn''tɛnɪəl','sen''teniəl','[n] 百年纪念','The centennial Olympics was in Atlanta, Georgia.  奥运会百年庆典在乔治亚州的亚特兰大举行。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3208','monetary','''mʌnɪtɛri','''mʌnɪteri','[adj] 金钱的， 货币的','the government’s tight monetary policy  政府从紧的货币政策'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3209','rush','rʌʃ','rʌʃ','[v] 冲，突进；奔，急速流动；仓促从事；突袭; [n] 冲，急速行进；匆忙；','A small girl rushed past her.  一个小女孩从她身边匆匆经过。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3210','demolish','dɪ''mɑlɪʃ','dɪ''mɑːlɪʃ','[vt] 拆除； 破坏； 驳倒， 推翻','He demolished my argument in minutes.  他几分钟内就把我的论点驳倒了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3211','shellfish','''ʃɛl''fɪʃ','''ʃelfɪʃ','[n] 贝类， 有壳的水生动物','Fish and shellfish are the specialties.  鱼和甲壳类水生动物是特产。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3212','trade','tred','treɪd','[v] 交易， 买卖； 互相交换; [n] 贸易，商业；交易；职业，行业','They had to travel into town to trade the produce from their farm.  他们不得不到镇上去出售他们农场的产品。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3213','gush','ɡʌʃ','gʌʃ','[v] 滔滔不绝地说；喷涌; [n] 喷出， 涌出； 迸发， 发作','The wound gushed blood.  伤口大量出血。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3214','derivation','''dɛrə''veʃən','ˌderɪ''veɪʃn','[n] 起源， 发源； 派生','The derivation of its name is obscure.  它名字的根源起源鲜为人知。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3215','spew','spju','spjuː','[v] 喷涌；射出；呕吐，呕出; [n] 喷出物','Factory chimneys spewed fumes out into the sky.  工厂的烟囱向空中喷吐浓烟。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3216','comic','''kɑmɪk','''kɑːmɪk','[adj] 可笑的，滑稽的；喜剧的; [n] 喜剧演员','a comic novel  滑稽小说'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3217','weave','wiv','wiːv','[v] 迂回行进；编织；编造，编纂; [n] 编法， 织法','hand-woven scarves  手织围巾'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3218','normally','''nɔrmli','''nɔːrməli','[adv] 通常地； 正常地','The journey normally takes about two hours.  这段旅程通常需要大约两小时。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3219','vague','veɡ','veɪg','[adj] 模糊的； 不明确的','The governor gave only a vague outline of his tax plan.  州长只是含糊地大致说了一下他的税务计划。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3220','fare','fɛr','fer','[vi] 进展; [n] 费用','It is unlikely that the marine industry will fare any better in September.  海运业不大可能在9月份有所好转。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3221','juridical','dʒʊ''rɪdɪkl','dʒu''rɪdɪkl','[adj] 法律的， 司法的','A juridical precedent is nothing but "authenticated custom".  司法惯例只不过是“权威的惯例”罢了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3222','ephemeral','ə''fɛmərəl','ɪ''femərəl','[adj] 短暂的， 转瞬即逝的','Fashion is by nature ephemeral.  从本质上说，时尚不过是一时的潮流。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3223','accuracy','''ækjərəsi','''ækjərəsi','[n] 准确， 精确','He passes the ball with unerring accuracy.  他传球准确无误。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3224','curtsy','''kɝtsi','''kɜːrtsi','[vi] 行屈膝礼; [n] 屈膝礼','We were taught how to curtsy to the Queen.  有人教我们如何向女王行屈膝礼。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3225','setting','''sɛtɪŋ','''setɪŋ','[n] 环境； 背景； 布景； 曲； 底座， 底板','I’ve worked with children in various settings, mainly in secondary school.  我在许多地方教过孩子，主要是在中学。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3226','score','skɔ','skɔː','[v] 评分；划；获胜，成功; [n] 得分， 分数； 乐谱； 抓痕， 划痕； 二十','Each event will be scored separately.  每个项目将单独评分。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3227','quote','kwot','kwout','[v] 引用；','He quoted a short passage from the Bible.  他引用了《圣经》里的一小段。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3228','unanimous','jʊ''nænəməs','ju''nænɪməs','[adj] 全体一致的， 一致同意的','It was decided by a unanimous vote that the school should close.  关闭学校是大家一致通过的决定。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3229','quota','''kwotə','''kwoutə','[n] 配额， 限额， 定额','The government has decided to scrap quotas on car imports.  政府决定取消汽车进口配额。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3230','scorn','skɔrn','skɔːrn','[v] 轻蔑， 鄙视； 不屑于; [n] 轻蔑，鄙视','Many women scorn the use of make-up.  许多女性不屑于使用化妆品。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3231','thermal','''θɝml','''θɜːrml','[adj] 热的，热量的；保暖的，防寒的; [n] 上升的热气流','thermal energy  热能'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3232','percussion','pɚ''kʌʃən','pər''kʌʃn','[n] 打击乐器','Tonight we have Paul Duke on percussion (= playing a percussion instrument ) .  今晚我们请到保罗·杜克先生负责打击乐。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3233','nationalism','''næʃnəlɪzəm','''næʃnəlɪzəm','[n] 国家主义； 民族主义， 民族优越感','Scottish national­ism  苏格兰民族主义'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3234','sulfur','''sʌlfɚ','''sʌlfər','[n] 硫； 硫黄',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3235','terrain','tɛˈren','tə''reɪn','[n] 地势， 地形； 地带','rocky terrain  多石的地形'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3236','navigate','''nævə''get','''nævɪgeɪt','[v] 航行， 横渡； 导航； 设法完成','The river is too dangerous to navigate.  这河道太危险，不适宜航行。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3237','culpable','''kʌlpəbl','''kʌlpəb','[adj] 有罪的； 该谴责的， 难辞其咎的','Both parties were held to be to some extent culpable.  双方都被追究了一定的责任。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3238','raw','rɔ','rɔː','[adj] 生的， 未烹制的； 自然状态的， 未经加工的； 生疏的， 无经验的； 粗犷的； 原始的， 未经处理的','raw meat  生肉'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3239','sprinkle','''sprɪŋkl','''sprɪŋkl','[v] 撒，洒，喷; [n] 少量','Sprinkle the meat with salt and place in the pan.  给肉撒点盐，然后放进平锅里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3240','backlighting','','bæk''laɪtɪŋ','[n] 逆光','The fluorescent lamps for backlighting have made progress in technology with the development of liquid crystal display.  随着液晶显示的发展，背光照明用荧光灯取得了技术进步。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3241','municipal','mju''nɪsɪpl','mjuː''nɪsɪpl','[adj] 市政的； 内政的； 地方性的','the municipal waste dump  城市垃圾场'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3242','institute','''ɪnstɪtut','''ɪnstɪtjuːt','[vt] 设立；制定；开创; [n] 研究所， 学院','We had no choice but to institute court proceedings against the airline.  我们别无选择，只能对航空公司提起诉讼。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3243','endure','ɪn''dʊr','ɪn''dur','[vt] 忍受， 忍耐； 持久， 持续','It seemed impossible that anyone could endure such pain.  似乎谁都不可能忍受这样的疼痛。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3244','feign','fen','feɪn','[vt] 装作， 假装； 伪造','Feigning a headache, I went upstairs to my room.  我假装头痛，上楼到自己房间去了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3245','poster','''postɚ','''poustər','[n] 海报， 招贴画； 发布消息的人','A team of volunteers were putting up posters .  一队志愿者正在张贴海报。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3246','shortly','''ʃɔrtli','''ʃɔːrtli','[adv] 不久； 简要地； 不耐烦地','‘I’ve explained that already,’ Rod said shortly.  “那个问题我已经解释过了。”罗德不耐烦地说。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3247','criterion','kraɪˈtɪriən','kraɪ''tɪriən','[n] 〔判断、决定的〕标准，准则','the criteria we use to select candidates  我们挑选候选人的标准'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3248','essence','''ɛsns','''esns','[n] 本质， 精髓','In essence his message was very simple.  实质上他想表达的意思很简单。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3249','pore','pɔr','pɔːr','[vi] 仔细阅读，审阅；审视; [n] 气孔， 小孔','We spent hours poring over travel brochures.  我们花了几个小时仔细研究旅游宣传册。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3250','ambient','''æmbɪənt','''æmbiənt','[adj] 周围的， 周围环境的； 产生轻松氛围的','...ambient sounds of children in the background.  ...背景处环绕着孩子们的声音。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3251','insistence','in''sistəns','ɪn''sɪstəns','[n] 坚持， 坚决主张','...her insistence on personal privacy.  …她对个人隐私权的坚持。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3252','manual','''mænjuəl','''mænjuəl','[adj] 手工的；体力的; [n] 手册， 指南','People in manual occupations have a lower life expectancy.  干体力活的人预期寿命较短。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3253','ornamental',',ɔrnə''mɛntl','ˌɔːrnə''mentl','[adj] 装饰性的，装饰用的; [n] 装饰物','ornamental gardens  装饰性花园'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3254','sentimental','''sɛntə''mɛntl','ˌsentɪ''mentl','[adj] 情感的； 伤感的， 多愁善感的','She said a sentimental goodbye.  她依依不舍地道别。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3255','maneuver','mə''nʊvɚ; mə''njʊvɚ','mə''nuːvər','[v] 操纵，控制；耍花招; [n] 策略； 花招',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3256','dual','''dʊəl','''duːəl','[adj] 双的， 二重的','a dual system of education  二元[双元]教育体系'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3257','retire','rɪ''taɪɚ','rɪ''taɪər','[v] 退休， 引退， 退役； 退出； 撤退； 就寝','At the age when most people retire, he is ready to face a new career.  在大多数人退休的年纪，他准备要面对一项新事业。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3258','dexterous','''dɛkstrəs','''dekstrəs','[adj] 惯用右手的； 灵巧的， 熟练的','dextrous use of the needle  灵巧的针法'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3259','aspect','''æspɛkt','''æspekt','[n] 方面； 朝向， 方向； 外表， 外观','a south-facing aspect  朝南方向'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3260','vegetarian','ˌvɛdʒəˈtɛrɪən','ˌvedʒə''teriən','[adj] 素食者的; [n] 素食者','Yasmin sticks to a strict vegetarian diet.  亚斯敏坚持一种严格的纯素饮食。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3261','aggressive','ə''ɡrɛsɪv','ə''gresɪv','[adj] 侵略的， 挑衅的； 强有力的； 敢作敢为的， 有进取心的','Jim’s voice became aggressive.  吉姆的声音凶了起来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3262','resilience','rɪˈzɪliəns','rɪ''zɪliəns','[n] 弹力， 弹性； 复原力； 适应力','People showed remarkable resilience during the war.  战争期间人们表现得特别坚韧。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3263','corona','kə''ronə','kə''rounə','[n] 日冕， 日华； 光环',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3264','midterm',',mɪd''tɝm','ˌmɪd''tɜːrm','[adj] 中间的，期中的; [n] 期中考试； 中期； 期中','midterm elections  中期选举'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3265','signify','''sɪɡnɪfaɪ','''sɪgnɪfaɪ','[v] 意味； 表示， 预示； 要紧， 有重要性','These figures don’t really signify in the overall results.  这些数字对于总体结果影响不是很大。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3266','suction','''sʌkʃən','''sʌkʃn','[n] 吸， 抽吸； 吸力','My vacuum cleaner has very good suction.  我的真空吸尘器吸力很强。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3267','holistic','ho''lɪstɪk','hou''lɪstɪk','[adj] 整体的， 全面的； 功能整体性的','a holistic approach to design  设计的整体方法'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3268','stratum','''stretəm','''streɪtəm','[n] 岩层；地层','Contained within the rock strata is evidence that the region was intensely dry 15,000 years ago.  岩层中的证据表明该地区在15,000 年前曾经非常干旱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3269','swing','swɪŋ','swɪŋ','[v] 摆动，摇荡；突然转向，突然转身; [n] 摆动， 摇摆； 秋千','Let your arms swing as you walk.  边走边摆动双臂。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3270','turbulent','''tɝbjələnt','''tɜːrbjələnt','[adj] 动乱的； 狂暴的， 汹涌的','the turbulent times of the French Revolution  法国大革命的动荡时期'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3271','overt','o''vɝt','ou''vɜːrt','[adj] 公开的， 非秘密的','an overt attempt to silence their political opponents  他们想压制政敌言论的明显企图'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3272','invasion','ɪn''veʒn','ɪn''veɪʒn','[n] 侵入， 侵略， 侵犯','...seven years after the Roman invasion of Britain.  …罗马人入侵大不列颠岛之后的7年。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3273','forefront','''fɔrfrʌnt','''fɔːrfrʌnt','[n] 最前沿， 最前线； 中心','They have been at the forefront of the campaign for political change.  他们一直处于政治变革运动的前沿。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3274','spin','spɪn','spɪn','[v] 快速旋转；纺纱；吐丝；甩干衣服; [n] 旋转','The plane’s propellers were spinning.  飞机的螺旋桨在快速旋转。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3275','grocery','''ɡrosəri','''grousəri','[n] 杂货店； 杂货','They run a small grocery store.  他们经营一家小食品杂货店。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3276','shallow','''ʃælo','''ʃælou','[adj] 浅的；','a shallow river  浅河'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3277','scout','skaʊt','skaut','[v] 侦察；寻找；搜索; [n] 侦察员； 侦察机； 童子军','American companies are keen to scout out business opportunities in Vietnam.  美国公司很想在越南寻找商机。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3278','edifice','''ɛdɪfɪs','''edɪfɪs','[n] 大厦， 宏伟的建筑物','Their head office was an imposing edifice.  他们的总部大楼是一幢宏伟建筑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3279','register','''rɛdʒɪstɚ','''redʒɪstər','[v&n] 登记， 注册','Have you signed the hotel register ?  你在酒店登记簿上签名了吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3280','persuasive','pɚ''swesɪv','pər''sweɪsɪv','[adj] 有说服力的， 让人信服的','Trevor can be very persuasive.  特雷弗有时很会说服人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3281','couple','''kʌpl','''kʌpl','[n] 对，双；夫妇，情侣；几个人，几件事; [vt] 连接， 结合','a newly married couple  一对新婚夫妇'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3282','communicate','kə''mjunɪket','kə''mjuːnɪkeɪt','[v] 交流， 沟通； 传达， 传播； 通信','We communicated mostly by e-mail.  我们主要是用电子邮件沟通。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3283','saddle','''sædl','''sædl','[n] 马鞍；车座; [vt] 给…备鞍','It is no surprise that she could saddle the horses.  她能给马备鞍并没有什么值得惊讶的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3284','rural','''rʊrəl','''rurəl','[adj] 乡村的， 农村的； 田园的','a rural setting  乡村环境'),
