('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3286','concord','''kɑŋkɔrd','''kɑːŋkɔːrd','[n] 和睦； 公约','They expressed the hope that he would pursue a neutral and balanced policy for the sake of national concord.  他们希望他能为国家的和谐而追求一种中立而平衡的政策。'),
