('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3305','respect','rɪ''spɛkt','rɪ''spekt','[vt] 尊重，尊敬；遵守; [n] 尊敬， 尊重； 重视； 方面','I respect his views, although I do not agree with them.  我尊重他的观点，虽然我不敢苟同。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3306','retreat','rɪ''trit','rɪ''triːt','[vi] 退却，撤退；退缩; [n] 退却， 撤退； 隐退处','The rebels retreated to the mountains.  叛乱分子撤退到山区。'),
