('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3308','parachute','''pærə''ʃʊt','''pærəʃuːt','[v] 跳伞； 空投; [n] 降落伞','He was a courier for the Polish underground and parachuted into Warsaw.  他是波兰地下组织的信使，被空降到了华沙。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3309','behaviorism','bɪ''hevjɚ,ɪzəm','bɪ''heɪvjərɪzəm','[n] 行为主义','A psychologist who subscribes to behaviorism .  赞成行为主义的心理学者。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3310','mutual','''mjutʃuəl','''mjuːtʃuəl','[adj] 相互的； 共有的','I didn’t like Dev, and the feeling seemed to be mutual.  我不喜欢德夫，他好像也不喜欢我。'),
