('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3312','carnivore','''kɑrnɪvɔr','''kɑːrnɪvɔːr','[n] 食肉动物','This is a delicious vegetarian dish that even carnivores love.  这是一道肉食者们都喜欢的美味素食。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3313','pharmacy','''fɑrməsi','''fɑːrməsi','[n] 药店； 药剂学','an all-night pharmacy  通宵药店'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3314','therefore','''ðɛrfɔr','''ðerfɔːr','[adv] 因此，从而; [conj] 因此','Their car was bigger and therefore more comfortable.  他们的车大些，所以更舒适些。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3315','exchange','ɪks''tʃendʒ','ɪks''tʃeɪndʒ','[vt] 兑换；交易；调换，交换；交流; [n] 交易； 兑换； 交换； 交流','We exchanged addresses.  我们交换了地址。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3316','crooked','''krʊkɪd','''krukɪd','[adj] 不诚实的； 欺诈的； 弯曲的','Your tie’s crooked.  你的领带歪了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3317','contiguous','kən''tɪɡjuəs','kən''tɪgjuəs','[adj] 接壤的， 毗邻的； 不间断的','America’s 48 contiguous states  美国的48个互相毗连的州'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3318','nourishment','''nɝɪʃmənt','''nɜːrɪʃmənt','[n] 营养， 营养品','lack of proper nourishment  缺乏适当的营养'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3319','connote','kə''not','kə''nout','[v] 意味着； 暗示','The term "organization" often connotes a sense of neatness.  “组织”这个词常常给人一种整洁的感觉。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3320','puddle','''pʌdl','''pʌdl','[n] 水坑， 水洼','Children splashed through the puddles.  孩子们噼噼啪啪地踩过一个个小水坑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3321','primal','''praɪml','''praɪml','[adj] 最初的； 主要的， 首要的','a primal fear of the unknown  对未知事物的本能恐惧'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3322','paste','pest','peɪst','[v] 粘贴；拼贴; [n] 面团； 糨糊','A notice had been pasted to the door.  一张告示被贴在了门上。'),
