('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3335','fresco','''frɛsko','''freskou','[v] 绘湿壁画于; [n] 湿壁画；湿壁画技法','We show this in a scene in the Sistine Chapel [in Rome] where we create a big crack in the fresco of God and Adam.  我们将这个观点放到了发生在罗马西斯廷教堂的一幕里——一幅绘有上帝与亚当的壁画发生严重断裂。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3336','identify','aɪ''dɛntɪfaɪ','aɪ''dentɪfaɪ','[v] 识别； 鉴定； 找到， 发现','He was too far away to be able to identify faces.  他离得太远，没法看面孔认出谁是谁。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3337','embrace','ɪm''bres','ɪm''breɪs','[v] 拥抱；包含；欣然接受; [n] 拥抱','Jack warmly embraced his son.  杰克热情拥抱他的儿子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3338','nitrogen','''naɪtrədʒən','''naɪtrədʒən','[n] 氮','All of these from the group one and two through the group five and six elements, but what about elements, what about molecules like hydrogen, or nitrogen, or maybe oxygen?  所有的这些都是来自于第一主族和第二组主族，到第五主族和第六组主族的悬殊，那么元素呢，比如氢气，氮气或氧气那样的分子呢？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3339','artesian','ɑr''tiʒən','ɑːr''tiːʒn','[adj] 自流水的， 喷水的','Each guestroom also features celebrated local and regional works of art, paying tribute to the true artesian nature of the indigenous painters, sculptors, and basket-weavers.  每个客房还设有著名的地方和地域性的艺术作品，赞颂的土著画家、雕塑家真正的自流性，和编织篮子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3340','label','ˈlebəl','''leɪbl','[vt] 标记; [n] 标签； 称号','Label the diagram clearly.  把图表标示清楚。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3341','aquarium','ə''kwɛrɪəm','ə''kweriəm','[n] 养鱼缸； 水族馆','We saw a ray at the aquarium.  我们在水族馆看见了一只鳐。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3342','modify','''mɑdɪfaɪ','''mɑːdɪfaɪ','[vt] 修改， 更改； 缓和； 【语】修饰','The feedback will be used to modify the course for next year.  这些反馈意见将用于修改明年的课程。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3343','soprano','sə''prɑno','sə''prɑːnou','[n] 女高音','She sings soprano .  她唱女高音。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3344','mortify','''mɔrtɪfaɪ','''mɔːrtɪfaɪ','[vt] 使蒙受屈辱， 使难堪','Jane mortified her family by leaving her husband.  简的家人为简离开丈夫感到奇耻大辱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3345','cram','kræm','kræm','[v] 填塞， 塞满； 匆忙准备， 临时死记硬背','Thousands of people crammed the mall Sunday.  星期天成千上万的人挤进了这家大型购物中心。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3346','clone','klon','kloun','[n] 克隆动物，无性繁殖动物；复制品，翻版; [vt] 克隆， 以无性繁殖技术复制','Tom was in some ways a younger clone of his handsome father.  汤姆在某些方面是他英俊父亲年轻时的翻版。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3347','detest','dɪ''tɛst','dɪ''test','[v] 憎恶','The two men detested each other.  两个男人互相厌恶。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3348','enunciate','ɪ''nʌnsɪet','ɪ''nʌnsieɪt','[v] 清晰地发音； 表达， 阐明','ideas that he was to enunciate decades later  他将于数十年后清晰阐述的想法'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3349','reservoir','''rɛzɚ,vɔr','''rezərvwɑːr','[n] 水库， 蓄水池； 储备， 储藏','...the huge oil reservoir beneath the Kuwaiti desert.  …科威特沙漠下面大量的石油储备。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3350','exempt','ɪg''zɛmpt','ɪg''zempt','[adj] 被免除的，被豁免的; [vt] 免除， 豁免','Men in college were exempt from military service.  在校男大学生免服兵役。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3351','degenerative','dɪ''dʒɛnərətɪv','dɪ''dʒenərətɪv','[adj] 衰退的， 堕落的； 变性的','...degenerative diseases of the brain, like Alzheimer''s.  ... 大脑退化的疾病，就像老年痴呆症一样。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3352','crab','kræb','kræb','[n] 蟹， 螃蟹','crab meat  蟹肉'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3353','feminist','''fɛmənɪst','''femənɪst','[n] 女权主义者','She’s been an outspoken feminist for over twenty years.  20多年来，她一直是个直言不讳的女权主义者。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3354','aesthetic','esˈθetɪk; ɛsˈθɛtɪk','es''θetɪk','[adj] 审美的， 美学的； 美的， 艺术的','From an esthetic point of view, it’s a nice design.  从美学角度看，这是个不错的设计。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3355','backup','''bæk,ʌp','''bækʌp','[n] 后援，增援；','There is no emergency back-up immediately available.  没有立即就能获得的后备。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3356','arithmetic','ə''rɪθmətɪk','ə''rɪθmətɪk','[n] 算术','...teaching the basics of reading, writing and arithmetic.  …教授读、写、算的基本知识。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3357','hardy','','''hɑːrdi','[adj] 强壮的； 耐寒的； 能吃苦耐劳的','hardy mountain goats  能适应恶劣环境的石山羊'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3358','caption','''kæpʃən','''kæpʃn','[n] 说明文字；标题；字幕; [vt] 给加说明文字','The local paper featured me standing on a stepladder with a caption, "Wendy climbs the ladder to success."  当地的报纸刊登了一幅我站在活梯上的特写，下面写着：“温迪登上了成功之梯。”'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3359','mismanage','''mɪs''mænɪdʒ','ˌmɪs''mænɪdʒ','[vt] 对…管理不当， 处理不当','The nation’s finances had been badly mismanaged.  国家的金融管理非常混乱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3360','carbohydrate',',kɑrbo''haɪdret','ˌkɑːrbou''haɪdreɪt','[n] 碳水化合物','You should not have too much carbohydrate in your diet.  你日常饮食中不该有过多碳水化合物。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3361','subconscious',',sʌb''kɑnʃəs','ˌsʌb''kɑːnʃəs','[adj] 下意识的， 潜意识的; [n] 下意识，潜意识','a subconscious fear of failure  对失败下意识的恐惧'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3362','eject','ɪ''dʒɛkt','i''dʒekt','[v] 逐出， 驱赶； 喷出， 喷射； 弹出','Two engines cut out and the plane started to eject fuel as it lost height.  两个发动机突然熄火，飞机在下降的同时开始喷出燃料。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3363','meteorologist','''mitɪə''rɑlədʒɪst','ˌmiːtiə''rɑːlədʒɪst','[n] 气象学者','But meteorologist David Beachler from the National Weather Service says not to worry.  但是国家气象局的气象专家大卫·贝赤勒表示并不需要担心。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3364','defect','‘dɪfɛkt','''diːfekt; dɪ''fekt','[vi] 变节， 叛变; [n] 瑕疵， 缺陷； 过失','...a KGB officer who defected in 1963.  …一个1963年叛变的克格勃官员。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3365','obedience','ə''bidjəns','ou''biːdiəns','[n] 服从， 顺从','obedience classes for dogs and their owners  为狗和主人安排的服从训练课'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3366','reinforce',',riɪn''fɔrs','ˌriːɪn''fɔːrs','[vt] 加固， 加强； 增援','The film reinforces the idea that women should be pretty and dumb.  这部影片强化了这个观点——女人要漂亮，而且要笨一些。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3367','casual','''kæʒʊəl','''kæʒuəl','[adj] 非正式的， 随便的； 漫不经心的； 漠不关心的， 冷淡的； 偶然的， 碰巧的； 临时的','a casual manner  漫不经心的态度'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3368','rim','rɪm','rɪm','[n] 边，轮缘；边界; [vt] 给…镶边','She looked at him over the rim of her glass.  她沿玻璃杯口看着他。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3369','decline','dɪ''klaɪn','dɪ''klaɪn','[n&v] 下降； 衰退； 拒绝， 谢绝','The number of staff has declined from 217,000 to 114,000.  员工人数已从217000人减少到114000人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3370','rip','rɪp','rɪp','[v] 扯破，撕坏; [n] 裂口， 裂缝','Her clothes had all been ripped.  她的衣服都被撕破了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3371','property','''prɑpɚti','''prɑːpərti','[n] 财产， 所有物； 所有权； 房产， 地产； 特性','The hotel is not responsible for any loss or damage to guests’ personal property .  宾馆对住客个人财物的丢失和损坏概不负责。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3372','debris','dəˈbri','də''briː','[n] 岩屑； 残骸； 碎屑','She was hit by flying debris from the blast.  她被爆炸产生的飞散碎片击中。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3373','scuffle','''skʌfl','''skʌfl','[n&vi] 扭打， 混战','Scuffles broke out between rival supporters during the match.  比赛过程中，双方球迷之间发生了打斗。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3374','luster','''lʌstɚ','''lʌstər','[n] 光亮， 光泽； 荣耀',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3375','handle','''hændl','''hændl','[v] 处理；对待；操纵；触，摸; [n] 柄， 把手， 拉手','I handled most of the paperwork.  大部分文书工作是我做的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3376','urbanization',',ɝbənɪ''zeʃən','ˌɜːrbənaɪ''zeɪʃn','[n] 都市化','In their own process of urbanization, every country will encounter the problem of land requisition and housing demolition.  每个国家在自己的城市化进程中，都会遇到土地征用、房屋拆迁的问题。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3377','tough','tʌf','tʌf','[adj] 坚韧的； 棘手的， 困难的； 强健的， 吃苦耐劳的； 粗暴的； 严格的； 老的','It was a tough race.  比赛打得很艰难。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3378','yeast','jist','jiːst','[n] 酵母， 发酵粉','Flour, , milk, butter and yeast are some ingredients in bread.  面粉、牛奶、黄油和酵母是做面包的一些原料。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3379','script','skrɪpt','skrɪpt','[n] 剧本，脚本，广播稿；笔迹；字母表; [vt] 为电影写剧本','They write all their own scripts.  他们所有的剧本都是自己写的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3380','melody','''mɛlədi','''melədi','[n] 旋律， 曲调； 乐曲， 歌曲','They played some lovely melodies.  他们演奏了一些动听的曲子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3381','trilogy','''trɪlədʒi','''trɪlədʒi','[n] 三部剧， 三部曲','part 2 of a trilogy  三部曲的第二部'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3382','spot','spɑt','spɑːt','[v] 认出，发现; [n] 地点； 斑点； 少量','I spotted a police car behind us.  我发现有辆警车在我们后面。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3383','sterile','''stɛrəl','''sterəl','[adj] 不育的； 贫瘠的； 无菌的； 无结果的， 没有实际价值的； 刻板的','The classrooms are sterile, with no artwork on the walls.  这些教室毫无生气，墙上一张画都没有。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3384','watercourse','''wɔtɚkɔrs','''wɔːtərkɔːrs','[n] 水道， 河道','chemicals that pollute the local watercourse  污染当地河道的化学品'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3385','catholic','kæθəlɪk','''kæθlɪk','[adj] 广泛的，包罗万象的；[C-]天主教的; [n] [C-]天主教','She has catholic tastes (= likes a lot of different things ) .  她的兴趣非常广泛。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3386','mighty','''maɪti','''maɪti','[adj] 强有力的； 巨大的','the mighty Mississippi river  浩荡的密西西比河'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3387','partial','''pɑrʃəl','''pɑːrʃl','[adj] 部分的， 不完全的； 偏爱的， 癖好的； 偏袒的','The exhibition was only a partial success.  那次展会只获得部分成功。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3388','pictorial','pɪk''tɔrɪəl','pɪk''tɔːriəl','[adj] 图示的，有图片的；绘画的，图画的; [n] 画报， 画刊','a pictorial record of their journey  他们旅程的照片记录'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3389','slough','slʌf; slaʊ; slu','slʌf；slaʊ','[vt] 使脱落; [n] 泥坑， 沼泽； 绝境','All reptiles have to slough their skin to grow.  所有爬行动物都必须自然脱皮才能成长'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3390','drench','drɛntʃ','drentʃ','[vt] 使湿透','In the early morning they had got drenched in the grass.  一大清早他们在草丛里弄得浑身湿透。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3391','retain','rɪ''ten','rɪ''teɪn','[vt] 保持， 保留','You have the right to retain possession of the goods.  你有权保留这些物品。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3392','drastic','''dræstɪk','''dræstɪk','[adj] 剧烈的， 猛烈的， 激烈的','drastic cuts in government spending  政府开支的急剧削减'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3393','epoch','''ɛpək','''iːpɑːk','[n] 新纪元， 时代','the Victorian epoch  维多利亚时代'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3394','retail','''ritel','''riːteɪl','[adv] 以零售方式; [v] 零售；以…价格销售; [n] 零售','Their products are retailed all over Britain.  他们的产品在英国各地都有零售。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3395','crew','krʊ','kruː','[n] 全体船员； 全体工作人员','The plane crashed, killing two of the crew and four passengers.  飞机坠毁，造成两名机组人员和四名乘客死亡。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3396','spear','spɪr','spɪr','[v] 刺，戳; [n] 矛， 枪； 嫩叶','Spear a piece of fish with a carving fork and dip it in the batter.  用切肉叉叉起一片鱼并在面糊里蘸一下。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3397','innovate','''ɪnəvet','''ɪnəveɪt','[v] 革新， 创新','the need for large businesses to innovate  大公司革新的需要'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3398','extravagant','ɪk''strævəgənt','ɪk''strævəgənt','[adj] 放肆的， 过分的； 奢侈的， 铺张的','Would it be too extravagant to buy both?  把两个都买下会不会太奢侈了？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3399','accommodate','ə''kɑmədet','ə''kɑːmədeɪt','[v] 提供； 容纳； 适应， 顺应','He bought a huge house to accommodate his library.  他买了一座大房子来放他的藏书。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3400','bubble','''bʌbl','''bʌbl','[n] 泡；','When water boils, bubbles rise to the surface.  水烧开时，水面会冒泡泡。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3401','yield','jild','jiːld','[v] 生产，出产；屈服，顺从；让出，放弃；变形，弯曲; [n] 产量； 收益','Our research has only recently begun to yield important results.  直到最近我们的研究才开始取得重要成果。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3402','protagonist','prə''tæɡənɪst','prə''tægənɪst','[n] 主角， 主人公； 领导者， 倡导者','the main protagonists in the conflict  主要的冲突方'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3403','vacation','veˈkeʃən','veɪ''keɪʃn','[vi] 度假; [n] 假期','What will you do this vacation?  你这个假期将干什么？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3404','sacred','''sekrɪd','''seɪkrɪd','[adj] 宗教的； 上帝的， 神圣的','a sacred vow  神圣的誓言'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3405','outcome','''aʊt''kʌm','''autkʌm','[n] 结果， 成果','People who had heard the evidence at the trial were surprised at the outcome.  在审判过程中听过证词的人都对此结果感到吃惊。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3406','polar','''polɚ','''poulər','[adj] 极的， 极地的； 磁极的； 正好相反的， 截然对立的','As our climate warms up, the polar ice caps will begin to melt.  随着地球气候逐渐变暖，极地的冰冠将开始融化。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3407','tender','''tɛndɚ','''tendər','[adj] 嫩的；脆弱的；温柔的，亲切的; [v] 提出；投标; [n] 投标','Continue cooking until the meat is tender.  把肉一直烧到松软为止。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3408','vapor','ˈveɪpər','''veɪpər','[n] 蒸气， 潮气','This system traps the gasoline vapor escaping from the fuel tank and carburetor .  这个系统能收集从燃油箱和化油器泄漏出来的汽油蒸气。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3409','curriculum','kə''rɪkjələm','kə''rɪkjələm','[n] 课程','Languages are an essential part of the school curriculum.  语言是学校课程中必不可少的部分。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3410','meditate','''mɛdɪtet','''medɪteɪt','[v] 沉思， 冥想； 考虑； 谋划','I try to meditate for half an hour every evening.  我每天晚上尽量默想半小时。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3411','prototype','''protə''taɪp','''proutətaɪp','[n] 原型， 雏形','How do you test the prototype of the vending machine?  你如何测试一个自动售货机的原型?。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3412','meantime','''min''taɪm','''miːntaɪm','[n&ad] 其时， 同时','In the meantime, you have to insulate yourself from his moods.  同时，你必须将你自己隔绝在他的情绪之外。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3413','dehydrate','di''haɪdret','diː''haɪdreɪt','[v] 脱水','The substance is dehydrated and stored as powder.  该物质经脱水处理后以粉末形式储存。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3414','cite','saɪt','saɪt','[vt] 引用， 引证； 传唤， 传讯； 表彰， 嘉奖','The judge cited a 1956 Supreme Court ruling in her decision.  法官在她的判决中引用了1956年最高法院的一项裁决。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3415','blurt','blɝt','blɜːrt','[vt] 脱口而出','"I was looking for Sally," he blurted, and his eyes filled with tears.  他眼含热泪，突然脱口说道：“我在找莎丽。”'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3416','atom','''ætəm','''ætəm','[n] 原子； 微粒， 微量','carbon atoms  碳原子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3417','internship','''ɪntɝnʃɪp','''ɪntɜːrnʃɪp','[n] 实习期','...an internship in surgery in New York.  …一个在纽约做外科实习的职位。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3418','pertain','pɝ''ten','pər ''teɪn','[vi] 存在； 适用','...matters pertaining to naval district defence.  …与海军区域防卫有关的问题。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3419','shed','ʃɛd','ʃed','[vt] 抛弃；摆脱；流出；散发；发出；脱落; [n] 小屋','The company is planning to shed about a quarter of its workforce.  这家公司正计划裁减约四分之一的人员。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3420','spun','spʌn','spʌn','[adj] 拉成丝的','As the nebula collapsed because of its gravity, it spun faster and flattened into a disk.  随着由于重力引起的星云坍缩，它旋转得越来越快，并变成了盘状。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3421','tolerable','''tɑlərəbl','''tɑːlərəbl','[adj] 可忍受的， 可容忍的； 尚好的， 过得去的','The apartment is really too small, but it’s tolerable for the time being.  这套公寓实在太小，不过暂时还能凑合。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3422','bicameral',',baɪ''kæmərəl','ˌbaɪ''kæmərəl','[adj] 两院制的， 有两个议院的','On legislative system for a bicameral legislature, both Chambers of the elected directly by the voters in a house of representatives of the senate and state elected;  在立法体制上实行两院制，两院由一个选民直接选举产生的众议院和各州选举产生的参议院组成；'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3423','correspond',',kɔrə''spɑnd','ˌkɔːrə''spɑːnd','[vi] 相一致， 符合； 相当于； 通信','The two halves of the document did not correspond.  这份文件的前后两部分不相符。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3424','spur','spɝ','spɜːr','[n] 刺激；激励；马刺; [vt] 激励， 鼓舞； 刺激， 促进','The crowd’s reaction only acted as a spur.  人群的反应不过起了刺激作用。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3425','mode','mod','moud','[n] 方式， 形式； 风格； 时尚','Set the monitor to 256 colour mode.  把显示器调成256色彩模式。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3426','rear','rɪr','rɪr','[adj] 后部的， 后面的; [vt] 养育，抚养，培养；饲养; [n] 后部，后方；臀部','the rear door of the car  汽车的后门'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3427','elapse','ɪ''læps','ɪ''læps','[vi] 消逝， 流逝','Several months elapsed before his case was brought to trial.  过了几个月他的案子才开审。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3428','symmetry','''sɪmətri','''sɪmətri','[n] 对称； 相似， 相仿','There was a certain symmetry to coming back to New York, where I started my artistic life all those years ago.  人生的经历似乎是对称的，我又回到了纽约，那里是我早年开始艺术生涯的地方。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3429','insect','''ɪnsɛkt','''ɪnsekt','[n] 昆虫， 虫','an insect bite  昆虫的叮咬'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3430','complement','ˈkɑːmplɪment','''kɒmplɪm(ə)nt','[vt] 补充， 补足， 使完善； 与…相配; [n] 补充物， 补足物； 足数， 足额； 补足语','John and Bob complemented each other well.  约翰和鲍勃互相配合得很好。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3431','qualify','ˈkwɑləˌfaɪ','''kwɑːlɪfaɪ','[v] 具有资格， 合格； 有权； 限定， 修饰','Free school lunches are given to children who qualify.  符合条件的儿童可获得免费的学生午餐。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3432','bode','bəud','boud','[vi] 预示','She says the way the bill was passed bodes ill for democracy.  她说议案通过的方式预示民主的恶运。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3433','already','ɔl''rɛdi','ɔːl''redi','[adv] 已， 已经','The design of the new house is similar to those that have already been built.  新房的设计与那些已建好的房子相似。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3434','Pueblo','','''pweblou','[n] 普韦布洛印第安人村落； 普韦布洛人','There are several dozen Indian pueblos near Santa Fe.  圣达菲附近有几十个印第安人村庄。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3435','applicable','''æplɪkəbl','ə''plɪkəbl','[adj] 可应用的， 可实施的； 适当的， 合适的','What is a reasonable standard for one family is not applicable for another.  对一个家庭合理的标准对于另一个家庭并不适用。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3436','admission','əd''mɪʃən',' əd''mɪʃn','[n] 准许进入； 入场费； 承认','Reese, by his own admission , lacks the necessary experience.  里斯自己也承认缺乏必要的经验。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3437','adhere','əd''hɪr','əd''hɪr','[vi] 黏附， 附着； 坚持； 遵守','All members of the association adhere to a strict code of practice.  所有该协会的成员都遵守严格的业务守则。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3438','sediment','sɛdəmənt','''sedɪmənt','[n] 沉淀物， 沉积物','a thick layer of sediment  一层厚厚的沉积物'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3439','tremulous','''trɛmjələs','''tremjələs','[adj] 发抖的， 颤抖的； 害怕的','a tremulous voice  颤抖的声音'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3440','hybrid','''haɪbrɪd','''haɪbrɪd','[adj] 杂交产生的；混合的，合成的; [n] 杂交植物； 混合物， 合成物','...the hybrid corn seed.  …杂交玉米种子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3441','panorama',',pænə''ræmə','ˌpænə''ræmə','[n] 全景， 全貌； 概观， 综述','Horton looked out over a panorama of fertile valleys and gentle hills.  霍顿眺望着那一片肥沃山谷和平缓山脉的景象。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3442','adaptable','ə''dæptəbl','ə''dæptəbl','[adj] 能适应的； 可改编的','The American Constitution has proved adaptable in changing political conditions.  事实证明美国宪法能适应政治形势的变化。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3443','contemporary','kən''tɛmpərɛri','kən''tempəreri','[adj] 当代的；','She writes a lot of contemporary music for people like Whitney Houston.  她为惠特尼·休斯敦等人创作大量当代音乐作品。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3444','mock','mɑk','mɑːk','[v] 嘲笑，嘲弄；模仿；蔑视，; [n] 模拟考试','Opposition MPs mocked the government’s decision.  反对党议员讥笑政府的这一决策。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3445','credence','''kridns','''kriːdns','[n] 可信性， 真实性； 信任； 信念','Good studies are needed to lend credence to the notion that genuine progress can be made in this important field.  要有优秀的研究才能使人相信在这一重大领域能取得真正的进步。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3446','gear','ɡɪr','gɪr','[n] 齿轮，传动装置；挡；设备; [vt] 调节， 使适应','His mountain bike had 18 gears.  他的山地自行车有18挡。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3447','facilitate','fə''sɪlə''tet','fə''sɪlɪteɪt','[vt] 推动， 促进','The new airport will facilitate the development of tourism.  新机场将促进旅游业的发展。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3448','rob','rɑb','rɑːb','[vt] 抢夺， 抢掠； 剥夺， 使失去','They killed four policemen while robbing a bank.  他们抢劫一家银行的时候杀了4名警察。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3449','rod','rɑd','rɑːd','[n] 杆， 棒','a measuring rod  测量杆'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3450','roe','ro','rou','[n] 鱼卵','...cod''s roe.  ...鳕鱼子。'),
