('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3454','disappoint','''dɪsə''pɔɪnt','ˌdɪsə''pɔɪnt','[v] 失望， 扫兴','I hated to disappoint her.  我不愿意让她失望。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3455','rebellious','rɪ''bɛljəs','rɪ''beljəs','[adj] 反叛的， 叛逆的； 叛乱的','rebellious teenagers  叛逆的青少年'),
