('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3462','subjective','səb''dʒɛktɪv','səb''dʒektɪv','[adj] 主观的， 个人的','As a critic, he is far too subjective.  作为评论家，他过于主观。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3463','blossom','''blɑsəm','''blɑːsəm','[vi] 开花； 长成; [n] 花','The apple trees are just beginning to blossom.  苹果树正开始开花。'),
