('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3477','hypothesis','haɪ''pɑθəsɪs','haɪ''pɑːθəsɪs','[n] 假设， 假说； 前提','One hypothesis is that the victim fell asleep while driving.  一种假设是受害人开车时睡着了。'),
