('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3482','potency','''potnsi','''poutnsi','[n] 影响力， 支配力； 效力','The myth of male superiority was losing its potency.  男性优越的错误观念在逐渐失去影响力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3483','accurate','''ækjərət','''ækjərət','[adj] 正确无误的， 精确的','The brochure tries to give a fair and accurate description of each hotel.  该手册尽量公正、准确地介绍每一家酒店。'),
