('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3485','prostitution','''prɑstə''tʊʃən','ˌprɑːstə''tjuːʃn','[n] 卖淫； 出卖灵魂， 堕落； 滥用','She eventually drifted into prostitution.  她最终沦落风尘。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3486','legend','''lɛdʒənd','''ledʒənd','[n] 传奇故事， 传说； 传奇文学','Local legend has it that (= says that ) the island was the original Garden of Eden.  当地传说这个岛就是伊甸园的原型。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3487','paraphrase','ˈpærəfreɪz','''pærəfreɪz','[v] 解释； 改写; [n] 释义','To paraphrase Finkelstein, mathematics is a language, like English.  芬克尔斯坦的意思是，数学是一门语言，就像英语一样。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3488','erect','ɪ''rɛkt','ɪ''rekt','[adj] 直立的; [vt] 建立； 竖立','Martin stood erect on the platform.  马丁在讲台上笔直地站着。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3489','exalted','ɪg''zɔltɪd','ɪg''zɔːltɪd','[adj] 崇高的， 高贵的， 显赫的','I felt shy in such exalted company.  我与如此显贵的人在一起觉得拘束。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3490','identification','aɪˌdentɪfɪ''keʃn','aɪˌdentɪfɪ''keɪʃn','[n] 身份证明； 辨认， 鉴定','Do you have any identification?  你有什么身份证明文件吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3491','protein','''protin','''proutiːn','[n] 蛋白质','Where do you get your protein?  你从哪里获得蛋白质？'),
