('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3513','overtime',',ovə''taɪm','''ouvərtaɪm','[adv] 加班; [adj] 超时的， 加班的','Half say they get no overtime.  有一半人说他们没有加班。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3514','scorch','skɔrtʃ','skɔːrtʃ','[v] 烧焦；枯萎，枯黄; [n] 焦痕','The walls had been blackened and scorched by fire.  这些墙被大火熏黑了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3515','telescope','''tɛləˌskop','''telɪskoup','[n] 望远镜','What is the range of this telescope?  这架望远镜的有效距离多大?。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3516','mound','maʊnd','maund','[n] 土墩， 土丘； 堆， 垛','an ancient burial mound  古代墓冢'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3517','gentility','dʒɛn''tɪləti','dʒen''tɪləti','[n] 有教养， 文雅','The hotel had an air of discreet gentility.  这家酒店有一种不露痕迹的典雅气派。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3518','accuse','ə''kjuz','ə''kjuːz','[vt] 谴责； 指责， 归咎； 指控， 控告','The professor stands accused of (=  has been accused of  ) stealing his student’s ideas and publishing them.  那位教授被指控剽窃学生的观点拿去发表。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3519','algebra','''ældʒɪbrə','''ældʒɪbrə','[n] 代数','On the basis of minimax algebra theory, this paper provides an algebra method of solving countable stages decision problems in the dynamic programming.  本文根据极大极小代数理论，给出了一种用以求解动态规划中有限多阶段决策问题的代数算法。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3520','espouse','ɪ''spaʊz','ɪ''spauz','[vt] 支持， 拥护， 赞成','She ran away with him to Mexico and espoused the revolutionary cause.  她与他一起逃到了墨西哥，支持革命事业。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3521','predecessor','''prɛdəsɛsɚ','''predəsesər','[n] 前辈； 前任； 原有事物','Kennedy’s predecessor as President was the war hero Dwight Eisenhower.  肯尼迪总统的前任是战争英雄德怀特·艾森豪威尔。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3522','acquire','ə''kwaɪr','ə''kwaɪər','[vt] 获得， 取得','Manning hoped to acquire valuable works of art as cheaply as possible.  曼宁希望以尽可能低的价格买到有价值的艺术品。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3523','tactic','''tæktɪk','''tæktɪk','[n] 手段，策略；','a tactic employed to speed up the peace process  为加速和平进程而采取的策略'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3524','worth','wɝθ','wɜːrθ','[adj] 值…的，价值…的，值得…的; [n] 价值； 财产','a chance to win £2,000 worth of computing equipment  一次赢取价值2,000英镑的电脑设备的机会'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3525','automobile',',ɔtəmə''bil','''ɔːtəməbiːl','[n] 汽车， 机动车','the automobile industry  汽车工业'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3526','fertile','ˈfɝtəl; (canadian) ˈfɝˌtaɪl','''fɜːrtl','[adj] 肥沃的， 富饶的； 能结果的， 能繁殖的； 想象力丰富的','800 acres of fertile cropland  800英亩的肥沃耕地'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3527','diversity','dɪˈvəsɪti','dɪ''vɜːrsəti','[n] 多样性','...the cultural diversity of Latin America.  …拉丁美洲文化的多样性。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3528','notion','''noʃən','''nouʃn','[n] 概念， 观念； 想法','She had no notion what he meant.  她根本不明白他是什么意思。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3529','captive','''kæptɪv','''kæptɪv','[adj] 被监禁的，被困住的；受控制的; [n] 俘虏， 战俘','captive soldiers  被俘的士兵'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3530','dividend','''dɪvɪdɛnd','''dɪvɪdend','[n] 红利， 股息； 回报， 效益； 被除数','Good eating habits will pay dividends later on in life.  保持良好的饮食习惯，将来会受益的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3531','popular','''pɑpjəlɚ','''pɑːpjələ','[adj] 通俗的； 受欢迎的； 流行的','Hilary was popular at school.  希拉里在学校里很受欢迎。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3532','vice','vaɪs','vaɪs','[n] 恶行， 恶习； 副， 代理','the fight against vice on the streets  打击街头犯罪'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3533','esteem','ɪ''stim','ɪ''stiːm','[n&vt] 尊重， 敬重','Peden was greatly esteemed by the people of Ayrshire.  佩登深受艾尔郡人的尊敬。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3534','outweigh','''aʊt''we','ˌaut''weɪ','[vt] 超过','The advantages of this deal largely outweigh the disadvantages.  这笔交易的利远大于弊。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3535','shear','ʃɪr','ʃɪr','[v] 剪； 切断， 剪切','Competitors have six minutes to shear four sheep.  参赛者们有6分钟的时间来给4只羊剪毛。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3536','wedge-shaped','','''wedʒˌʃeɪpt','[adj] 楔形的','Note the wedge-shaped area of avascular necrosis (osteonecrosis) at the upper right of this femoral head.  可见股骨头右上方楔形的缺血性坏死（骨坏死）区。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3537','alga','''ælgɚ','''ælgə','[n] 水藻','The shampoo composition features that it contains both blue - green alga extract and scurf eliminating agent.  本发明香波组合物的特征在于同时包含蓝藻提取物和去屑剂。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3538','dupe','dju:p','duːp','[n] 上当者; [vt] 欺骗， 愚弄','...a plot to dupe stamp collectors into buying fake rarities.  …一个欺骗集邮爱好者购买假冒珍品的阴谋。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3539','meteor','''mitɪɚ','''miːtiər','[n] 流星','Astronomers track large meteors using radar.  天文学家使用雷达跟踪大型流星。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3540','empower','ɪm''paʊɚ','ɪm''pauər','[v] 授权， 准许； 使控制局势','The Voting Rights Act was needed to empower minority groups.  《选举权法案》对于赋予少数民族自主权是必不可少的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3541','suppress','sə''prɛs','sə''pres','[vt] 抑制， 阻止； 镇压， 压制； 禁止发表， 查禁； 阻止…的生长','The uprising was ruthlessly suppressed.  起义受到了残酷的镇压。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3542','crater','''kretɚ','''kreɪtər','[n] 火山口； 坑','craters on the moon’s surface  月球表面的坑'),
