('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3699','moss','mɔs','mɔːs','[n] 苔藓','...ground covered over with moss.  …长满青苔的地面。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3700','detective','dɪ''tɛktɪv','dɪ''tektɪv','[adj] 侦探的; [n] 侦探，私人侦探','...Arthur Conan Doyle''s classic detective novel.  …阿瑟·柯南·道尔的经典侦探小说。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3701','transfer','træns''fɝ','''trænsˌfɜːr','[v] 转移；转学；转让；换乘; [n] 转移； 转学； 转让； 换乘','He was transferred for a fee of £8 million.  他以800万英镑的转会费转到了其他球队。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3702','resin','''rɛzn','''rezn','[n] 树脂','...a tropical tree that is bled regularly for its resin.  …定期被采割树脂的一棵热带树。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3703','affection','ə''fɛkʃən','ə''fekʃn','[n] 喜爱，钟爱；','She looked back on those days with affection .  她深情地回顾那些日子。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3704','diversion','dəˈvɝʒən; dəˈvɝʃən; daɪˈvɝʒən; daɪˈvɝʃən','daɪ''vɜːrʒn','[n] 消遣， 娱乐； 转移， 转换','...the illegal diversion of profits from secret arms sales.  …销售秘密武器所得收益的非法转移。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3705','omit','ə''mɪt','ə''mɪt','[vt] 省略， 删去； 遗漏， 忽略','Please don’t omit any details, no matter how trivial they may seem.  请不要忽略任何细节，不管它多细小。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3706','courteous','''kɝtɪəs','''kɜːrtiəs','[adj] 谦恭的， 有礼貌的','The staff are always courteous and helpful.  员工们总是彬彬有礼、乐于帮助。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3707','limitation',',lɪmɪ''teʃən','ˌlɪmɪ''teɪʃn','[n] 限制； 局限性','a nuclear limitation treaty  核限制条约'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3708','sponsor','''spɑnsɚ','''spɑːnsər','[vt] 主办；赞助; [n] 发起者； 赞助者','The competition was sponsored by British Airways.  此项比赛由英国航空公司赞助。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3709','jog','dʒɑɡ','dʒɑːg','[vi] 慢跑； 轻轻触碰','I go jogging every morning.  我每天早晨都去慢跑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3710','ascertain','''æsɚ''ten','ˌæsər''teɪn','[vt] 弄清， 查明','A postmortem was ordered to try to ascertain the cause of death.  下令验尸以查明死因。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3711','insert','''ɪnsɝt','ɪn''sɜːrt','[vt] 插入','He took a small key from his pocket and slowly inserted it into the lock.  他从衣袋里掏出一把小钥匙，然后缓缓地将其插入锁孔里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3712','jot','dʒɑt','dʒɑːt','[vt] 草草记下， 匆匆记下','Could you just jot his name on there?  你能就把他的名字简单记在那儿吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3713','Neolithic','ˌniəˈlɪθɪk','ˌniːə''lɪθɪk','[adj] 新石器时代的','a Neolithic burial ground  一块新石器时代的墓地'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3714','highlight','''haɪlaɪt','''haɪlaɪt','[vt] 强调，突出；以强烈光线照射; [n] 最精彩部分','Last year Collins wrote a moving ballad which highlighted the plight of the homeless.  去年柯林斯写了一首感人的叙事诗，突出描写了无家可归者的苦境。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3715','database','''detəbes','''deɪtəbeɪs','[n] 数据库','customer details held on a database  存储在数据库内的客户详细信息'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3716','sac','sæk','sæk','[n] 囊， 液囊','The lungs consist of millions of tiny air sacs.  肺包含数百万个小肺泡。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3717','patient','ˈpeʃənt','''peɪʃnt','[adj] 有耐心的，能忍耐的; [n] 病人， 患者','You’ll just have to be patient and wait till I’m off the phone.  你只能耐心点，等我打完电话。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3718','reject','rɪ''dʒɛkt','rɪ''dʒekt','[vt] 拒绝， 抵制； 抛弃， 摈弃， ， 丢弃； 拒收， 不录用； 排斥; [n] 被拒货品， 不合格产品','Sarah rejected her brother’s offer of help.  萨拉拒绝了她弟弟的帮助。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3719','sheer','ʃɪr','ʃɪr','[adv] 垂直地，陡峭地; [vi] 急转， 偏离; [adj] 陡峭的；完全的，十足的，全然的；绝对的；极薄的','cliffs which rose sheer from the sea  从海面垂直拔起的悬崖'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3720','imitation',',ɪmɪ''teʃən','ˌɪmɪ''teɪʃn','[n] 模仿， 仿效； 仿制； 仿造品','The remake of ‘Casablanca’ was a pale imitation (= something that is much less good than the thing it imitates ) of the original movie.  重拍的《卡萨布兰卡》远不如原版。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3721','compliment','ˈkɑːmplɪmənt','''kɒmplɪm(ə)nt','[vt] 赞美， 称赞; [n] 赞美；','The groom was so nervous he forgot to compliment the bridesmaids.  新郎太紧张了，都忘了夸奖伴娘。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3722','miracle','''mɪrəkl','''mɪrəkl','[n] 奇事， 奇迹','It’s a miracle you weren’t killed!  你没有死真是奇迹！'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3723','rinse','rɪns','rɪns','[vt] 冲洗，漂洗，冲刷; [n] 漂洗， 冲洗， 洗涤； 染发剂','Let me just rinse my hands.  让我冲个手。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3724','amount','ə''maʊnt','ə''maunt','[vi] 总计; [n] 总额','Consumer spending on sports-related items amounted to $9.75 billion.  消费者在体育相关用品上的消费总共达到了97.5亿美元。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3725','comply','kəm''plaɪ','kəm''plaɪ','[vi] 服从； 遵守','The newspaper was asked by federal agents for assistance and agreed to comply.  联邦探员要求这家报社给予协助，报社同意配合。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3726','sap','sæp','sæp','[vt] 使衰竭；削弱，逐渐破坏; [n] 液， 汁； 精力； 笨蛋','I was afraid the sickness had sapped my strength.  恐怕这场病已经消耗了我的力气。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3727','spellbind','''spɛl,baɪnd','''spelbaɪnd','[vt] 用妖术迷惑； 迷住， 使入迷',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3728','nectar','''nɛktɚ','''nektər','[n] 花蜜； 甘美的饮料， 琼浆玉液',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3729','feudal','''fjudl','''fjuːdl','[adj] 封建的','the feudal system  封建制度'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3730','kingdom','''kɪŋdəm','''kɪŋdəm','[n] 王国； 领域， 界','the United Kingdom  联合王国'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3731','spread','sprɛd','spred','[v] 展开；蔓延，扩散；散布；涂，敷; [n] 传播， 蔓延； 涉及幅度， 活动范围','She spread a towel on the sand and lay on it.  她把一块浴巾铺在沙地上，然后躺在上面。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3732','puppet','''pʌpɪt','''pʌpɪt','[n] 木偶； 玩偶； 傀儡， 受人操纵的人','When the invasion occurred he seized power and ruled the country as a puppet of the occupiers.  他趁入侵之时夺取了政权，作为占领者的傀儡统治着这个国家。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3733','educated','''ɛdʒə''ketɪd','''edʒukeɪtɪd','[adj] 受过教育的， 有教养的','a highly educated woman  很有修养的女子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3734','favor','''fevɚ','''feɪvər','[n] 帮助； 赞同， 支持； 偏爱',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3735','latter','''lætɚ','''lætər','[adj] 后面的，后半期的；后者的; [n] 后者','In the latter case, buyers pay a 15% commission.  在后一种情况下，买家付15%的佣金。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3736','clinic','''klɪnɪk','''klɪnɪk','[n] 门诊部， 诊所','an appointment at an outpatient clinic  门诊预约'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3737','affiliate','ə''fɪlɪet','ə''fɪlɪeɪt','[vt] 使隶属于; [n] 分公司','He wanted to affiliate with a U.S. firm because he needed expert advice in legal affairs.  他想成为一家美国公司的会员，因为他需要法律事务方面的专家意见。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3738','simply','''sɪmpli','''sɪmpli','[adv] 简单地， 简明地； 简直； 仅仅， 只； 朴素地， 简朴地','Some students lose marks simply because they don’t read the question properly.  有些学生丢分只是因为没有好好读题目。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3739','recessive','rɪ''sɛsɪv','rɪ''sesɪv','[adj] 隐性的','In normal seedlings the deleterious recessive genes are not expressed.  有害的隐性基因在正常菌木中不表现出来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3740','equivalent','ɪ''kwɪvələnt','ɪ''kwɪvələnt','[adj] 相同的； 相当的; [n] 对等物；等价物','I had no dollars, but offered him an equivalent amount of sterling.  我没有美金，但给了他等值的英镑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3741','momentary','''moməntɛri','''moumənteri','[adj] 片刻的， 瞬间的， 暂时的','There was a momentary pause.  停顿了片刻。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3742','hypocritical',',hɪpə''krɪtɪkl','ˌhɪpə''krɪtɪkl','[adj] 伪善的， 虚伪的','It would be hypocritical to say I travel at 70 mph simply because that is the law.  如果仅仅因为法律规定的时速是70英里我就说自己的行驶时速是70英里，那就太虚伪了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3743','constricted','','kən''strɪktɪd','[adj] 狭窄的； 收缩的； 抑制的， 约束的',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3744','sensational','sɛn''seʃənl','sen''seɪʃənl','[adj] 轰动性的， 引起哗然的， 耸人听闻的； 〈口〉极好的， 绝妙的','a sensational discovery  引起轰动的发现'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3745','canoe','kə''nu','kə''nuː','[vi] 乘独木舟，划独木舟; [n] 独木舟','Get out on the water - Rent a sailboat, rowboat, paddleboat, kayak, or canoe. Grab a pole and go fishing or don your swimsuit and jump in.  水上约会活动——你可以租一艘帆船，皮划艇，划艇，皮艇，或独木舟。有了船，你可以划船和钓鱼，或是穿上泳衣潜水去。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3746','wedge','wɛdʒ','wedʒ','[n] 楔子；楔形物; [vt] ■入， 塞入','Garnish with lemon wedges.  用几角柠檬片作装饰。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3747','alienate','''eiljəneit','''eɪliəneɪt','[vt] 使疏远， 使不友好； 转让， 让渡','The latest tax proposals will alienate many voters.  最新的纳税提案将失去远许多选民的支持。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3748','awake','ə''wek','ə''weɪk','[v] 唤醒；醒；觉醒，醒悟; [adj] 醒着的； 警觉的','It was midday when she awoke.  她醒来时已是中午。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3749','plague','pleɡ','pleɪg','[vt] 困扰，使苦恼；纠缠; [n] 鼠疫； 传染病； 祸患， 灾害','Financial problems continued to plague the company.  资金问题持续困扰着该公司。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3750','perpetual','pɚ''pɛtʃuəl','pər''petʃuəl','[adj] 连续不断的； 永久的， 长期的','the perpetual noise of the machines  机器连续不断的噪音'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3751','retrospect','''rɛtrəspɛkt','''retrəspekt','[n] 回顾， 反顾','In retrospect, I wonder if we should have done more.  回过头看，我在想我们是否应该做得更多些。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3752','fascinate','''fæsə''net','''fæsɪneɪt','[v] 深深吸引， 迷住','The idea of travelling through time fascinates me.  穿越时光的想法深深吸引着我。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3753','offer','''ɔfɚ','''ɔːfər','[v] 提供；自愿给予；提出，提议; [n] 提议； 报价， 出价； 特价','I don’t need any help, but it was nice of you to offer.  我不需要任何帮助，但是我谢谢你的好意。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3754','diplomatic',',dɪplə''mætɪk','ˌdɪplə''mætɪk','[adj] 外交的， 从事外交的； 有策略的， 有手腕的， 老练的','Diplomatic efforts to end the fighting began on October 25.  停战的外交努力于10月25日开始。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3755','projector','prə''dʒɛktɚ','prə''dʒektər','[n] 放映机， 幻灯机， 投影仪','...a slide projector.  …幻灯机。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3756','draft','dræft','dræft','[adj] 供役使的; [n] 草图，草稿；汇票；气流; [vt] 起草；征募，选派','the rough draft of his new novel  他的新小说的草稿'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3757','loath','loθ','louθ','[adj] 不情愿的， 勉强的','Sensing he held the advantage, Mr. Danbar was loath to change the subject.  丹巴先生觉得占有优势，不愿改变话题。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3758','complex','ˈkɑmplɛks;kəmˈplɛks','''kɒmpleks','[adj] 合成的， 综合的； 复杂的， 错综的， 难以理解的; [n] 建筑群； 综合体， 集合体； 情结','a complex system of highways  复杂的公路网'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3759','humidity','hju''mɪdəti','hjuː''mɪdəti','[n] 湿度； 潮湿','The room is kept at 72 degrees and 50% relative humidity.  房间的温度保持在72度，相对湿度50%。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3760','fluid','''fluɪd','''fluːɪd','[adj] 液体的； 流动的; [n] 液体，流体','a loose, fluid style of dancing  舒展而优美的舞姿'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3761','pamphlet','ˈpæmflɪt','''pæmflət','[n] 小册子','a political pamphlet  政治宣传册'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3762','healthful','''hɛlθfl','''helθfl','[adj] 有益健康的','healthful mountain air  有利于健康的山区空气'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3763','posit','''pɑzɪt','''pɑːzɪt','[vt] 安排； 假定','Several writers have posited the idea of a universal consciousness.  几个作者都假设一种普遍意识的思想。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3764','ornate','ɔr''net','ɔːr''neɪt','[adj] 华丽的， 豪华的','an ornate gold mirror  华丽的金镜子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3765','metropolis','mə''trɑpəlɪs','mə''trɑːpəlɪs','[n] 首府； 大都市','The city has become a huge, bustling metropolis.  这座城市已变成繁忙的大都市。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3766','documentation','''dɑkjəmɛn''teʃən','ˌdɑːkjumen''teɪʃn','[n] 文件； 归档， 文献记录','Applicants must provide supporting documentation .  申请人必须提供证明文件。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3767','proliferate','prə''lɪfə''ret','prə''lɪfəreɪt','[vi] 激增， 迅速繁殖','Computer courses continue to proliferate.  计算机课程层出不穷。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3768','personal','''pɝsənl','''pɜːrsənl','[adj] 个人的， 私人的； 亲自的','My personal view is that we shouldn’t offer him the job.  我个人认为我们不该给他这份工作。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3769','plastic','''plæstɪk','''plæstɪk','[adj] 塑料的； 可塑的； 做作的， 虚伪的; [n] 塑料','a plastic spoon  塑料汤匙'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3770','delay','dɪ''le','dɪ''leɪ','[v] 耽搁，延迟; [n] 耽搁， 延迟','Don’t delay – send off for the information now.  别犹豫——即刻去函索取信息。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3771','onslaught','''ɑnslɔt','''ɑːnslɔːt','[n] 冲击； 攻击， 猛攻','The press launched another vicious onslaught on the president.  新闻界对这位总统进行了新一轮的恶毒抨击。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3772','transient','ˈtrænʃnt; trænʃənt','''trænziənt','[adj] 短暂的， 转瞬即逝的； 临时的','transient fashions  短暂的时尚'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3773','disrepute',',dɪsrɪ''pjut','ˌdɪsrɪ''pjuːt','[n] 坏名声， 不光彩','He faces six charges of bringing the game into disrepute .  他面临六项破坏这项运动声誉的指控。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3774','plank','plæŋk','plæŋk','[n] 木板； 政策要点， 政纲的核心','a long plank of wood  一长条厚木板'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3775','heyday','''hede','''heɪdeɪ','[n] 全盛期','In its heyday, the studio''s boast was that it had more stars than there are in heaven.  该制片厂吹嘘，它在鼎盛时期拥有的明星比天上的星星还多。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3776','sponge','spʌndʒ','spʌndʒ','[v] 用海绵擦， 揩; [n] 海绵；寄生虫','Clean the rug by sponging it gently.  用湿布轻轻擦洗以清洁小地毯。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3777','deal','dil','diːl','[v] 处理， 对付； 给予； 做买卖， 经营; [n] 交易，买卖；协议','Many users end up dealing to support their habit.  许多吸毒者最后都是靠做毒品买卖来供自己吸毒。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3778','spaghetti','spə''ɡɛti','spə''geti','[n] 意大利式细面条','Bill: I would like mashed potato and spaghetti.  比尔：我想要份土豆泥和意大利面条。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3779','insulate','ˈɪnsəˌleɪt ; ˈɪnsjʊˌleɪt','''ɪnsəleɪt','[vt] 使隔离， 使隔绝','an insulated attic  隔热[隔音]的阁楼'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3780','scheme','skim','skiːm','[v] 密谋， 秘密策划， 图谋; [n] 计划，方案；阴谋；体系，体制','She’s nothing but a lying, scheming little monster!  她就是个爱撒谎、爱算计的小巫婆！'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3781','affect','ə''fɛkt','ə''fekt','[vt] 影响； 感染','the areas affected by the hurricane  受飓风影响的地区'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3782','drain','dren','dreɪn','[v] 流走，流出；使耗尽; [n] 下水道， 排水沟； 排放； 消耗','Huge imports were draining the country’s currency reserves.  大量的进口正在耗尽该国的货币储备。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3783','smoothly','''smʊðli','''smuːðli','[adv] 顺利地； 平稳地； 平静地','Traffic flowed smoothly.  路上交通畅通。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3784','isolate','aɪslˌet','''aɪsəleɪt','[vt] 使隔离， 使孤立','The town was isolated by the floods.  洪水使该镇与外界隔绝。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3785','civil','''sɪvl','''sɪvl','[adj] 市民的， 公民的， 平民的； 民事的； 国家的， 政府的； 文明的， 有教养的','They were married in a civil ceremony in May.  他们在五月份举行了世俗婚礼。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3786','subsequent','''sʌbsɪkwənt','''sʌbsɪkwənt','[adj] 随后的； 并发的','These skills were passed on to subsequent generations.  这些技能代代相传。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3787','indicate','''ɪndɪket','''ɪndɪkeɪt','[v] 表明， 显示； 指出， 指示； 象征， 预示； 暗示， 间接提及','The study indicates a connection between poverty and crime.  研究显示贫穷和犯罪有关联。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3788','metabolic',',mɛtə''bɑlɪk','ˌmetə''bɑːlɪk','[adj] 新陈代谢的','Exercise can increase your metabolic rate.  运动可以提高新陈代谢率。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3789','completion','kəm''pliʃən','kəm''pliːʃn','[n] 完成， 实现； 结束','The house is nearing completion (= almost finished ) .  房子即将完工。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3790','contain','kən''ten','kən''teɪn','[vt] 包含， 容纳； 控制； 防止…蔓延','The thieves stole a purse containing bank-notes.  小偷们偷到了一个里面有钞票的钱包。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3791','litter','''lɪtɚ','''lɪtər','[v] 乱扔； 使凌乱; [n] 废弃物，垃圾；一窝幼崽','Clothes littered the floor.  衣服扔了一地。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3792','sew','so','sou','[v] 缝， 做针线活； 缝补， 缝上','I learned to sew at school.  我在学校学会了缝纫。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3793','oval','''ovl','''ouvl','[adj] 卵形的，椭圆形的; [n] 卵形， 椭圆形','...the small oval framed picture of a little boy.  …一个小男孩的镶在椭圆形框架里的小幅照片。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3794','column','''kɑləm','''kɑːləm','[n] 专栏； 圆柱， 支柱； 纵队','He writes a weekly column for ‘The Times’.  他每周为《泰晤士报》写一篇专栏文章。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3795','indigent','''ɪndɪdʒənt','''ɪndɪdʒənt','[adj] 贫困的， 贫穷的','No where in the article does it mention her financial status. So…what is it that leads everyone to assume she was indigent?  在文章中哪也没提及她的财务状况。那么…究竟是什么导致每个人都认为她是贫困的？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3796','biography','baɪ''ɑɡrəfi','baɪ''ɑːgrəfi','[n] 传记','...recent biographies of Stalin.  …近年的斯大林传记。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3797','procedure','prə''sidʒɚ','prə''siːdʒər','[n] 程序， 手续， 步骤','On board, we were given the usual talk on safety procedures (= what to do if an accident happens, or to prevent an accident ) .  在飞机上，我们听了例行的飞行安全讲解。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3798','sample','''sæmpl','''sæmpl','[n] 样品，标本; [vt] 抽样调查； 品尝， 体验','They took a blood sample to test for hepatitis.  他们取了血样做肝炎化验。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3799','integrate','''ɪntɪɡret','''ɪntɪgreɪt','[v] 合并， 成为一体','He didn''t integrate successfully into the Italian way of life.  他没有成功融入到意大利的生活方式中去。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3800','operant','''ɑpərənt','''ɑːpərænt','[adj] 运转中的；生效的；操作性的; [n] 起作用的人','The actual tests would employ the well-honed methods of operant conditioning, developed initially on pigeons, in which the test subject has first to work out what is going on by trial and error.  实际的测试会采用精确的操作性条件反射方法，测试对象首先要清楚实验的过程和错误。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3801','cellist','''tʃɛlɪst','''tʃelɪst','[n] 大提琴演奏家','Who can deny his stature as the world''s greatest cellist?  谁能否认他是世界上最伟大的大提琴演奏家呢? ?。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3802','applicant','''æplɪkənt','''æplɪkənt','[n] 申请者','We have had lots of applicants for these positions.  对这些职位我们已有了很多申请人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3803','awesome','''ɔsəm','''ɔːsəm','[adj] 使人敬畏的； 使人恐惧的','an awesome responsibility  一项令人惊惧的责任'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3804','admiration',',ædmə''reʃən','ˌædmə''reɪʃn','[n] 钦佩， 赞赏， 羡慕','Daniel gazed at her in admiration .  丹尼尔用爱慕的眼神注视着她。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3805','Jupiter','''dʒʊpətɚ','''dʒuːpɪtər','[n] 木星','a space probe on its way to Jupiter  飞向木星的一个太空探测器'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3806','pique','pik','piːk','[vt] 激怒；激起，引起; [n] 恼怒， 生气； 怨恨','Privately, Zarich was piqued that his offer was rejected.  提议遭到拒绝，扎里克私下里很气愤。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3807','planetary','''plænətɛri','''plænəteri','[adj] 行星的','Within our own galaxy there are probably tens of thousands of planetary systems.  在我们所在的银河系中，很可能存在数以万计的行星系。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3808','ultraviolet',',ʌltrə''vaɪələt','ˌʌltrə''vaɪələt','[adj] 紫外的','This is the energy of an ultraviolet photon, a "large" energy on the atomic scale .  这是一个紫外光子的能量，在原子尺度上，它是一个“大”能量。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3809','diagnose',',daɪəɡ''nos','ˌdaɪəg''nous','[v] 诊断； 判断','The soldiers were diagnosed as having flu.  这些士兵被诊断为患了流感。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3810','petition','pə''tɪʃən','pə''tɪʃn','[v] 请愿， 正式请求; [n] 请愿；请愿书；诉状','...couples petitioning for divorce.  …申请离婚的几对夫妇。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3811','somewhat','''sʌmwʌt','''sʌmwʌt','[adv] 稍微， 有点','Things have changed somewhat since then.  从那时候起，情况就有些不一样了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3812','vicinity','və''sɪnəti','və''sɪnəti','[n] 邻近， 附近','The stolen car was found in the vicinity of the station.  被盗汽车在车站附近被发现。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3813','earnest','','''ɜːrnɪst','[adj] 认真的；真诚的; [n] 诚挚； 认真','a rather earnest young man  相当认真的一个年轻人'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3814','validity','və''lɪdəti','və''lɪdəti','[n] 合法性； 符合逻辑',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3815','crevice','''krɛvɪs','''krevɪs','[n] 缺口， 裂缝','small creatures that hide in crevices in the rock  藏在岩石缝里的小生物'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3816','precede','prɪ''sid','prɪ''siːd','[v] 在…之前， 先于','a type of cloud that precedes rain  下雨前出现的一种云'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3817','humorous','''hjumərəs','''hjuːmərəs','[adj] 幽默的， 滑稽的， 诙谐的','humorous stories  诙谐的故事'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3818','bet','bɛt','bet','[v] 打赌； 敢说， 确信; [n] 打赌；赌注','‘I’m sure Tom’ll be here soon.’ ‘Wanna bet?’  “我肯定汤姆很快就到。”“打赌吗？”'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3819','differentiate',',dɪfə''rɛnʃɪet','ˌdɪfə''renʃieɪt ','[v] 不同， 区别','What differentiates these two periods of history?  这两个历史时期的差别在哪里？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3820','discharge','dɪs''tʃɑrdʒ','dɪs''tʃɑːdʒ','[v] 释放； 放； 解雇； 清偿； 履行; [n] 流出物； 放电','...the quiet competence with which he discharged his many duties.  …他履行他的诸多职责所用的平静的办事能力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3821','disadvantage',',dɪsəd''væntɪdʒ','ˌdɪsəd''væntɪdʒ','[n] 缺点， 障碍， 不利之处','Criminal behaviour can be linked to economic disadvantage.  犯罪行为可能会与经济困难有关。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3822','plaster','''plæstɚ','''plæstər','[v] 在…上抹灰泥， 厚厚地涂; [n] 灰浆，灰泥，石膏','The ceiling he had just plastered fell in and knocked him off his ladder.  他刚抹过灰泥的那块天花板脱落了，把他从梯子上砸了下来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3823','metropolitan',',mɛtrə''pɑlɪtən','ˌmetrə''pɑːlɪtən','[adj] 大都市的； 本土的','a metropolitan area of South Australia  南澳大利亚的一个都市区'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3824','eclecticism','','ɪ''klektɪsɪzəm','[n] 折中主义','...her cultural eclecticism.  ...她的文化折中主义。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3825','garbage','''ɡɑrbɪdʒ','''gɑːrbɪdʒ','[n] 垃圾， 废物； 废话， 无聊的东西； 垃圾箱','Can you take out the garbage when you go?  你走的时候把垃圾带出去好吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3826','suspicious','sə''spɪʃəs','sə''spɪʃəs','[adj] 可疑的， 令人怀疑的； 不信任的， 猜疑的， 多疑的','His reluctance to answer my questions made me suspicious .  他不愿回答我的问题，这引起我的怀疑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3827','complain','kəm''plen','kəm''pleɪn','[v] 诉苦， 抱怨； 投诉； 控告','Miners have complained bitterly that the government did not fulfil their promises.  矿工们已愤愤地抱怨政府没有兑现他们的承诺。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3828','polygamy','pə''lɪɡəmi','pə''lɪgəmi','[n] 一夫多妻制， 一妻多夫制， 多配偶制','The sect, which broke from the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-Day Saints more than a century ago, believes polygamy brings glorification in heaven.  这个教派，原本是一个多世纪以前从摩门教末世圣徒教会分离出来的，相信一夫多妻制可以升上天堂。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3829','renovate','''rɛnəvet','''renəveɪt','[vt] 修复； 更新， 翻新','The hotel has been renovated and redecorated.  酒店已经翻新，并重新装饰。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3830','adjust','ə''dʒʌst','ə''dʒʌst','[v] 调整， 调节； 适合， 适应； 校正， 校准','They’ll soon settle in – kids are very good at adjusting.  他们很快就会习惯的——小孩子适应能力很强。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3831','debt','dɛt','det','[n] 债务； 负债情况； 罪过','He had enough money to pay off his outstanding debts.  他有足够的钱偿还亏欠的债务。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3832','perpendicular','''pɝpən''dɪkjəlɚ','ˌpɜːrpən''dɪkjələr','[adj] 成直角的，垂直的; [n] 垂直线','a perpendicular line  垂直线'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3833','ordinate','''ɔrdɪnət','''ɔːrdɪnət','[n] 纵坐标','Use a minimum of ordinate and abscissa values so they do not run together.  使用最低限度的协调与横坐标值使他们不跑在一起。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3834','deem','dim','diːm','[vt] 认为， 相信','French and German were deemed essential.  法语和德语被认为是必需的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3835','stiffen','''stɪfn','''stɪfn','[v] 变僵硬； 变坚定， 变强硬','a campaign to stiffen rules against drink-driving  要求对酒后驾车严加管制的运动'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3836','compel','kəm''pɛl','kəm''pel','[vt] 驱使， 强迫','...the introduction of legislation to compel cyclists to wear a helmet.  …强制骑车人戴头盔的法律的引入。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3837','depress','dɪ''prɛs','dɪ''pres','[vt] 降低， 削弱； 使沮丧； 使萧条','High interest rates may depress share prices.  高利率可能打压股价。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3838','pendant','''pɛndənt','''pendənt','[n] 垂饰， 下垂物','a ruby pendant  红宝石吊坠'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3839','repress','rɪ''prɛs','rɪ''pres','[vt] 克制， 抑制； 镇压， 压制','Brenda repressed the urge to shout at him.  布伦达克制住想对他吼的冲动。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3840','riddle','''rɪdl','''rɪdl','[n] 谜；谜语；难解之谜；粗筛; [vt] 使布满窟窿','See if you can solve this riddle .  看看你能不能猜出这个谜语。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3841','apprise','ə''praiz','ə''praɪz','[vt] 通知， 告诉','Have customers been fully apprised of the advantages?  客户有没有被充分告知各项好处呢？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3842','candid','''kændɪd','''kændɪd','[adj] 坦白的， 直率的， 直言不讳的','It struck me as an unusually candid confession for a politician.  我觉得这对一个政治家来说是非常坦率的告白了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3843','client','''klaɪənt','''klaɪənt','[n] 委托人， 当事人； 顾客','a meeting with an important client  与一位重要客户的会面'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3844','plankton','''plæŋktən','''plæŋktən','[n] 浮游生物','...its usual diet of plankton and other small organisms.  ...它通常赖以为食的浮游生物和其他微生物。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3845','conversion','kən''vɝʒn','kən''vɜːrʒn','[n] 转变， 变换； 改变信仰， 皈依','...the conversion of disused rail lines into cycle routes.  …把废弃的铁路改变成自行车道。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3846','brilliant','''brɪljənt','''brɪliənt','[adj] 给人印象深刻的； 闪耀的； 杰出的， 卓越的','The film was absolutely brilliant .  这部电影极为出色。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3847','practical','''præktɪkl','''præktɪkl','[adj] 实用的； 实际的； 现实的','Candidates should have training and practical experience in basic electronics.  应征者应该具备基础电子学方面的培训和实践经验。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3848','deductive','dɪ''dʌktɪv','dɪ''dʌktɪv','[adj] 演绎的， 推论的','deductive reasoning  演绎推理'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3849','breathing','''briðɪŋ','''briːðɪŋ','[n] 呼吸','His breathing was deep and regular.  他的呼吸深沉而均匀。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3850','bound','baʊnd','baund','[adj] 被束缚的，有义务的; [v] 跳跃； 弹回； 形成…的界线， 给…划界','a fog-bound airport  因大雾而关闭的机场'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3851','falter','''fɔltɚ','''fɔːltər','[v] 衰退， 衰落； 发抖， 结巴地说； 蹒跚','The economy is showing signs of faltering.  经济出现衰退迹象。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3852','breed','brid','briːd','[v] 〔动物〕交配繁殖; [n] 〔宠物或牲畜的〕品种','Eagles breed during the cooler months of the year.  鹰在一年中较凉爽的季节交配繁殖。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3853','elusive','ɪ''lusɪv','i''luːsɪv','[adj] 难以理解的， 难懂的； 难捕捉的； 逃避的','She enjoys a firm reputation in this country but wider international success has been elusive.  她在这个国家享有稳固的声誉，但却一直难以在国际上取得更大的成功。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3854','appraise','ə''prez','ə''preɪz','[vt] 估价； 估量； 评价， 评定','Greenpeace has been invited to appraise the environmental costs of such an operation.  绿色和平组织已受邀评估这样一次行动对环境的影响。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3855','pyramid','''pɪrəmɪd','''pɪrəmɪd','[n] 金字塔； 锥体； 金字塔形物； 金字塔式的组织','different levels of the management pyramid  金字塔式管理体系中的不同层次'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3856','realm','rɛlm','relm','[n] 王国， 国度； 界， 范围， 领域','the spiritual realm  精神领域'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3857','avoid','ə''vɔɪd','ə''vɔɪd','[vt] 避免， 规避','Road safety is taught to young children to avoid road accidents.  小孩子受到道路安全知识的教育，以避免交通事故。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3858','comprehensive','ˌkɑːmprɪˈhensɪv','ˌkɑːmprɪ''hensɪv','[adj] 全面的； 综合的','We offer our customers a comprehensive range of financial products.  我们为客户提供全面的金融产品。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3859','entourage','''ɑnturɑʒ','''ɑːnturɑːʒ','[n] 〈总称〉随从， 随行人员','the president and his entourage  总统和他的随行人员'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3860','prompt','prɑmpt','prɑːmpt','[adj] 敏捷的；及时的，迅速的; [vt] 促进，推动；提示；鼓励; [n] 提词， 提示','Prompt action must be taken.  必须立即采取行动。'),
