('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3885','pursuit','pɚ''sut','pər''suːt','[n] 追求；','The quarterback sprinted toward the end zone with Jansen in hot pursuit (= following closely behind ) .  那名四分卫快速冲向底线区，詹森穷追不舍。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3886','cowhand','''kaʊhænd','''kauhænd','[n] 牛仔， 牧牛工','A cowhand herds cattle past a petroleum processing plant.  一个牧牛人赶着一群牛在一家石油加工厂附近经过。'),
