('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3888','tournament','ˈtɝ​nəmənt','''tɜːrnəmənt','[n] 比赛； 锦标赛','I feel I can win this tournament.  我觉得我能打赢这次锦标赛。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3889','ruthless','''rʊθləs','''ruːθləs','[adj] 无情的， 残酷的， 冷酷的； 坚决的， 彻底的','a ruthless dictator  无情的独裁者'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3890','lure','lʊr','lur','[vt] 吸引，诱惑; [n] 诱惑力； 诱饵','He lured her to his home and shot her with his father''s gun.  他把她诱骗到家里，然后用父亲的枪把她打死。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3891','simile','''sɪməli','''sɪməli','[n] 明喻','This is the simile of what I have just given to you.  不过这是我已经给予你们的明喻。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3892','inflammation','''ɪnflə''meʃən','ˌɪnflə''meɪʃn','[n] 炎症， 发炎','The drug can cause inflammation of the liver.  这种药会引发肝脏炎症。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3893','dissolve','dɪ''zɑlv','dɪ''zɑːlv','[v] 溶解； 清除； 解散， 结束','Stir until the sugar dissolves.  一直搅拌到糖溶解掉。'),
