('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3899','bundle','''bʌndl','''bʌndl','[n] 捆，束；包袱; [vt] 收集， 归拢； 把…塞入','a small bundle containing mostly clothing  一个小包袱，里面主要是衣服'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3900','soybean','''sɔɪ,bin','''sɔɪbiːn','[n] 大豆','But the rain might have come too late to save many farmers'' corn and soybean crops.  但这场雨可能来得太晚了，无力挽救许多农民的玉米和大豆作物。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3901','counseling','''kaʊnslɪŋ','''kaunsəlɪŋ','[n] 咨询； 辅导','The best solution to his problem lies in seeing a psychiatrist for counseling. But what if he refuses such counseling?  解决他的问题的最好办法是向精神病专家作些咨询。但如果他拒绝这种咨询怎么办？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3902','thorn','θɔrn','θɔːrn','[n] 刺， 荆棘； 带刺小灌木','a long, low hedge of thorns  一长排矮矮的荆棘树篱'),
