('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3914','polygon','''pɑlɪɡɑn','''pɑːligɑːn','[n] 多角形， 多边形','Best way to "match" an array of polygon vertices to another?  最佳方法“匹配”多边形顶点到另一个数组?。'),
