('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3934','novice','''nɑvɪs','''nɑːvɪs','[n] 生手， 新手； 新信徒','The computer course is ideal for novices.  这门计算机课程非常适合初学者。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3935','portraiture','''pɔrtrətʃɚ','''pɔːrtrətʃər','[n] 画像技法； 肖像， 画像',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3936','peripheral','pə''rɪfərəl','pə''rɪfərəl','[adj] 不重要的； 外围的','the city’s peripheral suburbs  这座城市的市郊'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3937','incoming','''ɪnkʌmɪŋ','''ɪnkʌmɪŋ','[adj] 引入的；新任的；正来临的，刚收到的; [n] 进来，到来；','incoming flights  进港航班'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3938','inanimate','ɪn''ænɪmət','ɪn''ænɪmət','[adj] 无生命的； 无生气的','an inanimate object  无生命的物体'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3939','level','''lɛvl','''levl','[adj] 平坦的；等高的; [n] 水平；高度；级别; [vt] 夷平， 使平坦','The floors in the old house were not completely level.  老房子的地面不是完全平整的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3940','preserve','prɪ''zɝv','prɪ''zɜːrv','[vt] 保护， 维护； 保存， 保养','We must encourage the planting of new trees and preserve our existing woodlands.  我们必须鼓励栽种新树木，同时也要保护现有的林地。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3941','lush','lʌʃ','lʌʃ','[adj] 茂盛的','a lush green mountainous island  草木茂盛苍翠、山峦起伏的岛'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3942','establish','ɪˈstæblɪʃ','ɪ''stæblɪʃ','[vt] 建立， 设立； 安置， 使定居； 确定， 证实','The city of Boerne was established by German settlers in the 1840s.  博恩市是德国移民于19世纪40年代建立的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3943','mammoth','''mæməθ','''mæməθ','[adj] 巨大的; [n] 猛犸， 毛象','Reforming the prison system would be a mammoth task.  改革监狱制度将是一项巨大的任务。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3944','relevant','''rɛləvənt','''reləvənt','[adj] 相关的， 有关的； 中肯的， 贴切的； 有价值的， 有意义的','Relevant documents were presented in court.  法庭上出示了相关的文件。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3945','deter','dɪ''tɝ','dɪ''tɜːr','[v] 威慑， 阻止','Supporters of the death penalty argue that it would deter criminals from carrying guns.  死刑的支持者辩称，死刑可以阻止罪犯携带枪支。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3946','synthetic','sɪn''θɛtɪk','sɪn''θetɪk','[adj] 合成的，综合的；人造的','synthetic chemicals  合成化学品'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3947','proclaim','prə''klem','prə''kleɪm','[v] 宣布， 声明； 显示','The President proclaimed the republic’s independence.  总统宣布共和国独立。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3948','bunch','bʌntʃ','bʌntʃ','[v] 捆成一束； 聚集; [n] 簇，束，捆；帮，伙','The ancient Egyptians were a clever bunch.  古埃及人很聪明。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3949','jolt','dʒolt','dʒoult','[v] 震动，颠簸；震惊; [n] 震动， 颠簸； 震惊； 一阵强烈的感情等','We jolted along rough wet roads through an endless banana plantation.  我们沿崎岖潮湿的公路颠簸着驶过无边无际的香蕉种植园。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3950','jeopardize','''dʒɛpɚdaɪz','''dʒepərdaɪz','[vt] 破坏， 危及','large-scale military offensives which could jeopardize the UN peace process  可能会破坏联合国和平进程的大规模军事进攻'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3951','provincialism','prə''vɪnʃə''lɪzəm','prə''vɪnʃlɪzəm','[n] 地方主义， 乡土性','Wright grew frustrated with American provincialism.  赖特对美国的地方偏狭观念愈发感到沮丧。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3952','predominant','prɪ''dɑmənənt','prɪ''dɑːmɪnənt','[adj] 占优势的， 主导的， 支配的； 显著的， 盛行的','the predominant group in society  社会中的主导群体'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3953','domesticate','də''mɛstɪket','də''mestɪkeɪt','[vt] 驯养， 驯化； 使精于家务， 使喜爱家居','We domesticated the dog to help us with hunting.  我们驯养狗来帮助我们打猎。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3954','recipe','''rɛsəpi','''resəpi','[n] 食谱； 方法， 秘诀， 诀窍','a recipe book  一本烹饪书'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3955','roost','rust','ruːst','[vi] 栖息; [n] 栖息处， 鸟巢','The peacocks roost in nearby shrubs.  那只孔雀在附近的灌木丛里栖息。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3956','apportion','ə''pɔrʃən','ə''pɔːrʃn','[vt] 分配； 分派','It’s not easy to apportion blame (=  say who deserves to be blamed  ) when a marriage breaks up.  婚姻破裂很难说是谁的错。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3957','mental','''mɛntl','''mentl','[adj] 精神的； 智力的； 精神健康的','The centre provides help for people suffering from mental illness .  该中心对精神病患者提供帮助。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3958','decent','''disnt','''diːsnt','[adj] 体面的； 适当的， 得体的； 令人满意的； 正派的','a decent burial  得体的葬礼'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3959','afloat','ə''flot','ə''flout','[adv] 漂浮地; [adj] 漂浮的；有偿债能力的，能维持下去的','They talked modestly of their valiant efforts to keep the tanker afloat.  他们谦虚地谈论了他们为让油轮保持不沉而付出的英勇努力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3960','switch','swɪtʃ','swɪtʃ','[v] 转变， 改变； 交换， 掉换; [n] 开关，电闸；转换，改变；枝条，鞭子','The terrorists will switch tactics .  恐怖分子会改变战术。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3961','auxiliary','ɔːɡ''zɪlɪəri','ɔːg''zɪliəri','[adj] 辅助的， 补助的， 补充的； 备用的， 后备的','an auxiliary nurse  助理护士'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3962','savage','''sævɪdʒ','''sævɪdʒ','[adj] 凶残的；野蛮的，未开化的; [n] 野蛮人，未开化的人; [vt] 残害； 激烈抨击','a savage dog  一条凶猛的狗'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3963','viable','','''vaɪəbl','[adj] 可行的， 可实施的； 可生长发育的','viable seeds  可存活的种子'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3964','facial','''feʃl','''feɪʃl','[adj] 面部的； 面部用的','Victor’s facial expression didn’t change.  维克托脸上的表情没有变化。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3965','by-product','''baɪ,prɑdəkt','''baɪˌprɑːdʌkt','[n] 副产品； 副作用， 意外结果','The raw material for the tyre is a byproduct of oil refining.  这种轮胎的原料是汽油提炼的副产品。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3966','console','''kɑnsol','kən''soul','[vt] 安慰， 抚慰','No one could console her when Peter died.  彼得去世时没人能够安慰她。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3967','auspicious','ɔ''spɪʃəs','ɔː''spɪʃəs','[adj] 吉兆的， 吉利的； 幸运的','On the reverse the same inscription is repeated, besides a row of five Swastikas as auspicious symbols signifying security and good luck.  倒转的同样碑刻是重复的，此外一排五个纳粹党所用的十字记号如幸运的符号表示安全和好运。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3968','chance','tʃæns','tʃæns','[v] 碰巧， 偶然发生； 冒…的险; [n] 机会；可能性，偶然性；偶然的事','I wasn’t sure if I’d got quite enough petrol to get me home, but I decided to chance it .  我不知道开车回家汽油够不够，但我决定冒险一试。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3969','medication','''mɛdɪ''keʃən','ˌmedɪ''keɪʃn','[n] 药物治疗； 药物','When somebody comes for treatment I always ask them if they are on any medication.  有人来治疗时，我总是会问他们是否在服药。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3970','demanding','dɪ''mændɪŋ','dɪ''mændɪŋ','[adj] 苛求的， 难满足的； 需要高的， 费力的','a demanding job  高要求的工作'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3971','drill','drɪl','drɪl','[v] 钻，打眼；训练; [n] 钻； 训练','Drill a hole in each corner.  在每个角上钻一个孔。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3972','corollary','''kɔrəlɛri','''kɔːrəleri','[n] 必然的结果； 推断','The number of prisoners increased as a corollary of the government''s determination to combat violent crime.  政府决心打击暴力犯罪，其后果是囚犯数量增加了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3973','conjure','''kʌndʒɚ','''kʌndʒər','[v] 变魔术， 变戏法； 召唤','The magician conjured a rabbit out of his hat.  魔术师从帽子里变出一只兔子来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3974','acknowledge','ək''nɑlɪdʒ','ək''nɑːlɪdʒ','[v] 承认， 确认； 对…表示感谢','The family acknowledge the need for change.  全家人都承认需要改变一下。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3975','receptor','rɪ''sɛptɚ','rɪ''septər','[n] 感受器； 受体','...the information receptors in our brain.  …我们大脑中的信息感受器。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3976','dormant','''dɔrmənt','''dɔːrmənt','[adj] 静止的； 休眠的； 隐匿的','a huge dormant volcano  一座巨大的休眠火山'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3977','lobby','''lɑbi','''lɑːbi','[v] 游说; [n] 休息室，大厅；游说团','The Wilderness Society lobbied Congress to authorize the Endangered Species Act.  荒野协会游说国会批准《濒危物种法》。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3978','pulse','pʌls','pʌls','[n] 脉搏， 脉率； 脉冲','His breathing was shallow and his pulse was weak .  他呼吸很浅，脉搏微弱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3979','descriptive','dɪ''skrɪptɪv','dɪ''skrɪptɪv','[adj] 描述性的， 叙述的','the descriptive passages in the novel  小说中的描写性段落'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3980','reconstruction',',rikən''strʌkʃən','ˌriːkən''strʌkʃn','[n] 复兴； 改造， 再建','a reconstruction of a Roman villa  罗马别墅的重现'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3981','hereditary','hə''rɛdə''tɛri','hə''redɪteri','[adj] 遗传的； 可继承的， 世袭的','a hereditary peer  世袭贵族'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3982','stumble','''stʌmbl','''stʌmbl','[vi] 绊脚； 蹒跚而行； 结巴','In her hurry, she stumbled and spilled the milk all over the floor.  匆忙中她绊了一下，把牛奶洒得满地都是。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3983','lineage','''lɪnɪɪdʒ','''lɪniɪdʒ','[n] 宗系， 世系， 血统','a family of ancient lineage  古老世家'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3984','lighthearted','''lait''hɑ:tid','ˌlaɪt''hɑːrtɪd','[adj] 无忧无虑的； 愉快的','"He whistles as he goes, lighthearted wretch, /Cold and yet cheerful" (William Cowper).  他边走边吹口哨，无忧无虑的小家伙/寒冷但仍然很高兴“ （威廉姆·考珀）。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3985','hoard','hɔrd','hɔːrd','[v] 贮藏，囤积; [n] 储藏， 贮存','families who hoarded food during the strike  罢工期间囤积食品的家庭'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3986','vary','ˈveri','''veri','[v] 改变， 变化','Quentin’s mood seems to vary according to the weather.  昆廷的情绪似乎随天气而变化。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3987','coherent','ko''hɪrənt','kou''hɪrənt','[adj] 条理清楚的， 连贯的； 有表达能力的','The three years of the course are planned as a coherent whole.  这三年的课程是作为连贯的整体来安排的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3988','ledge','lɛdʒ','ledʒ','[n] 突出部分； 暗礁','From the base of the rock on which I stood, a moss-covered ledge stuck into deep water.  从我所站立的岩石的底部，一个满是苔藓的暗礁伸进深水里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3989','delta','''dɛltə','''deltə','[n] 三角洲； 希腊字母表的第四个字母','the Nile delta  尼罗河三角洲'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3990','episode','''ɛpɪsod','''epɪsoud','[n] 一段时期； 片段， 插曲； 一集','She decided she would try to forget the episode by the lake.  她决心尽量忘掉湖边的那次经历。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3991','infrared',',ɪnfrə''rɛd','ˌɪnfrə''red','[adj] 红外线的；产生红外线的; [n] 红外线','...searching with infrared scanners for weapons and artillery.  …用红外线扫描仪搜查武器和大炮。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3992','respondent','rɪ''spɑndənt','rɪ''spɑːndənt','[adj] 回答的; [n] 回答者，响应者；调查对象；被告','Only 62 percent of respondents said they were satisfied.  回复调查的人中只有62%表示满意。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3993','ponder','''pɑndɚ','''pɑːndər','[v] 思索， 沉思','He continued to ponder the problem as he walked home.  他一边往家走一边继续思考那个问题。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3994','animate','''ænɪmet','''ænɪmeɪt','[adj] 活的， 有生命的; [vt] 赋予生命， 使有活力','animate beings  生物'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3995','scene','sin','siːn','[n] 地点， 现场； 景色； 一场， 一个镜头； 场面； 活动领域， 圈子','I’m not into the club scene (= going to night clubs ) .  我不喜欢逛夜店。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3996','objective','əb''dʒɛktɪv','əb''dʒektɪv','[adj] 客观的; [n] 目标，目的','Scientists need to be objective when doing research.  科学家做研究时要客观。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3997','exert','ɪɡ''zɝt','ɪg''zɜːrt','[vt] 运用， 行使； 施加； 努力， 竭力','They exerted considerable influence within the school.  他们在校内施加了很大的影响力。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3998','scandal','''skændl','''skændl','[n] 丑事， 丑闻； 恶意诽谤， 流言蜚语； 可耻的行为','It caused quite a scandal when he left his wife.  他离开妻子成了一大丑闻。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_3999','dormancy','''dɔrmənsi','''dɔːrmənsɪ','[n] 休眠； 催眠状态； 隐匿',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4000','hinder','''hɪndɚ','''hɪndər','[vt] 阻碍， 妨碍','His career has been hindered by injury.  由于受伤，他的事业受到了阻碍。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4001','scent','sɛnt','sent','[n] 香味，香气；气味；踪迹，线索；香水; [vt] 闻出； 察觉','a yellow rose with a lovely scent  香气怡人的黄玫瑰'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4002','exhibit','ɪɡ''zɪbɪt','ɪg''zɪbɪt','[v] 陈列，展览；显示，表现; [n] 展览， 陈列','Her paintings have been exhibited all over the world.  她的绘画作品在世界各地展出。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4003','adjunct','''ædʒʌŋkt','''ædʒʌŋkt','[n] 附加物， 附件； 附加语， 修饰语',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4004','mushroom','''mʌʃrʊm','''mʌʃrum','[vi] 迅速成长; [n] 蘑菇','New housing developments mushroomed on the edge of town.  城郊新住宅区雨后春笋般地冒出来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4005','pinpoint','''pɪnpɔɪnt','''pɪnpɔɪnt','[adj] 准确的， 精确的; [vt] 精准定位；准确解释; [n] 极小的范围；光点','New satellites will allow cars to pinpoint their position within an inch .  新的卫星系统将让汽车精确他们的位置到每一英寸。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4006','altruistic',',æltrʊ''ɪstɪk','ˌæltru''ɪstɪk','[adj] 利他的， 无私心的， 为他人着想的','Were his motives entirely altruistic?  他的动机是完全无私的吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4007','extremity','ɪk''strɛməti','ɪk''streməti','[n] 末端； 极端， 极度','The committee was uncomfortable about the extremity of the proposal.  委员会因该建议太极端而感到不安。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4008','deny','dɪ''nai','dɪ''naɪ','[v] 否认； 拒绝承认； 拒绝给予','The government denied the existence of poverty among 16- and 17-year-olds.  政府否认十六七岁的青少年当中存在贫困问题。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4009','alchemist','''ælkəmɪst','''ælkəmɪst','[n] 炼金术士','Would you rather be an alchemist or a chemist?  那么，你想做一个炼金术士，还是一个化学家呢？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4010','trench','trɛntʃ','trentʃ','[v] 挖沟; [n] 沟渠，壕沟；战壕','Orders came that we should spade the trench in an hour.  有命令要我们必须在一小时内挖好战壕。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4011','miserable','''mɪzrəbl','''mɪzrəbl','[adj] 痛苦的； 可怜的； 令人不快的','I’ve been so miserable since Pat left me.  自从帕特离我而去后，我十分痛苦。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4012','subtract','səb''trækt','səb''trækt','[vt] 减去','Then the deal is that when you sell the house they subtract -you''ve got to pay this.  那么当你售出房子后，他们会从中减去，这个余额，这就是你要付给他们的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4013','dent','dɛnt','dent','[vt] 使凹下；挫伤，损害; [n] 缺口， 凹痕','The scandal has dented his reputation.  这桩丑闻损害了他的名誉。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4014','hurricane','ˈhʌrɪken','''hɜːrəkən','[n] 飓风， 暴风','I still remember a hurricane that hit us thirty years ago.  我还记得三十年前袭击我们的一次飓风。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4015','asthma','''æzmə','''æzmə','[n] 哮喘','Any illness of the lungs or throat , such as asthma or a cough.  消耗病，痨病肺部或喉咙的任何一种病变，如哮喘或咳嗽。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4016','hike','haɪk','haɪk','[v&n] 徒步旅行， 远足','a hike in the woods  林间远足'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4017','zigzag','''zɪɡzæɡ','''zɪgzæg','[vi] 曲折行进; [adj] 之字形的，弯弯曲曲的; [n] 之字形','The path zigzagged down the hillside.  小路沿着山坡蜿蜒而下。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4018','mission','''mɪʃən','''mɪʃn','[n] 代表团， 使团； 任务， 使命','He was sent on over 200 missions before being killed in action.  在阵亡之前他奉命执行过200多次军事任务。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4019','generalization',',dʒɛnrələ''zeʃən','ˌdʒenrəlaɪ''zeɪʃn','[n] 概括， 归纳','You can’t make generalizations about what men and women are like.  男人什么样，女人什么样，不能一概而论。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4020','biologist','baɪ''ɑlədʒɪst','baɪ''ɑːlədʒɪst','[n] 生物学家','This is that biologist having rescued her life.  这就是救了她生命的那个生物学家。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4021','rancher','''ræntʃɚ','''ræntʃər','[n] 牧场主； 大农场工人','...a cattle rancher.  ...一位养牛场场主。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4022','hustle','''hʌsl','''hʌsl','[v] 推搡，硬挤; [n] 忙碌；喧闹','the hustle and bustle of the marketplace  市场里的熙熙攘攘'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4023','mercantile','''mɝkəntɪl','''mɜːrkəntaɪl','[adj] 贸易的， 商业的； 重商主义的','mercantile law  商法'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4024','dosage','''dosɪdʒ','''dousɪdʒ','[n] 剂量','The daily dosage is steadily reduced over several weeks.  几周之内逐渐减少每日剂量。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4025','motor','''motɚ','''moutər','[adj] 机动的；肌肉运动的; [n] 发动机， 电动机','the motor industry  汽车工业'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4026','access','''æksɛs','''ækses','[n] 通道；接近，进入；机会; [vt] 进入； 使用； 存取','Access is by means of a small door on the right.  入口是右边的一扇小门。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4027','primitive','''prɪmətɪv','''prɪmətɪv','[adj] 原始的，远古的；简单的，粗糙的; [n] 原始人； 原始事物','a primitive society  原始社会'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4028','advisable','əd''vaɪzəbl','əd''vaɪzəbl','[adj] 可取的， 适当的； 明智的','Regular medical check-ups are advisable.  定期检查身体是明智的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4029','dormitory','''dɔrmətɔri','''dɔːrmətɔːri','[n] 宿舍','She lived in a college dormitory.  她住在一幢大学宿舍楼里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4030','hind','haɪnd','haɪnd','[adj] 后面的， 在后的','Suddenly the cow kicked up its hind legs.  突然奶牛踢起了后腿。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4031','overcome',',ovɚ''kʌm','ˌouvər''kʌm','[vt] 战胜， 克服','He struggled to overcome his shyness.  他努力克服自己的羞怯。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4032','sum','sʌm','sʌm','[v] 共计， 合计， 总计; [n] 和，总数；金额，数额；算术','He owes me a large sum of money .  他欠我一大笔钱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4033','stratigraphy','strə''tɪgrəfi','strə''tɪgrəfɪ','[n] 地层学； 地层中的岩石组成','Seismic stratigraphy - the study of stratigraphy and depositional facies as interpreted from seismic data.  地震地层学-- 按照地震资料解释进行地层学和沉积相的研究。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4034','obliterate','ə''blɪtə''ret','ə''blɪtəreɪt','[vt] 覆盖； 消灭； 忘却','Nothing could obliterate the memory of those tragic events.  那些悲惨事件的记忆是无法抹去的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4035','current','kɝ​ənt','''kɜːrənt','[adj] 现行的， 当前的； 流通的； 最近的; [n] 流；潮流，趋势','the current President  现任总统'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4036','bookstore','bʊkstɔr','''bukstɔːr','[n] 书店','I like to go bookstore on my spare time.  我喜欢在我的业余时间去书店。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4037','obligate','''ɑblɪ,ɡeɪt','''ɑːblɪgeɪt','[vt] 使负义务， 强迫','The ruling obligates airlines to release information about their flight delays.  这一裁决迫使航空公司公布航班晚点信息。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4038','democrat','''dɛməkræt','''deməkræt','[n] 民主主义者； [D-]民主党人','Murray has joined other Senate Democrats in blocking the legislation.  默里已经加入其他民主党参议员反对这项立法了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4039','angiosperm','''ændʒɪo,spɝm','''ændʒiouˌspɜːrm','[n] 被子植物','This latter statement finds support in contemporary works on angiosperm embryology.  后者这一说法，在当代被子植物胚胎学研究中获得了支持。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4040','audit','''ɔdɪt','''ɔːdɪt','[vt] 旁听； 审计','Each year they audit our accounts and certify them as being true and fair.  每年他们都会审核我们的账目，以证明其准确合理。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4041','cactus','''kæktəs','''kæktəs','[n] 仙人掌','We have to water this cactus once a month.  我们必须每月给仙人掌浇一次水。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4042','copper','''kɑpɚ','''kɑːpər','[n] 铜； 铜币','He offered to do the job for a few coppers.  他说他来做这份工作，给他几个铜板就行。'),
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO words (book_slug, slug, word, phonetic_us, phonetic_uk, meaning, example) VALUES,
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4043','audio','''ɔdɪo','''ɔːdiou','[adj] 音频的； 声音的','audio and video equipment  音频视频设备'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4044','patriarchy','''petrɪɑrki','''peɪtriɑːrki','[n] 父权制， 父系社会， 家长统治','The main cause of women''s and children''s oppression is patriarchy.  妇女及儿童受欺压的主要根源在于父权制度。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4045','incense','''ɪnsɛns','''ɪnsens','[n] 〔燃烧时发出怡人香味的〕香; [v] 使〔某人〕十分愤怒','a church filled with the smell of incense  充满焚香气味的教堂'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4046','offensive','ə''fɛnsɪv','ə''fensɪv','[adj] 攻击性的；冒犯的，使人不快的；攻方的; [n] 进攻， 攻击； 攻势','I found her remarks deeply offensive.  我觉得她的话令人非常恼火。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4047','texture','''tɛkstʃɚ','''tekstʃər','[n] 质地； 纹理； 结构','Matured over 18 months, this cheese has an open, crumbly texture with a strong flavour.  这种奶酪18个月后发酵成熟，气孔多，组织松脆，味道浓郁。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4048','amid','ə''mɪd','ə''mɪd','[prep] 在…中， 被…围绕','He sat amid the trees.  他坐在树丛中。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4049','launch','lɔntʃ','lɔːntʃ','[vt] 发动，发起；推出；使下水；','The organization has launched a campaign to raise $150,000.  为了筹集15万美元，该组织发起了一场募捐活动。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4050','silt','sɪlt','sɪlt','[v] 阻塞; [n] 淤泥','The lake was almost solid with silt and vegetation.  这个湖几乎填满了泥沙和植被。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4051','quell','kwɛl','kwel','[vt] 制止， 镇压； 缓解， 减轻','‘Jerry?’ she called, trying to quell the panic inside her.  “杰里？”她叫道，试图减轻内心的惊慌。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4052','understate','''ʌndɚ''stet','ˌʌndər''steɪt','[vt] 轻描淡写， 避重就轻地说','The press have tended to understate the extent of the problem.  媒体想淡化问题的严重程度。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4053','confirm','kən''fɝm','kən''fɜːrm','[vt] 证实； 使巩固； 批准','New evidence has confirmed the first witness’s story.  新的证据证实了第一个证人的说法。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4054','detectable','dɪ''tɛktəbl','dɪ''tektəbl','[adj] 可发觉的， 可察觉的','Doctors say the disease is probably inherited but not detectable at birth.  医生们说该疾病很可能是遗传的，但在出生时是不可发现的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4055','bud','bʌd','bʌd','[vi] 发芽， 萌芽; [n] 芽；蓓蕾','Without love, the best in the bud before killing!  得不到的爱情，最好在萌芽之前扼杀！'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4056','uppermost','''ʌpɚmost','''ʌpərmoust','[adv] 在最上面， 在最重要的位置; [adj] 最高的，最上面的；最重要的','Lastly comes the question which is uppermost in most minds, the most treacherous question of all—that of retaliation.  最后一个问题是在所有被关心问题中最重要的，也是最危险的——关于报复的问题。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4057','expeditious',',ɛkspə''dɪʃəs','ˌekspə''dɪʃəs','[adj] 迅速而有效的， 迅速完成的','The judge said that arbitration was a fair and expeditious decision-making process.  法官说仲裁是一个公正且迅速有效率的决定过程。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4058','gallop','''ɡæləp','''gæləp','[v] 飞奔， 疾驰','A neighbour’s horse came galloping the road, riderless.  一匹邻居家的马在路上飞奔，上面没人骑着。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4059','neoclassical',',nio''klæsɪkl','ˌniːou''klæsɪkl','[adj] 新古典主义的','a palace built in a neoclassical style  新古典主义风格的宫殿'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4060','mortality','mɔr''tæləti','mɔːr''tæləti','[n] 死亡率','Mortality from heart disease varies widely across the world.  心脏病死亡率世界各地差异很大。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4061','vast','væst','væst','[adj] 巨大的； 大量的； 范围广的','The refugees come across the border in vast numbers.  大量难民涌过边境。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4062','dissent','dɪ''sɛnt','dɪ''sent','[vi] 不同意，持异议; [n] 不同意见， 异议','There are some dissenting voices (= people who do not agree ) among the undergraduates.  大学生中有一些反对的呼声。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4063','symbol','''sɪmbl','''sɪmbl','[n] 符号， 标志； 象征','The symbol on the packet is a guarantee that the food has been produced organically.  包装盒上的这个标识保证这种食物是有机生产的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4064','ignite','ɪɡ''naɪt','ɪg''naɪt','[v] 点燃， 着火','The petrol tank suddenly ignited.  油箱突然着火了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4065','declare','dɪ''klɛr','dɪ''kler','[v] 表明； 断言， 声称； 申报','A state of emergency has been declared.  已宣布进入紧急状态。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4066','calamitous','kə''læmɪtəs','kə''læmɪtəs','[adj] 灾难性的','...the calamitous state of the country.  ...该国家的悲惨境况。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4067','available','ə''veləbl','ə''veɪləbl','[adj] 可得到的， 可找到的； 有空的','Tickets are available from the box office.  售票处有票出售。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4068','unequal','ʌn''ikwəl','ʌn''iːkwəl','[adj] 不同的， 不相等的； 不平等的， 不相称的； 不胜任的','an unequal contest  不公平的竞赛'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4069','confine','kən''faɪn','kən''faɪn','[vt] 限制； 禁闭','Vaughan is confined to a wheelchair .  沃恩离不开轮椅。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4070','advocate','ˈædvəkeɪt；-et','''ædvəkeɪt；-ət','[vt] 提倡; [n] 倡导者','Mr. Williams is a conservative who advocates fewer government controls on business.  威廉斯先生是一位提倡减少政府对商业的控制的保守人士。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4071','posthumous','''pɑstʃəməs','''pɑːstʃəməs','[adj] 死后的， 身后的','a posthumous collection of his articles  他身后出版的文集'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4072','horizontal','''hɔrə''zɑntl','ˌhɔːrə''zɑːntl','[adj] 水平的； 与地面平行的','a horizontal surface  水平面'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4073','consort','''kɑn,sɔrt','''kɒnsɔːt','[vi] 结交； 鬼混; [n] 配偶； 团伙','Aja The Babylonian dawn goddess and consort of the sun god.  巴比伦的黎明女神，太阳神的配偶。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4074','drawback','''drɔbæk','''drɔːbæk','[n] 缺点， 障碍， 不利条件； 退款， 退税','It’s a great city – the only drawback is the weather.  这是座很不错的城市，唯一的不足就是天气。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4075','missile','''mɪsl','''mɪsl','[n] 发射物； 导弹， 飞弹','a nuclear missile  核导弹'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4076','variant','''vɛrɪənt','''veriənt','[adj] 不同的， 变异的; [n] 变体，变形','Note that you must use the same variant of this option for all compiler runs related to the same project.  注意，对于所有运行的与同一个项目相关的编译器，必须使用这个选项的相同变体。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4077','generate','''dʒɛnəret','''dʒenəreɪt','[vt] 产生； 引起， 导致','a useful technique for generating new ideas  能产生新创意的有用技术'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4078','beaver','''bivɚ','''biːvər','[vi] 忙于; [n] 海狸； 海狸毛皮','...a coat with a huge beaver collar.  …一件带有大海狸毛皮领的大衣。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4079','passion','''pæʃən','''pæʃn','[n] 激情， 热情','The issue arouses strong passions .  那件事激起了人们强烈的情绪。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4080','extreme','ɪk''strim','ɪk''striːm','[adj] 极度的；极端的; [n] 极端','Extreme poverty still exists in many rural areas.  许多农村地区仍处于赤贫状态。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4081','anecdotal',',ænɪk''dotl','ˌænɪk''doutl','[adj] 轶话的， 逸闻趣事的','His findings are based on anecdotal evidence rather than serious research.  他的发现依据的是传闻轶事，而不是认真的调查研究。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4082','coordinate','ko''ɔrdɪnet','kəʊ''ɔ:dɪneɪt','[v] 协调， 相配合; [n] 同等物； 坐标','The agencies are working together to co-ordinate policy on food safety.  这些机构在共同合作为食品安全政策做协调工作。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4083','athlete','''æθlit','''æθliːt','[n] 运动员， 体育家','a professional athlete  一位专业运动员'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4084','despoil','dɪ''spɔɪl','dɪ''spɔɪl','[vt] 夺取， 掠夺； 蹂躏','...people who despoil the countryside.  ...掠夺乡村的人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4085','query','''kwɪri','''kwɪri','[v] 向…提问； 对…表示怀疑; [n] 疑问，问题','Both players queried the umpire’s decision.  两名球员都质疑裁判员的判罚。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4086','degree','dɪ''ɡri','dɪ''griː','[n] 程度； 度数； 学位； 等级','Preheat the oven to 425 degrees.  把烘箱预热至425度。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4087','dismal','''dɪzməl','''dɪzməl','[adj] 阴沉的， 阴郁的； 忧郁的， 沮丧的； 差劲的','The future looks pretty dismal right now.  目前前景似乎相当暗淡。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4088','vocalize','''vokə''laɪz','''voukəlaɪz','[v] 用言语表达； 说， 唱， 发声','Archbishop Hunthausen also vocalized his beliefs that women and homosexuals should be more active in the church.  大主教亨特豪森也阐述了他的想法：妇女和同性恋者应更积极地参与教堂事务。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4089','astronomy','ə''strɑnəmi','ə''strɑːnəmi','[n] 天文学','The book treats of astronomy.  这本书是讲天文学的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4090','ranch','ræntʃ','ræntʃ','[n] 大牧场， 饲养场','He lives on a cattle ranch in Texas.  他住在德克萨斯州的一个养牛的大牧场里。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4091','tube','tub','tjuːb','[n] 管； 管状物； 管状器官','pasta tubes  通心粉'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4092','discord','''dɪskɔrd','''dɪskɔːrd','[n] 不一致； 不和， 纷争； 不和谐','marital discord  婚姻不和'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4093','ripple','''rɪpl','''rɪpl','[v] 起涟漪； 扩散; [n] 细浪，涟漪','fields of grain rippling in the soft wind  和风中麦浪起伏的田野'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4094','dismay','dɪs''me','dɪs''meɪ','[vt] 使气馁，使沮丧；使诧异; [n] 灰心， 气馁； 诧异','The poor election turnout dismayed politicians.  投票人数少，政治家们感到失望。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4095','naval','''nevl','''neɪvl','[adj] 海军的','a naval officer  海军军官'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4096','hint','hɪnt','hɪnt','[v] 暗示， 示意; [n] 暗示，提示；','She hinted at the possibility of a treat of some sort.  她暗示可以找找乐子什么的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4097','myopic','maɪ''ɑpɪk','maɪ''oupiə','[adj] 近视的； 缺乏远见的','the government’s myopic attitude to environmental issues  政府对环境问题所持的短视态度'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4098','illegible','ɪ''lɛdʒəbl','ɪ''ledʒəbl','[adj] 难以辨认的， 模糊的','His handwriting is totally illegible.  他的字迹完全无法辨认。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4099','demonstrate','''dɛmən''stret','''demənstreɪt','[v] 论证， 证明； 表现， 显露； 示范， 演示； 游行示威','The study demonstrates the link between poverty and malnutrition.  这项研究证明了贫困与营养不良之间的联系。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4100','decompose',',dikəm''poz','ˌdiːkəm''pouz','[v] 分解； 腐烂','a partially decomposed body  部分腐烂的尸体'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4101','throng','θrɔŋ','θrɔːŋ','[v] 群集， 拥向; [n] 一大群人','Tourists thronged the bars and restaurants.  游客挤满了酒吧和餐馆。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4102','monument','''mɑnjumənt','''mɑːnjumənt','[n] 纪念碑； 历史遗迹','...a newly restored monument commemorating a 119-year-old tragedy.  …为纪念一起有着119年历史的惨剧而新修复的一座纪念碑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4103','inventory','''ɪnvəntɔri','''ɪnvəntɔːri','[n] 目录， 清单； 库存','...one inventory of twelve sails for each yacht.  …为每艘游艇配备12张帆的存货。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4104','saunter','''sɔntɚ','''sɔːntər','[vi&n] 闲逛， 漫步','We watched our fellow students saunter into the building.  我们看着同学们漫步走进了那栋楼。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4105','vivid','''vɪvɪd','''vɪvɪd','[adj] 清晰的； 鲜明的； 生动的； 活泼的','I’ve got vivid memories of that summer.  我对那年夏天记忆犹新。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4106','blues','bluz','bluːz','[n] 布鲁斯音乐， 蓝调','She combines jazz and blues in her music.  她的音乐融入了爵士和蓝调的元素。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4107','defecate','''dɛfəket','''defəkeɪt','[vi] 排便； 澄清','Fills me with the urge to defecate!  让我充满了要澄清一切的欲望！'),
