('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4109','virtue','''vɝtʃʊ','''vɜːrtʃuː','[n] 美德； 优点','Women have often been used as symbols of virtue.  女性常被用作美德的象征。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4110','coverage','''kʌvərɪdʒ','''kʌvərɪdʒ','[n] 新闻报道； 覆盖范围','live coverage of the match (= the match is broadcast at the same time that it is happening )  这场比赛的现场直播'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4111','perishable','''pɛrɪʃəbl','''perɪʃəbl','[adj] 易腐的， 易变质的','perishable goods such as butter, milk, fruit and fish  黄油、牛奶、水果和鱼等易变质的商品'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4112','gradual','''ɡrædʒuəl','''grædʒuəl','[adj] 逐渐的， 逐步的； 坡度平缓的， 不陡的','There has been a gradual change in climate.  气候渐渐发生了变化。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4113','figure','''fɪɡjɚ','''fɪgjər','[n] 身材，体形；轮廓；数字；图形，图表；人物，','She has a good figure .  她身材很好。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4114','corrupt','kə''rʌpt','kə''rʌpt','[adj] 堕落的，腐化的；腐败的，','Corrupt judges have taken millions of dollars in bribes.  腐败的法官接受了几百万美元的贿赂。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4115','commemorate','kə''mɛməret','kə''meməreɪt','[vt] 庆祝， 纪念','a parade to commemorate the town’s bicentenary  庆祝该镇建立200周年的游行'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4116','transmit','trænzˈmɪt','træns''mɪt','[v] 传送， 传递， 输送； 传播， 传染','The US Open will be transmitted live via satellite.  美国公开赛将通过卫星现场直播。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4117','consumption','kən''sʌmpʃən','kən''sʌmpʃn','[n] 消耗； 消费； 食用','Vigorous exercise increases oxygen consumption.  剧烈运动增加氧的消耗。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4118','repertory','''rɛpɚtɔri','''repərtɔːri','[n] 保留剧目； 保留剧目轮演； 库存， 储备； 仓库','a repertory company  轮演剧目剧团'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4119','hazel','''hezl','''heɪzl','[n] 榛树; [adj] 〔眼睛〕绿褐色的','Then on to our old haunt, the hazel grove.  接着，到我们经常去的小榛树林。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4120','voltage','''voltɪdʒ','''voultɪdʒ','[n] 电压， 伏特数','The systems are getting smaller and using lower voltages.  这些系统正变得更小而且使用更低的电压。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4121','vaccine','væk''sin','væk''siːn','[n] 疫苗','a polio vaccine  小儿麻痹症疫苗'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4122','zest','zɛst','zest','[n] 趣味； 热情， 狂热','The danger of being caught added a certain zest to the affair.  被捉奸的危险为这件风流韵事增添了一些刺激性。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4123','drought','draʊt','draut','[n] 干旱， 旱灾','...a country where drought and famines have killed up to two million people during the last eighteen years.  …过去18年来干旱和饥荒致死达两百万人的一个国家。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4124','periodical',',pɪrɪ''ɑdɪkl','ˌpɪri''ɑːdɪkl','[adj] 周期的， 定期的; [n] 期刊，杂志','She made periodical visits to her dentist.  她定期去看牙医。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4125','bluff','blʌf','blʌf','[v] 虚张声势，吓唬; [adj] 直率的， 坦率的; [n] 悬崖，峭壁；虚张声势，唬人','You wouldn’t really tell her. You’re bluffing!  你不会真的告诉她吧，你在吓唬我！'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4126','punctual','''pʌŋtʃʊəl','''pʌŋktʃuəl','[adj] 守时的','She’s always very punctual for appointments.  她一向准时赴约。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4127','compromise','''kɑmprəmaɪz','''kɑːmprəmaɪz','[n&v] 妥协， 折中','Compromise is an inevitable part of marriage.  妥协是婚姻生活中必不可少的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4128','advertise','''ædvɚtaɪz','''ædvərtaɪz','[vt] 为…做广告， 宣传； 公告， 公布','They no longer advertise alcohol or cigarettes at sporting events.  他们不再在体育赛事上做烟酒广告了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4129','yogurt','''joɡət','''jougərt','[n] 酸奶','If you like cottage cheese, add some fruit and/or yogurt!  如果你喜欢农家鲜干酪，那就加些水果和酸奶吧！'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4130','comparative','kəm''pærətɪv','kəm''pærətɪv','[adj] 比较的；比较级的；相对的; [n] 比较级','After a lifetime of poverty, his last few years were spent in comparable comfort.  他穷了一辈子，最后几年还算过得比较舒适。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4131','hesitant','''hɛzɪtənt','''hezɪtənt','[adj] 犹豫的， 吞吞吐吐的， 犹豫不定的','Gail gave me a hesitant little smile.  盖尔迟疑地对我微微一笑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4132','feedback','''fidbæk','''fiːdbæk','[n] 反馈； 反馈信息','How can I provide feedback without making someone angry?  我怎样才能提出反馈意见又不会得罪人呢？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4133','folklore','''foklɔr','''fouklɔːr','[n] 民间传说； 民俗学','In Chinese folklore the bat is a symbol of good fortune.  在中国民间传说中，蝙蝠是好运的象征。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4134','credential','krə''dɛnʃl','krə''denʃl','[n] 证书； 文凭； 资格',''),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4135','justify','''dʒʌstə''fai','''dʒʌstɪfaɪ','[v] 证明…是正当的； 为…辩护','Ministers must appear before Parliament and justify their actions.  大臣们必须就自己的行为向议会作出解释。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4136','review','rɪ''vju','rɪ''vjuː','[vt&n] 审查； 复习； 回顾； 评论； 检阅','The policy comes up for review (= will be reviewed ) in April.  这项政策将在4月份予以审议。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4137','entrench','ɪn''trɛntʃ','ɪn''trentʃ','[vt] 使根深蒂固， 牢固确立','...a series of measures designed to entrench democracy and the rule of law.  …一系列旨在巩固民主和法制的举措。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4138','timber','''tɪmbɚ','''tɪmbər','[n] 木材， 木料','a bench made of timber  木制长椅'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4139','roam','rom','roum','[vi] 漫游，漫步，闲逛; [n] 漫步， 漫游','Chickens and geese roam freely in the back yard.  鸡和鹅在后院随意溜达。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4140','simulate','''sɪmjulet','''sɪmjuleɪt','[vt] 模仿， 模拟； 假装， 伪装','a machine that simulates conditions in space  一台模拟太空环境的机器'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4141','tenet','''tɛnɪt','''tenɪt','[n] 原则； 信条； 教义','Non-violence and patience are the central tenets of their faith.  非暴力和忍耐是他们信仰的基本原则。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4142','spectacle','''spɛktəkl','''spektəkl','[n] 精彩的表演；壮观的场面；奇观；壮丽的景象；','a multimedia dance and opera spectacle  盛大的多媒体舞蹈戏剧表演'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4143','efficiency','ɪˈfɪʃənsɪ','ɪ''fɪʃnsi','[n] 效率， 功效','considerable advancements in energy efficiency  能源效率的显著提高'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4144','ethnic','''ɛθnɪk','''eθnɪk','[adj] 种族的； 民族的','The school teaches pupils from different ethnic groups.  该校教授不同种族的小学生。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4145','lettuce','''lɛtɪs','''letɪs','[n] 生菜； 莴苣','Do you like lettuce in sandwiches?  你喜欢在三明治里放生菜吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4146','intact','ɪn''tækt','ɪn''tækt','[adj] 无损伤的， 完整的','Only the medieval tower had remained intact.  只有这座中世纪塔楼保存完好。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4147','motto','''mɑto','''mɑːtou','[n] 座右铭； 箴言， 格言','‘Be prepared’ is the motto of the Boy Scouts.  “时刻准备着”是童子军的格言。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4148','juvenile','''dʒʊvənaɪl','''dʒuːvənl','[adj] 幼稚的， 不成熟的； 少年的， 未成年的; [n] 幼体；未成年人，少年','juvenile crime  少年犯罪'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4149','pervasive','pɚ''vesɪv','pər''veɪsɪv','[adj] 普遍深入的； 遍及的， 弥漫的','the pervasive influence of television  电视无所不在的影响'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4150','tableland','''tebllænd','''teɪbllænd','[n] 高原， 台地','The forests have changed into bare little hills; the riverbed has become a high tableland.  森林变成了光秃秃的浅山，河床变成了高高的台地。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4151','hive','haɪv','haɪv','[v] 入蜂箱；群居; [n] 蜂箱， 蜂房； 闹市， 忙碌之地','This marketplace was once a hive of activity.  这个市场曾经熙熙攘攘。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4152','laborious','lə''bɔrɪəs','lə''bɔːriəs','[adj] 艰苦的， 费力的， 艰难的； 勤劳的','the laborious business of drying the crops  把收获的庄稼晒干这一艰苦的工作'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4153','flag','flæg','flæg','[v] 标记; [n] 旗帜；标记','I’ve flagged the parts I want to comment on.  我已经标示出我要评论的部分。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4154','racing','''resɪŋ','''reɪsɪŋ','[adj] 比赛的; [n] 比赛， 竞赛','racing pigeons  赛鸽'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4155','sympathetic',',sɪmpə''θɛtɪk','ˌsɪmpə''θetɪk','[adj] 感应的， 交感的； 有同情心的； 体谅的','a sympathetic friend  一个有同情心的朋友'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4156','freight','fret','freɪt','[n] 货运；运费; [vt] 运送， 货运； 使充满','freight services  货运公司'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4157','wear','wɛr','wer','[v] 穿，戴；留；面露，面带；磨损，用旧; [n] 穿戴， 衣着； 服装， 穿戴物； 磨损， 损坏','Susanna was wearing a black silk dress.  苏珊娜穿着一条黑色真丝连衣裙。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4158','botany','''bɑtəni','''bɑːtəni','[n] 植物学； 植物','He studied botany at university.  他在大学学习植物学。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4159','range','rendʒ','reɪndʒ','[v] 变动； 散布； 漫游; [n] 范围；山脉；一系列；射程，距离','They range in price from $3 to $15.  它们的价格在$3到$15之间变化。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4160','topsoil','''tɑp''sɔɪl','''tɑːpsɔɪl','[n] 表层土','The topsoil has been almost completely washed away.  表层土壤已差不多完全给冲走了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4161','aurora','','ɔː''rɔːrə','[n] 极光','The light creates the aurora that we see.  这些光亮造就了我们所看到的极光。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4162','glamorous','''glæmərəs','''glæmərəs','[adj] 富有魅力的， 迷人的','She led an exciting and glamorous life.  她生活奢华，充满刺激。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4163','disprove',',dɪs''pruv','ˌdɪs''pruːv','[vt] 证明…不成立， 证明…是错误的','These figures disproved Smith’s argument.  这些数据证明史密斯的论点是错误的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4164','derive','dɪ''raɪv','dɪ''raɪv','[v] 取得； 起源','Mr. Ying is one of those happy people who derive pleasure from helping others.  英先生是那种助人为乐的快活人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4165','overseas',',ovɚ''siz','ˌouvər''siːz','[adv] 在海外，在国外; [adj] 海外的， 国外的','Chris is going to work overseas.  克里斯要去国外工作。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4166','leak','lik','liːk','[v] 漏，渗出，泄漏; [n] 漏洞， 裂缝； 泄露； 走漏','The roof is leaking.  屋顶在漏水。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4167','complacence','kəm''plesns','kəm''pleɪsns','[n] 自满， 满足','She made no further progress because of complacence.  由于自满，她没有取得进一步进展。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4168','assert','ə''sɝt','ə''sɜːrt','[v] 断言， 声称','French cooking, she asserted, is the best in the world.  她坚称法国菜是世界上最好的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4169','recall','''rikɔl','rɪ''kɔːl','[v] 回忆起，回想起；召回，叫回；收回，撤销; [n] 记忆力， 记性； 召回','You don’t happen to recall his name, do you?  你不会恰巧还想得起他的名字吧？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4170','flap','flæp','flæp','[n] 拍打；振翅；封盖，','the flap of the sails  船帆的拍动'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4171','leap','lip','liːp','[vi] 跳跃； 急速行动； 骤变； 激增; [n] 跳跃；骤变；激增','He leapt 27 places to second spot.  他上升了27位，跃居第二名。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4172','regular','''rɛgjəlɚ','''regjələr','[adj] 规则的， 有规律的； 整齐的， 匀称的； 频繁的， 经常的； 正常的； 经常的； 正规的， 正式的','The company holds regular meetings with employees.  公司定期召集雇员开会。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4173','glacial','''ɡleʃl','''gleɪʃl','[adj] 冰川期的， 冰河时代的； 寒冷的， 冰冷的； 冷若冰霜的','a glacial valley  冰川谷'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4174','picturesque',',pɪktʃə''rɛsk','ˌpɪktʃə''resk','[adj] 如画的； 别致的； 生动的','a quiet fishing village with a picturesque harbour  拥有一座美丽港口的宁静渔村'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4175','informed','ɪn''fɔrmd','ɪn''fɔːrmd','[adj] 有学识的； 见多识广的， 有见识的','Informed sources said it was likely that the president would make a televised statement.  据消息灵通人士说，总统可能会发表电视声明。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4176','dispute','''dɪs''pjʊt','dɪ''spjuːt','[v] 争论； 对…表示异议; [n] 争论；纠纷','The main facts of the book have never been disputed.  书中的主要事实从未遭到质疑。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4177','aggression','ə''ɡrɛʃən','ə''greʃn','[n] 侵略； 敌对的情绪或行为','an unprovoked act of aggression  无端的侵犯'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4178','refurbish',',ri''fɝbɪʃ','ˌriː''fɜːrbɪʃ','[vt] 再装修， 重新装饰','We have spent money on refurbishing the offices.  我们已在这些办公室的翻新上花了钱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4179','rugged','''rʌɡɪd','''rʌgɪd','[adj] 崎岖的， 凹凸不平的； 艰难的； 粗犷的； 结实的， 耐用的； 粗野的， 不文雅的','a rugged coastline  崎岖不平的海岸线'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4180','lead','lid; lɛd','liːd','[v] 领导，引导；领先，占首位；通向，导致，','The president and vice president led the mourners.  总统和副总统带领着送葬人群。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4181','fraction','''frækʃən','''frækʃn','[n] 小部分， 一点儿， 少许','She hesitated for a fraction of a second before responding.  她犹豫了一下才回应。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4182','token','''tokən','''toukən','[adj] 象征性的; [n] 表示，标志，象征；记号；信物；代币；礼券，代价券','A small token payment will keep the bank happy.  象征性地付点钱，银行就会满意了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4183','filter','''fɪltɚ','''fɪltər','[v] 过滤；筛选；走漏；渗入，透过; [n] 过滤器； 筛选','The water in the tank is constantly filtered.  鱼缸里的水在不停地被过滤。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4184','expect','ɪk''spɛkt','ɪk''spekt','[v] 预期， 期望， 指望','He will be hard to beat. I fully expect (= am completely sure about ) that and I’m ready.  他很难击败。我确信这一点，不过我准备好了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4185','emotion','ɪ''moʃən','ɪ''mouʃn','[n] 感情， 激情， 情绪','Her voice was full of emotion.  她的声音充满了激情。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4186','soothe','sʊð','suːð','[vt] 缓和， 减轻； 抚慰， 安慰','Lucy soothed the baby by rocking it in her arms.  露西把宝宝抱在怀里摇晃着，让他安静下来。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4187','cease','sis','siːs','[v&n] 结束， 终止， 停止','The things people will do for charity never cease to amaze me (= I am always surprised by them ) .  人们的慈善义举总是让我感到惊讶。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4188','assess','ə''sɛs','ə''ses','[vt] 估价； 评定','The test was to assess aptitude rather than academic achievement.  该测试将评估能力而不是学业成绩。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4189','etiquette','''ɛtɪkɛt','''etɪket','[n] 礼节， 礼仪','strict rules of professional etiquette  严格的行规'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4190','prescription','prɪ''skrɪpʃən','prɪ''skrɪpʃn','[n] 处方， 药方； 开处方， 开药方','We are trying to cut the price of prescription drugs .  我们正努力降低处方药的价格。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4191','spectator','''spɛktetɚ','''spekteɪtər','[n] 观众； 旁观者','The match attracted over 40,000 spectators.  这场比赛吸引了四万多名观众。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4192','submission','səb''mɪʃən','səb''mɪʃn','[n] 屈服， 服从； 提交， 呈递； 提交物； 看法， 意见','The deadline for the submission of proposals is May 1st.  呈交提案的最后期限是 5 月 1 日。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4193','scarce','skɛrs','skers','[adj] 缺乏的； 稀有的， 罕见的','Food was often scarce in the winter.  冬季常常粮食短缺。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4194','obsess','əb''sɛs','əb''ses','[v] 迷住； 牵挂','Sometimes the best thing you can do is not think, not wonder, not imagine, not obsess. Just breathe, and have faith that everything will work out for the best.  有时候你能做的最好的事情就是不去想、不去怀疑，不去想象，不去牵挂。只呼吸，并相信一切都会得到最佳结果。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4195','utter','''ʌtɚ','''ʌtər','[adj] 完全的; [vt] 出声；说','That’s utter nonsense!  真是一派胡言！'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4196','adequate','ˈædɪkwət','''ædɪkwət','[adj] 适当的； 足够的； 适当的， 胜任的','One in four people worldwide are without adequate homes.  世界上1/4的人没有足够的住房。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4197','fauna','''fɔnə','''fɔːnə','[n] 动物群','...the flora and fauna of the African jungle.  …非洲丛林的植物群和动物群。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4198','uniformity',',jʊnə''fɔrməti','ˌjuːnɪ''fɔːməti','[n] 同样， 一致； 一致性','There seems to be no uniformity among the various systems.  各系统之间似乎没有统一性。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4199','bustle','''bʌsl','''bʌsl','[vi] 奔忙， 匆匆忙忙; [n] 忙乱嘈杂，喧嚣','My mother bustled around the kitchen.  我母亲在厨房里忙得团团转。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4200','dozen','''dʌzn','''dʌzn','[n] 一打， 十二个','a dozen eggs  一打鸡蛋'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4201','tremendous','trə''mɛndəs','trə''mendəs','[adj] 惊人的； 巨大的','Suddenly, there was a tremendous bang, and the whole station shook.  突然一声巨响，整个车站都晃动了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4202','condense','kən''dɛns','kən''dens','[v] 压缩； 凝结','the mist which condensed on every cold surface  每个冰冷的表面上凝结的水汽'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4203','substantiate','səb''stænʃɪet','səb''stænʃieɪt','[vt] 证实， 证明','Katzen offered little evidence to substantiate his claims .  卡曾拿不出什么证据来证明他的说法。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4204','divert','dɪˈvɚt','daɪ''vɜːrt','[vt] 转移…的注意力， 使分心； 使娱乐； 使转向， 使改道','The high street is closed and traffic is being diverted .  大街封闭，车辆正改道而行。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4205','hygiene','''haɪdʒin','''haɪdʒiːn','[n] 卫生； 卫生学','the importance of personal hygiene  个人卫生的重要性'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4206','sage','sedʒ','seɪdʒ','[adj] 贤明的；审慎的; [n] 智者， 圣人','sage advice  明智的忠告'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4207','tycoon','taɪ''kun','taɪ''kuːn','[n] 巨头， 大亨','...a self-made Irish-American property tycoon.  …一个靠自己奋斗成功的爱尔兰裔美国房地产大亨。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4208','conspicuous','kən''spɪkjʊəs','kən''spɪkjuəs','[adj] 显眼的， 明显的','The notice must be displayed in a conspicuous place.  通告一定要贴在显眼的地方。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4209','justice','''dʒʌstɪs','''dʒʌstɪs','[n] 法官； 司法； 正义， 公正','No one doubts the justice of our cause.  没有人怀疑我们的事业是正义的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4210','verse','vɝs','vɜːrs','[n] 诗歌； 韵文； 诗节','Let’s sing the last verse again.  我们把最后一节再唱一遍吧。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4211','furious','''fjʊrɪəs','''fjuriəs','[adj] 狂怒的， 狂暴的； 强烈的， 猛烈的','She was absolutely furious .  她怒不可遏。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4212','individual','ˌɪndəˈvɪdʒʊəl','ˌɪndɪ''vɪdʒuəl','[adj] 单独的；独特的; [n] 个人， 个体','Each individual leaf on the tree is different.  树上每片叶子都不相同。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4213','salmon','''sæmən','''sæmən','[n] 鲑鱼， 大马哈鱼','He gave them a splendid lunch of smoked salmon.  他款待了他们一顿极好的熏三文鱼午餐。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4214','bouquet','bu''ke','bu''keɪ','[n] 花束； 香味， 芬芳','The woman carried a bouquet of dried violets.  那个女子拿着一束干紫罗兰花。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4215','instinctual','ɪn''stɪŋktʃuəl','ɪn''stɪŋktʃuəl','[adj] 本能的','The relationship between a parent and a child is instinctual and stems from basic human nature.  父母与孩子之间的关系是本能的，源于人类的本性。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4216','constrain','kən''stren','kən''streɪn','[vt] 束缚， 限制','Poor soil has constrained the level of crop production.  贫瘠的土地限制了农作物的产量。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4217','empress','''ɛmprəs','''emprəs','[n] 女皇， 皇后','Yuena is Rome empress, while the Romans worshiped her as the God of women and marriage.  约娜是罗马众神的皇后，罗马人同时将她尊奉为妇女和婚姻之神。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4218','informant','ɪn''fɔrmənt','ɪn''fɔːrmənt','[n] 提供消息或情报的人， 线人； 提供资料的人； 合作者','One of the witnesses was a paid informant for the FBI.  目击者之一是联邦调查局出钱雇用的线人。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4219','tendon','''tɛndən','''tendən','[n] 腱','...a torn tendon in his right shoulder.  …他右肩一根被拉伤的腱。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4220','interim','''ɪntərɪm','''ɪntərɪm','[adj] 暂时的， 过渡的; [n] 间歇，过渡期间','an interim report  中期报告'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4221','testimony','''tɛstə''moni','''testɪmouni','[n] 证词； 证据， 证明','Barker’s testimony is crucial to the prosecution’s case.  巴克的证词对控方的指控起到了关键作用。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4222','enforce','ɪn''fɔrs','ɪn''fɔːrs','[vt] 实施， 生效， 执行； 强迫， 迫使','Parking restrictions will be strictly enforced.  停车限制将会严格执行。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4223','glitter','''ɡlɪtɚ','''glɪtər','[vi] 闪烁，闪耀; [n] 灿烂的光辉； 诱惑力， 魅力','The river glittered in the sunlight.  阳光下河面波光粼粼。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4224','destined','''dɛstɪnd','''destɪnd','[adj] 注定的； 以…为目的地的','The flight was destined for Cairo.  本次航班飞往开罗。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4225','fragile','''frædʒəl','''frædʒl','[adj] 易碎的； 脆弱的； 纤巧的； 虚弱的','Be careful with that vase – it’s very fragile.  小心那只花瓶——很容易打碎的。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4226','painstaking','''penztekɪŋ','''peɪnzteɪkɪŋ','[adj] 煞费苦心的， 勤勉的','The work had been done with painstaking attention to detail.  这项工作被一丝不苟地完成了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4227','sociology',',sosɪ''ɑlədʒi','ˌsousi''ɑːlədʒi','[n] 社会学','Basic courses in sociology and psychology as well as other humanities courses give students plenty of opportunity to explore their own emotions.  社会学和心理学的基础，以及其他人文学科的课程，赋予学生大量的机会去探索其个人情感。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4228','stout','staʊt','staut','[adj] 结实的， 强壮的； 肥胖的； 顽强的','a short, stout man  一个矮胖的男人'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4229','gigantic','dʒaɪ''ɡæntɪk','dʒaɪ''gæntɪk','[adj] 巨大的， 庞大的','a gigantic skyscraper  摩天大楼'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4230','distinct','dɪ''stɪŋkt','dɪ''stɪŋkt','[adj] 明显的， 清楚的； 确实的； 截然不同的','two entirely distinct languages  两种完全不同的语言'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4231','forage','''fɔrɪdʒ','''fɔːrɪdʒ','[vi] 觅食；搜寻; [n] 草料， 饲料','In the summer, the goats forage freely (= in any place they want to go ) .  夏天，羊群自由自在地觅食。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4232','nomadic','nəu''mædik, nɔ-','nou''mædɪk','[adj] 游牧的； 流浪的','nomadic herdsmen  游牧民'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4233','geology','dʒɪ''ɑlədʒi','dʒi''ɑːlədʒi','[n] 地质学； 地质概况','He was visiting professor of geology at the University of Georgia.  他曾是佐治亚大学的地质学客座教授。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4234','hedge','hɛdʒ','hedʒ','[v] 用篱笆围； 避免直接回答; [n] 树篱；防止损失的措施；防备','You’re hedging again - have you got the money or haven’t you?  你又在闪烁其词了，你究竟有没有钱？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4235','dragonfly','ˈdrægənˌflaɪ','''drægənflaɪ','[n] 蜻蜓','It looks like a blue dragonfly.  它看上去像只蓝色蜻蜓。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4236','aware','ə''wɛr','ə''wer','[adj] 知道的； 意识到的','Mr Braley has been made aware of the need for absolute secrecy.  布雷利先生被告知需要绝对保密。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4237','eligible','''ɛlɪdʒəbl','''elɪdʒəbl','[adj] 符合条件的， 合格的； 适合的','Stephen was regarded as an eligible bachelor.  斯蒂芬被认为是一个钻石王老五。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4238','alarm','ə''lɑrm','ə''lɑːrm','[n] 闹钟；警报; [vt] 使惊恐； 使担心','I forgot to set the burglar alarm.  我忘记打开防盗警报器了。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4239','weed','wid','wiːd','[n] 杂草； 水草','the constant battle against weeds  对付杂草的长期斗争'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4240','Babylonian',',bæbi''ləunjən','ˌbæbɪ''ləunɪən','[adj] 巴比伦的；奢华的; [n] 巴比伦人','So too the stories of Moses and of Samson have Sumerian and Babylonian parallels.  同样，关于摩西和参孙的传说在苏美尔和巴比伦也有相似的版本。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4241','glacier','''ɡleʃɚ','''gleɪʃər','[n] 冰川， 冰河','Do you think we can glide down this glacier?  你觉得我们可以从冰河上滑行下去吗？'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4242','ultimatum',',ʌltɪ''metəm','ˌʌltɪ''meɪtəm','[n] 最后通牒','The club gave him an ultimatum – either he apologized, or he would be expelled from the team.  俱乐部给他下了最后通牒——要么道歉，要么等着被开除出队。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4243','horde','hɔrd','hɔːrd','[n] 一大群人； 游牧部落','This attracts hordes of tourists to Las Vegas.  这吸引了一群群的旅客来到拉斯维加斯。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4244','rainfall','''ren''fɔl','''reɪnfɔːl','[n] 降雨； 降雨量','We’ve had a long period of low rainfall.  我们已有很长一段时间雨量偏低。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4245','racism','''resɪzəm','''reɪsɪzəm ','[n] 种族主义， 种族歧视','The government has promised to continue the fight against racism.  政府已承诺继续打击种族歧视。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4246','orientation','orɪɛn''teʃən','ˌɔːriən''teɪʃn','[n] 方向， 方位； 定位； 培训； 情况介绍','The party has a broadly socialist orientation.  该政党大体上倾向于社会主义。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4247','luxurious','lʌɡ''ʒʊrɪəs','lʌg''ʒuriəs','[adj] 奢侈的， 奢华的','a luxurious 30-room villa  一栋有30个房间的豪华度假别墅'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4248','motion','''moʃən','''mouʃn','[v] 做动作， 示意; [n] 运动，移动；动作；提议，动议','She motioned for the locked front doors to be opened.  她打手势示意把锁着的前门打开。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4249','idle','''aɪdl','''aɪdl','[adj] 懒散的；没有工作的，闲散的；空闲的；漫无目的的；无用的，无效的; [v] 无所事事， 虚度','I cannot afford to leave the land lying idle.  我不能让土地闲置。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4250','plight','plaɪt','plaɪt','[n] 困境， 苦境','the country’s economic plight  该国的经济困境'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4251','match','mætʃ','mætʃ','[v] 匹配; [n] 比赛；对手','We painted the cabinets green to match the rug.  我们把柜子刷成绿色，和地毯相配。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4252','fault','fɔlt','fɔːlt','[n] 过错， 过失； 缺点， 弱点； 断层','I’m really sorry - it’s all my fault.  我真的很抱歉——都是我的错。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4253','interplay',',ɪntɚ''plɛi','''ɪntərpleɪ','[n&vi] 相互作用， 相互影响','...the interplay of political, economic, social and cultural factors.  ...政治、经济，社会和文化因素的互相影响。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4254','hail','hel','heɪl','[v] 招呼； 高呼； 赞扬， 称颂； 下冰雹; [n] 冰雹；一阵','She leaned out of the window and hailed a passerby.  她探出窗户向一个路人大喊。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4255','accent','''æksɛnt','''æks(ə)nt; -sent','[n] 重音； 口音； 重音符号; [vt] 重读','He had a strong Irish accent  他有浓重的爱尔兰口音。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4256','passive','''pæsɪv','''pæsɪv','[adj] 被动的， 消极的； 被动语态的','Kathy seems to take a very passive role in the relationship.  凯茜在这一关系中似乎扮演着十分被动的角色。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4257','nauseous','''nɔʃəs','''nɔːʃəs','[adj] 恶心的； 令人作呕的， 令人厌恶的','I felt slightly nauseous.  我觉得有点恶心。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4258','fragment','''fræɡmənt','''frægm(ə)nt','[v] 分裂， 成碎片; [n] 碎片， 断片','the dangers of fragmenting the Health Service  医疗保健服务分崩离析的危险'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4259','granite','''grænɪt','''grænɪt','[n] 花岗岩， 花岗石','A pile of sand is loose, but it mixed with cement, stone, water, the toughness than granite.  一堆沙子是松散的，可是它和水泥、石子、水混合后，比花岗岩还坚韧。——王杰。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4260','response','rɪ''spɑns','rɪ''spɑːns','[n] 回答； 反应， 响应','His immediate response was one of disbelief.  他的第一反应是不相信。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4261','refreshing','ri''frɛʃɪŋ','rɪ''freʃɪŋ','[adj] 使人耳目一新的； 提神的， 使人精神振作的','It made a refreshing change to talk to someone new.  和刚认识的人谈话感觉很新鲜。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4262','oblivious','ə''blɪvɪəs','ə''blɪviəs','[adj] 遗忘的； 未注意的， 不知不觉的','She lay motionless where she was, oblivious to pain.  她一动不动地躺在原地，感觉不到疼痛。'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4263','category','''kætəɡɔri','''kætəgɔːri','[n] 种类； 范畴','people in the over-45 age category  属45岁以上年龄组的人'),
('TOEFL_3','TOEFL_3_4264','rival','''raɪvl','''raɪvl','[adj] 竞争的， 对抗的; [vt] 与…相匹敌，比得上; [n] 竞争对手','He is, in effect, my rival.  实际上他是我的竞争对手。'),
('CET6_1','CET6_1_1','abandonment','ə''bændənmənt','əˈbændənmənt','[n] 放弃','...memories of her father''s complete abandonment of her.  …她父亲对她的彻底抛弃的那些记忆。'),
('CET6_1','CET6_1_2','abnormally','','æb''nɔ:məlɪ','[adv] 不正常的','Both were big at birth but were not abnormally large.  这两个孩子出生时都比较大，但并非异常的大。'),
('CET6_1','CET6_1_3','absolutely','''æbsəlutli','ˈæbsəlu:tli','[adv] 当然','‘Do you let your kids travel alone at night?’ ‘Absolutely not!’  “你会让孩子们晚上单独外出吗？”“当然不行！”'),
('CET6_1','CET6_1_4','abstract','''æbstrækt','''æbstrækt','[adj] 抽象的','By the age of seven, children are capable of thinking in abstract terms .  儿童到了七岁就具有抽象思维的能力。'),
('CET6_1','CET6_1_5','abuse','ə''bjus','ə''bju:s','[n] 虐待; [v] 滥用','several cases of child abuse  数宗虐待儿童案'),
('CET6_1','CET6_1_6','accelerate','əkˈsɛləˌret','ək''seləreɪt','[v] 加速','measures to accelerate the rate of economic growth  加快经济增长速度的措施'),
