('ChuZhongluan_2','ChuZhongluan_2_508','supper','''sʌpɚ','''sʌpə','[n] 晚餐，晚饭；夜宵','Why don’t you come over for supper on Friday?  周五为什么不过来吃晚饭呢？'),
