('SAT_2','SAT_2_440','gloomy','''ɡlumi','''gluːmɪ','[adj] 黑暗的；沮丧的；阴郁的','The report paints a gloomy picture of the economy.  这篇报告描绘了一幅惨淡的经济现状。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_441','implausible','ɪm''plɔzəbl','ɪm''plɔːzɪb(ə)l','[adj] 难以置信的，不像真实的','It’s not entirely implausible that a galaxy could be identical to our own.  某个星系和我们这个星系完全相同并非完全不可能。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_442','espouse','ɪ''spaʊz','ɪ''spaʊz; e-','[v] 支持；嫁娶；赞成；信奉','She ran away with him to Mexico and espoused the revolutionary cause.  她与他一起逃到了墨西哥，支持革命事业。'),
