('SAT_2','SAT_2_735','apparent','ə''pærənt','ə''pær(ə)nt','[adj] 显然的；表面上的','He did well in his exams, despite his apparent lack of interest in his work.  他考得很好，尽管表面上他对功课不感兴趣。'),
