('SAT_2','SAT_2_752','admittance','əd''mɪtns','əd''mɪt(ə)ns','[n] 进入；入场权；通道','Gaining admittance to the club was no easy matter.  获准进入那家俱乐部并非易事。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_753','ductile','''dʌktaɪl','''dʌktaɪl','[adj] 柔软的；易教导的；易延展的',''),
