('SAT_2','SAT_2_763','juxtaposition',',dʒʌkstəpə''zɪʃən',',dʒʌkstəpə''zɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 并置，并列；毗邻','This juxtaposition of brutal reality and lyrical beauty runs through Park''s stories.  残酷的现实和抒情诗般的美并存贯穿于帕克的故事之中。'),
