('SAT_2','SAT_2_990','compression','kəm''prɛʃən','kəm''preʃ(ə)n','[n] 压缩，浓缩；压榨，压迫','If so, they still generate a compression dictionary, but in this case, there is no compressed record, as all data has already been moved into the table.  如果有，那么它们仍然生成一个压缩字典，但是在这里，没有被压缩的记录，因为所有数据已经被移到表中。'),
