('SAT_2','SAT_2_994','brigadier',',brɪɡə''dɪr','brɪgə''dɪə','[n] 准将；陆军准将','He became a brigadier general before leaving the military in 1966.  他的军人生涯升至准将，随后在1966年退伍。'),
