('SAT_2','SAT_2_1000','assiduous','ə''sidjuəs','ə''sɪdjʊəs','[adj] 刻苦的，勤勉的','Podulski had been assiduous in learning his adopted language.  珀杜斯基曾经勤奋地学习他所选的外语。'),
