('SAT_2','SAT_2_1008','negligent','''nɛɡlɪdʒənt','''neɡlɪdʒənt','[adj] 疏忽的；粗心大意的','Mr Brown was found guilty of negligent driving.  布朗先生被判疏忽驾驶罪。'),
