('SAT_2','SAT_2_1629','audacity','ɔ''dæsəti','ɔː''dæsɪtɪ','[n] 大胆；厚颜无耻','I can’t believe he had the audacity to ask me for more money!  我真不敢相信，他竟胆敢还向我要钱！'),
