('SAT_2','SAT_2_2405','tenet','''tɛnɪt','''tenɪt; ''tiːnet','[n] 原则；信条；教义','Non-violence and patience are the central tenets of their faith.  非暴力和忍耐是他们信仰的基本原则。'),
