('SAT_2','SAT_2_2455','rate','ret','reɪt','[n] 比率，率；速度；价格；等级; [v] 认为；估价；责骂','Immediately his heart rate (= the number of beats per minute ) increased.  他的心率立即加快了。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_2456','celibacy','''sɛləbəsi','''selɪbəsɪ','[n] 独身','...priests who violate their vows of celibacy.  …违反独身誓言的牧师们。'),
