('SAT_2','SAT_2_2467','perusal','pə''ru:zəl','pə''ruːz(ə)l','[n] 熟读；精读','They undertook to send each of us a sample contract for perusal.  他们答应给我们每人寄送一份合同样本以供阅读。'),
