('SAT_2','SAT_2_2482','inequality',',ɪnɪ''kwɑləti','ɪnɪ''kwɒlɪtɪ','[n] 不平等；不同；不平均','People are concerned about corruption and social inequality.  人们对腐败和社会不公感到担忧。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_2483','claimant','''klemənt','''kleɪm(ə)nt','[n] 原告；[贸易] 索赔人；提出要求者','benefit claimants  救济金申请人'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_2484','oxidize','''ɑksə''daɪz','''ɒksɪdaɪz','[v] 使氧化；使生锈','If the organic material decays or is oxidized, it will not form petroleum.  如果有机物腐烂或氧化，它不会形成石油。'),
