('SAT_2','SAT_2_2867','contemplation',',kɑntəm''pleʃən',',kɒntem''pleɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 沉思；注视；意图','The monks spend an hour in contemplation each morning.  那些修道士每天早上默想一小时。'),
