('SAT_2','SAT_2_3484','homily','''hɔmili','''hɒmɪlɪ','[n] 说教；训诫','...a receptive audience for his homily on moral values.  ...乐于倾听他关于道德价值观说教的观众。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_3485','complementary','''kɑmplə''mɛntri','kɒmplɪ''ment(ə)rɪ','[adj] 补足的，补充的','The computer and the human mind have different but complementary abilities.  电脑与人脑各不相同，却又互为补充。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_3486','predominant','prɪ''dɑmənənt','prɪ''dɒmɪnənt','[adj] 主要的；卓越的；支配的；有力的；有影响的','Mandy''s predominant emotion was confusion.  曼迪的主导情绪是困惑。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_3487','derange','di''reindʒ','dɪ''reɪn(d)ʒ','[v] 扰乱；使错乱；使发狂','Whatever you do, don''t let the stress derange owe head.  但无乱咋样，无所不能让压力使得你精神错乱。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_3488','emphasize','''ɛmfəsaɪz','''emfəsaɪz','[v] 强调，着重','The report emphasizes the importance of improving safety standards.  报告强调了改进安全标准的重要性。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_3489','timorous','''tɪmərəs','''tɪm(ə)rəs','[adj] 胆怯的；胆小的；羞怯的','She was no helpless, timorous female.  她决不是柔弱胆怯的女性。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_3490','complaint','kəm''plent','kəm''pleɪnt','[n] 抱怨；诉苦；疾病；委屈','If you wish to make a complaint, you should see the manager.  如果你要投诉，应该去找经理。'),
