('SAT_2','SAT_2_3587','auricle','''ɔrɪkl','''ɔːrɪk(ə)l','[n] 耳廓；外耳；心耳','Also known as the auricle, it works like a funnel, directing sounds into the ear canal.  耳廓也被称为外耳，能起到漏斗一样功用，将声音导入耳道。'),
