('SAT_2','SAT_2_3601','ambivalent','æm''bɪvələnt','æm''bɪv(ə)l(ə)nt','[adj] 矛盾的；好恶相克的','As a group, they are ambivalent about whether the quality of online content would suffer if companies could not charge for it—34% think so while 30% do not; and the remaining 36% have no firm opinion.  对于如果网站对内容不收费这些内容的质量是否会变差的调查有矛盾：34%的人认为会变差，同时30%的认为不会，而36%的人没有固定的意见。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_3602','vocation','vo''keʃən','və(ʊ)''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 职业；天职；天命；神召','Her vocation is her work as an actress.  她适合的职业就是当演员。'),
