('SAT_2','SAT_2_3608','tirade','''taɪred','taɪ''reɪd; tɪ-','[n] 激烈的长篇演说','Now I fully recognize that I’m sitting here, a nobody myself, spouting off in what could be considered a hypocritical tirade, guilty of the same thing Ms. Barr is.  现在，我完全意识到我正坐在这儿，只有我自己，进行着一次被认为是伪善的长篇演讲，对同巴尔遇到的同样的事儿感到内疚。'),
