('SAT_2','SAT_2_4245','inalterable','ɪn''ɔltərəbl','ɪn''ɔːlt(ə)rəb(ə)l; -''ɒl-','[adj] 不变的；不能变更的','This is the cultural play of signification that theorists have discussed as if it were an inalterable feature of life.  这就是理论家们谈论的意义的文化游戏，仿佛它是生活的固定不变的特性。'),
