('SAT_2','SAT_2_4248','prosaic','prə''zeɪk','prə(ʊ)''zeɪɪk','[adj] 平凡的，乏味的；散文体的','a prosaic writing style  乏味的写作风格'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_4249','comparative','kəm''pærətɪv','kəm''pærətɪv','[adj] 比较的；相当的; [n] 比较级；对手','After a lifetime of poverty, his last few years were spent in comparable comfort.  他穷了一辈子，最后几年还算过得比较舒适。'),
