('SAT_2','SAT_2_4263','impassive','ɪm''pæsɪv','ɪm''pæsɪv','[adj] 冷漠的；无感觉的','Her impassive face showed no reaction at all.  她表情冷淡，毫无反应。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_4264','phlegmatic','flɛɡ''mætɪk','fleg''mætɪk','[adj] 冷淡的；迟钝的；冷漠的','The taxi driver, a phlegmatic man in middle age, showed no surprise at this request.  出租车司机是个冷静的中年人，对这一要求毫不惊讶。'),
