('SAT_2','SAT_2_4273','incisive','ɪn''saɪsɪv','ɪn''saɪsɪv','[adj] 深刻的；敏锐的；锋利的','He is a very shrewd operator with an incisive mind.  他是一位非常精明的经营者，有着敏锐的头脑。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_4274','aspirant','ə''spaɪərənt','ə''spaɪər(ə)nt; ''æsp(ɪ)r-','[n] 有抱负的人；野心家; [adj] 上进的；有野心的','...the young aspirant to power.  ...对权力有抱负的年轻人。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_4275','injurious','ɪn''dʒʊrərɪəs','ɪn''dʒʊərɪəs','[adj] 有害的；诽谤的','...substances that are injurious to health.  ...有害健康的物质。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_4276','ameliorate','ə''milɪə''ret','ə''miːlɪəreɪt','[v] 改善；减轻（痛苦等）；改良','It is not clear what can be done to ameliorate the situation.  可以采取什么办法来改善局面并不明确。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_4277','scarcity','''skɛrsəti','''skeəsɪtɪ','[n] 不足；缺乏','...an ever increasing scarcity of water.  …越来越匮乏的水资源。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_4278','illusion','ɪ''luʒn','ɪ''l(j)uːʒ(ə)n','[n] 幻觉，错觉；错误的观念或信仰','She was under no illusion that he loved her.  她不再幻想他爱她了。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_4279','humid','''hjumɪd','''hjuːmɪd','[adj] 潮湿的；湿润的；多湿气的','Tokyo is extremely humid in mid-summer.  仲夏的东京十分潮湿。'),
('SAT_2','SAT_2_4280','proclamation',',prɑklə''meʃən','prɒklə''meɪʃn','[n] 公告；宣布；宣告；公布','The authorities issued a proclamation forbidding public meetings.  当局发布了公告，禁止公开集会。'),
